<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN" data-site-prefix="../" data-page-kind="topic"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>23 领域的数据责任 · 架构逆向与实现对照文档</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/542ae2d5e2de76f7a482e81bed7afe56395d5076e55bb540bec24f2862bef6e9.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/2d6f64a41592ecc5580f5c9af7df50312d13003a44b11a009e97a399d0f450fe.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/0406149be904073c2ce7f9c463de30c838a7e631d14c8d5bb6a37504503d377b.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/803029919eed32de8e6b562de1110670aa54f8c208a24d221e5d9aec09164500.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/d5fece9265f8ae702d5f7a43c7726a744c7ed184259f0e2cb8a9cfd1cef19b94.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/2da1f7cfd40bdcb9d85e54468d109c375ebeade01cfe9c94372762f7bb9200ed.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/e0aa4d2e552f0df112cd943bd3ba39229da3836f54211ecabd618e977dfa3702.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/site.css"></head><body><a class="site-skip" href="#main-content">跳到正文</a><header class="site-header"><nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="../index.html">首页／界面入口</a><a href="../主题/主界面入口.html">主界面</a><a href="../工具/index.html">工具窗口</a><a href="../数据/index.html">数据与 Owner</a><a href="../主题/执行与状态.html">执行与结果</a><a href="../清单/交付与兼容.html">范围／兼容</a></nav><p class="breadcrumb">架构逆向与实现对照文档 / 23 领域的数据责任</p><h1>23 领域的数据责任</h1><p class="muted">原版事实、当前独立实现、拟议设计与未知分别保留。导航示意属于文档组织，不代表原程序的控件树或完整运行验证。</p><p id="route-message" role="status" hidden></p></header><main id="main-content" class="site-main"><p class="site-notice">本页正文与分类来自拆分前页面。长原文已迁移到内容寻址证据页，原始 SHA 和返回路径仍保留。</p><div class="source-content"><section id="domain-data-obligations"><h3>数据分析还要覆盖什么？按23个架构领域核对</h3><p>图像和参数只是其中两部分。下面依据原计划列出每个领域的数据义务、已核片段与尚缺内容。领域关联是研究组织，不代表原版调用，也不代表该领域已完成。</p><details open><summary>接下来优先补这五类数据合同</summary><table><thead><tr><th>优先项 / 为什么</th><th>下一份具体交付</th><th>什么证据才算这一批收口</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1 · 非图像数据的类型与变量生命周期尚未形成逐族闭环。<p><a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-01">F-01</a> / <a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-17">F-17</a> / <a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-15">F-15</a></p></td><td>在已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB逐族表上，下一有限取证应选择SDK this+0x23a8回调注册及opcode0xbd2桥，或typed callable实际分配/清理与旧header非0链；复合输入嵌套pointer生产/转移、图像新buffer/handle退役、PointSet仍各自待核。已取得的Batch复制、逻辑清空、控制块delete、复合析构与ModuleFrame到receiver槽不重复取证。Group/结果/保存及gvar另保留完整范围。</td><td>每族明确类型/基数、身份、写入时点、缓存失效、释放边界及原/当前差异；没有原生产体的族不得算闭合。</td></tr><tr><td>2 · Group身份、每轮索引、中断和累积结果仍分散，容易把多轮结果当单节点输出。<p><a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-10">F-10</a> / <a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-12">F-12</a> / <a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-13">F-13</a> / <a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-14">F-14</a></p></td><td>OG01～07已恢复循环准备、索引发布、输出标量复制与本次描述退役；CG01～10及三组当前合成流程已区分last/累积/显示、失败和零轮。下一有限原件取证是12dcb0动态typed目标绑定与图像/复合输出生产者、最后读者；当前取消/间隔异常及真实宿主scope关闭尚未由三例覆盖，不重复已核正常切片。</td><td>输出实例、基数、停止时保留值与失效动作逐步有据；原native和独立上限分列，不靠运行测试数关闭。</td></tr><tr><td>3 · 编辑历史载荷与运行结果/显示缓存尚缺共同所有权账本。<p><a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-21">F-21</a> / <a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-18">F-18</a> / <a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-04">F-04</a></p></td><td>选参数修改→撤销/重做→保存→方案替换这一个有限序列，逐步记录root/part、JSON/临时文件、scope和在飞回调持有与释放；保留写失败/密码取消分支。</td><td>区分历史捕获成功、栈迁移、文件提交、最后读者与失败保留；不以清字典称内存已释放。</td></tr><tr><td>4 · 通信/触发/脚本等非点击生产者的数据与退出协议在数据页仍薄弱。<p><a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-04">F-04</a> / <a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-16">F-16</a> / <a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-23">F-23</a></p></td><td>先固定已有通信换方案回调一条链：报文bytes→UTF8/XML/Base64→匹配项→加载请求→成功/失败标志→解除订阅；相机设备路径仅列待核。</td><td>每个载荷都有类型/编码/长度、生产者/消费者、线程与对象身份、失败返回及解除边界；不推定全部外部服务。</td></tr><tr><td>5 · 独立保存投影与原生容器数据模型尚不能直接对照。<p><a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-18">F-18</a> / <a href="domain-data-obligations.html#F-19">F-19</a></p></td><td>制作一张独立文档/资源事务表和一张原sol已识别UserData/记录字段表；只追已恢复写入成员，明确writer、mdata和未知段保存边界。</td><td>已知字段必须有读/写/默认/缺失/身份关系；未知原生格式与版本/密码组合显式保留，禁止用JSON重命名充兼容。</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details data-data-domain="F-01" id="F-01"><summary>F-01 · 公共数据契约 · 类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>B04 · 原生类型、复合叶及累积</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>DynamicOutput/GetAllLeafIO/ProcessGroupOutputV44</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>类型形状、基数、float/ABI、叶模式和清理规则</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按类型族拆叶/根任务；scalar/array/pointset/POLYGON/Region/Fixture/Components逐个追生产者与消费者</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每种开放类型有原生产者→订阅→Group→存储→结果证据；缺失类型禁用或明确独立合同</dd></dl><p>结果getter、订阅与当前输出累积片段；原类型生产、float/ABI和全部清理规则未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B04</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="24a585b2078fc0f2489dc017267680d9dcf7cbad21d5f728c6bc25434f73c324" href="../../证据/24a585b2078fc0f2489dc017267680d9dcf7cbad21d5f728c6bc25434f73c324.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>24a585b2078f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B07 · 插件交接合同与真实消费</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>FCR生产者/消费者、提交级接口和真实工具</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>已交付插件是否满足框架的身份/数据/会话合同</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>等待用户选择提交；只审已提交差异，逐字段兼容；根流程与Group验证真实端口/参数/ROI</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>明确实际采用SHA与合同；待集成和已实现分开；不搬未提交文件</dd></dl><p>仅映射当前provider、编辑所有者与scope合同消费；提交级采用SHA及真实工具交付验收未在此矩阵证明</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B07</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="240fda248171a769d3c39c3ea86545b7618b69e4e159ad991114ae0f2fb8c229" href="../../证据/240fda248171a769d3c39c3ea86545b7618b69e4e159ad991114ae0f2fb8c229.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>240fda248171</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B08 · 模型与Group组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>真实插件、嵌套Group、变量、ROI与历史持久化组合</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>单项通过后组合是否保持身份和数据一致</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>混合类型/多层/循环中断/累积/改型/撤销/保存重开/停止失败恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每场景对照原机输出和状态；失败不读陈旧结果；组合未知仍开放</dd></dl><p>模型/Group组合验收：需嵌套、变量、累积、保存重开和再次运行的同场景证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e" href="../../证据/4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f3a8f2e940f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>CP03 · 节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每个节点先从已复制n.Parameters建立新的字典，补Clone后的默认JSON值，再在执行到此节点时通过workflow.Resolve解析订阅；参数订阅经WorkflowSubscriptions.Parameter检查标量种类并SerializeToElement，覆盖该节点参数。普通连线则直接把上游PortValue赋入nodeInputs。ExecuteAsync收到两套ReadOnlyDictionary包装；ModuleExecutionContext构造器直接持有这两套只读接口。只读包装没有复制PortValue中图像/对象的含义。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：DataKinds.Coerce及插件执行可有自己的转换/复制规则；仅凭框架字典不能推定任意具体图像在工具内零复制或深复制。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：下游动态读取服务与原生参数setter认可状态不在这条托管参数传递事实内。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633" href="../../证据/e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e137f34d98c9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464" href="../../证据/a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a2d27b66691d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662" href="../../证据/f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f51cff92f0bd</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484" href="../../证据/e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e79249d8651c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39" href="../../证据/c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c50568f01e32</small></a></details></details><details><summary>DP02 · VmIO.Value / GetValue(executeCount,index) → 关联值、主动拉取与本轮值门</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Value getter在输入叶订阅分支直接返回RelateIO.Value；否则按Root回调模式/流程执行计数决定RefreshResult，再MergeIOLoopValue。GetValue对非uint.MaxValue的计数进行匹配，既不匹配本身/关联计数且不是常量时清Value并返回null。数组索引越界在该体回退0，不按当前实现的验证门推断原版规则。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“VmIO.Value / GetValue(executeCount,index) → 关联值、主动拉取与本轮值门”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：MergeIOLoopValue的完整合并/组合树语义、并发值变更及所有索引类型仍单独取证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/data-lifecycle-cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8c451bff3b6aa826267f423f41bc7dcce91d92571628d4c690442fd199432904" href="../../证据/8c451bff3b6aa826267f423f41bc7dcce91d92571628d4c690442fd199432904.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8c451bff3b6a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/data-lifecycle-cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58d4a072ee2e45fd5822f8ea4426b2574688ed0a807460b3f7d867cc01e80aae" href="../../证据/58d4a072ee2e45fd5822f8ea4426b2574688ed0a807460b3f7d867cc01e80aae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58d4a072ee2e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/data-lifecycle-cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1f255b046bb730ea4c605ccda6e1f6219b39a2e8ee64a6970df18d4c81fe002d" href="../../证据/1f255b046bb730ea4c605ccda6e1f6219b39a2e8ee64a6970df18d4c81fe002d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1f255b046bb7</small></a></details></details><details><summary>DR04 · 当前模块ExecuteAsync返回 → 模块实例Dispose后校验/保存输出引用</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor在finally释放本次模块实例，之后才检查取消/超时/异常、输出类型及动态描述符，再把输出字典包装为ReadOnlyDictionary并Record。字典包装没有深复制PortValue。模块实例、scope持久state和输出图像是三种寿命，不能用一次模块Dispose概括三者。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“当前模块ExecuteAsync返回 → 模块实例Dispose后校验/保存输出引用”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：工具Dispose是否影响其输出需按工具证据核实；本体不证明外部资源在返回后安全。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4bff101f2bffcec6f5804bb707528f6bd57d55ebd85186a5e26ef5a8e9130c32" href="../../证据/4bff101f2bffcec6f5804bb707528f6bd57d55ebd85186a5e26ef5a8e9130c32.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4bff101f2bff</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c949c55173154cf1681510c25bbc056952aebf41af69b2cfd0e9ca2e7c592461" href="../../证据/c949c55173154cf1681510c25bbc056952aebf41af69b2cfd0e9ca2e7c592461.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c949c5517315</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD01 · 原VariableManager绑定的DataSource模块 → VarCount/GlobalValueList快照与显示值</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>构造函数只在dataSource为VmModule时保存DataSource。GetAllVar(ref IMVS_VARIABLE[])通过DataSource.Params先取VarCount：只有正整数才读GlobalValueList，且非空、字节长度可整除IMVS_VARIABLE大小才覆盖调用者ref数组；不是数量相等校验，其他分支保留旧ref。List&lt;VarItem>重载逐条附加元数据，int/float将native数组复制到byte[]再BlockCopy成数值数组，但显示Value只取第0项；string读取描述数组后，仅复制第0项指向的字符串payload作显示。不能把Value文本当成完整数组。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原VariableManager绑定的DataSource模块 → VarCount/GlobalValueList快照与显示值”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：native变量模块GlobalValueList的生产、稳定快照/锁与内嵌payload回收协议缺体；不能由外层byte[]推断内层pointer已深拷贝。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="943b60adf0aa435016be817cc972300be3d0511f106b969ce267cf8f540d0ca9" href="../../证据/943b60adf0aa435016be817cc972300be3d0511f106b969ce267cf8f540d0ca9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>943b60adf0aa</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5eba28c661697c8b07365c4e3c0d26cb33e08b49e37c0ddb85687d3095342dbf" href="../../证据/5eba28c661697c8b07365c4e3c0d26cb33e08b49e37c0ddb85687d3095342dbf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5eba28c66169</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="63745f03db58ac7a81abfd3bea8b22a09513e551eb9bd4e7d2645ac1939d6929" href="../../证据/63745f03db58ac7a81abfd3bea8b22a09513e551eb9bd4e7d2645ac1939d6929.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>63745f03db58</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.Variable/VarItem.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e620a76eece5fee85a5d273ac303a806a0f9aebc3e9103a5513257f08f3125aa" href="../../证据/e620a76eece5fee85a5d273ac303a806a0f9aebc3e9103a5513257f08f3125aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e620a76eece5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD02 · 原SetVarIntValue/SetVarFloatValue数组写入口 → ModifyVar描述+临时HGlobal数值块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>两个setter拒绝空名、null和空数组，修复名字后设置VAR_VALUE动作、类型文本int/float及nValueNum。逐数值BitConverter.GetBytes→List&lt;byte>→ToArray，再AllocHGlobal并Marshal.Copy，pBinaryValue指向该临时块；序列化的是IMVS_MODIFY_VAR描述，调用SetBinaryData(&quot;ModifyVar&quot;,描述bytes)。进入try后finally释放临时块，但分配、复制、StructToBytes位于try之前，不能宣称所有构造异常都会释放。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原SetVarIntValue/SetVarFloatValue数组写入口 → ModifyVar描述+临时HGlobal数值块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModifyVar的native接收、解析、同步复制/异步消费、底层旧值释放及多线程原子性未取得原体。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="49d1325c103be60b2ed33c739fc8612dfde7abb9c8ec54568e9f59808efe4d3e" href="../../证据/49d1325c103be60b2ed33c739fc8612dfde7abb9c8ec54568e9f59808efe4d3e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>49d1325c103b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fc3eb63cedb01ac59c9a3231bc5ee5e070ed1d347208a48b4bda7e86c336046c" href="../../证据/fc3eb63cedb01ac59c9a3231bc5ee5e070ed1d347208a48b4bda7e86c336046c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fc3eb63cedb0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d236513cac113626256966d4829a5f8b8aef2fd1270cdaf55a6410edc576a330" href="../../证据/d236513cac113626256966d4829a5f8b8aef2fd1270cdaf55a6410edc576a330.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d236513cac11</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD03 · 原字符串变量写入口 → 短文本SDK路径、长文本binary路径与string[]嵌套块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>SetVarValue按UTF8字节数&lt;=256选择ServerSDKAPI.IMVS_SetParamValue，超过256改用SetBinaryData与补零UTF8数组，键的固定前缀为GlobalScipt-（按原拼写）。SetVarStringValue则为每个字符串创建补零UTF8数组、独立HGlobal，写入ByteDataArray(pData/nDataLen/nDataSize)；再为整个描述数组分配HGlobal，最后把其地址写到ModifyVar。finally逐项Free再Free外层；分配与序列化在try之前。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原字符串变量写入口 → 短文本SDK路径、长文本binary路径与string[]嵌套块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：精确键见源引用；native文本/二进制两入口的一致性、截断/编码与存储深拷贝需接收方原体。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f95e5db663eeb7c187e2f4c70755d4bf7b563061b62cc449d991778fd7ce481f" href="../../证据/f95e5db663eeb7c187e2f4c70755d4bf7b563061b62cc449d991778fd7ce481f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f95e5db663ee</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="321c3d313f04dc9c8e31d73988d4af489b473d2fdde536e8a2a7a6679b13882d" href="../../证据/321c3d313f04dc9c8e31d73988d4af489b473d2fdde536e8a2a7a6679b13882d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>321c3d313f04</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD05 · 原PointSet变量接口 → ByteDataArray复制→MatchPoint列表；专用setter为空体</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>GetVarPointset读取VarValue-null-加名字的binary结构，检查变量类型pointset；若nValueNum非0，从pByteValue取ByteDataArray[]，仅第0块nDataLen非0才复制其pData到byte[]。随后按Marshal.SizeOf(MatchPoint)步进，将每段复制到单个临时HGlobal再PtrToStructure并Add到MatchOutlinePoints；正常末尾Free临时块。对应SetVarPointset(string,List&lt;MatchOutline>)本轮新静态提取确认为空方法，不能从getter或POINT坐标数组的setter补造pointset写入协议。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原PointSet变量接口 → ByteDataArray复制→MatchPoint列表；专用setter为空体”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：native pointset生产者序列格式/版本、MatchPoint ABI和写入入口仍缺体；原空setter不等于整个产品所有pointset入口均不支持。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="848f77af62d187312ec6c4dfa31bc83198d5fd1cfa18e4c40e664ba6432f6044" href="../../证据/848f77af62d187312ec6c4dfa31bc83198d5fd1cfa18e4c40e664ba6432f6044.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>848f77af62d1</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9846f219a08a8c60409b9c24ffe7ef095ac04eb024433cc5b6dc0dceeed1ea15" href="../../证据/9846f219a08a8c60409b9c24ffe7ef095ac04eb024433cc5b6dc0dceeed1ea15.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9846f219a08a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VN02 · 原VAR_VALUE动作3 → 已有类型核验 → pBinaryValue/数量传入typed值分发</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>case3从payload+0x304读数量，记录+0x448非0时将payload+0x308与数量直接交0x28250；另一分支核目标类型文本：payload+0x204非空且与记录+0x129类型不符时返回0xe000030f。通过门后调用0x28c30，汇编明确RDX=记录名称+0x29、R8=类型文本、R9=payload+0x308内的pointer，第五栈参数为数量；还在调用前stack+0x28写入字节1，不能按伪码五参数显示丢掉这个调用点事实。0x28c30原体按int/float/string分别向0x295b0/0x29eb0/0x2a7b0转发；本轮没取这些最终存储体。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原VAR_VALUE动作3 → 已有类型核验 → pBinaryValue/数量传入typed值分发”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：0x28250组合值体及0x295b0/0x29eb0/0x2a7b0 typed存储体尚未取得；copy、旧值释放和越界行为不推测。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：额外第六字节的业务含义未取得原符号，不将其命名成copy/ownership标志。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800249ea.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd26736750989f51a531369b644ee3521a7d48dc2b5bbd021894568209a2b6bd" href="../../证据/bd26736750989f51a531369b644ee3521a7d48dc2b5bbd021894568209a2b6bd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd2673675098</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800249ea.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ab2227453298c5a9d4b660964bb8937ae7087db25ae80cdf063f9b26d34f169b" href="../../证据/ab2227453298c5a9d4b660964bb8937ae7087db25ae80cdf063f9b26d34f169b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ab2227453298</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800249ea.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4541332abd9292871278901864796e35aa2942d9b3926f1c5a9030c022a17ef9" href="../../证据/4541332abd9292871278901864796e35aa2942d9b3926f1c5a9030c022a17ef9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4541332abd92</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9df3908c4d2ed9487283a192bfed2b52c376aadac922ec387cb457217086bc29" href="../../证据/9df3908c4d2ed9487283a192bfed2b52c376aadac922ec387cb457217086bc29.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9df3908c4d2e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VN03 · 原VAR_TYPE动作1 → 删除旧值成功门 → 新类型文本与0x130子描述复制</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>case1先调用0x28110，返回0才继续；随后清记录+0x139的0x100字节与+0x129的0x10字节，并将payload+0x204的类型文本写入记录。数量非0时按nValueNum×0x130构造数组并保存在记录+0x470，目标为空则返回0xe0000002；分配非空时清数组并调用memcpy_s，从payload+0x308指向区域请求复制同样字节数；所选代码未分支检查其返回值，随后设记录+0x448=1、+0x450=数量。数量0分支另调用0x27080并置+0x448=0。原IAT0x180055568绑定MSVCR120.dll::memcpy_s，原汇编核到RCX目标、RDX容量、R8源pointer、R9长度。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原VAR_TYPE动作1 → 删除旧值成功门 → 新类型文本与0x130子描述复制”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：0x25c40/0x27080初始化清理体、数组构造失败与回滚、嵌套数据深拷贝仍未闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bcfa30253c519667a81ed446938d148d0c69a8710989c5562cad3124afd53e3f" href="../../证据/bcfa30253c519667a81ed446938d148d0c69a8710989c5562cad3124afd53e3f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bcfa30253c51</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6748c12f9603f62d81dc5559a3079f072fc03d9448eb31549374ec6bb0dc6eae" href="../../证据/6748c12f9603f62d81dc5559a3079f072fc03d9448eb31549374ec6bb0dc6eae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6748c12f9603</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02941cd60a3cba0deb6cfd3499d702fcb97760a10282e39ec8c3b3a65a2ec7ee" href="../../证据/02941cd60a3cba0deb6cfd3499d702fcb97760a10282e39ec8c3b3a65a2ec7ee.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02941cd60a3c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="07194a3175f971fa79b0f97f477557ff52ec98112165b8cd0631f0f3d98a0e70" href="../../证据/07194a3175f971fa79b0f97f477557ff52ec98112165b8cd0631f0f3d98a0e70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>07194a3175f9</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6aba67054835d3cfc5fceee02d854c6e6b1a940042247ed1c6307c1e834baf43" href="../../证据/6aba67054835d3cfc5fceee02d854c6e6b1a940042247ed1c6307c1e834baf43.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6aba67054835</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VS01 · 原typed int@0x295b0 / float@0x29eb0 → 带第五栈字节的ModuleFrame batch调用</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>两个原体对名称或payload指针为0返回0xe0000001，否则先调用ModuleFrame.VM_M_BatchSetGlobalVarInt/Float。原汇编明确RCX=context+8对象、RDX=变量名、R8=原payload指针、R9D=数量，并从typed入口第五字节实参写到调用前stack+0x20；不能因伪码只显示四个参数就称第五标志未传。IAT分别0x180055638和0x1800556c8绑定同名ModuleFrame导出。所选wrapper没有在batch调用前为数值数组分配/逐字节复制新的本地存储，传的是输入数组地址。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原typed int@0x295b0 / float@0x29eb0 → 带第五栈字节的ModuleFrame batch调用”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModuleFrame.VM_M_BatchSetGlobalVarInt RVA0x134710及Float RVA0x134880为已绑定下一种子，本轮未取它们原体，底层存储所有权仍未知。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c24cbecd8f21c26cd78e67acd24062403deb7851d84ac21ae5eb673e56af9501" href="../../证据/c24cbecd8f21c26cd78e67acd24062403deb7851d84ac21ae5eb673e56af9501.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c24cbecd8f21</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dc288a95ba15520517963dbb4380bdbe762f68f0a76f38cc7c902da23eedc525" href="../../证据/dc288a95ba15520517963dbb4380bdbe762f68f0a76f38cc7c902da23eedc525.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dc288a95ba15</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/180029eb0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="28cebe035e23cc0b660c06d71f2d73b2312a17ca437845af35dccd9eab3a41fa" href="../../证据/28cebe035e23cc0b660c06d71f2d73b2312a17ca437845af35dccd9eab3a41fa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>28cebe035e23</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VS02 · 原typed string@0x2a7b0 → 0x60字节输入描述 → 0x10字节STRING_UNIT临时数组</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原体按数量×0x10分配临时数组；逐项从输入记录i×0x60的+0 pointer、+8长度、+0xc容量字段，写到输出i×0x10的同三字段。复制的是pointer/length/size描述，没有在这个循环复制指向的字符串字节。调用ModuleFrame.VM_M_BatchSetGlobalVarString时R8传临时数组、R9D传数量，另传第五栈字节；保存返回码后，无论返回码0还是非0，正常控制流立即对该临时数组delete[]，随后才判断结果/继续联动。IAT0x1800556a0绑定batch string，0x180055540绑定MSVCR120.dll::??_V@YAXPEAX@Z。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原typed string@0x2a7b0 → 0x60字节输入描述 → 0x10字节STRING_UNIT临时数组”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModuleFrame.VM_M_BatchSetGlobalVarString RVA0x1349f0是否同步复制字符串内容、是否保留临时描述pointer、旧值free与失败回滚仍缺原体。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="10e1879bcd6f83d073f0d4467978a46958645a06b395f9c4e144d627a5e53e03" href="../../证据/10e1879bcd6f83d073f0d4467978a46958645a06b395f9c4e144d627a5e53e03.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>10e1879bcd6f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e5392cdab49603bde7a41b4a3e2327ecf9c9f7ac387f2ac809494f07c3ea6e8a" href="../../证据/e5392cdab49603bde7a41b4a3e2327ecf9c9f7ac387f2ac809494f07c3ea6e8a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e5392cdab496</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ac5e545406949eb25d355d2bc82658598532e7b45d953ded0da31f6d674e8413" href="../../证据/ac5e545406949eb25d355d2bc82658598532e7b45d953ded0da31f6d674e8413.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ac5e54540694</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VS03 · 原typed设置成功后的运行参数联动 → 只取第0个值，发送到记录中的linked模块/参数</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>三个typed原体都仅在batch返回0、数量>0且typed入口第六字节为0时进入linked记录循环；记录中+0x43c是链接数量、+0x440按0x94字节步进，每项取目标模块ID及+0x14的参数名。int在调用格式helper0x1b450前，汇编实际从原payload第0项读EDX；伪码遗漏该实参，不能说无值输入。float同样读第0项到XMM1再调用0x1b650。字符串联动用原输入第0条描述的pData/nDataLen直接调用VM_M_SetBinayData，未按每个linked目标选择不同数组元素。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原typed设置成功后的运行参数联动 → 只取第0个值，发送到记录中的linked模块/参数”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：第六字节精确控制是否联动，但其正式参数名/业务语义未取符号；不泛称订阅/copy开关。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModuleFrame.VM_M_SetBinayData对这些linked参数文本的接收和租约仍未闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="43f988348765c1a311662763785a903a0cc6ebfc4fddf2ac84958ebaaa34d4d0" href="../../证据/43f988348765c1a311662763785a903a0cc6ebfc4fddf2ac84958ebaaa34d4d0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>43f988348765</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5db18d9820cbfa4b0a584240d6112e8686427470ffa5e417ca498cb37a5f5bf7" href="../../证据/5db18d9820cbfa4b0a584240d6112e8686427470ffa5e417ca498cb37a5f5bf7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5db18d9820cb</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/180029eb0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cfbedccc0b64ef8d7a5f1740024b831ae63519fa4be1658ad840d253c763a676" href="../../证据/cfbedccc0b64ef8d7a5f1740024b831ae63519fa4be1658ad840d253c763a676.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cfbedccc0b64</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4071b4e835b04171274c2bdaf6debed308b28fc20bb7d81f759c9abaa753f24f" href="../../证据/4071b4e835b04171274c2bdaf6debed308b28fc20bb7d81f759c9abaa753f24f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4071b4e835b0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ea1b8d0d35e5cb8f5fa2fb947b1e3fff7d0df0c5469bf4a621269d901a433f41" href="../../证据/ea1b8d0d35e5cb8f5fa2fb947b1e3fff7d0df0c5469bf4a621269d901a433f41.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ea1b8d0d35e5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VS04 · 原typed返回码与后续链接异常门 → batch结果与各linked更新结果分开保留</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>int/float保存在local_c8的batch结果，string保存在local_c4；batch非0时直接返回该码。batch成功后的linked VM_M_SetBinayData错误保存到另一个local_a0/local_98，仅在日志门下记录，不覆盖最终batch返回值。链接参数名为空时记录后提前返回的也仍是原batch码，剩余链接不再处理。因此函数返回0不能证明每个linked运行参数都已更新；这一结论来自实际局部赋值和返回门，不能把日志存在当作错误向上传播。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原typed返回码与后续链接异常门 → batch结果与各linked更新结果分开保留”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：native最终存储/引用表一致性与跨线程执行顺序未运行验证；正常返回0仅能按所选返回码来源解释。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="abc882c2e17c666c0daaaa97465c9e23fcdb67f513dd95a3ec0e459d86aba3c1" href="../../证据/abc882c2e17c666c0daaaa97465c9e23fcdb67f513dd95a3ec0e459d86aba3c1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>abc882c2e17c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da3b7dfadcce51b7f9ab1ff9e2499c8406bc085a6c995f5b91d8e5407fe41f61" href="../../证据/da3b7dfadcce51b7f9ab1ff9e2499c8406bc085a6c995f5b91d8e5407fe41f61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da3b7dfadcce</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a257c6d6743b95015097d0d4943984352e701eee751ff1aa4ed1c86d0ff47e69" href="../../证据/a257c6d6743b95015097d0d4943984352e701eee751ff1aa4ed1c86d0ff47e69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a257c6d6743b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e88ddec9f944933d4ac657a87f4d692b4df9a64530ca9046235dce7352aa0408" href="../../证据/e88ddec9f944933d4ac657a87f4d692b4df9a64530ca9046235dce7352aa0408.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e88ddec9f944</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3c5fb8f9636219313b09ad6fa74d798d9d517508da8fce4c72d2851e700e9aad" href="../../证据/3c5fb8f9636219313b09ad6fa74d798d9d517508da8fce4c72d2851e700e9aad.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3c5fb8f96362</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ01 · 原ModuleFrame的Batch int/float/string导出 → 原指针/数量/第五字节进入各内部接收者</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原PE导出表分别确认BatchInt=0x134710、BatchFloat=0x134880、BatchString=0x1349f0，三者不是独立SetGlobalVarInt/Float/String导出。三wrapper汇编保存原RCX/RDX/R8/R9，检查句柄、名称和payload非null；调用内部126f10/127050/127340时，RDX=原句柄指针、R8=原名称、R9=原payload，数量写栈+0x20，原第五字节从当前栈+0xc0读出并写栈+0x28。内部接收体再从句柄首int取得键；不能因伪码callee少显示参数就说原指针或隐藏字节已丢弃。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModuleFrame的Batch int/float/string导出 → 原指针/数量/第五字节进入各内部接收者”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：实际从GlobalVariableModule typed调用进入这些导出的运行实例未执行；已有静态IAT与caller链和本导出体分别保存。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：第五字节的具体业务命名不由ABI位置推定；后续非零分支可据所取体说明，但不命名为通用copy或ownership标志。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180134710.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d0fba8f2fd3f43c8b893abcfa54bc9f0177d3f21ca783153b904ae9a23bb36aa" href="../../证据/d0fba8f2fd3f43c8b893abcfa54bc9f0177d3f21ca783153b904ae9a23bb36aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d0fba8f2fd3f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180134880.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5414fa228e3e76743b123625c90c7f207af3fa1f8e4599bf2e102318b94afbbd" href="../../证据/5414fa228e3e76743b123625c90c7f207af3fa1f8e4599bf2e102318b94afbbd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5414fa228e3e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1801349f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5cff4e556a475c48c26ffbd880449c696518cc35a1804be9339e530e94a9e0c1" href="../../证据/5cff4e556a475c48c26ffbd880449c696518cc35a1804be9339e530e94a9e0c1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5cff4e556a47</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180126f10.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c718b0de5572a3f6b7d0ba570e09b387bc4ecfb34bc159fc8d492c5e32d7d522" href="../../证据/c718b0de5572a3f6b7d0ba570e09b387bc4ecfb34bc159fc8d492c5e32d7d522.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c718b0de5572</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127050.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e5ab0cf15e8875f07074ff9a426fa90377fd934b697e880b2e5271bd3c040ae5" href="../../证据/e5ab0cf15e8875f07074ff9a426fa90377fd934b697e880b2e5271bd3c040ae5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e5ab0cf15e88</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127340.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="48d0d2d5245469dd81ee311bc544064a76fb0e0506ec8444abe5cdb63a7fd9a3" href="../../证据/48d0d2d5245469dd81ee311bc544064a76fb0e0506ec8444abe5cdb63a7fd9a3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>48d0d2d52454</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ02 · Batch内部992e0/99550的附加分支与主仓读取 → 非零字节分支逐值记录，随后取共享模块记录</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>int与float接收体均仅把count==0直接判错；字节参数非零时，按上下文键查另一记录，更新标记/名称，然后仅在count>0时循环从原payload按4字节读取并写各自数值列表。之后仍执行公共检查并进入全局共享模块记录查找：记录为空返回0xe0000003，否则交f4d10/f4dc0处理。这里附加记录与主typed存储是两条持有关系，且负数量不等于被count==0门拒绝。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“Batch内部992e0/99550的附加分支与主仓读取 → 非零字节分支逐值记录，随后取共享模块记录”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：负数量、附加记录与主记录一致性及0x09a7e0完整准入合同没有运行验证；不从本片段推通用线程安全或失败原子性。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800992e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b23ad560142b53472b6c32e3001f55645f1df2c0a6256f3e25ac01c3cea08317" href="../../证据/b23ad560142b53472b6c32e3001f55645f1df2c0a6256f3e25ac01c3cea08317.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b23ad560142b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180099550.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1c9487feac1b03dbe34e5cbbdc5781d0615975f1821541062ff1b5666b311b0b" href="../../证据/1c9487feac1b03dbe34e5cbbdc5781d0615975f1821541062ff1b5666b311b0b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1c9487feac1b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800992e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a5ea0a8c22e033f5412af311fdf32673c2680877c8155cd4fe852ade1a326b77" href="../../证据/a5ea0a8c22e033f5412af311fdf32673c2680877c8155cd4fe852ade1a326b77.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a5ea0a8c22e0</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ03 · f4d10/f4dc0的数值主写入 → 输入每个4字节值复制进所取值记录的内部数组</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>int写入先经f74b0取得共享值对象，空则返回0xe0000003；非空先调用其虚表+8槽，再对正count循环从原pointer+i*4读取4字节并交fc50。fc50经准备函数后取对象+0x10中的载荷，必要时扩容，并向其数组base+8+当前数目*4写入该值、增加计数。float的f4dc0对应fd30，写入另一组+0x40/+0x44/+0x48数组字段。这个层级已有实际标量复制，不能继续说数值始终只是原pointer转发；也不能把虚表+8未解体的行为擅称完整旧值清空。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“f4d10/f4dc0的数值主写入 → 输入每个4字节值复制进所取值记录的内部数组”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：值对象创建、虚表+8目标、扩容失败和所有其它读者的退役仍需独立追体；本轮未运行数值或并发验证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800f4d10.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e648227a5e1775656123c8a489ab2ec8d9901d735bd992251d97fa44a8ce8190" href="../../证据/e648227a5e1775656123c8a489ab2ec8d9901d735bd992251d97fa44a8ce8190.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e648227a5e17</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800f4dc0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ffb1de5af647f1687ba3d663fd984ff2a8ad09a652d29fcd51e36a82480e71a4" href="../../证据/ffb1de5af647f1687ba3d663fd984ff2a8ad09a652d29fcd51e36a82480e71a4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ffb1de5af647</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18000fc50.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13de87f63bfa6f1ab1a08a6112764443401f712e0000ebc0983286a957291bc2" href="../../证据/13de87f63bfa6f1ab1a08a6112764443401f712e0000ebc0983286a957291bc2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13de87f63bfa</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18000fd30.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c546634755a16fdf1e80473d32ddfcff222499c1dd6acc61d85508682f8d919" href="../../证据/5c546634755a16fdf1e80473d32ddfcff222499c1dd6acc61d85508682f8d919.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c546634755a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800f4d10.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b08ad24aae3c3fca07c68a4973f1ab2cf003c6ca1364cc38c4b28d2bddbbb389" href="../../证据/b08ad24aae3c3fca07c68a4973f1ab2cf003c6ca1364cc38c4b28d2bddbbb389.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b08ad24aae3c</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ04 · BatchString接收体997c0 → 描述步长16字节→局部字符串→内部字符串记录副本</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>接收体在正count循环中每次读取16字节描述的首pointer，再按尾零扫描构造局部字符串；还存在字节参数非零时向辅助列表复制字符串的分支。主分支按模块/名称取得字符串值对象后，汇编明确把当前索引和局部字符串作为参数交00ffe0。该体按索引选择已有或新增的内部字符串，再调用006470复制字符；006470在非同对象分支按实际字符串长度调用原IAT memcpy、更新长度并写尾零。00ffe0随后对临时字符串大容量块调用operator delete并重置它。此处释放的是临时字符串存储，不能当作调用者STRING_UNIT数组或其原pointer的释放。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“BatchString接收体997c0 → 描述步长16字节→局部字符串→内部字符串记录副本”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：STRING_UNIT长度/容量字段没有在这些读取分支中作为统一边界消费；不能把它们推成全部字符串均带长度安全读取。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：空指针、嵌入尾零、分配失败和字符串剩余分支没有原机运行验证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800997c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ad9f9ce0c19dea05a04fa72fda3fade01b92bcdfac5a599dd9a5ac2908070709" href="../../证据/ad9f9ce0c19dea05a04fa72fda3fade01b92bcdfac5a599dd9a5ac2908070709.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ad9f9ce0c19d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800997c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="11333a1f99378032925c9d990ce9bae621b367f8436d41a488bb8b8d8994f453" href="../../证据/11333a1f99378032925c9d990ce9bae621b367f8436d41a488bb8b8d8994f453.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>11333a1f9937</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800997c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5b449236c5381aa47f70095407da8efdd615e750a85ee54805b1813e6f9dea63" href="../../证据/5b449236c5381aa47f70095407da8efdd615e750a85ee54805b1813e6f9dea63.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5b449236c538</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18000ffe0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f6088371e11903993f19394e2e6e540bbc2ae537bdb94ec9ecc66a79d987a642" href="../../证据/f6088371e11903993f19394e2e6e540bbc2ae537bdb94ec9ecc66a79d987a642.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f6088371e119</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180006470.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f7639568604227fbf64dd23ab699f88806690c07b8bb1f888a2b9b0efbae301c" href="../../证据/f7639568604227fbf64dd23ab699f88806690c07b8bb1f888a2b9b0efbae301c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f76395686042</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CD01 · 数值、整数、布尔、文本与NumberArray工厂 → PortValue的标量载荷与单对象数值序列</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Number检查double有限后包装值，Integer(long)与Boolean(bool)包装值，Text拒绝null但保留传入string引用；string本身不可变，不需要为每次传递重新复制字符。Numbers(IEnumerable&lt;double>)则先ToArray、拒绝非有限项，再用只读集合包装副本，Kind为NumberArray但Cardinality仍采用构造器默认Scalar。Components也ToArray，但它是Components整体载荷，不因内部是列表就自动变Cardinality.Array。只读集合是容器接口限制，复制行为来自明确ToArray，不能把readonly一词当所有权证据。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“数值、整数、布尔、文本与NumberArray工厂 → PortValue的标量载荷与单对象数值序列”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不把托管long/double及文本合同视为原SDK int32/float32/UTF8缓冲ABI等价；自定义或原生工具内部是否另复制需逐工具取证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4a42ffe0e3384dd408d87824d4e54563ccf211d8a5ada9d1275fbc5f7ed892fa" href="../../证据/4a42ffe0e3384dd408d87824d4e54563ccf211d8a5ada9d1275fbc5f7ed892fa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4a42ffe0e338</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="30b8791c7d0cfaff6153171bb4713236ef543d6fc2cc651d865a2be02d6ec833" href="../../证据/30b8791c7d0cfaff6153171bb4713236ef543d6fc2cc651d865a2be02d6ec833.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>30b8791c7d0c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e7a8575cf0066d49319d26e5e6dc428273da8556601ac34baf4d3946bbaeffef" href="../../证据/e7a8575cf0066d49319d26e5e6dc428273da8556601ac34baf4d3946bbaeffef.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e7a8575cf006</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CD02 · Cardinality.Array工厂与Element / JoinArray → 复制数组容器、标量取项与重新物化集合</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>PortTypes.Valid只允许Integer/Number/Text/Circle/Point/Fixture使用Array基数；并无PointSet枚举。IntegerArray/NumberArray/TextArray及几何数组工厂均ToArray后包装只读视图；Number数组校验有限，Text数组拒绝null，Point/Circle/Fixture数组逐项调用相应校验。Element对Scalar且index0返回同一PortValue，对Array则从只读列表取值并创建标量PortValue。JoinArray先把同Kind输入Elements展平，再调用对应数组工厂，因此输出是新容器；Text只复制字符串引用，Point2/Component等值结构复制其数值字段，不是深复制任意引用对象。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“Cardinality.Array工厂与Element / JoinArray → 复制数组容器、标量取项与重新物化集合”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：FixtureValue内部可能持有复合引用，数组ToArray本身不证明它们递归深复制；本条不将PointArray/Components解释为原版pointset二进制布局。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/PortArrays.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="96f1aea026ee215fc3d2cfcc7ae864b8b8e10c6b6103991e0be3a17209276b7b" href="../../证据/96f1aea026ee215fc3d2cfcc7ae864b8b8e10c6b6103991e0be3a17209276b7b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>96f1aea026ee</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/PortArrays.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="08da30895b133e34d5364ca0e407cd2993a6ecd7ff9be7e31e795fdded00a371" href="../../证据/08da30895b133e34d5364ca0e407cd2993a6ecd7ff9be7e31e795fdded00a371.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>08da30895b13</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionData/ImageGeometry.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2d255d4019262159fcf02dbea530408f6a9efe74edd4fa0433ef09f732be4de9" href="../../证据/2d255d4019262159fcf02dbea530408f6a9efe74edd4fa0433ef09f732be4de9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2d255d401926</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CD03 · DataKinds.Coerce / PortTypes.AcceptsInput → 不转换时同引用；数值提升时新包装并可能降精度</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>CanFlow同Kind通常允许原值通过；Coerce(value,DataKind)只有Number→NumberArray会Numbers([double])新分配一个序列，其余可流转类型原样返回PortValue。带PortDescriptor的Coerce先保留支持deferred读的原始类型；否则AcceptInteger且Integer输入时，将long先强转float再包装Number或Numbers。这是显式单精度中间转换，不是无损long→double。GraphExecutor先按基数与种类验证每个输入，再Coerce；常规类型门不接受不同Cardinality，支持deferred的输入另有准入例外。还须注意：AcceptInteger的转换体调用As&lt;long>()，不是逐元素转换；Integer+Array即使通过目标Number+Array的声明类型门，仍会在这里读取long失败，并被Graph记录InputTypeMismatch，不能把声明接受等同运行数组提升已实现。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“DataKinds.Coerce / PortTypes.AcceptsInput → 不转换时同引用；数值提升时新包装并可能降精度”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：这里描述当前显式代码的转换点，不声明原版数值精度或原生getter行为；全部数值极值和调用路径未做运行差分。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="51a2b8d30006f10393ccc1cdc309fcdb2ff5f3bc48266f18a14ba5f6b9f69df1" href="../../证据/51a2b8d30006f10393ccc1cdc309fcdb2ff5f3bc48266f18a14ba5f6b9f69df1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>51a2b8d30006</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/PortArrays.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f8fa6f429136eb1a00e9edc401f2bff8449667b3bdec8565b1ccffa39d1f855" href="../../证据/0f8fa6f429136eb1a00e9edc401f2bff8449667b3bdec8565b1ccffa39d1f855.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f8fa6f42913</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/PortArrays.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a1fbc4a66a9f68698532cc99661a37a936f649e46013d49ad6688b87a8089d19" href="../../证据/a1fbc4a66a9f68698532cc99661a37a936f649e46013d49ad6688b87a8089d19.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a1fbc4a66a9f</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="130161cc408b92d9fb55147a1277b65567b614b14e81cc83914c9badfad585b5" href="../../证据/130161cc408b92d9fb55147a1277b65567b614b14e81cc83914c9badfad585b5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>130161cc408b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CD04 · Point / Components复合结果 → 投影叶子是新数值容器，复合父载荷仍原样保留</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>CompoundOutputFields.Expand先浅复制原Outputs，再用TryAdd追加投影字段，已存在同名字段优先保留。Point标量投影X/Y新Number；Point数组的X/Y用Numbers分别物化为NumberArray+Scalar。Components父载荷是Component只读列表，投影BlobNum/TotalArea标量及Area/中心/矩形等Number+Array叶子，叶子数组逐列新建。因此父Point/Components与各投影列同时可被结果持有；不能称所有子字段只是父数组的零复制切片。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“Point / Components复合结果 → 投影叶子是新数值容器，复合父载荷仍原样保留”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不据恢复XML字段名推定native点集ABI；当前Region/Fixture等其它复合投影及全部插件自定义输出仍应独立核查。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/CompoundOutputFields.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d56a2412c7a48c4db852f898ab3ab725652e4cfef6aa2516b94b22ed8f5e90ca" href="../../证据/d56a2412c7a48c4db852f898ab3ab725652e4cfef6aa2516b94b22ed8f5e90ca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d56a2412c7a4</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/CompoundOutputFields.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="85ab80c833c797323d8c1e5eb3434215bd1911c866d937352ce9428a2e611063" href="../../证据/85ab80c833c797323d8c1e5eb3434215bd1911c866d937352ce9428a2e611063.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>85ab80c833c7</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5b431adcf041c1a9423ba308f8cbe28de1e4f4205963b0d5eab1ad5ea5e99e17" href="../../证据/5b431adcf041c1a9423ba308f8cbe28de1e4f4205963b0d5eab1ad5ea5e99e17.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5b431adcf041</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/PortArrays.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="82a394a8ee5006280fe88a9b0c4a232c1ad7443ec9e9ef7736a39e78b48aec1e" href="../../证据/82a394a8ee5006280fe88a9b0c4a232c1ad7443ec9e9ef7736a39e78b48aec1e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>82a394a8ee50</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX01 · 原GlobalVariableModule复合设置0x28250 → 0x130描述逐项分发至已绑定typed入口</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>入口RDX是描述数组、R8D是条数，按0x130步进读取+0x100类型与+0x104数量。类型0/1/2分别用+0x108/+0x110/+0x118的payload指针调用295b0/29eb0/2a7b0。汇编确认typed第五栈字节来自VM_M_SetGlobalVarLockStatus返回AL，第六栈字节固定1；据VS03已见第六字节非0跳过typed联动分支。起始SetGlobalVarLockStatus(moduleID,moduleID,1)，正常末尾同入口第三参0；这里只证API及实参，不能等同原生互斥锁实现。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原GlobalVariableModule复合设置0x28250 → 0x130描述逐项分发至已绑定typed入口”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：负条数经MOVSXD后无符号比较的异常输入安全性未运行验证；不据正常条数循环推断边界校验。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：复合条目的创建/命名及不同订阅者看到更新的原子性没有由此证明。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180028250.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="055473846a95f55149afdcd543d0c4bff8f73638368e2477f1a846abd95be06c" href="../../证据/055473846a95f55149afdcd543d0c4bff8f73638368e2477f1a846abd95be06c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>055473846a95</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180028250.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="51f10ad48da32e80dd0f4af7b01d755c17c509c844b2b1b777457d74cc2bfca8" href="../../证据/51f10ad48da32e80dd0f4af7b01d755c17c509c844b2b1b777457d74cc2bfca8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>51f10ad48da3</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX03 · record+0x470数组析构1bc70(pointer,3) → 逐0x130子描述析构，再释放cookie前的数组分配</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>1bc70参数3同时启用vector析构与delete[]：从pointer-8读数量，以0x130步长调用1b900，然后delete[](pointer-8)。每个1b900对子描述+0x108/+0x110非空指针直接delete[]，清pointer与+0x104；+0x118非空则调用1ba20(pointer,3)。1ba20以0x60步长调用1b830并delete[]其pointer-8。1b830只有描述+0x50的int非0且+0pointer非0时才delete[]内容、清pointer与+8长度，最后始终清+0xc容量。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“record+0x470数组析构1bc70(pointer,3) → 逐0x130子描述析构，再释放cookie前的数组分配”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：+0x50正式所有权语义、每个生产分支如何置位/转移仍未闭合；不由delete条件猜字段名。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001bc70.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb146ba90b7409f4710bed80d27ee8ed733c5651fb5fcf0515f67461e760db7d" href="../../证据/cb146ba90b7409f4710bed80d27ee8ed733c5651fb5fcf0515f67461e760db7d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb146ba90b74</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001bc70.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="36b12553da384ed3fa61819c1ab8db81dc7e4ae461dd8dfc8df5db9ac037527c" href="../../证据/36b12553da384ed3fa61819c1ab8db81dc7e4ae461dd8dfc8df5db9ac037527c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>36b12553da38</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b900.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161" href="../../证据/d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d55b696b7636</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b900.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="68e726aee9d5048c9b0f861be252a835373dc7d2af298852f8192cc20cf63225" href="../../证据/68e726aee9d5048c9b0f861be252a835373dc7d2af298852f8192cc20cf63225.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>68e726aee9d5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001ba20.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7a2b430230145c8abc26e777b89212b81b23ce6735b86452685683001ac8da07" href="../../证据/7a2b430230145c8abc26e777b89212b81b23ce6735b86452685683001ac8da07.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7a2b43023014</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b830.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="85a3e5e558b5033c23fe210411421e293bd471f74b4ab97816a8c1bd4071e6b3" href="../../证据/85a3e5e558b5033c23fe210411421e293bd471f74b4ab97816a8c1bd4071e6b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>85a3e5e558b5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b830.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="775f61ca653ec23a67610e68a4205aaf99080666438a87f257f6fdd4481a1816" href="../../证据/775f61ca653ec23a67610e68a4205aaf99080666438a87f257f6fdd4481a1816.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>775f61ca653e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX04 · 复合描述构造1b890与先前VAR_TYPE浅描述复制 → 初始化与后续嵌套释放边界分开</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>本次取到1b890：清名称0x100字节、+0x104=0、+0x100类型=6、+0x108/+0x110/+0x118=0。先前VAR_TYPE分支已见按条数分配带cookie的0x130数组、逐项构造、随后整段memcpy_s输入描述；该整段复制包含指针字段，不能因调用memcpy_s就称嵌套payload已复制。新增析构体证明这些复制进来的非空数值pointer将进入delete[]，内层内容则受+0x50控制。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“复合描述构造1b890与先前VAR_TYPE浅描述复制 → 初始化与后续嵌套释放边界分开”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：VAR_TYPE case是大函数内片段，in_stack字段依赖原整体栈语义，不当成独立函数正式参数。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：输入嵌套地址来源与借用/转移协议尚缺，不能直接断言原版存在double-free。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b890.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c0a84c7530a5d7f8117329c51c2eb2f8c5b3626399b32f9ebd5f90258272ab7c" href="../../证据/c0a84c7530a5d7f8117329c51c2eb2f8c5b3626399b32f9ebd5f90258272ab7c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c0a84c7530a5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="abe329fd6070bf0a3f4cbb279191fb7a4e30fba18a1a4c816ad5b4f958c40bf9" href="../../证据/abe329fd6070bf0a3f4cbb279191fb7a4e30fba18a1a4c816ad5b4f958c40bf9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>abe329fd6070</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b900.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161" href="../../证据/d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d55b696b7636</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP01 · VZ03/04 typed map factory f74b0/f7650/f7260 → 明确构造的0x88值对象与另一份0x18共享控制块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>名称未命中时三个factory分别分配0x88对象并写vtable 22e690/22e6b8/22e6e0；命中则复制已有节点+0x40共享对。包装体fa090/fa100/fa020另分配0x18控制块，强/弱计数均初始1，保存对象指针+0x10，写22e538/22e560/22e5b0。原PE字节校验这些实际表槽，不能把typed对象虚表与shared控制块虚表混成同一析构入口。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“VZ03/04 typed map factory f74b0/f7650/f7260 → 明确构造的0x88值对象与另一份0x18共享控制块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：初始化所复制callable的动态分配器目标未在本切片定位。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f74b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb91909534d4f84ab527516d41f5f029b5b05a666c180823d29a0712ddee1a99" href="../../证据/cb91909534d4f84ab527516d41f5f029b5b05a666c180823d29a0712ddee1a99.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb91909534d4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f7650.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c195902f1ee88ad4129cdacb8cd63138c9e7ab49174ee79bb4b9e81684cef907" href="../../证据/c195902f1ee88ad4129cdacb8cd63138c9e7ab49174ee79bb4b9e81684cef907.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c195902f1ee8</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f7260.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="85c9884a479f11dfaa0eab71e83f878165d29860dd52d40e2712ad01f36f9f97" href="../../证据/85c9884a479f11dfaa0eab71e83f878165d29860dd52d40e2712ad01f36f9f97.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>85c9884a479f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa090.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="56f01e8413c4c5565ac5d16a6389911b997c8f1729c036aea7002f8c72552b1a" href="../../证据/56f01e8413c4c5565ac5d16a6389911b997c8f1729c036aea7002f8c72552b1a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>56f01e8413c4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa100.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="34cde5ff72b3e6f3075f057a8d04ff817030aea50de849aed89407acf7c641bf" href="../../证据/34cde5ff72b3e6f3075f057a8d04ff817030aea50de849aed89407acf7c641bf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>34cde5ff72b3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa020.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d70e937437973cf687bc12ee18cc2081093a9977b89cfa7426696e18936536c3" href="../../证据/d70e937437973cf687bc12ee18cc2081093a9977b89cfa7426696e18936536c3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d70e93743797</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP02 · typed对象虚表+8 → 清逻辑长度，保留既有数值/字符串分配</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原表明确int/float/string的+8槽为f3fb0/f40b0/f42e0。int/float在当前数量大于0时仅把payload+0x68/+0x40写0；string逐项将内部字符串长度写0并首字符置零（按capacity选择SSO或heap），最后把payload+0x30计数写0。所选体没有delete/free；VZ03所调用的+8现在可细化为逻辑清空，不能称完整释放。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“typed对象虚表+8 → 清逻辑长度，保留既有数值/字符串分配”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：所有消费者最后读者以及何时触发最终载荷析构仍未知。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3fb0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2a188934e53b1d2ab5b67e78889d4c3ec5b0115615a35d4659be3e790a238558" href="../../证据/2a188934e53b1d2ab5b67e78889d4c3ec5b0115615a35d4659be3e790a238558.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2a188934e53b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f40b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9a6d1845477ec819bfcb39c052ef1010e1cb8cd3a8aa2b63971f1bad6c080be1" href="../../证据/9a6d1845477ec819bfcb39c052ef1010e1cb8cd3a8aa2b63971f1bad6c080be1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9a6d1845477e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f42e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="764d603111ef7d55c0e071cdb9983edd1b004da6ec7ad835d57b521e4062e731" href="../../证据/764d603111ef7d55c0e071cdb9983edd1b004da6ec7ad835d57b521e4062e731.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>764d603111ef</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3f90.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d6c6dbf32cfdc9db8a070ba0c71187b7e8ea0dabfc1773b508288d7bd379b60" href="../../证据/0d6c6dbf32cfdc9db8a070ba0c71187b7e8ea0dabfc1773b508288d7bd379b60.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d6c6dbf32cf</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3fa0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="19b76cd83bfe520a59fa58b3f8727486236d5de04398be6837f4faa15b8c40b3" href="../../证据/19b76cd83bfe520a59fa58b3f8727486236d5de04398be6837f4faa15b8c40b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>19b76cd83bfe</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f40a0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="695ba0dc66e664b4b142e9ed8a3ca9b722b412781c99f7b624436d33ec19d8b0" href="../../证据/695ba0dc66e664b4b142e9ed8a3ca9b722b412781c99f7b624436d33ec19d8b0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>695ba0dc66e6</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f42d0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dad4af1710b9cb2029d7407ab7dda63883d0c41297f279e37ed8e18476220bcd" href="../../证据/dad4af1710b9cb2029d7407ab7dda63883d0c41297f279e37ed8e18476220bcd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dad4af1710b9</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP04 · typed虚槽+0x10的数值准备 → 扩容复制旧值，并有条件退役旧数组</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>int/float仅capacity小于对象请求量时扩容，目标容量取请求量、旧容量两倍与最小4的最大值。新块前8字节保存旧块header；数据初始化后按旧count复制4字节值。旧块非null且旧header==0才delete[]，否则本体不释放旧块。string槽仅在数量不足时调用1a39f0追加差额，未将该callee未取体补成数组析构。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“typed虚槽+0x10的数值准备 → 扩容复制旧值，并有条件退役旧数组”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：00f3a0与1a39f0未取体；非零header的最终持有/退役责任未闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3f80.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="516d879359ab56148c3231d7456b54d21b3d2365f2c5790d35b17952ad0196d1" href="../../证据/516d879359ab56148c3231d7456b54d21b3d2365f2c5790d35b17952ad0196d1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>516d879359ab</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f4080.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="82fbd5eba549e448ea2b569bfa18f5c0fa1e9f6616ab9208854a46cc1fd693bf" href="../../证据/82fbd5eba549e448ea2b569bfa18f5c0fa1e9f6616ab9208854a46cc1fd693bf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>82fbd5eba549</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3f80.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="95e2ca0496f7f44532eb793ac34843afced7a0fd7f2b53170a29bfb936a36d4e" href="../../证据/95e2ca0496f7f44532eb793ac34843afced7a0fd7f2b53170a29bfb936a36d4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>95e2ca0496f7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f42b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7027861988d462e151a27d955fac3527f1018ce09430244073cbdbcb6c0e9298" href="../../证据/7027861988d462e151a27d955fac3527f1018ce09430244073cbdbcb6c0e9298.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7027861988d4</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP01 · 原UserData[key] → 按Parent.ID普通键或动态复合键读写SDK界面数据</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>UserData不是一个本地Dictionary。getter在Parent非活动或正在Dispose时返回null，否则调用SDK；setter在Parent为空或Dispose时直接返回。isUsedForDynamicUIParam决定路由：动态key用字面分隔符&amp;?;?拆分，array[0]为名字、array[1]（若有）为optional，更多片段没有继续传递；普通路由传完整key和Parent.ID。Parent.IsDynamicModu控制撤销分支，是另一项判断，不能等同isUsedForDynamicUIParam。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原UserData[key] → 按Parent.ID普通键或动态复合键读写SDK界面数据”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：SDK界面数据的最终native容器/落盘结构不在这些托管体内；不把写入等同.sol保存完成。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5d5f72b163877a62e3b615b2f9fb99aa1518ecf4b9b3c3d99ffa903a6a1c6515" href="../../证据/5d5f72b163877a62e3b615b2f9fb99aa1518ecf4b9b3c3d99ffa903a6a1c6515.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5d5f72b16387</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="021de486f6931368f5bca8a45ade703eef229bbca4a0fb48cfe498ddf7d8fb74" href="../../证据/021de486f6931368f5bca8a45ade703eef229bbca4a0fb48cfe498ddf7d8fb74.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>021de486f693</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8f307bdc44b2ef96adcc362459be499c77588d06695e5cd326e800b9ed2025e7" href="../../证据/8f307bdc44b2ef96adcc362459be499c77588d06695e5cd326e800b9ed2025e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8f307bdc44b2</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP03 · 原普通/动态UserData读取 → native pointer+nDataLen → 新托管byte[]；正常尾请求释放返回块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>普通GetUIParamValueByKey成功时new byte[nDataLen]并在pData非0时Marshal.Copy；复制异常被吞，随后仍请求RELEASE_MEMORY_BASE_ARRAY，释放失败抛VmException。错误码-536870911返回null，其他非0抛错。动态ModuleManager getter经ServerSDKAPI展开：成功时同样按返回nDataLen新建数组及复制，但Release调用位于pData非0条件内，不能合并成同一无条件尾释放。动态wrapper将byte[]返回给调用者。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“原普通/动态UserData读取 → native pointer+nDataLen → 新托管byte[]；正常尾请求释放返回块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不能由Release成功推断SDK权威存储已删除；本slice未执行SDK，也未恢复该释放类型内部allocator。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="040127f8a7fa0bfd03e501eec77f26c79d1167c395deaf2eb9236347f205cf7f" href="../../证据/040127f8a7fa0bfd03e501eec77f26c79d1167c395deaf2eb9236347f205cf7f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>040127f8a7fa</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="393587e633a044c73457ca65e0bfe4ffdf1d4c12ee1c2a4c71a86a2c091a5582" href="../../证据/393587e633a044c73457ca65e0bfe4ffdf1d4c12ee1c2a4c71a86a2c091a5582.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>393587e633a0</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ServerSDKAPI.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c5c2d283f34efba0d09c4875a819be3a7b2a8fd01466a027e9a72322701f1862" href="../../证据/c5c2d283f34efba0d09c4875a819be3a7b2a8fd01466a027e9a72322701f1862.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c5c2d283f34e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>HP01 · GraphEditorDocument.Capture → CaptureSnapshot → 配置文档副本 → 内存快照或独占JSON文件载荷</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Capture先Copy(document)，再SerializeToUtf8Bytes。仅当没有显式historyPayloadParentDirectory且字节数小于64KiB时，Snapshot直接保存传入的文档副本；其余情况创建HistoryPayloadStore并写独占.payload。Snapshot还保存ProcedureId和BaseDirectory。Restore通过Snapshot.Document读取/反序列化，再从旧BaseDirectory重基到当前BaseDirectory，替换document并Dirty/Revision/Changed；没有把workflowSessions、scope或工具像素FIFO装进这个Snapshot。</p><p>类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本：这条既有事实明确核实“GraphEditorDocument.Capture → CaptureSnapshot → 配置文档副本 → 内存快照或独占JSON文件载荷”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">标量/数组、PointSet、POLYGON、Region、Fixture、Components逐族的生产→订阅→Group→存储→结果及清理尚无同一张逐类型状态表；端口JSON不能替代原native布局。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：仅源码级配置快照合同；不证明原版undo载荷或当前完整GUI操作等价，也未据此测量内存峰值。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4c3ac12d3435cf9956a0527c054a7d5c0e6d1bfdd336bf65e5198c2fab936e51" href="../../证据/4c3ac12d3435cf9956a0527c054a7d5c0e6d1bfdd336bf65e5198c2fab936e51.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4c3ac12d3435</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="edfe94ff86a2eabb61c6c15c4ba88cbe93ce01e17cf0b1f8cad8ca37ae4c9774" href="../../证据/edfe94ff86a2eabb61c6c15c4ba88cbe93ce01e17cf0b1f8cad8ca37ae4c9774.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>edfe94ff86a2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="646cc4268bf3d69f42b5b28c68e6bd80e27243f739b563fcf00941fa5a8e8e12" href="../../证据/646cc4268bf3d69f42b5b28c68e6bd80e27243f739b563fcf00941fa5a8e8e12.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>646cc4268bf3</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691" href="../../证据/dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dd3930e245ff</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="93ca0cb3fa9c240d2ebca8145901c780625aa5379af2368887cfdc097f0210f8" href="../../证据/93ca0cb3fa9c240d2ebca8145901c780625aa5379af2368887cfdc097f0210f8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>93ca0cb3fa9c</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>workflow-data:D06 · VmModule.Subscribe / UnSubscribe → 类型检查、叶订阅 SDK 或对子项递归</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>先 IsSuitable；双方叶节点使用 GetSubInfo(source)、GetPubInfo(target,source.RelateIndex)，交 SubscribeResult/UnSubscribeResult。组合 Subscribe 要求子项数量相同，逐项赋 RelateIO，否则抛不对齐异常。变量名 source 在此是订阅方，不应按英语词义反转生产/消费方向。</p><p>计划将B04归入F-01，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5279877193f461fc572d778a6c75e70e8af46de299c11f36e4005dd292fc4a7c" href="../../证据/5279877193f461fc572d778a6c75e70e8af46de299c11f36e4005dd292fc4a7c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5279877193f4</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8f2f5dc028b536fb9ac350407ae5707a6cf4bcb4e44e56893175f0cae11f8d25" href="../../证据/8f2f5dc028b536fb9ac350407ae5707a6cf4bcb4e44e56893175f0cae11f8d25.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8f2f5dc028b5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>group-control:G10 · IMVSGroupTool.ModuResult / GroupResult → 查询结果 / DynamicOutput getter</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ModuResult 每次新建 GroupResult(ID,this) 并 QueryModuleOneResult；GroupResult 指定模块对象时创建 DynamicOutput，整型 getter 有对象才委托，否则返回 default。不要把动态 getter 与实际累积算法混为一体。</p><p>计划将B04归入F-01，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/IMVSGroup.WorkflowAudit/IMVSGroupCs/IMVSGroupTool.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d6352506ff3a07780478a2ef8a91de5f0be59accd5b5b9a73306015490aba7dc" href="../../证据/d6352506ff3a07780478a2ef8a91de5f0be59accd5b5b9a73306015490aba7dc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d6352506ff3a</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/IMVSGroup.WorkflowAudit/IMVSGroupCs/GroupResult.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5d38e5d652b284528dcf3c45c3b005c89898fdb7a1ef447119dab010d142184e" href="../../证据/5d38e5d652b284528dcf3c45c3b005c89898fdb7a1ef447119dab010d142184e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5d38e5d652b2</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/IMVSGroup.WorkflowAudit/IMVSGroupCs/GroupResult.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e6b7e66a21f2628f7c5f0809a5aeca5173f1e801d9090b107966a8fe14f73c96" href="../../证据/e6b7e66a21f2628f7c5f0809a5aeca5173f1e801d9090b107966a8fe14f73c96.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e6b7e66a21f2</small></a></details></details><details><summary>plugin-sessions:C11 · ModuleExecutionScope.ForProcedure / State → 借用流程视图 / 方案根资源</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>ForProcedure 返回绑定流程的借用视图；State 键是 procedure/module/node 三元组，状态由根scope保存。借用视图 Dispose 不关闭整个方案；不是每轮重建所有工具状态。</p><p>计划将B07归入F-01，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“类型、基数、复合叶、生产/消费与合同版本”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9b1bc69960793ee8cd7c99ab26caa9bb4333ad6075fb47d931d735f7494e5e5e" href="../../证据/9b1bc69960793ee8cd7c99ab26caa9bb4333ad6075fb47d931d735f7494e5e5e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9b1bc6996079</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b00ffd9614c944e8c9a5abb9477401b86b04667d03783a92c8ba7c428d2f24e5" href="../../证据/b00ffd9614c944e8c9a5abb9477401b86b04667d03783a92c8ba7c428d2f24e5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b00ffd9614c9</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-02" id="F-02"><summary>F-02 · 插件宿主与调试会话 · 插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：普通配置、自调试、专用窗口各自持有者及关闭排空须分路径核实；当前scope租约不证明全部原版宿主行为。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>B07 · 插件交接合同与真实消费</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>FCR生产者/消费者、提交级接口和真实工具</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>已交付插件是否满足框架的身份/数据/会话合同</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>等待用户选择提交；只审已提交差异，逐字段兼容；根流程与Group验证真实端口/参数/ROI</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>明确实际采用SHA与合同；待集成和已实现分开；不搬未提交文件</dd></dl><p>仅映射当前provider、编辑所有者与scope合同消费；提交级采用SHA及真实工具交付验收未在此矩阵证明</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B07</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="240fda248171a769d3c39c3ea86545b7618b69e4e159ad991114ae0f2fb8c229" href="../../证据/240fda248171a769d3c39c3ea86545b7618b69e4e159ad991114ae0f2fb8c229.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>240fda248171</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C05 · 配置/调试会话与框架释放</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>配置关闭→会话取消/等待→回调解除→资源释放</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>框架关闭如何消费插件取消与结果生命周期</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>用已交付会话在运行中关配置/换方案/退出；记录线程/回调/内存与资源所有者</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>只改main消费与生命周期；插件会话由插件线交付；无悬挂旧回调或误杀他任务进程</dd></dl><p>当前配置/调试取消、等待和scope释放合同；原版全宿主生命周期及真实关闭矩阵未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C05</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7bd18e5c18ff3dddd42d9c9c0eaa7b4b0e6740f750505b9c88ae0bbfb7828a4d" href="../../证据/7bd18e5c18ff3dddd42d9c9c0eaa7b4b0e6740f750505b9c88ae0bbfb7828a4d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7bd18e5c18ff</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C08 · 执行与历史组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>原机同状态流程/Group/配置/历史综合链</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>运行编辑保存切换撤销之间是否存在状态污染</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>运行→编辑→停止→撤销→保存重开→再次运行；含嵌套、错误、取消和关闭</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每步结果/历史/文件/资源同时核对；独立重构差异显式保留</dd></dl><p>执行/历史组合验收：需运行、编辑、停止、撤销、保存重开和关闭的连续状态证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13fc665d3cc7e8867e5ff2c971b4aba671e67a2b2d42dc0cefeb1e14159816fc" href="../../证据/13fc665d3cc7e8867e5ff2c971b4aba671e67a2b2d42dc0cefeb1e14159816fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13fc665d3cc7</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>CP04 · 工具配置自执行RunConfiguredTool → 本次配置参数副本与独立节点请求</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>配置自执行在调度前取得doc.Document中的procedure/node，Clone传入values；已解析参数订阅和默认值后建立isolated节点，再交GraphExecutor。ParameterSeed显式返回这次捕获node.Parameters，applied则是传入编辑值加本次绑定解析后的parameters，二者不可混称同一个快照。上游available重新建字典但里面仍为NodeRunRecord/PortValue引用；图像没有随JSON参数Clone自动复制。</p><p>插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者：这条既有事实明确核实“工具配置自执行RunConfiguredTool → 本次配置参数副本与独立节点请求”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">普通配置、自调试、专用窗口各自持有者及关闭排空须分路径核实；当前scope租约不证明全部原版宿主行为。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不能把全流程activeRun门移植成配置自执行期间全部编辑必被拒绝；各配置操作门不同。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：此处记录复用不是图像生产者生命周期或插件缓存释放的完整证明。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f49326ebeac23b3d2f85661096a899bd823bbf4d2bbf3ad811bf1fc7110211a" href="../../证据/4f49326ebeac23b3d2f85661096a899bd823bbf4d2bbf3ad811bf1fc7110211a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f49326ebeac</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2ea3760981c2cf4e1ee0f81cfdec2fd479fec11a947e7d1dc6400f558b75abf8" href="../../证据/2ea3760981c2cf4e1ee0f81cfdec2fd479fec11a947e7d1dc6400f558b75abf8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2ea3760981c2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5dcb396fb7df87181facc43015df866630ed0359a57776de8aae3fc2cc0829f4" href="../../证据/5dcb396fb7df87181facc43015df866630ed0359a57776de8aae3fc2cc0829f4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5dcb396fb7df</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CP05 · 进入ExecuteAsync前的有效参数 → scope按过程/模块/节点保存Seed和Values</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor在ExecuteAsync之前调用RememberExecutionParameters；该方法分别Clone seed与applied，所以缓存不依赖模块执行结束才写入，失败/取消也可能留下本次入参。ReadEffectiveParameters先Clone缓存Values，再把当前配置中与Seed的GetRawText不同的字段覆盖进去；RememberConfigurationParameters又可更新已变字段。因此“有效参数”是供编辑器继续配置的托管视图，不能直接标成上次成功算法实际使用的精确历史记录或原生setter确认。</p><p>插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者：这条既有事实明确核实“进入ExecuteAsync前的有效参数 → scope按过程/模块/节点保存Seed和Values”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">普通配置、自调试、专用窗口各自持有者及关闭排空须分路径核实；当前scope租约不证明全部原版宿主行为。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：没有逐工具核其如何消费每个参数、是否忽略字段、何时复制到native；这些不能从托管入参缓存替代取证。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：删除节点与旧在飞请求的全部竞争仍需具体调用时序验证，缓存删除不等于全局排空。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f" href="../../证据/2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2f3bad3dab71</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.Parameters.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c827a1b26669642473dd9503c7ecb82a7717b78fc37ff6822c8b360650721236" href="../../证据/c827a1b26669642473dd9503c7ecb82a7717b78fc37ff6822c8b360650721236.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c827a1b26669</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a718146e6141fe220b1543247b919e2340a695a52f504d083d0e0e7b70c241dc" href="../../证据/a718146e6141fe220b1543247b919e2340a695a52f504d083d0e0e7b70c241dc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a718146e6141</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9372e51b811508f8adfc9b4eb36b249716410bd671fd070fcb17e4eec1426fe4" href="../../证据/9372e51b811508f8adfc9b4eb36b249716410bd671fd070fcb17e4eec1426fe4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9372e51b8115</small></a></details></details><details><summary>DR05 · ModuleExecutionScope.Close / RemoveNode / lease → 取消 → 等租约归零 → 去重释放owned state/service</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>借用流程scope.Dispose直接return。根Dispose令closing=true并cancel，只有cancellationComplete且leases==0且未releaseStarted才Release。Release按引用去重states/ownedServices，先清字典再Dispose资源，单项异常记录后继续。GraphExecutor的using scopeLease在调用退出时归还租约；这不证明UI结果或历史持有的像素引用也被清除。</p><p>插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者：这条既有事实明确核实“ModuleExecutionScope.Close / RemoveNode / lease → 取消 → 等租约归零 → 去重释放owned state/service”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">普通配置、自调试、专用窗口各自持有者及关闭排空须分路径核实；当前scope租约不证明全部原版宿主行为。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：跨窗口/provider仍持有的输出引用和节点删除时活租约与state移除的完整并发边界另列，不推全域线程安全。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58374d2a1ded1c3eacb2813f60c107e96da734c47c1afe7eb98ade8041f60908" href="../../证据/58374d2a1ded1c3eacb2813f60c107e96da734c47c1afe7eb98ade8041f60908.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58374d2a1ded</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="80b4324b185bc5c252fc1a846b24bf4987606dc2a6bd71d5158b013e72497566" href="../../证据/80b4324b185bc5c252fc1a846b24bf4987606dc2a6bd71d5158b013e72497566.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>80b4324b185b</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="95cd8566c683e5945c10c93f03f1cdcddec201f16932bfa248e17036f8f16461" href="../../证据/95cd8566c683e5945c10c93f03f1cdcddec201f16932bfa248e17036f8f16461.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>95cd8566c683</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CR03 · GraphEditorDocument.DeleteNodes → Changed → scope节点状态移除不等于裁剪旧session/配置记录</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>DeleteNodes修改节点、连线与配置引用，Edit提交文档后发Changed；主窗Changed调用ValidateToolConfigurationOwner、RetainExecutionNodes和刷新。RetainExecutionNodes只将现存(过程,模块,节点)集合交scope.RetainProcedureNodes并裁剪pointAliasPresentation。scope移除对应参数缓存与state，state若IDisposable才Dispose。这个删除链没有按被删节点裁剪workflowSessions.Nodes、configurationResults或toolDebugRecords；这些容器先前保存的记录不能因文档节点消失而推定已释放。</p><p>插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者：这条既有事实明确核实“GraphEditorDocument.DeleteNodes → Changed → scope节点状态移除不等于裁剪旧session/配置记录”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">普通配置、自调试、专用窗口各自持有者及关闭排空须分路径核实；当前scope租约不证明全部原版宿主行为。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：只证明所选删除/Changed链没有这些裁剪，不宣称任意其它用户动作永远不会清记录；结果字典的最终可达时刻未测。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="810d369ee8a845712c9b72eca82d82cb4a62ff5eb2a76432d63551077416610c" href="../../证据/810d369ee8a845712c9b72eca82d82cb4a62ff5eb2a76432d63551077416610c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>810d369ee8a8</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="75e8106bc9bc96d506b86808cc57c16f695c444590c95b9fb4261c9debb12501" href="../../证据/75e8106bc9bc96d506b86808cc57c16f695c444590c95b9fb4261c9debb12501.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>75e8106bc9bc</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4cc28c3847610e14ba36a44eb663c05de11b3dc92d1ef8e32f727a9df0da8f8b" href="../../证据/4cc28c3847610e14ba36a44eb663c05de11b3dc92d1ef8e32f727a9df0da8f8b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4cc28c384761</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="38deced2927f8aa66655a09c85876f006fe64220ac9e266292c5008d9042b661" href="../../证据/38deced2927f8aa66655a09c85876f006fe64220ac9e266292c5008d9042b661.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>38deced2927f</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="80b4324b185bc5c252fc1a846b24bf4987606dc2a6bd71d5158b013e72497566" href="../../证据/80b4324b185bc5c252fc1a846b24bf4987606dc2a6bd71d5158b013e72497566.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>80b4324b185b</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0bbb7367df0c905d24020ff5ff34dbeba70df59ec4e7bbde034b690f21abeb95" href="../../证据/0bbb7367df0c905d24020ff5ff34dbeba70df59ec4e7bbde034b690f21abeb95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0bbb7367df0c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bababb0481abf1885427ee24e530ece03842e367c06fc45da5a57e4aceffe396" href="../../证据/bababb0481abf1885427ee24e530ece03842e367c06fc45da5a57e4aceffe396.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bababb0481ab</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CR05 · 工具调试 / 普通配置自执行 / 关闭编辑器 → 停止调度与LastResult、Task结果、宿主缓存分别退役</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前实际类型是ToolDebugSession和ExecutionSessionResult，并未发现名为ToolExecutionSession/RunRecord的同一实体。ToolDebugSession.active保存Start返回的Task，完成finally仅清取消源/更新状态，不把active置null；若为RunOnce，该完成Task可继续持有NodeRunRecord直到active被下次Start替换或session不再可达。StopAsync取消并等待active，不清已保存结果。普通配置调度ToolConfigurationExecution.Dispatch开始把LastResult=null，完成再置结果；StopAsync只取消轮询并等loop，不清LastResult；DisposeAsync再等待inFlight也不清它。宿主RunConfiguredTool按owner/配置存活/节点身份准入后缓存record，不限成功状态；关闭配置可阻止晚发布，但CloseToolConfiguration没有清configurationResults。独立调试窗口的关闭另等待session.DisposeAsync后移除session集合项，不等同清宿主toolDebugRecords。</p><p>插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者：这条既有事实明确核实“工具调试 / 普通配置自执行 / 关闭编辑器 → 停止调度与LastResult、Task结果、宿主缓存分别退役”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">普通配置、自调试、专用窗口各自持有者及关闭排空须分路径核实；当前scope租约不证明全部原版宿主行为。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：Task对象是否实际继续可达取决于窗口/context/session持有；此处只指出字段可达链，不声称关闭后必然泄漏。工具窗口内部额外结果/图像字段仍按各工具另核。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ToolDebugSession.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1998fa28ef516e0442ada798317a986a5a3a7f60203690a738f345329c9ed614" href="../../证据/1998fa28ef516e0442ada798317a986a5a3a7f60203690a738f345329c9ed614.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1998fa28ef51</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ToolDebugSession.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a78cf42bd70d7c1c0222977c76f53185752a26f03b4b50e61cf883890642ec8f" href="../../证据/a78cf42bd70d7c1c0222977c76f53185752a26f03b4b50e61cf883890642ec8f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a78cf42bd70d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ToolDebugSession.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6ec7e19c4b3b0f7f763b73c249f18f1019a44a90aa028285306a0c31e34552a9" href="../../证据/6ec7e19c4b3b0f7f763b73c249f18f1019a44a90aa028285306a0c31e34552a9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6ec7e19c4b3b</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPluginContracts/ToolConfigurationExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e196e40396b3ea0776ac5cc9adbbc9fe538659686d3cdea36826f1fa981bf43b" href="../../证据/e196e40396b3ea0776ac5cc9adbbc9fe538659686d3cdea36826f1fa981bf43b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e196e40396b3</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPluginContracts/ToolConfigurationExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87eb8bcbf3359be124d199634ce1a7909e06ea9eaef9d6dfc63999e2ae3bc936" href="../../证据/87eb8bcbf3359be124d199634ce1a7909e06ea9eaef9d6dfc63999e2ae3bc936.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87eb8bcbf335</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8ec0b81b57c5d1d5cc107b2546b4bad592c4820a68e5279450df5724326f412a" href="../../证据/8ec0b81b57c5d1d5cc107b2546b4bad592c4820a68e5279450df5724326f412a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8ec0b81b57c5</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolConfigurationHost.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="42604d24cc11b563b44ee3c2a7628efe85f2da87a36111e265e7a925323ecbbb" href="../../证据/42604d24cc11b563b44ee3c2a7628efe85f2da87a36111e265e7a925323ecbbb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>42604d24cc11</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolEditorHost.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a60c55c875165f1664e7b08be499963a0769b1b0ac8de25d5e89e180834aff93" href="../../证据/a60c55c875165f1664e7b08be499963a0769b1b0ac8de25d5e89e180834aff93.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a60c55c87516</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolEditorHost.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e69702eb8a969534a5cf213f6b2eb0fe5b15f32050a66b005ac1c830d6a6cc8f" href="../../证据/e69702eb8a969534a5cf213f6b2eb0fe5b15f32050a66b005ac1c830d6a6cc8f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e69702eb8a96</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CR06 · 切方案 / 关闭主窗 → 先阻止旧owner发布，scope等待租约；主窗关闭不等于全持有者清零</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>切方案ReplaceExecutionScope先使执行owner失效、取消当前请求，显式Clear调试记录、configurationResults、workflowSessions、results等，再Dispose旧scope并创建新scope。scope.Dispose先closing并Cancel，只有取消完成且leases==0才Release；Release清state/services/参数字典，再逐个Dispose可释放资源，失败资源额外存failedResources。主窗关闭与切方案不同：DrainWorkflowBeforeClose先取消活动流程并等activeRun换出；独立调试session由OnClosing等停。OnClosed关闭owner/回调队列、关配置并Dispose scope，但该体没有Clear workflowSessions/results/configurationResults或逐个清控件图像。只可说关闭启动退役，不能说所有外部对象已同步归零。</p><p>插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者：这条既有事实明确核实“切方案 / 关闭主窗 → 先阻止旧owner发布，scope等待租约；主窗关闭不等于全持有者清零”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">普通配置、自调试、专用窗口各自持有者及关闭排空须分路径核实；当前scope租约不证明全部原版宿主行为。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：没有强制GC、原机内存峰值或最终外部读者测量；不得由静态Dispose路径推断释放的精确时刻、无泄漏或native等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="05f31e74763c9ab3c96c10a6f6e3d1159a01f5fdde6de5656335cb37afb8c675" href="../../证据/05f31e74763c9ab3c96c10a6f6e3d1159a01f5fdde6de5656335cb37afb8c675.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>05f31e74763c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2fb74670d574a271d0cb5235bcc52177ff5b4839e9c22fdcb02759751e179343" href="../../证据/2fb74670d574a271d0cb5235bcc52177ff5b4839e9c22fdcb02759751e179343.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2fb74670d574</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188" href="../../证据/310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>310faafd8596</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="964864aa21e58faf7a7b428113c7ab05132acdd2407ce54206ab7388147a21c8" href="../../证据/964864aa21e58faf7a7b428113c7ab05132acdd2407ce54206ab7388147a21c8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>964864aa21e5</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="520d0404f6be3fed6c2c287d2836b7d84f3528d2fdb24976cb170ce5bb51f140" href="../../证据/520d0404f6be3fed6c2c287d2836b7d84f3528d2fdb24976cb170ce5bb51f140.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>520d0404f6be</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolEditorHost.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b510d51bd818baedc968bd760d9fb0bcf442ec283de5e8494f8d718a233a757f" href="../../证据/b510d51bd818baedc968bd760d9fb0bcf442ec283de5e8494f8d718a233a757f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b510d51bd818</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d0d0acf4a14fb7e8c481ab31aacc00a124a3375031bc5afc1365a8eb395fe3cb" href="../../证据/d0d0acf4a14fb7e8c481ab31aacc00a124a3375031bc5afc1365a8eb395fe3cb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d0d0acf4a14f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR03 · 参数窗Closed → CurTabControlBase_Closed → 清窗引用/Tag，关闭参数与ROI状态</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>参数窗创建后以WeakEventManager登记Closed。Closed处理使用Dispatcher.Invoke把curTabControlBase置null；ROIPartUI若是ModuleResultView只把其Tag置null，随后IsOpenParams=false、SetRoiVisible(false)，再让Undo服务RemoveEmptyOperation。这个所见关闭尾部没有把ModuleSource或ImageDataSource置null，也没有调用ClearDataStore/Decorator.Dispose。关参数窗不能直接读成清除主界面图像/历史结果。</p><p>插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者：这条既有事实明确核实“参数窗Closed → CurTabControlBase_Closed → 清窗引用/Tag，关闭参数与ROI状态”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">普通配置、自调试、专用窗口各自持有者及关闭排空须分路径核实；当前scope租约不证明全部原版宿主行为。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：专用配置窗口内部Unloaded/DisposeFunction以及已排队的显示任务退出，必须按对应控件另核；本轮不扩为所有插件配置窗通用合同。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="93898410662c6b97fb675542cd19b3e39cfad78e2cb67aea50b2cddfd76a5ead" href="../../证据/93898410662c6b97fb675542cd19b3e39cfad78e2cb67aea50b2cddfd76a5ead.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>93898410662c</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9f7a6dac7969a6a699b7329d1771030b2068b76c0ee858677fc684624b2dd3e2" href="../../证据/9f7a6dac7969a6a699b7329d1771030b2068b76c0ee858677fc684624b2dd3e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9f7a6dac7969</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3a8cdd39e8b6fc1b41ee906288da9c31581ea6ea1c903cb69b06b5bb5aabcc50" href="../../证据/3a8cdd39e8b6fc1b41ee906288da9c31581ea6ea1c903cb69b06b5bb5aabcc50.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3a8cdd39e8b6</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR01 · ModuleExecutionScope.RegisterService&lt;T>替换旧owned服务 → 先撤owned标记，再Dispose；抛错可留下未回滚的旧映射</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>条件必须同时满足：同T已有previous、新service不是同引用、ownedServices.Remove(previous)返回true且previous实现IDisposable。该条件链先从ownedServices删除旧对象，再调用previous.Dispose；只有其正常返回才写services[typeof(T)]=新service及按owned标记登记新对象。旧Dispose抛异常时方法无catch/finally回滚：services仍映射旧previous，旧owned标记已移除，新service未写入，异常直接向调用者传播，也不调用RecordCleanupFailure。不能把注册失败描述为原状态完全不变。</p><p>插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者：这条既有事实明确核实“ModuleExecutionScope.RegisterService&lt;T>替换旧owned服务 → 先撤owned标记，再Dispose；抛错可留下未回滚的旧映射”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">普通配置、自调试、专用窗口各自持有者及关闭排空须分路径核实；当前scope租约不证明全部原版宿主行为。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本条是源码静态事实；另列ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限合成Disposable替换异常。真实相机/工具服务、GUI与设备未观测，不直接宣称现有资源会触发。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ownedServices按对象而非逐Type独立计数；所有多接口别名注册/外部所有者的实际组合未穷尽。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d10827d45e12e725d58d37e417f5352795f67844251dadcc24751e5c042b741d" href="../../证据/d10827d45e12e725d58d37e417f5352795f67844251dadcc24751e5c042b741d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d10827d45e12</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7d4f5619157a41957f0121e6ffe2c757e00e17489e154a3b2476533cbff9ac23" href="../../证据/7d4f5619157a41957f0121e6ffe2c757e00e17489e154a3b2476533cbff9ac23.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7d4f5619157a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188" href="../../证据/310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>310faafd8596</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="964864aa21e58faf7a7b428113c7ab05132acdd2407ce54206ab7388147a21c8" href="../../证据/964864aa21e58faf7a7b428113c7ab05132acdd2407ce54206ab7388147a21c8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>964864aa21e5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR02 · RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes批量裁剪 → 删除记录在Dispose之前完成；首个异常中断剩余裁剪</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>RemoveNode在root.gate内先删除effectiveParameters键，再从states.Remove取出value；离锁后仅当value实现IDisposable才Dispose，没有catch和RecordCleanupFailure。Dispose抛错时该node状态及参数已从这些字典移除，调用直接失败；重复RemoveNode找不到state就return，不自动重试旧对象。RetainProcedureNodes先批量删除不在keep中的全部参数键，再快照待移state键并foreach RemoveNode；其中一项抛错将中断剩余foreach，后续state仍可留在states，而其参数键可能已在第一阶段删除。</p><p>插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者：这条既有事实明确核实“RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes批量裁剪 → 删除记录在Dispose之前完成；首个异常中断剩余裁剪”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">普通配置、自调试、专用窗口各自持有者及关闭排空须分路径核实；当前scope租约不证明全部原版宿主行为。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：WPF doc.Changed等上层对传播异常如何显示/恢复需按调用者另追；本切片不宣称文档编辑或整个solution关闭必然失败。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe已观测有限顺序Remove/Retain异常；并发与真实资源异常未观测，本条仍按源码关系取证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="80b4324b185bc5c252fc1a846b24bf4987606dc2a6bd71d5158b013e72497566" href="../../证据/80b4324b185bc5c252fc1a846b24bf4987606dc2a6bd71d5158b013e72497566.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>80b4324b185b</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0bbb7367df0c905d24020ff5ff34dbeba70df59ec4e7bbde034b690f21abeb95" href="../../证据/0bbb7367df0c905d24020ff5ff34dbeba70df59ec4e7bbde034b690f21abeb95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0bbb7367df0c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="38deced2927f8aa66655a09c85876f006fe64220ac9e266292c5008d9042b661" href="../../证据/38deced2927f8aa66655a09c85876f006fe64220ac9e266292c5008d9042b661.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>38deced2927f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR03 · root closing置位与API准入 / 租约 → 立即拒新状态与租约，不等于所有查询/删除都禁用</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>root Dispose在gate下先设置closing=true再调用stopping.Cancel；State&lt;T>、RegisterService、Enter与参数Parameters入口均以closing抛ObjectDisposedException。与之不同，Service&lt;T>只锁gate查询，无closing检查：若活跃租约阻止Release清字典，它仍可在closing期间返回旧服务；Release清空后则返回null。ForProcedure只验证procedure字符串，可以继续生成borrowed view；RequestRun/RequestRefresh在closing直接返回。RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes没有closing或leases门，故root完整Release等待租约不能被概括成任何节点移除/替换都受同一租约保护。</p><p>插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者：这条既有事实明确核实“root closing置位与API准入 / 租约 → 立即拒新状态与租约，不等于所有查询/删除都禁用”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">普通配置、自调试、专用窗口各自持有者及关闭排空须分路径核实；当前scope租约不证明全部原版宿主行为。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：代码未给出所有方法的全域并发安全保证；不将允许调用某查询/Remove的事实解释为对资源在用状态必然安全。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：stopping.Token在CancellationTokenSource已Dispose之后的外部访问合同未在这里运行验证，不作应用级行为推断。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b00ffd9614c944e8c9a5abb9477401b86b04667d03783a92c8ba7c428d2f24e5" href="../../证据/b00ffd9614c944e8c9a5abb9477401b86b04667d03783a92c8ba7c428d2f24e5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b00ffd9614c9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c1fdec128386617fb806271f04cf9c49ebc3ffb414286470b3d305f549a896a6" href="../../证据/c1fdec128386617fb806271f04cf9c49ebc3ffb414286470b3d305f549a896a6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c1fdec128386</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9b1bc69960793ee8cd7c99ab26caa9bb4333ad6075fb47d931d735f7494e5e5e" href="../../证据/9b1bc69960793ee8cd7c99ab26caa9bb4333ad6075fb47d931d735f7494e5e5e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9b1bc6996079</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9bdb5ada7a12a4eb3889a4bf900f9c7482008d0490a4d04017f3d5118683c81" href="../../证据/b9bdb5ada7a12a4eb3889a4bf900f9c7482008d0490a4d04017f3d5118683c81.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9bdb5ada7a1</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4091fd40ad598f1bef1ca79035d29af8d004e4c17e7f12659d90fd5e779afeba" href="../../证据/4091fd40ad598f1bef1ca79035d29af8d004e4c17e7f12659d90fd5e779afeba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4091fd40ad59</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2fb74670d574a271d0cb5235bcc52177ff5b4839e9c22fdcb02759751e179343" href="../../证据/2fb74670d574a271d0cb5235bcc52177ff5b4839e9c22fdcb02759751e179343.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2fb74670d574</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.Parameters.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da16abd392367c1273981da0cd67a30389675f77d48ba998c04ea64931f8e9b1" href="../../证据/da16abd392367c1273981da0cd67a30389675f77d48ba998c04ea64931f8e9b1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da16abd39236</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR04 · 取消或资源Dispose异常后的root Dispose / Lease.Exit → root清理是一次性尝试；failedResources保留不等于排队重试</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Dispose设置closing后，stopping.Cancel抛Exception会RecordCleanupFailure(cancel,stopping,error)，finally仍设置cancellationComplete并TryRelease；不是因取消回调异常就跳过该finally。TryRelease要求closing、cancellationComplete、leases==0且!releaseStarted，在真正Release前置releaseStarted=true。Release对各IDisposable的Exception分别记录后继续下一资源，并单独尝试stopping.Dispose；这点现有CR06已有，本事实新增明确重试边界：root重复Dispose因closing立即return，后续Exit也因releaseStarted不再启动第二遍，failedResources只保留对象，所选类没有重试/清空该表的方法。</p><p>插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者：这条既有事实明确核实“取消或资源Dispose异常后的root Dispose / Lease.Exit → root清理是一次性尝试；failedResources保留不等于排队重试”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">普通配置、自调试、专用窗口各自持有者及关闭排空须分路径核实；当前scope租约不证明全部原版宿主行为。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不把源码Exception catch扩大为任何OOM、进程退出或任意RecordCleanupFailure自身失败时也必完整清理。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本条是源码静态事实；另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限异常与重复Dispose。GC、真实资源/GUI/设备及native释放未观测，不以幂等调用门推成功释放/原版等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="25130754904625cadcdad559712b1e9298d053ebf76c32aa1fd99c72476ca2de" href="../../证据/25130754904625cadcdad559712b1e9298d053ebf76c32aa1fd99c72476ca2de.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>251307549046</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f2e6a8876eda1fe94b3bfcc7876c5a9418ec89c22b3f630b0946e517cf0c13a0" href="../../证据/f2e6a8876eda1fe94b3bfcc7876c5a9418ec89c22b3f630b0946e517cf0c13a0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f2e6a8876eda</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="61daf69cd32d9631373aa1e2980f2bcdfb5c67b3667360b8d8ac2aca74c61898" href="../../证据/61daf69cd32d9631373aa1e2980f2bcdfb5c67b3667360b8d8ac2aca74c61898.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>61daf69cd32d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188" href="../../证据/310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>310faafd8596</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd2d67c66bdbf31088a906a44fad23a3cec8952a95b0b9cae68c729032eb3644" href="../../证据/bd2d67c66bdbf31088a906a44fad23a3cec8952a95b0b9cae68c729032eb3644.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd2d67c66bdb</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ca8fde56b8897ea11321f59623422ce5471c7fe1eda7a67886f3d360b0e0a7ba" href="../../证据/ca8fde56b8897ea11321f59623422ce5471c7fe1eda7a67886f3d360b0e0a7ba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ca8fde56b889</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0564c5545b60182cc37a0c1578d6e328f22f0eb5693b954dd058b2adf97291f7" href="../../证据/0564c5545b60182cc37a0c1578d6e328f22f0eb5693b954dd058b2adf97291f7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0564c5545b60</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>plugin-sessions:C04 · CreateScopedToolEditorContext.Guard → Dispatcher / epoch / solution / scope / 节点存活</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Guard 检查UI线程、当前所有者、锁/运行、方案、activeScope 与节点；此调试上下文和 C01 普通配置模型入口分开，不能把存在 DebugSession 当所有配置窗口都走此服务。</p><p>计划将B07/C05归入F-02，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolEditorHost.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="060f8523a724b888927bbc4df44516c1cf432ac319336de99c83120a5887120d" href="../../证据/060f8523a724b888927bbc4df44516c1cf432ac319336de99c83120a5887120d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>060f8523a724</small></a></details></details><details><summary>plugin-sessions:C09 · StopAsync / DisposeAsync → Stopping → cancel/await → Disposed</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Stop 对活动任务置 Stopping并Cancel，await只吞 OperationCanceledException；Dispose先置closing，await Stop，finally置Disposed。一般执行异常可以传播，不能写成全部关闭错误被吞。</p><p>计划将C05归入F-02，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ToolDebugSession.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9b89c98354b72b5d6d9cf259ea1824a8546da7a815ea2b1268c7acf88970cd4" href="../../证据/c9b89c98354b72b5d6d9cf259ea1824a8546da7a815ea2b1268c7acf88970cd4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9b89c98354b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>plugin-sessions:C12 · scope Enter / Dispose / Exit → 取消后等租约归零再释放</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Enter 在根锁下累加lease；Dispose标closing并取消，finally写cancellationComplete，TryRelease要求leases==0且尚未release。最后Exit可能触发Release，逐资源释放并收CleanupFailures；这属于当前资源合同。</p><p>计划将B07/C05归入F-02，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="455219ce3023ddf5b572bcfb4661a3bef25d32ed078ee26d46f540c66366f395" href="../../证据/455219ce3023ddf5b572bcfb4661a3bef25d32ed078ee26d46f540c66366f395.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>455219ce3023</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58374d2a1ded1c3eacb2813f60c107e96da734c47c1afe7eb98ade8041f60908" href="../../证据/58374d2a1ded1c3eacb2813f60c107e96da734c47c1afe7eb98ade8041f60908.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58374d2a1ded</small></a></details></details><details><summary>plugin-sessions:C13 · BindToolEditorLifetime → 取消本次关闭 / await Dispose / 再 Close</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>窗口Closing先取消并防重入，await调试session.DisposeAsync；finally移除会话、ready并调度Close，Closed再次移除。不是立即关闭后让后台继续运行。</p><p>计划将C05归入F-02，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“插件宿主入参、调试所有者、取消和最后读者”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolEditorHost.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e20fdfc8be76ac8285c0a0f1826d2c1b61c4ed0e1d7a7450dc1456ca40ea81d0" href="../../证据/e20fdfc8be76ac8285c0a0f1826d2c1b61c4ed0e1d7a7450dc1456ca40ea81d0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e20fdfc8be76</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-03" id="F-03"><summary>F-03 · WPF 主窗口 · 主窗DPI/工作区坐标、锁状态与资源持有</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：数据页未呈现设备坐标/逻辑坐标类型、跨屏变换及锁状态消费者表；窗口几何片段不能证明多屏/DPI全矩阵。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>A02 · 主窗口状态与DPI</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>MainWindow/WindowWorkArea/窗口模板与状态命令</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>多屏/DPI/最大化/焦点/锁定是否沿原绑定改变</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>追踪窗口模板到状态写入；覆盖100/150/200%DPI、边界拖动、恢复与关闭</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>原资源和几何公式可定位；实际桌面矩阵与独立策略分列</dd></dl><p>窗口模板/消息几何和工作区锁传播片段；多屏DPI及全部命令消费者未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A02</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4953a750de7f70530781620ce4334a3851fa28fc2877e4652c3dc9cca45ee5d4" href="../../证据/4953a750de7f70530781620ce4334a3851fa28fc2877e4652c3dc9cca45ee5d4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4953a750de7f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>A08 · 壳与交互全状态验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>上述原事件与发布版真实主窗口</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>是否还有未映射入口/资源/手势</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按分支清单逐项原机同状态对照，补边界、截图与事件/值记录</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>列出的壳范围无遗漏；未支持服务显式开放，不按测试总数关闭领域</dd></dl><p>壳组合验收：需逐项对账实际入口、资源、手势与桌面矩阵；局部页面不能替代组合证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e" href="../../证据/32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>32e894e8e249</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>OR01 · ProcedureConfigControl.OnSolutionChanged → 关闭当前参数窗后替换DecoratorSolution</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Solution依赖属性变化回调先看curTabControlBase是否为IsClosing=false的BaseWindow，仅该门通过才Close当前参数窗；新方案非null时创建新的VmSolutionDecorator并设DecorateSource，否则把DecoratorSolution置null。所选体对old solution的if块为空，没有直接调用旧decorator.Dispose、ClearDataStore或图像释放。这个外层入口不可用窗口关闭名补成渲染对象全部回收。</p><p>主窗DPI/工作区坐标、锁状态与资源持有：这条既有事实明确核实“ProcedureConfigControl.OnSolutionChanged → 关闭当前参数窗后替换DecoratorSolution”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">数据页未呈现设备坐标/逻辑坐标类型、跨屏变换及锁状态消费者表；窗口几何片段不能证明多屏/DPI全矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：当前活宿主是否发生该DP变化、窗口是否确实关闭及该窗口卸载后的显示源解绑顺序未运行确认。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：旧DecoratorSolution是否另由集合/容器清理，尚未取得完整caller到payload退出的绑定链。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c2b817b6d084684144af5adda8ed4677df62b39912b63164bb1bb2c23264719" href="../../证据/7c2b817b6d084684144af5adda8ed4677df62b39912b63164bb1bb2c23264719.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c2b817b6d08</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR02 · ProcedureConfigControl流程容器更换/Remove/Reset → 解除集合订阅、移除装饰项与条件清选中项</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>OnProceduresChanged对旧集合RemoveHandler并ClearProcedures，对新集合先Remove再Add CollectionChanged handler，随后按复制状态重新AddProcedures。ClearProcedures调用ResetDisposeStatus把IsDisposeNotify先true再false，再清DecoratedProcedures/DecoratedModules。Remove通知逐来源移除匹配装饰项，并仅在OldItems含当前DecorateSource时把SelectedItem/SelectedTabItem置null；Reset调用ClearProcedures。所选体没有逐装饰项调用Dispose。</p><p>主窗DPI/工作区坐标、锁状态与资源持有：这条既有事实明确核实“ProcedureConfigControl流程容器更换/Remove/Reset → 解除集合订阅、移除装饰项与条件清选中项”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">数据页未呈现设备坐标/逻辑坐标类型、跨屏变换及锁状态消费者表；窗口几何片段不能证明多屏/DPI全矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：已定位SearchDryPopup一个消费者及其退搜索事件行为；其它消费者与Release包装Dispose的更外层caller仍未闭合；包装层到MainViewControl的直接调用另见OR07。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：单模块删除的所有选择同步和全部UI消费者未闭合；不能以流程集合Remove代表所有模块删除都已清屏。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="00d457f9c26d3f5ab484cec8cd7b4ae35ef605a9760cb4d48263d8ca3fa1d4c1" href="../../证据/00d457f9c26d3f5ab484cec8cd7b4ae35ef605a9760cb4d48263d8ca3fa1d4c1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>00d457f9c26d</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b3898d7c62c8cb38b954ff3b62dac37630237c6e5ff9f3461568c2812e066a90" href="../../证据/b3898d7c62c8cb38b954ff3b62dac37630237c6e5ff9f3461568c2812e066a90.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b3898d7c62c8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR06 · MainViewControl.Dispose可调用入口 → 仅将其模板ModuleResultView.ModuleSource设null</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>OnApplyTemplate把m_ModuleView取为ModuleResultView，Dispose仅在mrv非null时将ModuleSource置null。该属性后续若实际发生变化，可关联已有V02的旧decorator清理；本体没有调用RenderThreadPool.ShutDown，也没有直接清所有图层/历史仓。本轮已定位Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose的直接调用（OR07）；该Release.Dispose在具体退出/换方案场景中的更外层caller仍未闭合，不能宣称每次切方案/主窗关闭都必经。</p><p>主窗DPI/工作区坐标、锁状态与资源持有：这条既有事实明确核实“MainViewControl.Dispose可调用入口 → 仅将其模板ModuleResultView.ModuleSource设null”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">数据页未呈现设备坐标/逻辑坐标类型、跨屏变换及锁状态消费者表；窗口几何片段不能证明多屏/DPI全矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：初始三个PE的5630个有体方法查得0直接引用，仅是有限scope；随后补入Release层986个方法并定位VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose直接调用（OR07）。它的更外层caller、224个接口候选和动态分派仍未知，不能声称每次切方案/关主窗都已释放图像。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/MainViewControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5589d054d5bc9b53856ce77058a6e8bc400162bebb22cb8dbb69df6978fb70ab" href="../../证据/5589d054d5bc9b53856ce77058a6e8bc400162bebb22cb8dbb69df6978fb70ab.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5589d054d5bc</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/MainViewControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="638d5cb8db93a568ccddf6f2efc05a5c7f53ab0685a70768b75a1ba15239360b" href="../../证据/638d5cb8db93a568ccddf6f2efc05a5c7f53ab0685a70768b75a1ba15239360b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>638d5cb8db93</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-retirement.resources/caller-scan.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f84264f50a87cc472c6d5251bb01e2fc01298aaa4da39d2f54f37548e583c7f" href="../../证据/4f84264f50a87cc472c6d5251bb01e2fc01298aaa4da39d2f54f37548e583c7f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f84264f50a8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR07 · Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose → 退宿主事件 → MainViewControl.Dispose → Content=null</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>已恢复的Release包装层Dispose先调用自身Unloaded处理以解除方案事件，再解除RestoreDefaultDisplay，mainViewControl非null才调用其Dispose，最后Content=null。新PE扫描确认其method token 0x06000038、IL offset 40的call目标正是VMControls.WPF.MainViewControl.Dispose（MemberRef 0x0a000086），不是接口候选猜测。保留shell MainWindow.xaml实例化Release控件、该控件XAML嵌入普通MainViewControl的声明，原三份对应BAML资源已重取。</p><p>主窗DPI/工作区坐标、锁状态与资源持有：这条既有事实明确核实“Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose → 退宿主事件 → MainViewControl.Dispose → Content=null”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">数据页未呈现设备坐标/逻辑坐标类型、跨屏变换及锁状态消费者表；窗口几何片段不能证明多屏/DPI全矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：谁在具体关闭主窗/切方案操作中调用Release.Dispose尚未定位，不能由XAML构造或IDisposable实现推自动调用。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原生像素与显示最后读者、全部异常退出和主宿主实际运行顺序仍未知。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF.Release/VMControls.WPF.Release/VmMainViewConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="83ecb93cd769f476908429cb9afae47c53089dcb0427541083e4fa6da98437d2" href="../../证据/83ecb93cd769f476908429cb9afae47c53089dcb0427541083e4fa6da98437d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>83ecb93cd769</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF.Release/VMControls.WPF.Release/VmMainViewConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="73ecf41af0f60dcfd6a249a43574603d39062fc1dca784a4f009a7b5018bb077" href="../../证据/73ecf41af0f60dcfd6a249a43574603d39062fc1dca784a4f009a7b5018bb077.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>73ecf41af0f6</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF.Release/VMControls.WPF.Release/VmMainViewConfigControl.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e9067eaea4f5e89982cc527d195dbe1f78ee22579d692b30cdca13df2dc3bbd8" href="../../证据/e9067eaea4f5e89982cc527d195dbe1f78ee22579d692b30cdca13df2dc3bbd8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e9067eaea4f5</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VisionMasterMain/VisionMasterMain/MainWindow.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0ebc66bd488b52189414bc307634f3d5e79ce68f3cff777b8ced50e1e029fec0" href="../../证据/0ebc66bd488b52189414bc307634f3d5e79ce68f3cff777b8ced50e1e029fec0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0ebc66bd488b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-retirement.resources/caller-scan.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4abac833528f5b0715a470f4cc497e7bcf6d56e9d6a9e3c17f2c333745fae47f" href="../../证据/4abac833528f5b0715a470f4cc497e7bcf6d56e9d6a9e3c17f2c333745fae47f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4abac833528f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR08 · ResetDisposeStatus → ZoomArea SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify → true通知只解除搜索控件事件，不调用图像Dispose</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ProcedureConfigControl.ResetDisposeStatus将IsDisposeNotify先true再false。保留ZoomArea.xaml将祖先ProcedureConfigControl的该属性绑定到DryPopup.IsDisposeNotify；该DP注册OnDisposeStatusChanged，只有NewValue=true才DeleteSelf。DeleteSelf解除TextBox的TextChanged/LostFocus/GotFocus、清除按钮Click及宿主Window的LocationChanged/Deactivated，再_window=null。所选完整体没有调用MainViewControl.Dispose，不清图像或模块结果；这条通知不能再被当成图像释放触发器。</p><p>主窗DPI/工作区坐标、锁状态与资源持有：这条既有事实明确核实“ResetDisposeStatus → ZoomArea SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify → true通知只解除搜索控件事件，不调用图像Dispose”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">数据页未呈现设备坐标/逻辑坐标类型、跨屏变换及锁状态消费者表；窗口几何片段不能证明多屏/DPI全矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：当前只闭合一个静态模板消费者；原模板是否在特定宿主激活、其它IsDisposeNotify消费者与重复模板应用生命周期未穷举。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bcb889050a265f1870abb13b3ab1b318eed6a9eb06785198195020b8a080c0ff" href="../../证据/bcb889050a265f1870abb13b3ab1b318eed6a9eb06785198195020b8a080c0ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bcb889050a26</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/ZoomArea.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6c123919bc5efd7c2bdc048e1b8cb9cf4d6c476870c450d4d7bef4af9d2d0e4a" href="../../证据/6c123919bc5efd7c2bdc048e1b8cb9cf4d6c476870c450d4d7bef4af9d2d0e4a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6c123919bc5e</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/SearchDryPopup.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ed6af86cce4a8dd11a4097977d5462e346a80b108c355664866e83db91c8ca68" href="../../证据/ed6af86cce4a8dd11a4097977d5462e346a80b108c355664866e83db91c8ca68.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ed6af86cce4a</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/SearchDryPopup.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="065d575258ee3d838663c92a4fdaa6b4f35eccf1552d936ff60156b8555665cd" href="../../证据/065d575258ee3d838663c92a4fdaa6b4f35eccf1552d936ff60156b8555665cd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>065d575258ee</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>window-layout:W07 · WmGetMinMaxInfo 主/副屏分支 → ptMaxPosition / ptMaxSize / ptMaxTrackSize</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>先从(0,0)取显示器和monitorinfo，再取窗口最近显示器。相同时用首显示器rcWork位置/尺寸；不同时ptMaxPosition仍取首monitorinfo.rcMonitor.left/top，尺寸与最大跟踪尺寸取第二显示器rcWork。保留这套原公式，不改写为通用monitor-relative公式。</p><p>计划将A02归入F-03，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“主窗DPI/工作区坐标、锁状态与资源持有”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。这只是反编译文本公式；多屏/任务栏位置/原件CIL和实际桌面行为仍未确认。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Controls/VM.Controls/BaseWindow.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="777d0f31d764a64f17b67bff09147df975115b4e55f995ba703436be754cf1a6" href="../../证据/777d0f31d764a64f17b67bff09147df975115b4e55f995ba703436be754cf1a6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>777d0f31d764</small></a></details></details><details><summary>window-layout:W08 · GetWindowMinMax / TransformFromDevice / TransformToDevice → 逻辑限制与设备单位跟踪值</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>保存设备单位的min/max track和window max值；有CompositionTarget时GetWindowMinMax将设备上限转逻辑，最大化时取track与window max的较大值，再与MinWidth/MaxWidth和高度分支取max/min；结果转设备单位并DoubleToInt写回结构。</p><p>计划将A02归入F-03，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“主窗DPI/工作区坐标、锁状态与资源持有”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。DoubleToInt舍入、系统DPI策略及句柄/CompositionTarget生命周期仍须原件与运行验证。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Controls/VM.Controls/BaseWindow.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="511432a524e2e34fea708b1393dd7140627cf6ee95a2683625fdab3e66c07d7b" href="../../证据/511432a524e2e34fea708b1393dd7140627cf6ee95a2683625fdab3e66c07d7b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>511432a524e2</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Controls/VM.Controls/BaseWindow.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b47015025c168736eaa29bb27342a777208bcbf132fa32b33b377dc801f208e7" href="../../证据/b47015025c168736eaa29bb27342a777208bcbf132fa32b33b377dc801f208e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b47015025c16</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Controls/VM.Controls/BaseWindow.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="32bfe450a21bf5bfc1952d52326f3977880e960062a50c9c59ba81cea72acc4c" href="../../证据/32bfe450a21bf5bfc1952d52326f3977880e960062a50c9c59ba81cea72acc4c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>32bfe450a21b</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Controls/VM.Controls/BaseWindow.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f787673b1fe00dc2c07287c75e0af9bc82124283cd174b39246d06c8cf223587" href="../../证据/f787673b1fe00dc2c07287c75e0af9bc82124283cd174b39246d06c8cf223587.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f787673b1fe0</small></a></details></details><details><summary>window-layout:K04 · MainWindowData.IsWorkAreaLocking setter → 状态 → IUnRedoService → LockProcess → PropertyChanged</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>变化时先写字段，再可空调用SetLockStatus，再LockProcess，最后通知。LockProcess仅沿文件菜单查Lang_ImportProcess并设IsEnabled=!isLock；前序抛错不保证通知/其它效果继续，也没有事务回滚。</p><p>计划将A02归入F-03，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“主窗DPI/工作区坐标、锁状态与资源持有”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。IUnRedoService具体锁实现、运行注入版本及全部消费者仍开放；不能说VM流程模型全部只读。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VisionMaster.Exe.Audit/VisionMaster/MainWindowData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="10c0452fe1a52064afc10d546ac7891bc6e0d431fb145d8f94c42cb3a1401edc" href="../../证据/10c0452fe1a52064afc10d546ac7891bc6e0d431fb145d8f94c42cb3a1401edc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>10c0452fe1a5</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VisionMaster.Exe.Audit/VisionMaster/MainWindowData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="53eeab92727acdb50a2663e4277da1f87141bc1d822fae7019619f5d3b3a119a" href="../../证据/53eeab92727acdb50a2663e4277da1f87141bc1d822fae7019619f5d3b3a119a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>53eeab92727a</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-04" id="F-04"><summary>F-04 · 菜单、工具栏与全局入口 · 菜单操作的配置、设计器缓冲、服务与历史数据入口</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：布局XAML三缓冲、UserData投影、通信/触发配置与历史根不同；不能把一个保存按钮/通用JSON方案当作所有入口的数据事务。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>A02 · 主窗口状态与DPI</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>MainWindow/WindowWorkArea/窗口模板与状态命令</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>多屏/DPI/最大化/焦点/锁定是否沿原绑定改变</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>追踪窗口模板到状态写入；覆盖100/150/200%DPI、边界拖动、恢复与关闭</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>原资源和几何公式可定位；实际桌面矩阵与独立策略分列</dd></dl><p>窗口模板/消息几何和工作区锁传播片段；多屏DPI及全部命令消费者未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A02</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4953a750de7f70530781620ce4334a3851fa28fc2877e4652c3dc9cca45ee5d4" href="../../证据/4953a750de7f70530781620ce4334a3851fa28fc2877e4652c3dc9cca45ee5d4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4953a750de7f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>A05 · 菜单、工具栏及全局入口清点</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>MainWindowData命令、TitleMenueItemData和原始资源字典</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>每个可达菜单/快捷键对应哪个模块和持久化入口</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>提取完整命令/资源清单；逐项追踪禁用条件、参数、窗口、存储、效果；分类相机/通信/全局变量/触发/脚本/综合配置</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每个入口有任务归属和覆盖状态，不能用仅打开窗口结项；新增服务按父任务拆子项</dd></dl><p>菜单物化、反射分派与当前直接Action；完整入口全集未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A05</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="21acbd65419ccb08d4582b07763c9270cae87fc767d89ab58f38a83655e94a3b" href="../../证据/21acbd65419ccb08d4582b07763c9270cae87fc767d89ab58f38a83655e94a3b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>21acbd65419c</small></a></details></details><details><summary>A06 · 运行界面编辑与显示布局</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>EditFrontendUI → EditFrontendWindow/FrontendWindowData → FrontendEdit.Close</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>BAML绑定、编辑保存取消及运行态数据消费</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>REA提取BAML/资源和精确成员；布局编辑、关闭两态、存储、重开与运行值追踪</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>布局与真实结果绑定闭合；未知控件单列；插件显示只消费交付合同</dd></dl><p>设计器创建/关闭、保存与取消、三缓冲及UserData写回、运行窗ParseXaml消费已取有限原件体；原BAML激活、完整控件绑定/结果及SDK保存仍未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A06</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d3f1be5d9f658a2b1f57955e9ba404c4ed5a396a104e5cec98dccfcb85d2c6b8" href="../../证据/d3f1be5d9f658a2b1f57955e9ba404c4ed5a396a104e5cec98dccfcb85d2c6b8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d3f1be5d9f65</small></a></details></details><details><summary>A08 · 壳与交互全状态验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>上述原事件与发布版真实主窗口</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>是否还有未映射入口/资源/手势</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按分支清单逐项原机同状态对照，补边界、截图与事件/值记录</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>列出的壳范围无遗漏；未支持服务显式开放，不按测试总数关闭领域</dd></dl><p>壳组合验收：需逐项对账实际入口、资源、手势与桌面矩阵；局部页面不能替代组合证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e" href="../../证据/32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>32e894e8e249</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B05 · 流程IO、局部/全局变量与gvar</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>GlobalVariableItem/DynamicInput/DynamicOutput与导入导出命令</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>变量作用域、初始化、订阅、删除改型和gvar规则</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>追原服务与序列化；父子传参、重复占用、改名改型、复制、导入导出及运行重开</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>入口/身份/持久化/执行闭合；全局与局部不混用；未知gvar不改名JSON代替</dd></dl><p>原全局变量迁移/读取和当前局部typed数据消费；gvar与全局完整执行/持久化仍未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B05</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9b593ac896d0f8c37f6a0f098ab90a625307f06d5874b350abf8c8ff9065b21a" href="../../证据/9b593ac896d0f8c37f6a0f098ab90a625307f06d5874b350abf8c8ff9065b21a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9b593ac896d0</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C01 · 撤销root/part实际捕获</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>VM.UnRedo.Schedule.Register/UpdateActionData及ModuleParam/UserData</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>真实根身份、捕获时点、抑制及取消异常效果</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>独占工作副本/TempFiles；编辑同模块两次、不同模块、Group关闭、Undo/Redo；记录动作/值/栈</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>CIL/反编译与真实命中相互对应；临时文件原件保全；不构造服务清理他任务TempFiles</dd></dl><p>根/分片录入与当前历史引擎的有限对照</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C01</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="610bb0d99c71d688e9a0c37e2e4b299a119a1778498af2ef5eed531ebb7c00e8" href="../../证据/610bb0d99c71d688e9a0c37e2e4b299a119a1778498af2ef5eed531ebb7c00e8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>610bb0d99c71</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C04 · 撤销恢复与临时文件所有权</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>Module/Model/UserData/SolutionUnRedoOperation与Import/Export</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>内存/临时gro/流程/sol载荷和密码取消如何恢复</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐根类型覆写/清redo/栈溢出/关闭/密码取消；被动记录文件创建引用删除和数据回放</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>数据恢复、栈显示和文件所有权分别验收；异常假设不当通用回滚；按根类型选择本地适配</dd></dl><p>历史密码取消、动作回放顺序与当前失败/释放边界</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C04</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5561454372ad01773e952122c3db0e0e7e649d2e5f489a78d6cab5250c427f87" href="../../证据/5561454372ad01773e952122c3db0e0e7e649d2e5f489a78d6cab5250c427f87.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5561454372ad</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C06 · 外部服务调度与故障隔离</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>全局触发/脚本/通信/设备服务的实际入口到执行链</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>服务由谁创建、触发流程、停止和保存</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>对A05每个服务建立子任务并REA取得原实现；无设备时先闭合managed/native调用，真实设备矩阵待资源</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每服务有显式证据/合同/错误和资源边界；没有设备证据不得标硬件闭合；不默认操作连接设备</dd></dl><p>函数源/MQ及通信换方案、触发即时写入和通信文件保护的有界调查；SDK生产/native与全服务仍未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C06</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="805ad58f7626bc5d5443e009993ac0439a586f104a7c488613d7b0d5547e6205" href="../../证据/805ad58f7626bc5d5443e009993ac0439a586f104a7c488613d7b0d5547e6205.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>805ad58f7626</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C08 · 执行与历史组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>原机同状态流程/Group/配置/历史综合链</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>运行编辑保存切换撤销之间是否存在状态污染</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>运行→编辑→停止→撤销→保存重开→再次运行；含嵌套、错误、取消和关闭</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每步结果/历史/文件/资源同时核对；独立重构差异显式保留</dd></dl><p>执行/历史组合验收：需运行、编辑、停止、撤销、保存重开和关闭的连续状态证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13fc665d3cc7e8867e5ff2c971b4aba671e67a2b2d42dc0cefeb1e14159816fc" href="../../证据/13fc665d3cc7e8867e5ff2c971b4aba671e67a2b2d42dc0cefeb1e14159816fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13fc665d3cc7</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>CP06 · 用户保存方案 → 插件持久化投影→JSON方案文件→编辑器提交</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>MainWindow将doc.PrepareSave接到plugins.PrepareSave(document,baseDirectory,executionScope)。GraphEditorDocument.Save向PrepareSave传入Copy(document)，插件注册表只对IToolAssetPersistence参与者调用其PrepareSave(node,catalog,procedureScope)，回收这些插件前缀资源并采用返回Node/Resources。随后重基路径、SolutionStore验证和序列化方案，经同目录临时文件Flush(true)+Move覆盖成功后编辑器才提交rebased文档。框架没有把scope有效参数或运行结果字典统一自动拷回所有节点。</p><p>菜单操作的配置、设计器缓冲、服务与历史数据入口：这条既有事实明确核实“用户保存方案 → 插件持久化投影→JSON方案文件→编辑器提交”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">布局XAML三缓冲、UserData投影、通信/触发配置与历史根不同；不能把一个保存按钮/通用JSON方案当作所有入口的数据事务。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本片段不展开每个IToolAssetPersistence参与者；不能宣称所有最后运行参数、缓存图像、SDK内部状态都能保存和重开恢复。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：插件PrepareSave在最终方案文件提交前可能有自身资产写入副作用；此处只证明方案文件提交顺序，不宣称全资产跨文件事务。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4cc28c3847610e14ba36a44eb663c05de11b3dc92d1ef8e32f727a9df0da8f8b" href="../../证据/4cc28c3847610e14ba36a44eb663c05de11b3dc92d1ef8e32f727a9df0da8f8b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4cc28c384761</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f" href="../../证据/9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9ed5d7beed27</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPluginContracts/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b2bf628ee4ba486c7fbcfdee3e2415c7500e722fd23ab5e41b6eb6270108c297" href="../../证据/b2bf628ee4ba486c7fbcfdee3e2415c7500e722fd23ab5e41b6eb6270108c297.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b2bf628ee4ba</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="df7dca5bb4adc6503a57abd82d22c53b76afed5b93a675e219260708e6f671c0" href="../../证据/df7dca5bb4adc6503a57abd82d22c53b76afed5b93a675e219260708e6f671c0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>df7dca5bb4ad</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CP01 · 工具配置Apply与编辑文档 → 经校验的JSON参数副本</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>常规工具配置窗口的Apply先核方案/目录/窗口与执行所有者，并在activeRun非null时拒绝修改，再取before、调用SetProcedureNodeParameters并更新有效参数缓存。CheckedParameters为每个JsonElement调用Clone，校验参数错误后交给文档编辑；Document getter又调用Copy，Copy重新分配节点参数字典并Clone各JSON值。因此正常全流程运行中不能把此Apply描述为允许实时修改本轮参数。</p><p>菜单操作的配置、设计器缓冲、服务与历史数据入口：这条既有事实明确核实“工具配置Apply与编辑文档 → 经校验的JSON参数副本”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">布局XAML三缓冲、UserData投影、通信/触发配置与历史根不同；不能把一个保存按钮/通用JSON方案当作所有入口的数据事务。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：此门只证明所选常规配置Apply路径；不能扩称所有API、插件内部状态和配置自执行期间都具有同一禁改门。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolConfigurationHost.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a09999e256e7d3f5243baa49d058628274441f93381c20c1638dc43bcb30c558" href="../../证据/a09999e256e7d3f5243baa49d058628274441f93381c20c1638dc43bcb30c558.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a09999e256e7</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4a9b1bacdb248b1a185f104853215d1a01da26c973fbe7067b23f675a1eee4a8" href="../../证据/4a9b1bacdb248b1a185f104853215d1a01da26c973fbe7067b23f675a1eee4a8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4a9b1bacdb24</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7e3dd26a78a6f3ad48dca542413add08c9d856a2466bf9521218391c64dca421" href="../../证据/7e3dd26a78a6f3ad48dca542413add08c9d856a2466bf9521218391c64dca421.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7e3dd26a78a6</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a847417041600ab2f5b154fb2ce08a9c2e4263894d69d712be4fb079e7d71ef8" href="../../证据/a847417041600ab2f5b154fb2ce08a9c2e4263894d69d712be4fb079e7d71ef8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a84741704160</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691" href="../../证据/dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dd3930e245ff</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP01 · 原UserData[key] → 按Parent.ID普通键或动态复合键读写SDK界面数据</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>UserData不是一个本地Dictionary。getter在Parent非活动或正在Dispose时返回null，否则调用SDK；setter在Parent为空或Dispose时直接返回。isUsedForDynamicUIParam决定路由：动态key用字面分隔符&amp;?;?拆分，array[0]为名字、array[1]（若有）为optional，更多片段没有继续传递；普通路由传完整key和Parent.ID。Parent.IsDynamicModu控制撤销分支，是另一项判断，不能等同isUsedForDynamicUIParam。</p><p>菜单操作的配置、设计器缓冲、服务与历史数据入口：这条既有事实明确核实“原UserData[key] → 按Parent.ID普通键或动态复合键读写SDK界面数据”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">布局XAML三缓冲、UserData投影、通信/触发配置与历史根不同；不能把一个保存按钮/通用JSON方案当作所有入口的数据事务。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：SDK界面数据的最终native容器/落盘结构不在这些托管体内；不把写入等同.sol保存完成。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5d5f72b163877a62e3b615b2f9fb99aa1518ecf4b9b3c3d99ffa903a6a1c6515" href="../../证据/5d5f72b163877a62e3b615b2f9fb99aa1518ecf4b9b3c3d99ffa903a6a1c6515.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5d5f72b16387</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="021de486f6931368f5bca8a45ade703eef229bbca4a0fb48cfe498ddf7d8fb74" href="../../证据/021de486f6931368f5bca8a45ade703eef229bbca4a0fb48cfe498ddf7d8fb74.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>021de486f693</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8f307bdc44b2ef96adcc362459be499c77588d06695e5cd326e800b9ed2025e7" href="../../证据/8f307bdc44b2ef96adcc362459be499c77588d06695e5cd326e800b9ed2025e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8f307bdc44b2</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP04 · 原UserData赋值 → 分支化撤销载荷持有，不是统一原子保存事务</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>全局模块以及CheckedImages/DESIGNERBUFFER/ConfigAvailable直接Set；动态ModifyConfig先登记AllUserData再Set，DynamicIO普通写绕过记录，其他动态分支有先记录或后记录差异。普通分支先Get旧byte[]、Set新值，再按引用不等及CheckItemParamReady特例登记。RecordSingleData将oldValue/newValue直接赋给UnRedo_UserData字段，没有该处数组深复制。AllUserData先保存表达式，CanRegister在允许的root操作且未重复时才Compile执行抓取；不能把表达式创建时点当快照完成时点。</p><p>菜单操作的配置、设计器缓冲、服务与历史数据入口：这条既有事实明确核实“原UserData赋值 → 分支化撤销载荷持有，不是统一原子保存事务”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">布局XAML三缓冲、UserData投影、通信/触发配置与历史根不同；不能把一个保存按钮/通用JSON方案当作所有入口的数据事务。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不把字节引用登记称深克隆；外部IUnRedoService是否接受/何时清记录、VmModule.GetAllUserData/SetUserData全量格式仍需独立追踪。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d7c92adfd1dd69857d2414aeebb68373772f3f2eb611ee60666f0af1faaa8e4d" href="../../证据/d7c92adfd1dd69857d2414aeebb68373772f3f2eb611ee60666f0af1faaa8e4d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d7c92adfd1dd</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ced43def5b4394e6f7306a84def49f5f1881459868a0774c4a27f63bb1ec61f4" href="../../证据/ced43def5b4394e6f7306a84def49f5f1881459868a0774c4a27f63bb1ec61f4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ced43def5b43</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="974f20afcc09e739f09fa161479cfac33a8d8690f2f051601ab5cab212cfe7b5" href="../../证据/974f20afcc09e739f09fa161479cfac33a8d8690f2f051601ab5cab212cfe7b5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>974f20afcc09</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8ce57591679d6d82fe6b8e7d697d2e994b4d229c8d6a0dc244a8fd9c3cef2614" href="../../证据/8ce57591679d6d82fe6b8e7d697d2e994b4d229c8d6a0dc244a8fd9c3cef2614.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8ce57591679d</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58ef8702b50b9d2e925ce3d8e91483253c4e045795f612f3f95fe1a07ffa2d53" href="../../证据/58ef8702b50b9d2e925ce3d8e91483253c4e045795f612f3f95fe1a07ffa2d53.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58ef8702b50b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PST04 · SaveAs的Copy/Rebase与SolutionStore.Save → 路径字段变换、文件提交、编辑器提交分离</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Copy给Resources建立新数组但仍使用原资源record引用；参数JsonElement.Clone、ROI顶点数组等另行快照。Rebase再次Copy，只改每个ResourceDocument.Path及ModuleId恰为vision.image-file的字符串Path参数：绝对路径原样保留，相对路径先按旧base解析，再相对新base表示。任意插件私有路径不被通用Rebase扫描；ImageSource自己的绝对化来自PST02。Rebase不复制外部图像或标定文件。SolutionStore.Save完成结构/JSON检查、临时文件写入Flush(true)、Move覆盖且finally正常结束后，doc才写document/BaseDirectory/FilePath/IsDirty/Revision并发Changed。</p><p>菜单操作的配置、设计器缓冲、服务与历史数据入口：这条既有事实明确核实“SaveAs的Copy/Rebase与SolutionStore.Save → 路径字段变换、文件提交、编辑器提交分离”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">布局XAML三缓冲、UserData投影、通信/触发配置与历史根不同；不能把一个保存按钮/通用JSON方案当作所有入口的数据事务。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原子覆盖的文件系统/崩溃持久性未在本切片实测；源码Flush/Move不能证明多文件事务。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：通用路径规则不保证每个插件资源的跨机器可移植性；只能按其具体参与者分支判断。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691" href="../../证据/dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dd3930e245ff</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d4648a8a412d138d0fb649560fd14fdf1e3a27237c7840666cb16b2ca444ecdd" href="../../证据/d4648a8a412d138d0fb649560fd14fdf1e3a27237c7840666cb16b2ca444ecdd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d4648a8a412d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f" href="../../证据/9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9ed5d7beed27</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a23434c51066e9ceceb3f9aa5a1974961608b8c315168113e404eba343362b1e" href="../../证据/a23434c51066e9ceceb3f9aa5a1974961608b8c315168113e404eba343362b1e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a23434c51066</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.ShellSaveSolution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8cfa41ffcb20e1ac55931082dac6b8a9424d52b4734d3012be8a9e4a2aee3bf1" href="../../证据/8cfa41ffcb20e1ac55931082dac6b8a9424d52b4734d3012be8a9e4a2aee3bf1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8cfa41ffcb20</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>configuration-hosts:H12 · FrontendEdit.Save(save2Solution,save2Design) → XAML序列化 → TempDesignerBuffer → 两种独立提交目标</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>设计面或DesignContext为null时返回；否则SaveDesignerToXamlCode→UTF8→MemoryStream写TempDesignerBuffer。save2Design直接把临时流赋DesignerBuffer；save2Solution读取临时流GetBuffer/Length建立新流赋SolutionDesignerBuffer，再清TempDesignerBuffer。path和isExcuteAction在所选方法体无读取。catch Exception记日志并显示错误，返回void；不能将方法名解释为直接写.sol文件或成功确认。</p><p>计划将A06归入F-04，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“菜单操作的配置、设计器缓冲、服务与历史数据入口”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。设计面序列化器/流扩展、共用底层byte[]生命周期、日志/UI失败及实际操作未验证；不将此方法与SaveAs文件导出合并。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/frontend-design-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="36f37017820b9180ab4c413c88977c5f4d339b2c3f807488e2e02c3c52ceefab" href="../../证据/36f37017820b9180ab4c413c88977c5f4d339b2c3f807488e2e02c3c52ceefab.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>36f37017820b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/frontend-design-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9143c9ea90fbaf9f164fdc69186be5626bfc36570bad5d05a278aeaac7c3576e" href="../../证据/9143c9ea90fbaf9f164fdc69186be5626bfc36570bad5d05a278aeaac7c3576e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9143c9ea90fb</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/frontend-design-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="471522e7bd8d40fc4da0d888a197092c0af999290baa074187ffcbf284224df4" href="../../证据/471522e7bd8d40fc4da0d888a197092c0af999290baa074187ffcbf284224df4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>471522e7bd8d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-managed/frontend-design/FrontendUI.Design.FrontendEdit.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6da56a955be0ccb8b792f5a1ab2c69df04abe4669dd451c41062aec1f85085fc" href="../../证据/6da56a955be0ccb8b792f5a1ab2c69df04abe4669dd451c41062aec1f85085fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6da56a955be0</small></a></details></details><details><summary>configuration-hosts:H13 · DocumentManager.SolutionDesignerBuffer setter → 替换本地流/摘要 → UserData[DESIGNERBUFFER]</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>setter先Dispose旧_solutionxml、赋新值并GetMd5，然后在try内将StringUtil.UTF8GetBytesPadZero(value.ToArray())写当前VmSolution.Instance.UserData[DESIGNERBUFFER]；catch仅记Info。GetMd5在try外，UserData失败不回滚先前字段变化。该字节字段仍需外层方案导出保存；不是此setter直接写磁盘。</p><p>计划将A06归入F-04，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“菜单操作的配置、设计器缓冲、服务与历史数据入口”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。GetMd5/UTF8GetBytesPadZero具体实现、UserData原native运输和.sol writer尚未在此恢复；写回字段不证明持久化成功。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/frontend-design-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="21334500e08d688048a7da77aa67655ead8b8e1cfe39147713d1c58d4f7ec649" href="../../证据/21334500e08d688048a7da77aa67655ead8b8e1cfe39147713d1c58d4f7ec649.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>21334500e08d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-managed/frontend-design/FrontendUI.Design.Helper.DocumentManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="572512dce12894bfecde1eac2e234853578b7f89b747ef2206422df1033604a2" href="../../证据/572512dce12894bfecde1eac2e234853578b7f89b747ef2206422df1033604a2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>572512dce128</small></a></details></details><details><summary>configuration-hosts:H14 · DocumentManager缓冲getter / NeedSave → 一次装载标志、去末字节XML与三份摘要</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>SolutionDesignerBuffer首次读取先置isSolutionDesignerBuffer_Loaded=true；UserData非null以Length-1建流，再XmlDocument.Load/OuterXml→UTF8，更新_solutionxml和_smd5/_dmd5；null走Init。catch记Info而不复位标志；若有流返回前Seek(0)。NeedSave仅在_tmd5非空时比较_smd5，NeedSaveForDesigner比较_dmd5；前者不是检查所有编辑器状态。FrontendEdit.No分支ResetBuffer只清临时并复位loaded位，与DocumentManager.ResetBuffer还Dispose/清_solutionxml不同。</p><p>计划将A06归入F-04，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“菜单操作的配置、设计器缓冲、服务与历史数据入口”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。默认Init文件、XML解析最终环境、末字节格式、空/坏字节失败后的旧数据及完整重试生命周期未验证；不能由Length-1推出所有输入均有效终止零格式。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/frontend-design-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7f80371f3304dc18b493cc9bb54478201a7335a66d7fac5521fe2ec99c5d94e4" href="../../证据/7f80371f3304dc18b493cc9bb54478201a7335a66d7fac5521fe2ec99c5d94e4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7f80371f3304</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/frontend-design-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="01d9029f6cd0b22361aad84c33b2e8c9ef541d16d8ecc51cb1768b1e2f3eee61" href="../../证据/01d9029f6cd0b22361aad84c33b2e8c9ef541d16d8ecc51cb1768b1e2f3eee61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>01d9029f6cd0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/frontend-design-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a2d1c7e8de31e379760b2ac7ebef80fbc4d54ba879d64b1aeda14f97d663f3f9" href="../../证据/a2d1c7e8de31e379760b2ac7ebef80fbc4d54ba879d64b1aeda14f97d663f3f9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a2d1c7e8de31</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/frontend-design-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a28e0428225a5193d77d458981d3c04df15a8a90b4ee1dd127223fc9a9103c1f" href="../../证据/a28e0428225a5193d77d458981d3c04df15a8a90b4ee1dd127223fc9a9103c1f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a28e0428225a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/frontend-design-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f5c13dce346eb30f3c051e9f14a6a5777d92de1b00d5e79b321ba082484b44e4" href="../../证据/f5c13dce346eb30f3c051e9f14a6a5777d92de1b00d5e79b321ba082484b44e4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f5c13dce346e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-managed/frontend-design/FrontendUI.Design.Helper.DocumentManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dd326030c7b356f73c5c3b8b4afba0dc40a14f32b6cb596dc458b08d1885aa10" href="../../证据/dd326030c7b356f73c5c3b8b4afba0dc40a14f32b6cb596dc458b08d1885aa10.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dd326030c7b3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-managed/frontend-design/FrontendUI.Design.Helper.DocumentManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="29909815c4a1eeb4a6a3034369d16c3e0701fc725fd78c69825a93f18679c8d1" href="../../证据/29909815c4a1eeb4a6a3034369d16c3e0701fc725fd78c69825a93f18679c8d1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>29909815c4a1</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-managed/frontend-design/FrontendUI.Design.FrontendEdit.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="24e635d20f68d652c94e9dacc04f8766228fe18f097a87d37902fe3ba361491a" href="../../证据/24e635d20f68d652c94e9dacc04f8766228fe18f097a87d37902fe3ba361491a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>24e635d20f68</small></a></details></details><details><summary>communication-dispatch:EA07 · SolutionCommInfo配置 → Base64解码XML → SolItems / Base64保存</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>LoadSolInfo非空时Base64解码后loadXml，为每个SolItem挂DeleteEventHander，再处理定时器与自动保存状态。SaveSolInfo将UTF8 XML转Base64写同一配置键，异常提示并吞掉。GetSolItem读取的正是该集合；编码不是加密，未证明所有方案/密码字段已持久化正确。</p><p>计划将C06归入F-04，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“菜单操作的配置、设计器缓冲、服务与历史数据入口”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。BaseNode XML字段映射、重复加载集合清理、timer完整生命周期、配置写入原子性及保存后重开未证。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VisionMaster.Exe.Audit/VisionMaster.AppMainWindow/SolutionItemsData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="df6bcabe4bf6b81def90f52d32e6120189d8e3de94d9568e928d55c32563505a" href="../../证据/df6bcabe4bf6b81def90f52d32e6120189d8e3de94d9568e928d55c32563505a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>df6bcabe4bf6</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VisionMaster.Exe.Audit/VisionMaster.AppMainWindow/SolutionItemsData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="90dbfc92c204d46e800d84f3ba7af43248ca65fbf2e69c8235472142c21761e4" href="../../证据/90dbfc92c204d46e800d84f3ba7af43248ca65fbf2e69c8235472142c21761e4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>90dbfc92c204</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VisionMaster.Exe.Audit/VisionMaster.AppMainWindow/SolutionItemsData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0ce4ab2236318a685718804e983ae255b9cb088358c6fc327c33e3db256cd86d" href="../../证据/0ce4ab2236318a685718804e983ae255b9cb088358c6fc327c33e3db256cd86d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0ce4ab223631</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/communication-dispatch-original-members.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="05aa3227cb022a353339ea946f079811b764f237d4e5f3332c16013a8aa6d62d" href="../../证据/05aa3227cb022a353339ea946f079811b764f237d4e5f3332c16013a8aa6d62d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>05aa3227cb02</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/communication-dispatch-original-members.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d37486884165d50225bbefba5c80678c1e05be7ab93a38ea39e517910502c4e4" href="../../证据/d37486884165d50225bbefba5c80678c1e05be7ab93a38ea39e517910502c4e4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d37486884165</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/communication-dispatch-original-members.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3d996071999775331a8d5a24cd8340038892f874216a4fbcd5110c63fd4bd6ca" href="../../证据/3d996071999775331a8d5a24cd8340038892f874216a4fbcd5110c63fd4bd6ca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3d9960719997</small></a></details></details><details><summary>history-replay:H05 · UnRedoSchedule.Register → 录入门 → BuildRoot / BuildPart</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>录入要求_unRedoing&lt;=0与_nLaziLoading&lt;=0；part需已有根且根未ForbidBuild；可选CanRegister也要求根并执行谓词。按IsPart分流，不将所有操作都当整文档快照。</p><p>计划将C01归入F-04，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“菜单操作的配置、设计器缓冲、服务与历史数据入口”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/batch16-20261019/B/unredo-source/UnRedoSchedule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ce9bd1b274704329013067bb9ff6d7447f571e6fc1615f0338b5ec187c36c772" href="../../证据/ce9bd1b274704329013067bb9ff6d7447f571e6fc1615f0338b5ec187c36c772.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ce9bd1b27470</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-05" id="F-05"><summary>F-05 · 工作流 Tab 与配置 · Tab配置身份、显示目标与实际运行请求</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：显示流程、运行根目标、Group内部图与每轮有效值需联合身份/时点表；主请求快照不证明原版实际运行Tab全分支。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>A03 · 流程Tab与Group导航</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>ProcedureConfigControl → VmProcedureDecorator.OpenGroupCommandExecute/UpCommandExecute</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>显示模块集、运行目标和历史视口是否独立</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>增删复制切换、嵌套进入返回、非活动Tab历史、运行停止、保存重开</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>身份/集合/导航链闭合；所有操作保持正确所属流程；导出入口另列</dd></dl><p>Group显示导航、父级返回及当前画布上下文片段；运行目标和完整Tab生命周期另待核</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A03</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8913b6e7fc8fe67d7f050d54b8022a5a373e66cee53f2ffcc901d16a4945d5dc" href="../../证据/8913b6e7fc8fe67d7f050d54b8022a5a373e66cee53f2ffcc901d16a4945d5dc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8913b6e7fc8f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>A08 · 壳与交互全状态验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>上述原事件与发布版真实主窗口</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>是否还有未映射入口/资源/手势</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按分支清单逐项原机同状态对照，补边界、截图与事件/值记录</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>列出的壳范围无遗漏；未支持服务显式开放，不按测试总数关闭领域</dd></dl><p>壳组合验收：需逐项对账实际入口、资源、手势与桌面矩阵；局部页面不能替代组合证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e" href="../../证据/32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>32e894e8e249</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C02 · 单次/连续/停止调度与参数准备</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>VmProcedure/VmSolution → ModuleManager/CollectionManager → 原生调度</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>调度顺序、上游准备、等待超时、停止回调和状态码</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>REA追native边界；空流程、禁用、失败、连续、停止、超时与重入各记回调/输出/状态</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>不是只对按钮状态；确定每轮清理配置有效值及结果；设备路径缺证据单列</dd></dl><p>连续/停止、等待与独立执行入口；native调度未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C02</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="051c92177bd5f7e599b8e1634fe1bc807d4c0ca0be246adbbaf045cea496242a" href="../../证据/051c92177bd5f7e599b8e1634fe1bc807d4c0ca0be246adbbaf045cea496242a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>051c92177bd5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>CP02 · 主流程启动与子流程调用 → 本次请求的JSON配置快照</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>MainWindow.RunCore先在调用线程用doc.Document构建SolutionWorkspace，再将workspace交Task.Run。SolutionExecutor.RunAsync再复制全部过程/节点参数，内部Execute和Group循环从这个document查子流程；GraphExecutor入口再复制目标图的参数。编辑文档后来替换JSON字段，不会替换已经捕获的本轮参数字典。ContinuousRun每次重新调用RunCore，故各轮具有各自的配置获取点；这不解除CP01的UI禁改门。</p><p>Tab配置身份、显示目标与实际运行请求：这条既有事实明确核实“主流程启动与子流程调用 → 本次请求的JSON配置快照”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">显示流程、运行根目标、Group内部图与每轮有效值需联合身份/时点表；主请求快照不证明原版实际运行Tab全分支。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：插件还可读取scope服务、运行状态、延迟输入读取器；这里只闭合JSON配置隔离，不能宣称整个执行环境不可变。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未执行线程竞争探针；不把静态复制链称为所有并发插件行为的运行证明。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="448e694dc315a2730a7d77260a9ee7ac5288f64fc4f58b95c4ffbeb90b71fb65" href="../../证据/448e694dc315a2730a7d77260a9ee7ac5288f64fc4f58b95c4ffbeb90b71fb65.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>448e694dc315</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="de8499c9502e975acd054f9babcb7931d2c02049a383ee86721d3ea436e73cff" href="../../证据/de8499c9502e975acd054f9babcb7931d2c02049a383ee86721d3ea436e73cff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>de8499c9502e</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9602b57c3aa8e64b1eb53daba79021f417e543ba392dfa007d5f7d07dd9479b" href="../../证据/b9602b57c3aa8e64b1eb53daba79021f417e543ba392dfa007d5f7d07dd9479b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9602b57c3aa</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e3c15660c826a8ad92f40bb1f45eb1dca0243ef458319ac966218ce2982698a5" href="../../证据/e3c15660c826a8ad92f40bb1f45eb1dca0243ef458319ac966218ce2982698a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e3c15660c826</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CP05 · 进入ExecuteAsync前的有效参数 → scope按过程/模块/节点保存Seed和Values</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor在ExecuteAsync之前调用RememberExecutionParameters；该方法分别Clone seed与applied，所以缓存不依赖模块执行结束才写入，失败/取消也可能留下本次入参。ReadEffectiveParameters先Clone缓存Values，再把当前配置中与Seed的GetRawText不同的字段覆盖进去；RememberConfigurationParameters又可更新已变字段。因此“有效参数”是供编辑器继续配置的托管视图，不能直接标成上次成功算法实际使用的精确历史记录或原生setter确认。</p><p>Tab配置身份、显示目标与实际运行请求：这条既有事实明确核实“进入ExecuteAsync前的有效参数 → scope按过程/模块/节点保存Seed和Values”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">显示流程、运行根目标、Group内部图与每轮有效值需联合身份/时点表；主请求快照不证明原版实际运行Tab全分支。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：没有逐工具核其如何消费每个参数、是否忽略字段、何时复制到native；这些不能从托管入参缓存替代取证。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：删除节点与旧在飞请求的全部竞争仍需具体调用时序验证，缓存删除不等于全局排空。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f" href="../../证据/2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2f3bad3dab71</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.Parameters.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c827a1b26669642473dd9503c7ecb82a7717b78fc37ff6822c8b360650721236" href="../../证据/c827a1b26669642473dd9503c7ecb82a7717b78fc37ff6822c8b360650721236.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c827a1b26669</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a718146e6141fe220b1543247b919e2340a695a52f504d083d0e0e7b70c241dc" href="../../证据/a718146e6141fe220b1543247b919e2340a695a52f504d083d0e0e7b70c241dc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a718146e6141</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9372e51b811508f8adfc9b4eb36b249716410bd671fd070fcb17e4eec1426fe4" href="../../证据/9372e51b811508f8adfc9b4eb36b249716410bd671fd070fcb17e4eec1426fe4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9372e51b8115</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CR01 · 新一轮开始 / 停止 / 抛取消异常 → 隐藏旧结果视图与保存旧会话是两个动作</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>BeginWorkflowResults增加过程执行计数，仅在count>1、workStatus非0且清旧结果偏好开启时，标记该过程及所调用子过程为cleared并清当前results视图；它不删除workflowSessions。RunCore返回session才StoreWorkflowCallResults覆盖对应会话并移除cleared标记。若Task.Run被取消或执行抛异常而没有返回session，catch只改状态文字，旧session仍在；偏好开启时可处于隐藏状态，未开启时也未由这个catch主动清除。工具栏停止只Cancel activeRun，FinishWorkflowRun清运行标记并Dispose该取消源，不清会话或插件scope状态。</p><p>Tab配置身份、显示目标与实际运行请求：这条既有事实明确核实“新一轮开始 / 停止 / 抛取消异常 → 隐藏旧结果视图与保存旧会话是两个动作”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">显示流程、运行根目标、Group内部图与每轮有效值需联合身份/时点表；主请求快照不证明原版实际运行Tab全分支。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：此事实仅区分返回session与抛异常两条路径，不把所有取消都判成保留旧会话；返回Cancelled session的覆盖路径见CR02。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/FrameworkExecutionPolicy.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f965f7e263d653379f09bb930ceffc1fd6b1db7b20df943285b27c215d28c8f" href="../../证据/4f965f7e263d653379f09bb930ceffc1fd6b1db7b20df943285b27c215d28c8f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f965f7e263d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/FrameworkExecutionPreferences.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8da1ce2ab5e98323b00b9a9e8eb7fdd47bb223e96ae34ec9499becea4e0cbfaf" href="../../证据/8da1ce2ab5e98323b00b9a9e8eb7fdd47bb223e96ae34ec9499becea4e0cbfaf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8da1ce2ab5e9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fe1cfce3cab105b405e736e1761f55727337ed8c18902455dc98b8e7bbba0751" href="../../证据/fe1cfce3cab105b405e736e1761f55727337ed8c18902455dc98b8e7bbba0751.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fe1cfce3cab1</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e6fb8499c2fb835c48d65b00944cf5ce1367b5afad61a5fb0d684b597688cce4" href="../../证据/e6fb8499c2fb835c48d65b00944cf5ce1367b5afad61a5fb0d684b597688cce4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e6fb8499c2fb</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3b3d33346a93968dde484b3816ea3552d288550b0cd0fabf19d02126f412d1b3" href="../../证据/3b3d33346a93968dde484b3816ea3552d288550b0cd0fabf19d02126f412d1b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3b3d33346a93</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f1555f4822151b0a56296c8cd9f8f3d38dea19055e2e48d6538369284f27fba4" href="../../证据/f1555f4822151b0a56296c8cd9f8f3d38dea19055e2e48d6538369284f27fba4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f1555f482215</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a5ec401f5dc603f1c1aa11208b567072cd67c74c72b42da3ec63d31b5069f16a" href="../../证据/a5ec401f5dc603f1c1aa11208b567072cd67c74c72b42da3ec63d31b5069f16a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a5ec401f5dc6</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e943375651b62f48f5f3c59e47fda53c2bed722dda5a0650e40bf894aa95277a" href="../../证据/e943375651b62f48f5f3c59e47fda53c2bed722dda5a0650e40bf894aa95277a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e943375651b6</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CR02 · GraphExecutor本轮取消 / 失败 / 跳过 → 本轮混合结果可替换上轮会话；旧插件状态另留</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor每轮新建records，不拿上一轮NodeRunRecord补失败节点。节点开始前发现取消会Record(Cancelled)且输出默认Empty；前驱失败或不可用会Record(Skipped)且输出Empty。单节点执行后取消/超时/异常与失败输出过滤按TD04生成本轮记录，已经成功完成的前序节点记录不因此统一清空。最终把全部本轮记录组成session，状态可为Cancelled/Failed/TimedOut。RunCore只检查owner、未以session成功作为发布前提，所以正常返回的取消/失败session也可替换workflowSessions，包含本轮早先成功节点图像与后续空输出。</p><p>Tab配置身份、显示目标与实际运行请求：这条既有事实明确核实“GraphExecutor本轮取消 / 失败 / 跳过 → 本轮混合结果可替换上轮会话；旧插件状态另留”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">显示流程、运行根目标、Group内部图与每轮有效值需联合身份/时点表；主请求快照不证明原版实际运行Tab全分支。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：Task.Run调度前取消或外层异常可能不产生session，需与CR01分别判断；未执行竞争、GC或内存峰值探针。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2082e9d411a4a1a24281e823dfce4b1fb47ddcaa18b7ec6f7289d79206574553" href="../../证据/2082e9d411a4a1a24281e823dfce4b1fb47ddcaa18b7ec6f7289d79206574553.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2082e9d411a4</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4a15fa5fe2346ec06b94f6f37f0d8c9fe42a4d9716719983bf953a2cac42f7d0" href="../../证据/4a15fa5fe2346ec06b94f6f37f0d8c9fe42a4d9716719983bf953a2cac42f7d0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4a15fa5fe234</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="416de0e82d27dffd4d0b19f69a6ea8f4c10011c3be64b9d4301f11429d793582" href="../../证据/416de0e82d27dffd4d0b19f69a6ea8f4c10011c3be64b9d4301f11429d793582.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>416de0e82d27</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3e4a043a6b139af31b1db3c6c72754feef3e05d76081bcdb1b1f812127a3de2e" href="../../证据/3e4a043a6b139af31b1db3c6c72754feef3e05d76081bcdb1b1f812127a3de2e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3e4a043a6b13</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e59c8e573396c2e41cd7fd0b21c07e060bddbfd552e1db6bd436e74f2e16c724" href="../../证据/e59c8e573396c2e41cd7fd0b21c07e060bddbfd552e1db6bd436e74f2e16c724.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e59c8e573396</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d05534cb90f898784350ce239f30d8b88468688dbfe8c8b60c5cc8b129ebda95" href="../../证据/d05534cb90f898784350ce239f30d8b88468688dbfe8c8b60c5cc8b129ebda95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d05534cb90f8</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>loading-navigation:N04 · DisplayModuleSet → 画布与配置目标</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DiagramArea 的 Procedure 和 ItemsSource 均取显示集合；配置按钮把 DisplayModuleSet 传给 ConfigParamsCommand。导航不是改变所属根流程执行对象。</p><p>计划将A03归入F-05，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“Tab配置身份、显示目标与实际运行请求”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。配置命令内部、模型替换/释放与模板投影将在配置视图中单独展开。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e196ca85916ba8a7c548c8c2ac9643aebf1a48a5b18ce9b7557691f1bfe3b9a8" href="../../证据/e196ca85916ba8a7c548c8c2ac9643aebf1a48a5b18ce9b7557691f1bfe3b9a8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e196ca85916b</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6fcba363253ce2033537f64a1d23f553a208aedfb957c75fe82a8ef749f7dd08" href="../../证据/6fcba363253ce2033537f64a1d23f553a208aedfb957c75fe82a8ef749f7dd08.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6fcba363253c</small></a></details></details><details><summary>execution-storage:M02 · StartRunCore → RunCore</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>拒绝已有 activeRun 或 CanStartWorkflow 失败；持有根流程 ID 与 CTS；finally 调用 FinishWorkflowRun。RunCore 捕获执行所有者与 scope、工作区，在 Task.Run 中调用 SolutionExecutor。</p><p>计划将C02归入F-05，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“Tab配置身份、显示目标与实际运行请求”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。节点/参数校验具体规则、所有者票据实现另属后续切片。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e4c9f993f214a03f9f19a21575376e5c441006a31e1d9dea63bf98202131cc8d" href="../../证据/e4c9f993f214a03f9f19a21575376e5c441006a31e1d9dea63bf98202131cc8d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e4c9f993f214</small></a></details></details><details><summary>execution-storage:M03 · SolutionExecutor.RunAsync → GraphExecutor.RunAsync</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>先校验并复制方案/参数；校验调用及资源；WaitTimeMs 使用链接 CTS，调用 GraphExecutor 后把等待超时导致的 Cancelled 改为 TimedOut。</p><p>计划将C02归入F-05，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“Tab配置身份、显示目标与实际运行请求”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。GraphExecutor 内部节点分支、Group 轮次和工具释放需单独展开，未由这一边关闭。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e05508700e964a7d1e23d33b262d51ec39a1dd8867bf2d9afbfe7066aaec4311" href="../../证据/e05508700e964a7d1e23d33b262d51ec39a1dd8867bf2d9afbfe7066aaec4311.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e05508700e96</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-06" id="F-06"><summary>F-06 · 工具箱、发现与装载 · 目录声明到注册工厂、实例与动态输出合同</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：目录/XML、已注册descriptor与实际可创建运行器是三份数据；惰性装载失败/刷新和Group回调仍需对象状态对照，目录数量不等于已实现。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>A01 · 工具加载与Group导入时序</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>ToolBoxData.UpdateLoad → VmSolution.internalImportGroup → AddModuleByInfo → Children</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>首次/悬停/展开/刷新及导入回调何时形成可用模型</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>独立实例记录对象身份、IsInit、集合计数、SDK回调与模型落地；损坏副本验证恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>事件顺序逐点匹配源码；缺Cs与构造失败分列；主宿主接入前合同明确</dd></dl><p>工具箱惰性装载、Group导入回调和当前分类载入；native回调生产与完整时序未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A01</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f609999cbaebfc22e2c5e53fc6ec07c330bf5aa61edd44b97333ed2537d3d4b1" href="../../证据/f609999cbaebfc22e2c5e53fc6ec07c330bf5aa61edd44b97333ed2537d3d4b1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f609999cbaeb</small></a></details></details><details><summary>A07 · 通用发现接入与缺插件体验</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>ToolNavigation/ModuleRegistry与已审查插件清单</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>目录到注册工厂、重复/版本/禁用的合同与呈现</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>用户选择插件提交后逐文件集成；展开拖放配置运行保存重开；缺失/不兼容/热刷新</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>至少一个真实插件消费；失败无悬挂节点；不扫描执行未知DLL；共享入口锁解除后实施</dd></dl><p>原工具类型构造和当前显式目录/能力注册片段；重复、版本、禁用与真实插件验收未全覆盖</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A07</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7949338c0b81661e00db76b2d4f74a41cb11c730f1164b92cdce561bc2f9090b" href="../../证据/7949338c0b81661e00db76b2d4f74a41cb11c730f1164b92cdce561bc2f9090b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7949338c0b81</small></a></details></details><details><summary>A08 · 壳与交互全状态验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>上述原事件与发布版真实主窗口</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>是否还有未映射入口/资源/手势</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按分支清单逐项原机同状态对照，补边界、截图与事件/值记录</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>列出的壳范围无遗漏；未支持服务显式开放，不按测试总数关闭领域</dd></dl><p>壳组合验收：需逐项对账实际入口、资源、手势与桌面矩阵；局部页面不能替代组合证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e" href="../../证据/32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>32e894e8e249</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>loading-navigation:L03 · ToolBoxData.UpdateLoad → IsInit → 目录/XML → 扁平集合替换</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>null、Lang_Tools 或 IsInit 提前返回；在目录枚举前置 IsInit=true；无首占位项则直接返回。否则清组、解析 XML、排序、插入真实项、移除占位并通知 ToolSource。</p><p>计划将A01归入F-06，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“目录声明到注册工厂、实例与动态输出合同”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。本地无 catch/finally 不等于全局无异常处理；未做原机故障注入。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.Data/VMControls.Data/ToolBoxData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7e6ceb7e9c9f198cdd967784da3ae79d65de55134215afc8b589865ecad6a004" href="../../证据/7e6ceb7e9c9f198cdd967784da3ae79d65de55134215afc8b589865ecad6a004.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7e6ceb7e9c9f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>loading-navigation:L10 · VmModuleSet.AddModuleByInfo → 构造 → Name+ID 去重 → Modules 替换</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>先 CreatModuleByInfo，再查 Name+ID；重复时返回旧实例，否则加新实例；最后替换 VmModuleCollection。Modules setter 发 Modules 和 Children 通知。</p><p>计划将A01归入F-06，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“目录声明到注册工厂、实例与动态输出合同”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModuleSet.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ba077fb8863db596d14ef8dc10d9a66bef421fd9ac7dfce2629c87be32b79186" href="../../证据/ba077fb8863db596d14ef8dc10d9a66bef421fd9ac7dfce2629c87be32b79186.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ba077fb8863d</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModuleSet.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89882b4f9821ce930657434f461abf641dbc6571c25cc8ce4cada49cbbb1fa2c" href="../../证据/89882b4f9821ce930657434f461abf641dbc6571c25cc8ce4cada49cbbb1fa2c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89882b4f9821</small></a></details></details><details><summary>loading-navigation:C03 · ReadCategoryTools / RefreshToolCatalog → 显式插件合同注册 / 新分类状态</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>读取 JSON；声明 Implementation 才按身份加载并注册，拒绝已注册身份；刷新清目录/分类状态与失败会话，重建工具栏。不是执行原 InfoCs 目录协议。</p><p>计划将A07归入F-06，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“目录声明到注册工厂、实例与动态输出合同”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。ManagedToolCatalogLoadSession 内部二进制装载、注册事务和版本合同需另图。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolNavigation.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="08de1279004c2fc47c2f6a030afb41a35a9ccaaae17321dd42bf515bd81a6c36" href="../../证据/08de1279004c2fc47c2f6a030afb41a35a9ccaaae17321dd42bf515bd81a6c36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>08de1279004c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolNavigation.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9bd218aa73c8a50b9aa1bacb16f23eea950adcd002171686ddd6a52e247db133" href="../../证据/9bd218aa73c8a50b9aa1bacb16f23eea950adcd002171686ddd6a52e247db133.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9bd218aa73c8</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-07" id="F-07"><summary>F-07 · 节点交互 · 节点位置、选择、拖放数据与历史捕获</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：节点几何、选中集合、拖拽暂态和已提交文档必须分开；数据页未形成坐标写入→撤销载荷→保存的节点编辑链。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>A04 · 节点手势、路由和视口</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>DiagramItem/DiagramArea/DiagramPage/ZoomArea输入和连接事件</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>全部手势路由、坐标空间、避障及焦点分支</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按原事件分支覆盖拖放/多选/粘贴/连接/插入/反向拖动/鹰眼与DPI</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每分支有公式与状态证据；桌面输入和宿主事件分别验收；极端坐标无静默偏差</dd></dl><p>节点、连线/避障及视口手势的选定原分支与当前消费者；全手势/极端布局未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A04</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a0ad015615623bac4c76a80aeff9ac2dbef89124d8a3d4de50ccfd58364db9a5" href="../../证据/a0ad015615623bac4c76a80aeff9ac2dbef89124d8a3d4de50ccfd58364db9a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a0ad01561562</small></a></details></details><details><summary>A08 · 壳与交互全状态验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>上述原事件与发布版真实主窗口</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>是否还有未映射入口/资源/手势</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按分支清单逐项原机同状态对照，补边界、截图与事件/值记录</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>列出的壳范围无遗漏；未支持服务显式开放，不按测试总数关闭领域</dd></dl><p>壳组合验收：需逐项对账实际入口、资源、手势与桌面矩阵；局部页面不能替代组合证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e" href="../../证据/32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>32e894e8e249</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>canvas-viewport:A03 · ItemsPage.GetDropItems → 5 像素吸附 / 每节点独立夹边</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>拖放坐标 Math.Round(value/5)*5；按每个节点相对最小 X/Y 的偏移算位置，再分别夹到 0..DiagramPageWidth-ActualWidth/Height。DoDropItems 将列表作为 OnDropItems 参数。</p><p>计划将A04归入F-07，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“节点位置、选择、拖放数据与历史捕获”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。后续模型位置、复制与插入分支未由这个坐标函数一并证明。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/ItemsPage.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9795d4eeb488e7dd6cf24a94748223df13bbca90a5abe02697ab886c101022e9" href="../../证据/9795d4eeb488e7dd6cf24a94748223df13bbca90a5abe02697ab886c101022e9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9795d4eeb488</small></a></details></details><details><summary>canvas-viewport:CA01 · NodeDown / SetBoxSelection → 选中、双击与可编辑边界</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前参数窗只拦 ClickCount&lt;2；双击 Group 进入、其它节点开配置；框选用 NodeBounds 完全包含。EditableCanvas 另有 windowClosed/lock/run/overview/currentProcedure 等守卫。</p><p>计划将A04归入F-07，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“节点位置、选择、拖放数据与历史捕获”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。原版 Tag is Button 例外不能从当前 ClickCount 分支推断为同构。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowCanvas.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="00d98056dd357f8167bdb1085150219e818dc2d178695905013497b840b79111" href="../../证据/00d98056dd357f8167bdb1085150219e818dc2d178695905013497b840b79111.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>00d98056dd35</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowGestures.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b3201744eac29160eca61da586952b3c9a5f9c21006a55771eebfdd94745e787" href="../../证据/b3201744eac29160eca61da586952b3c9a5f9c21006a55771eebfdd94745e787.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b3201744eac2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowGestures.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="78c04bfb39df8774fee774419d88a784e2dab7693ae168106e1072b2a96f2f96" href="../../证据/78c04bfb39df8774fee774419d88a784e2dab7693ae168106e1072b2a96f2f96.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>78c04bfb39df</small></a></details></details><details><summary>canvas-viewport:A04 · 完整手势/OLE 拖放 → 模型位置 / 历史 / 插入 / 取消</summary><p>unknown</p><p>本页只确认部分预览、选中与坐标生成；完整拖放资源绑定到各复制/移动/插入/撤销分支还须逐段展开。</p><p>计划将A04归入F-07，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“节点位置、选择、拖放数据与历史捕获”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。失焦、窗口关闭、跨画布、锁定期间的全部 OLE 取消时序未运行确认。</p></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-08" id="F-08"><summary>F-08 · 连线与避障 · 连接预览、拓扑提交、路径几何与持久化</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：执行连线、数据订阅与显示折线三类数据不能互代；尚需临时预览→提交/取消→历史→存储的具体字段与退化布局表。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>A04 · 节点手势、路由和视口</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>DiagramItem/DiagramArea/DiagramPage/ZoomArea输入和连接事件</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>全部手势路由、坐标空间、避障及焦点分支</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按原事件分支覆盖拖放/多选/粘贴/连接/插入/反向拖动/鹰眼与DPI</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每分支有公式与状态证据；桌面输入和宿主事件分别验收；极端坐标无静默偏差</dd></dl><p>节点、连线/避障及视口手势的选定原分支与当前消费者；全手势/极端布局未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A04</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a0ad015615623bac4c76a80aeff9ac2dbef89124d8a3d4de50ccfd58364db9a5" href="../../证据/a0ad015615623bac4c76a80aeff9ac2dbef89124d8a3d4de50ccfd58364db9a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a0ad01561562</small></a></details></details><details><summary>A08 · 壳与交互全状态验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>上述原事件与发布版真实主窗口</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>是否还有未映射入口/资源/手势</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按分支清单逐项原机同状态对照，补边界、截图与事件/值记录</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>列出的壳范围无遗漏；未支持服务显式开放，不按测试总数关闭领域</dd></dl><p>壳组合验收：需逐项对账实际入口、资源、手势与桌面矩阵；局部页面不能替代组合证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e" href="../../证据/32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>32e894e8e249</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>canvas-viewport:W03 · DiagramItem.Connect / OnConnect 资源 → VmModuleBaseDecorator.ConnectCommandExecute</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Connect 发送 target.DataContext、源端口和目标端口；XAML 的 ParamsEventCommand 绑定 ConnectCommand；处理体把三项传给 VMAddConnection。</p><p>计划将A04归入F-08，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“连接预览、拓扑提交、路径几何与持久化”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/DiagramItem.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="78c196b7852742a405d4a3c818d38ef17fb0ffd92dd148800830dc58bd1080f4" href="../../证据/78c196b7852742a405d4a3c818d38ef17fb0ffd92dd148800830dc58bd1080f4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>78c196b78527</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/DiagramItem.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a895cc830cedcaa6c59c0b67708d368d1af838a60ff5a346e079e2eeae1c0425" href="../../证据/a895cc830cedcaa6c59c0b67708d368d1af838a60ff5a346e079e2eeae1c0425.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a895cc830ced</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/VmModuleBaseDecorator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="24ee0faeb11b184c575ff7aeff9f99dce4663ced04c9fbc7dd35ab8c77135ce1" href="../../证据/24ee0faeb11b184c575ff7aeff9f99dce4663ced04c9fbc7dd35ab8c77135ce1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>24ee0faeb11b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>canvas-viewport:W08 · DiagramPage.GetPath → 全障碍 A* → 端点重试 → 后处理</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>先按全部矩形构图，以 5 像素偏移端点寻路；少于 3 点改为只用端点矩形重试；仍短则构建回退拐点。最后 OptimizeLinePoints、加实际锚点、GetTurnPoints 与 RechargeLinePoints。</p><p>计划将A04归入F-08，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“连接预览、拓扑提交、路径几何与持久化”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/DiagramPage.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4462eb49ebcb7bd522fa75fd5517c8498a582f4ab86c45018fbb0c31b24e8e6" href="../../证据/f4462eb49ebcb7bd522fa75fd5517c8498a582f4ab86c45018fbb0c31b24e8e6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4462eb49ebc</small></a></details></details><details><summary>canvas-viewport:CA03 · UpdateConnectionPreview / FinishConnection → 保留预览目标 → ConnectExecution</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>预览路径按指针生成；松手保留上一命中节点、重新选最近端口，不在 Up 临时发现新节点；清捕获与 preview 后在 EditableCanvas 下提交。</p><p>计划将A04归入F-08，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“连接预览、拓扑提交、路径几何与持久化”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowGestures.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2c78a08175d53ac7f9edab58e17e60114528ae5bd76852a12831b8cb96a73c5b" href="../../证据/2c78a08175d53ac7f9edab58e17e60114528ae5bd76852a12831b8cb96a73c5b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2c78a08175d5</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowGestures.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8f55b4d8053e122d29a426289ea0bdf015e782a1ca40c82c76064288b73403b5" href="../../证据/8f55b4d8053e122d29a426289ea0bdf015e782a1ca40c82c76064288b73403b5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8f55b4d8053e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>canvas-viewport:W09 · 自动寻路 / 手动折线编辑 → 全部退化布局和持久化</summary><p>unknown</p><p>本页有自动路由入口和局部生命周期，不将全部重叠、DPI、手动折线重写及 SDK/存储语义推断为完成。</p><p>计划将A04归入F-08，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“连接预览、拓扑提交、路径几何与持久化”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。手动拖线/插入/保存原生 UserData、极端 A* 路径与原机事件顺序待细化。</p></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-09" id="F-09"><summary>F-09 · 视口与小地图 · 视口会话、缩放/偏移、小地图与坐标空间</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：视口是按画布身份缓存的UI数据，不是图像像素缓存；跨流程/方案恢复、DPI和无效坐标尚需有界状态表。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>A04 · 节点手势、路由和视口</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>DiagramItem/DiagramArea/DiagramPage/ZoomArea输入和连接事件</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>全部手势路由、坐标空间、避障及焦点分支</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按原事件分支覆盖拖放/多选/粘贴/连接/插入/反向拖动/鹰眼与DPI</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每分支有公式与状态证据；桌面输入和宿主事件分别验收；极端坐标无静默偏差</dd></dl><p>节点、连线/避障及视口手势的选定原分支与当前消费者；全手势/极端布局未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A04</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a0ad015615623bac4c76a80aeff9ac2dbef89124d8a3d4de50ccfd58364db9a5" href="../../证据/a0ad015615623bac4c76a80aeff9ac2dbef89124d8a3d4de50ccfd58364db9a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a0ad01561562</small></a></details></details><details><summary>A08 · 壳与交互全状态验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>上述原事件与发布版真实主窗口</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>是否还有未映射入口/资源/手势</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按分支清单逐项原机同状态对照，补边界、截图与事件/值记录</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>列出的壳范围无遗漏；未支持服务显式开放，不按测试总数关闭领域</dd></dl><p>壳组合验收：需逐项对账实际入口、资源、手势与桌面矩阵；局部页面不能替代组合证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e" href="../../证据/32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>32e894e8e249</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>canvas-viewport:V01 · ZoomArea.OnPreviewMouseWheel → Shift 横滚 → Ctrl 缩放</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>先 OnHoriScroll 再 OnChangeZoom；Shift 按 Delta 正负 LineLeft/Right 并 Handled=true；Ctrl 在非零 Delta 改一档后 DoChangeZoom。Ctrl+Shift 两支都执行。</p><p>计划将A04归入F-09，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“视口会话、缩放/偏移、小地图与坐标空间”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/ZoomArea.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c53afa420bd9675061f1c6aacc394ddc6a32c473113a77cf5342b404b493ca09" href="../../证据/c53afa420bd9675061f1c6aacc394ddc6a32c473113a77cf5342b404b493ca09.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c53afa420bd9</small></a></details></details><details><summary>canvas-viewport:V05 · 鹰眼 Down / Move / Up / Wheel → 点击重定位 / 按初始位置拖动 / 释放</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>点在选框外先把选框中心移到指针并记请求坐标；Move 用初始鼠标/区域位置求总差量，按下且移动后捕获；Up 清标志并释放。鹰眼滚轮先 Shift 横滚，再转换网格锚点给 Ctrl 缩放。</p><p>计划将A04归入F-09，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“视口会话、缩放/偏移、小地图与坐标空间”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/ZoomArea.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d218b655f83532fbed845605856d985307402a8cc64fe233d4b642c47425a731" href="../../证据/d218b655f83532fbed845605856d985307402a8cc64fe233d4b642c47425a731.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d218b655f835</small></a></details></details><details><summary>canvas-viewport:CV03 · 总览切换 / 进入流程 → 保存视口会话 → 清当前画布身份 → RenderGraph</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>总览切换保存 scale/pan；从总览进流程前保存 __solution、清 canvasProcedure。RenderGraph 切目标恢复会话偏移，并始终从当前容器 CanvasZoomIndex 重读缩放。</p><p>计划将A04归入F-09，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“视口会话、缩放/偏移、小地图与坐标空间”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。一个 GraphLayer 换视口是独立实现，不是原版两套 ZoomArea 控件树。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowOverview.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dff2a43210288159370f4a8ffb597105fc7cf5bbfaa14b0a94349ba99d137188" href="../../证据/dff2a43210288159370f4a8ffb597105fc7cf5bbfaa14b0a94349ba99d137188.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dff2a4321028</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowCanvas.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a0a74fbafa4e5fd0c34553ff0a1c7a8def4a07d2949ce0509a6e9719d137c1f3" href="../../证据/a0a74fbafa4e5fd0c34553ff0a1c7a8def4a07d2949ce0509a6e9719d137c1f3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a0a74fbafa4e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>canvas-viewport:V06 · 原版视口状态 → 跨方案 / 多 DPI / 渲染与线程</summary><p>unknown</p><p>本页恢复 UserData 写入及鼠标几何，不将它等同为所有视口偏移和皮肤已持久化/差分一致。</p><p>计划将A04归入F-09，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“视口会话、缩放/偏移、小地图与坐标空间”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。原文件字节持久化、独立控件状态恢复、零 extent/多屏 DPI/路由事件竞争和实际渲染仍开放。</p></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-10" id="F-10"><summary>F-10 · Group 身份与所有权 · Group身份、代理、父链、复制与原生记录</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：同名嵌套/跨方案Group的身份重映射和内部引用不能由数组复制证明；VmServer/UI/mdata记录与对象身份尚未完整闭合。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>A01 · 工具加载与Group导入时序</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>ToolBoxData.UpdateLoad → VmSolution.internalImportGroup → AddModuleByInfo → Children</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>首次/悬停/展开/刷新及导入回调何时形成可用模型</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>独立实例记录对象身份、IsInit、集合计数、SDK回调与模型落地；损坏副本验证恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>事件顺序逐点匹配源码；缺Cs与构造失败分列；主宿主接入前合同明确</dd></dl><p>工具箱惰性装载、Group导入回调和当前分类载入；native回调生产与完整时序未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A01</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f609999cbaebfc22e2c5e53fc6ec07c330bf5aa61edd44b97333ed2537d3d4b1" href="../../证据/f609999cbaebfc22e2c5e53fc6ec07c330bf5aa61edd44b97333ed2537d3d4b1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f609999cbaeb</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B02 · Group身份、所有权和复制</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>VmModuleSet/IMVSGroup/VmGroupDecorator的新增复制删除与父链</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>嵌套/同名/跨方案身份及引用如何恢复</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>追踪ID/FullName/GUID及Parent；复制、改名、删除撤销、粘贴、导入gro、保存重开</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>节点/代理/引用/内部图始终指向正确实例；独立跨顶层兼容保留标签</dd></dl><p>模块导入落地、父导航和当前Group所有权片段；新增/复制/删除与跨方案身份全集未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B02</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="04bfe1b09adbaac3e9f14109f4c8d59101285bc4277b13a0d9e3a7da82f62b23" href="../../证据/04bfe1b09adbaac3e9f14109f4c8d59101285bc4277b13a0d9e3a7da82f62b23.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>04bfe1b09adb</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B08 · 模型与Group组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>真实插件、嵌套Group、变量、ROI与历史持久化组合</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>单项通过后组合是否保持身份和数据一致</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>混合类型/多层/循环中断/累积/改型/撤销/保存重开/停止失败恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每场景对照原机输出和状态；失败不读陈旧结果；组合未知仍开放</dd></dl><p>模型/Group组合验收：需嵌套、变量、累积、保存重开和再次运行的同场景证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e" href="../../证据/4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f3a8f2e940f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D03 · 原生容器与对象数据映射</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>VmServer/UI/mdata/绑定/策略/流程记录原始读写成员</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>字段类型、身份、默认、缺失与未知段如何表达</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按方案/流程/Group/变量/资源拆原函数级子任务；生成字段→成员→操作映射与正反例</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每已识别字段有读写链和差分；原始未知字节保留；不凭相似编码命名格式</dd></dl><p>仅UserData字节写入与模块落地子路径；VmServer/UI/mdata全字段读写映射未恢复</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D03</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eec94f8663ac39f7af480808c24d1d16364523a1121d4390d6f748a064c0b43e" href="../../证据/eec94f8663ac39f7af480808c24d1d16364523a1121d4390d6f748a064c0b43e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eec94f8663ac</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>CP02 · 主流程启动与子流程调用 → 本次请求的JSON配置快照</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>MainWindow.RunCore先在调用线程用doc.Document构建SolutionWorkspace，再将workspace交Task.Run。SolutionExecutor.RunAsync再复制全部过程/节点参数，内部Execute和Group循环从这个document查子流程；GraphExecutor入口再复制目标图的参数。编辑文档后来替换JSON字段，不会替换已经捕获的本轮参数字典。ContinuousRun每次重新调用RunCore，故各轮具有各自的配置获取点；这不解除CP01的UI禁改门。</p><p>Group身份、代理、父链、复制与原生记录：这条既有事实明确核实“主流程启动与子流程调用 → 本次请求的JSON配置快照”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">同名嵌套/跨方案Group的身份重映射和内部引用不能由数组复制证明；VmServer/UI/mdata记录与对象身份尚未完整闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：插件还可读取scope服务、运行状态、延迟输入读取器；这里只闭合JSON配置隔离，不能宣称整个执行环境不可变。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未执行线程竞争探针；不把静态复制链称为所有并发插件行为的运行证明。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="448e694dc315a2730a7d77260a9ee7ac5288f64fc4f58b95c4ffbeb90b71fb65" href="../../证据/448e694dc315a2730a7d77260a9ee7ac5288f64fc4f58b95c4ffbeb90b71fb65.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>448e694dc315</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="de8499c9502e975acd054f9babcb7931d2c02049a383ee86721d3ea436e73cff" href="../../证据/de8499c9502e975acd054f9babcb7931d2c02049a383ee86721d3ea436e73cff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>de8499c9502e</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9602b57c3aa8e64b1eb53daba79021f417e543ba392dfa007d5f7d07dd9479b" href="../../证据/b9602b57c3aa8e64b1eb53daba79021f417e543ba392dfa007d5f7d07dd9479b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9602b57c3aa</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e3c15660c826a8ad92f40bb1f45eb1dca0243ef458319ac966218ce2982698a5" href="../../证据/e3c15660c826a8ad92f40bb1f45eb1dca0243ef458319ac966218ce2982698a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e3c15660c826</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG01 · SolutionExecutor.RunAsync与OwnedGroups.Validate → 独占Group body身份及运行文档快照</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>RunAsync先ValidateStructure，其内调用OwnedGroups.Validate：body.GroupOwner是(parentProcedureId,nodeId)，父节点必须为workflow.subprogram且Call.ProcedureId指回body；全solution只能一个节点引用该owned body，所有权链限制三层并拒循环。随后solution快照复制Resources/Procedures、连接、执行边和节点；参数JsonElement逐项Clone，ROI vertices与Call/GroupBreak及Configuration另建结构容器。owned配置先GroupDisplayLinks.Synchronize再Snapshot，不等于保留原文档所有引用。</p><p>Group身份、代理、父链、复制与原生记录：这条既有事实明确核实“SolutionExecutor.RunAsync与OwnedGroups.Validate → 独占Group body身份及运行文档快照”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">同名嵌套/跨方案Group的身份重映射和内部引用不能由数组复制证明；VmServer/UI/mdata记录与对象身份尚未完整闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本次只核当前托管合同，不证明原版GroupOwner或原native布局一致；线程并发编辑的完整宿主锁域未在这里验证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f7ba53a0bc2b392acd5a1ef1f14371a34f051b80499eb27994d1d0c049b108a" href="../../证据/0f7ba53a0bc2b392acd5a1ef1f14371a34f051b80499eb27994d1d0c049b108a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f7ba53a0bc2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9e356616eb63325c05f687e21d4b9a6bad5f215516fb1524822c4a689aabb6d3" href="../../证据/9e356616eb63325c05f687e21d4b9a6bad5f215516fb1524822c4a689aabb6d3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9e356616eb63</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b679c89ae0be237a30b1b002073caa29f03682651e144df1404fbc7234ab2ef6" href="../../证据/b679c89ae0be237a30b1b002073caa29f03682651e144df1404fbc7234ab2ef6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b679c89ae0be</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="394b1008ef359ce254da96465a7eda76f37ae377601d1260bd923e9879796696" href="../../证据/394b1008ef359ce254da96465a7eda76f37ae377601d1260bd923e9879796696.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>394b1008ef35</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/OwnedGroups.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f5268709d8a46ee585b5cab40d9e116f74235ce4670d825302fe8acc9ff55429" href="../../证据/f5268709d8a46ee585b5cab40d9e116f74235ce4670d825302fe8acc9ff55429.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f5268709d8a4</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowConfiguration.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3cad7f7309cec081a6cdf39b8fec31aef95eeebf8ea53716075fce851b101a8a" href="../../证据/3cad7f7309cec081a6cdf39b8fec31aef95eeebf8ea53716075fce851b101a8a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3cad7f7309ce</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG02 · 父GraphExecutor的workflow.subprogram节点 → 参数/输入处理后进入owned body Call闭包</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>父GraphExecutor先从本轮records建立nodeInputs，再解析Subscriptions覆盖输入或参数、执行Coerce，之后才创建节点linked token。workflow.subprogram分支不registry.Create普通模块，而把Parameters=本轮参数字典及GroupBreak.Capture所得绑定放入node副本，传只读包装nodeInputs交callProcedure。SolutionExecutor.Call按node.Call.ProcedureId找body；GroupOwner为null直接单次Execute，有owner才进入Task.Run的Group循环。Task.Run包整个循环，不是ReadyQueue或各轮并行。</p><p>Group身份、代理、父链、复制与原生记录：这条既有事实明确核实“父GraphExecutor的workflow.subprogram节点 → 参数/输入处理后进入owned body Call闭包”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">同名嵌套/跨方案Group的身份重映射和内部引用不能由数组复制证明；VmServer/UI/mdata记录与对象身份尚未完整闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：父nodeInputs与payload本身是否可变取决于具体PortValue/工具数据类型；只读字典不代表深不可变图像内存。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b74c494bfaa76018bdedeefa2aef2a23fbdce9ae9b5df36f0bdb910f34fb433d" href="../../证据/b74c494bfaa76018bdedeefa2aef2a23fbdce9ae9b5df36f0bdb910f34fb433d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b74c494bfaa7</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="894ec88445bf80f6520757a6d193b2d130a7051f985140a3e554d1d8f0d89191" href="../../证据/894ec88445bf80f6520757a6d193b2d130a7051f985140a3e554d1d8f0d89191.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>894ec88445bf</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="707f8ba6e860d6cc03bbb4b47126cd3e3fc57514ef78e284339feae2d851353d" href="../../证据/707f8ba6e860d6cc03bbb4b47126cd3e3fc57514ef78e284339feae2d851353d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>707f8ba6e860</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OG01 · 原DoWork进入循环前 → 一次准备输入与输出描述列表</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoWork先调用a4a00，再调用a74c0(this,this+0x180,&amp;本次输出列表)，二者位于逐轮循环之前。a4a00构造原字符串input并交a4a90(this,this+0x170,input)；后者按类型分派输入准备helper。a74c0逐个读取配置描述，向12e200传递上下文、类型与名称，只有其返回0才复制名称/模式到临时描述并把描述加入本次列表，失败分支记录日志后继续其它条目。输入配置、临时输出描述和每轮结果不是同一对象。</p><p>Group身份、代理、父链、复制与原生记录：这条既有事实明确核实“原DoWork进入循环前 → 一次准备输入与输出描述列表”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">同名嵌套/跨方案Group的身份重映射和内部引用不能由数组复制证明；VmServer/UI/mdata记录与对象身份尚未完整闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：输入typed准备helper10450/10ab0/117a0等未在本切片逐体恢复，输入数据复制/共享不以方法名推定。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：12e200交12dcb0建立typed目标的具体动态绑定尚未补体；第5参数已核，但不把其载荷与其它专题的活实例直接合并。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8bbf5e1771f266c593c2492985e83911fb61b70aecb5cf582cfcd37a75f196d8" href="../../证据/8bbf5e1771f266c593c2492985e83911fb61b70aecb5cf582cfcd37a75f196d8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8bbf5e1771f2</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cd8eac6d74b37821d66d9cf04bea5a3ae663bca302708b8a9e189b6f650c1bcb" href="../../证据/cd8eac6d74b37821d66d9cf04bea5a3ae663bca302708b8a9e189b6f650c1bcb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cd8eac6d74b3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a4a00.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1a1363a4345a8fcd9bb8bc170621d64a543a82a6dd4e1d0440ef42eac3a113fa" href="../../证据/1a1363a4345a8fcd9bb8bc170621d64a543a82a6dd4e1d0440ef42eac3a113fa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1a1363a4345a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a4a90.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="337f38544b8ff26e8720c835a1dd3cf368b965c54fcf647856bfec2b85ad5ffb" href="../../证据/337f38544b8ff26e8720c835a1dd3cf368b965c54fcf647856bfec2b85ad5ffb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>337f38544b8f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a74c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="adee30a66c868c5bd851ef339e276fcfc091f29879e18c41f267f43b4ea8579f" href="../../证据/adee30a66c868c5bd851ef339e276fcfc091f29879e18c41f267f43b4ea8579f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>adee30a66c86</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a74c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b2066869955fbb020b77c0546bcd6c9a2cec15a726c14856c673a9f34f5714e6" href="../../证据/b2066869955fbb020b77c0546bcd6c9a2cec15a726c14856c673a9f34f5714e6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b2066869955f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/18012e200.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e169d5235169654703c8f4b012097846aca164e34ab5884d51a612b959947cce" href="../../证据/e169d5235169654703c8f4b012097846aca164e34ab5884d51a612b959947cce.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e169d5235169</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/selected-strings.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c" href="../../证据/d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d216d954d532</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>group-control:C03 · SolutionExecutor.Call → 拥有 Group body 才运行循环</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>无 GroupOwner 的旧跨流程调用直接单次 Execute；有 owner 才建循环/累积器。开始前结构、调用、break 约束与资源验证分别执行，不把可调用当 Group 所有权成立。</p><p>计划将B02归入F-10，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“Group身份、代理、父链、复制与原生记录”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d594a16211e82f72ec189af0e02bf0848b311a62b8879b5e8810de9fe76aa5ff" href="../../证据/d594a16211e82f72ec189af0e02bf0848b311a62b8879b5e8810de9fe76aa5ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d594a16211e8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>loading-navigation:L10 · VmModuleSet.AddModuleByInfo → 构造 → Name+ID 去重 → Modules 替换</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>先 CreatModuleByInfo，再查 Name+ID；重复时返回旧实例，否则加新实例；最后替换 VmModuleCollection。Modules setter 发 Modules 和 Children 通知。</p><p>计划将A01/B02/D03归入F-10，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“Group身份、代理、父链、复制与原生记录”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModuleSet.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ba077fb8863db596d14ef8dc10d9a66bef421fd9ac7dfce2629c87be32b79186" href="../../证据/ba077fb8863db596d14ef8dc10d9a66bef421fd9ac7dfce2629c87be32b79186.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ba077fb8863d</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModuleSet.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89882b4f9821ce930657434f461abf641dbc6571c25cc8ce4cada49cbbb1fa2c" href="../../证据/89882b4f9821ce930657434f461abf641dbc6571c25cc8ce4cada49cbbb1fa2c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89882b4f9821</small></a></details></details><details><summary>loading-navigation:C05 · GraphEditorDocument.EnterOwnedGroup → 独立 GroupOwnership / 当前 ProcedureId</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>检验模块类型和 Enabled；已有内部图须匹配 owner 身份；否则生成独立 Guid 的 ProcedureDocument、GroupOwner 和 Call，并事务提交。</p><p>计划将B02归入F-10，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“Group身份、代理、父链、复制与原生记录”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。当前 Guid/内部图结构是独立模型，不是原 native 模块 ID 或 .gro 格式。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.Groups.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a5628f81018e06983d613fe3ac54f31ce89e7ad8292201e111d5d2e6017e1440" href="../../证据/a5628f81018e06983d613fe3ac54f31ce89e7ad8292201e111d5d2e6017e1440.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a5628f81018e</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-11" id="F-11"><summary>F-11 · Group 导航返回 · 进入/返回Group的导航上下文</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：当前ProcedureId、DisplayModuleSet、上级路径和视口会话需要分别追踪；请求快照并非导航恢复的直接证据。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>A03 · 流程Tab与Group导航</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>ProcedureConfigControl → VmProcedureDecorator.OpenGroupCommandExecute/UpCommandExecute</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>显示模块集、运行目标和历史视口是否独立</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>增删复制切换、嵌套进入返回、非活动Tab历史、运行停止、保存重开</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>身份/集合/导航链闭合；所有操作保持正确所属流程；导出入口另列</dd></dl><p>Group显示导航、父级返回及当前画布上下文片段；运行目标和完整Tab生命周期另待核</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A03</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8913b6e7fc8fe67d7f050d54b8022a5a373e66cee53f2ffcc901d16a4945d5dc" href="../../证据/8913b6e7fc8fe67d7f050d54b8022a5a373e66cee53f2ffcc901d16a4945d5dc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8913b6e7fc8f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>A08 · 壳与交互全状态验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>上述原事件与发布版真实主窗口</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>是否还有未映射入口/资源/手势</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按分支清单逐项原机同状态对照，补边界、截图与事件/值记录</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>列出的壳范围无遗漏；未支持服务显式开放，不按测试总数关闭领域</dd></dl><p>壳组合验收：需逐项对账实际入口、资源、手势与桌面矩阵；局部页面不能替代组合证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e" href="../../证据/32e894e8e24960873f6e472e0c06cab3f6eb260fec8c786b236939fe1a39736e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>32e894e8e249</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B02 · Group身份、所有权和复制</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>VmModuleSet/IMVSGroup/VmGroupDecorator的新增复制删除与父链</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>嵌套/同名/跨方案身份及引用如何恢复</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>追踪ID/FullName/GUID及Parent；复制、改名、删除撤销、粘贴、导入gro、保存重开</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>节点/代理/引用/内部图始终指向正确实例；独立跨顶层兼容保留标签</dd></dl><p>模块导入落地、父导航和当前Group所有权片段；新增/复制/删除与跨方案身份全集未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B02</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="04bfe1b09adbaac3e9f14109f4c8d59101285bc4277b13a0d9e3a7da82f62b23" href="../../证据/04bfe1b09adbaac3e9f14109f4c8d59101285bc4277b13a0d9e3a7da82f62b23.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>04bfe1b09adb</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>CP02 · 主流程启动与子流程调用 → 本次请求的JSON配置快照</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>MainWindow.RunCore先在调用线程用doc.Document构建SolutionWorkspace，再将workspace交Task.Run。SolutionExecutor.RunAsync再复制全部过程/节点参数，内部Execute和Group循环从这个document查子流程；GraphExecutor入口再复制目标图的参数。编辑文档后来替换JSON字段，不会替换已经捕获的本轮参数字典。ContinuousRun每次重新调用RunCore，故各轮具有各自的配置获取点；这不解除CP01的UI禁改门。</p><p>进入/返回Group的导航上下文：这条既有事实明确核实“主流程启动与子流程调用 → 本次请求的JSON配置快照”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">当前ProcedureId、DisplayModuleSet、上级路径和视口会话需要分别追踪；请求快照并非导航恢复的直接证据。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：插件还可读取scope服务、运行状态、延迟输入读取器；这里只闭合JSON配置隔离，不能宣称整个执行环境不可变。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未执行线程竞争探针；不把静态复制链称为所有并发插件行为的运行证明。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="448e694dc315a2730a7d77260a9ee7ac5288f64fc4f58b95c4ffbeb90b71fb65" href="../../证据/448e694dc315a2730a7d77260a9ee7ac5288f64fc4f58b95c4ffbeb90b71fb65.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>448e694dc315</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="de8499c9502e975acd054f9babcb7931d2c02049a383ee86721d3ea436e73cff" href="../../证据/de8499c9502e975acd054f9babcb7931d2c02049a383ee86721d3ea436e73cff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>de8499c9502e</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9602b57c3aa8e64b1eb53daba79021f417e543ba392dfa007d5f7d07dd9479b" href="../../证据/b9602b57c3aa8e64b1eb53daba79021f417e543ba392dfa007d5f7d07dd9479b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9602b57c3aa</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e3c15660c826a8ad92f40bb1f45eb1dca0243ef458319ac966218ce2982698a5" href="../../证据/e3c15660c826a8ad92f40bb1f45eb1dca0243ef458319ac966218ce2982698a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e3c15660c826</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>loading-navigation:N02 · OpenGroupCommandExecute → DisplayModuleSet setter</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>禁用或 IsLoadFailed==true 时拒绝；Group 有密码时仅 IsPasswordOK 才设置；无密码/非 Group 直接设置。DisplayModuleSet setter 先令 IsSelected=true，变化时发三项通知。</p><p>计划将A03/B02归入F-11，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“进入/返回Group的导航上下文”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/VmProcedureDecorator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fea3ccc8a804443fd79e9e8787eef21ce8707b58d3481219e9289d158cfa7346" href="../../证据/fea3ccc8a804443fd79e9e8787eef21ce8707b58d3481219e9289d158cfa7346.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fea3ccc8a804</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/VmProcedureDecorator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d9e3f59557626cf3f444bce42b3a959b2064bdafdff77cb034129fd02476e1c6" href="../../证据/d9e3f59557626cf3f444bce42b3a959b2064bdafdff77cb034129fd02476e1c6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d9e3f5955762</small></a></details></details><details><summary>loading-navigation:N03 · Tab Up 按钮 → UpCommandExecute → 父为根 Tab 则 this，否则新 VmGroupDecorator</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>btnUp 绑定 UpCommand；取显示模块 Parent，若等于本 Tab DecorateSource 则回 this，否则构造父 Group decorator。</p><p>计划将A03/B02归入F-11，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“进入/返回Group的导航上下文”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。UpCommand 属性/可执行条件与所有输入路由仍需进一步展开。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2cebc0cbc8cb99dd21e52586d8602f1d0e3c7c77f00bbd77f5cb1fccca464354" href="../../证据/2cebc0cbc8cb99dd21e52586d8602f1d0e3c7c77f00bbd77f5cb1fccca464354.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2cebc0cbc8cb</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/VmProcedureDecorator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c49aa4bef65fd53c6e04f6fa9e6178877dc099676ef8149f7f9d61390678aa2c" href="../../证据/c49aa4bef65fd53c6e04f6fa9e6178877dc099676ef8149f7f9d61390678aa2c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c49aa4bef65f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>loading-navigation:C07 · ReturnFromGroup → GraphEditorDocument.LeaveGroup</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>不在 Group、参数窗打开或执行中则拒绝；清手势/选择后按 GroupOwner.ProcedureId 回父图。</p><p>计划将A03归入F-11，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“进入/返回Group的导航上下文”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/GroupCanvasNavigation.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7f2d7e486f8be2e4b0126baa4e3e9b96e979f78e39e0066888639fdcbbdf5908" href="../../证据/7f2d7e486f8be2e4b0126baa4e3e9b96e979f78e39e0066888639fdcbbdf5908.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7f2d7e486f8b</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.Groups.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="41242ed72bd35fdd76f1b7c0aeca4d30b246db50a4e1a9078b0fe647351e52e6" href="../../证据/41242ed72bd35fdd76f1b7c0aeca4d30b246db50a4e1a9078b0fe647351e52e6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>41242ed72bd3</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-12" id="F-12"><summary>F-12 · Group 循环 · 循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：需从范围参数到每轮实例/动态索引/输出替换的生命周期；独立long/迭代上限与原native算术差异不能隐去。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>B03 · Group循环、中断与每轮生命周期</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>ModuleFrame.CGroupNode.DoWork与范围/中断函数</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>signed步长/溢出/每轮实例状态/动态索引的真实路径</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>REA沿原生函数逐分支和字段偏移追踪；受控正负零边界、嵌套、索引、取消与错误</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>源码算术/回调/状态变更可定位；本地long和上限策略不冒充native；运行输出与状态同验</dd></dl><p>Group参数/枚举和当前循环/比较消费者；native signed步长、溢出及每轮状态仍未知</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B03</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ffa39b815aa84d417469927bcac42d2da17c07e4d42a1aa2553518d8cd491fb6" href="../../证据/ffa39b815aa84d417469927bcac42d2da17c07e4d42a1aa2553518d8cd491fb6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ffa39b815aa8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B08 · 模型与Group组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>真实插件、嵌套Group、变量、ROI与历史持久化组合</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>单项通过后组合是否保持身份和数据一致</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>混合类型/多层/循环中断/累积/改型/撤销/保存重开/停止失败恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每场景对照原机输出和状态；失败不读陈旧结果；组合未知仍开放</dd></dl><p>模型/Group组合验收：需嵌套、变量、累积、保存重开和再次运行的同场景证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e" href="../../证据/4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f3a8f2e940f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>CP02 · 主流程启动与子流程调用 → 本次请求的JSON配置快照</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>MainWindow.RunCore先在调用线程用doc.Document构建SolutionWorkspace，再将workspace交Task.Run。SolutionExecutor.RunAsync再复制全部过程/节点参数，内部Execute和Group循环从这个document查子流程；GraphExecutor入口再复制目标图的参数。编辑文档后来替换JSON字段，不会替换已经捕获的本轮参数字典。ContinuousRun每次重新调用RunCore，故各轮具有各自的配置获取点；这不解除CP01的UI禁改门。</p><p>循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态：这条既有事实明确核实“主流程启动与子流程调用 → 本次请求的JSON配置快照”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">需从范围参数到每轮实例/动态索引/输出替换的生命周期；独立long/迭代上限与原native算术差异不能隐去。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：插件还可读取scope服务、运行状态、延迟输入读取器；这里只闭合JSON配置隔离，不能宣称整个执行环境不可变。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未执行线程竞争探针；不把静态复制链称为所有并发插件行为的运行证明。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="448e694dc315a2730a7d77260a9ee7ac5288f64fc4f58b95c4ffbeb90b71fb65" href="../../证据/448e694dc315a2730a7d77260a9ee7ac5288f64fc4f58b95c4ffbeb90b71fb65.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>448e694dc315</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="de8499c9502e975acd054f9babcb7931d2c02049a383ee86721d3ea436e73cff" href="../../证据/de8499c9502e975acd054f9babcb7931d2c02049a383ee86721d3ea436e73cff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>de8499c9502e</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9602b57c3aa8e64b1eb53daba79021f417e543ba392dfa007d5f7d07dd9479b" href="../../证据/b9602b57c3aa8e64b1eb53daba79021f417e543ba392dfa007d5f7d07dd9479b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9602b57c3aa</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e3c15660c826a8ad92f40bb1f45eb1dca0243ef458319ac966218ce2982698a5" href="../../证据/e3c15660c826a8ad92f40bb1f45eb1dca0243ef458319ac966218ce2982698a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e3c15660c826</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CP03 · 节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每个节点先从已复制n.Parameters建立新的字典，补Clone后的默认JSON值，再在执行到此节点时通过workflow.Resolve解析订阅；参数订阅经WorkflowSubscriptions.Parameter检查标量种类并SerializeToElement，覆盖该节点参数。普通连线则直接把上游PortValue赋入nodeInputs。ExecuteAsync收到两套ReadOnlyDictionary包装；ModuleExecutionContext构造器直接持有这两套只读接口。只读包装没有复制PortValue中图像/对象的含义。</p><p>循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态：这条既有事实明确核实“节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">需从范围参数到每轮实例/动态索引/输出替换的生命周期；独立long/迭代上限与原native算术差异不能隐去。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：DataKinds.Coerce及插件执行可有自己的转换/复制规则；仅凭框架字典不能推定任意具体图像在工具内零复制或深复制。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：下游动态读取服务与原生参数setter认可状态不在这条托管参数传递事实内。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633" href="../../证据/e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e137f34d98c9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464" href="../../证据/a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a2d27b66691d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662" href="../../证据/f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f51cff92f0bd</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484" href="../../证据/e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e79249d8651c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39" href="../../证据/c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c50568f01e32</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OG01 · 原DoWork进入循环前 → 一次准备输入与输出描述列表</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoWork先调用a4a00，再调用a74c0(this,this+0x180,&amp;本次输出列表)，二者位于逐轮循环之前。a4a00构造原字符串input并交a4a90(this,this+0x170,input)；后者按类型分派输入准备helper。a74c0逐个读取配置描述，向12e200传递上下文、类型与名称，只有其返回0才复制名称/模式到临时描述并把描述加入本次列表，失败分支记录日志后继续其它条目。输入配置、临时输出描述和每轮结果不是同一对象。</p><p>循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态：这条既有事实明确核实“原DoWork进入循环前 → 一次准备输入与输出描述列表”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">需从范围参数到每轮实例/动态索引/输出替换的生命周期；独立long/迭代上限与原native算术差异不能隐去。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：输入typed准备helper10450/10ab0/117a0等未在本切片逐体恢复，输入数据复制/共享不以方法名推定。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：12e200交12dcb0建立typed目标的具体动态绑定尚未补体；第5参数已核，但不把其载荷与其它专题的活实例直接合并。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8bbf5e1771f266c593c2492985e83911fb61b70aecb5cf582cfcd37a75f196d8" href="../../证据/8bbf5e1771f266c593c2492985e83911fb61b70aecb5cf582cfcd37a75f196d8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8bbf5e1771f2</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cd8eac6d74b37821d66d9cf04bea5a3ae663bca302708b8a9e189b6f650c1bcb" href="../../证据/cd8eac6d74b37821d66d9cf04bea5a3ae663bca302708b8a9e189b6f650c1bcb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cd8eac6d74b3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a4a00.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1a1363a4345a8fcd9bb8bc170621d64a543a82a6dd4e1d0440ef42eac3a113fa" href="../../证据/1a1363a4345a8fcd9bb8bc170621d64a543a82a6dd4e1d0440ef42eac3a113fa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1a1363a4345a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a4a90.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="337f38544b8ff26e8720c835a1dd3cf368b965c54fcf647856bfec2b85ad5ffb" href="../../证据/337f38544b8ff26e8720c835a1dd3cf368b965c54fcf647856bfec2b85ad5ffb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>337f38544b8f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a74c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="adee30a66c868c5bd851ef339e276fcfc091f29879e18c41f267f43b4ea8579f" href="../../证据/adee30a66c868c5bd851ef339e276fcfc091f29879e18c41f267f43b4ea8579f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>adee30a66c86</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a74c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b2066869955fbb020b77c0546bcd6c9a2cec15a726c14856c673a9f34f5714e6" href="../../证据/b2066869955fbb020b77c0546bcd6c9a2cec15a726c14856c673a9f34f5714e6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b2066869955f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/18012e200.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e169d5235169654703c8f4b012097846aca164e34ab5884d51a612b959947cce" href="../../证据/e169d5235169654703c8f4b012097846aca164e34ab5884d51a612b959947cce.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e169d5235169</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/selected-strings.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c" href="../../证据/d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d216d954d532</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OG02 · DoWork每轮开始 → StartIndex/EndIndex/LoopIndex的第0项写入与严格上界</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>正常DoWork以开始字段+0x21c初始化本轮索引，先作有符号index&lt;end(+0x220)门；每轮写this+0x224，再用RCX=this、EDX=start、R8D=end、R9D=index调用a7190。该体从原PE字符串确认StartIndex/EndIndex/LoopIndex，按当前Group模块键取int共享对象，对三个名字分别调用f3ee0(target,0,value)。f3ee0准备对象后，已有第0项时覆盖该4字节，否则增加一项。轮尾32位ADD后再次有符号JL到循环体，不能把这个静态分支扩成数学整数或溢出安全循环。</p><p>循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态：这条既有事实明确核实“DoWork每轮开始 → StartIndex/EndIndex/LoopIndex的第0项写入与严格上界”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">需从范围参数到每轮实例/动态索引/输出替换的生命周期；独立long/迭代上限与原native算术差异不能隐去。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：负步长、start>=end、int32溢出以及所有错误分支未运行差分；不从C有符号算式推出语言层未定义行为结果。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="80bb2b89a07c4fe2543cb5b991cf4bceb5536bb664f0f461e0c06f46af8b1d23" href="../../证据/80bb2b89a07c4fe2543cb5b991cf4bceb5536bb664f0f461e0c06f46af8b1d23.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>80bb2b89a07c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a2557ff8d514eb38961a7504e8db974b7b88c7ea75f0fa682daa09708218ff0b" href="../../证据/a2557ff8d514eb38961a7504e8db974b7b88c7ea75f0fa682daa09708218ff0b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a2557ff8d514</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dc411bf5f7a7475472ea36f3d69d117b490430d62e3cfc59bf54929a1a45ea7a" href="../../证据/dc411bf5f7a7475472ea36f3d69d117b490430d62e3cfc59bf54929a1a45ea7a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dc411bf5f7a7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7190.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fe64c823b3724b1c02c5901efe81155a71063dabbd4cac884130bb425de91799" href="../../证据/fe64c823b3724b1c02c5901efe81155a71063dabbd4cac884130bb425de91799.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fe64c823b372</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800f3ee0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d9a2b9066e346f2fc36f5f1041e6e4df45cb1f05472a028736b46b8cee4e4e83" href="../../证据/d9a2b9066e346f2fc36f5f1041e6e4df45cb1f05472a028736b46b8cee4e4e83.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d9a2b9066e34</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/selected-strings.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c" href="../../证据/d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d216d954d532</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OG04 · 本轮执行对象与ProcessGroupOutputV44 → 执行后分型处理并按描述模式调用目标虚槽</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>通过break门后DoWork调用局部执行对象的虚表+8；随后不把相邻指令解释为未知线程池合同，而是保存实际关系：RCX=this、RDX=&amp;本次输出列表、R8=&amp;本轮状态字传入a7830，返回EAX被保存并检查。a7830逐描述按type分派：int/float/string仅mode字段==1时先调用相应目标虚表+8，再调用13450/139f0/13fa0；image及其它所见类型有无条件先调用+8的独立分支。不能把这些类型都画成相同的累积策略。</p><p>循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态：这条既有事实明确核实“本轮执行对象与ProcessGroupOutputV44 → 执行后分型处理并按描述模式调用目标虚槽”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">需从范围参数到每轮实例/动态索引/输出替换的生命周期；独立long/迭代上限与原native算术差异不能隐去。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：虚执行对象的具体调度与全部子节点状态传播未在本切片恢复。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：图像/复合类型累积、载荷租约与虚槽接收者需分别恢复，不从int路径外推。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1f99bd523568df0ee2a894108b8c24297cadf8d50e3cbaca00ec8ecf1814f9d2" href="../../证据/1f99bd523568df0ee2a894108b8c24297cadf8d50e3cbaca00ec8ecf1814f9d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1f99bd523568</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c80d9d34446afc02f2fe3932aa06292d3da8f4ea3df7021bee59ae7c262a4b71" href="../../证据/c80d9d34446afc02f2fe3932aa06292d3da8f4ea3df7021bee59ae7c262a4b71.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c80d9d34446a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7830.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="41ab8d4f6ff3bb15ce4ece32b77ca221ba531e34af54ac9128b125064318ac80" href="../../证据/41ab8d4f6ff3bb15ce4ece32b77ca221ba531e34af54ac9128b125064318ac80.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>41ab8d4f6ff3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7830.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="84716093886a2e5db9fc760a7aa2a5b50cfea7c93066ce166921fe37f5f8c775" href="../../证据/84716093886a2e5db9fc760a7aa2a5b50cfea7c93066ce166921fe37f5f8c775.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>84716093886a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG01 · SolutionExecutor.RunAsync与OwnedGroups.Validate → 独占Group body身份及运行文档快照</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>RunAsync先ValidateStructure，其内调用OwnedGroups.Validate：body.GroupOwner是(parentProcedureId,nodeId)，父节点必须为workflow.subprogram且Call.ProcedureId指回body；全solution只能一个节点引用该owned body，所有权链限制三层并拒循环。随后solution快照复制Resources/Procedures、连接、执行边和节点；参数JsonElement逐项Clone，ROI vertices与Call/GroupBreak及Configuration另建结构容器。owned配置先GroupDisplayLinks.Synchronize再Snapshot，不等于保留原文档所有引用。</p><p>循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态：这条既有事实明确核实“SolutionExecutor.RunAsync与OwnedGroups.Validate → 独占Group body身份及运行文档快照”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">需从范围参数到每轮实例/动态索引/输出替换的生命周期；独立long/迭代上限与原native算术差异不能隐去。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本次只核当前托管合同，不证明原版GroupOwner或原native布局一致；线程并发编辑的完整宿主锁域未在这里验证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f7ba53a0bc2b392acd5a1ef1f14371a34f051b80499eb27994d1d0c049b108a" href="../../证据/0f7ba53a0bc2b392acd5a1ef1f14371a34f051b80499eb27994d1d0c049b108a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f7ba53a0bc2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9e356616eb63325c05f687e21d4b9a6bad5f215516fb1524822c4a689aabb6d3" href="../../证据/9e356616eb63325c05f687e21d4b9a6bad5f215516fb1524822c4a689aabb6d3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9e356616eb63</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b679c89ae0be237a30b1b002073caa29f03682651e144df1404fbc7234ab2ef6" href="../../证据/b679c89ae0be237a30b1b002073caa29f03682651e144df1404fbc7234ab2ef6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b679c89ae0be</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="394b1008ef359ce254da96465a7eda76f37ae377601d1260bd923e9879796696" href="../../证据/394b1008ef359ce254da96465a7eda76f37ae377601d1260bd923e9879796696.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>394b1008ef35</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/OwnedGroups.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f5268709d8a46ee585b5cab40d9e116f74235ce4670d825302fe8acc9ff55429" href="../../证据/f5268709d8a46ee585b5cab40d9e116f74235ce4670d825302fe8acc9ff55429.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f5268709d8a4</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowConfiguration.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3cad7f7309cec081a6cdf39b8fec31aef95eeebf8ea53716075fce851b101a8a" href="../../证据/3cad7f7309cec081a6cdf39b8fec31aef95eeebf8ea53716075fce851b101a8a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3cad7f7309ce</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG03 · GroupLoop.Read与SolutionExecutor循环 → 每轮索引、独立context与等待控制</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Read强制LoopTimeGap在0..10000、LoopStep非0；EnableLoop=false时固定Start=0/End=1/Step=1。实际for条件始终index&lt;End，Increment为Start&lt;End?Step:-Step，不把它改述为完整双向区间循环。每轮先childToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested，再int32范围与10000已完成轮独立资源门，再Evaluate break；通过后await Execute(body.Id,同values,...,index)，completed++，仅Success累积，非Success退出，Success且IntervalMs>0才Delay。</p><p>循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态：这条既有事实明确核实“GroupLoop.Read与SolutionExecutor循环 → 每轮索引、独立context与等待控制”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">需从范围参数到每轮实例/动态索引/输出替换的生命周期；独立long/迭代上限与原native算术差异不能隐去。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：负步长、Start>=End等组合只按现有代码表达；本切片没有运行差分验证，也不称与原生范围语义等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupLoop.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="390e3fd1fa6dad682595e85bed11877c13e21c4ec592ecf3c834446bc9f054e8" href="../../证据/390e3fd1fa6dad682595e85bed11877c13e21c4ec592ecf3c834446bc9f054e8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>390e3fd1fa6d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupLoop.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="054dee618572fe76cf53c6bc4f90447aa99df3f32066eb89aefb883b5c3de76b" href="../../证据/054dee618572fe76cf53c6bc4f90447aa99df3f32066eb89aefb883b5c3de76b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>054dee618572</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="35e1f265d45445ea74aab5765e97da832c30797f5ff0cad070e159c74e43e7ec" href="../../证据/35e1f265d45445ea74aab5765e97da832c30797f5ff0cad070e159c74e43e7ec.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>35e1f265d454</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="df78e2b8b9e9abd1fcf080eaefebff9fcc527446395ed5dbe739945e96107a84" href="../../证据/df78e2b8b9e9abd1fcf080eaefebff9fcc527446395ed5dbe739945e96107a84.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>df78e2b8b9e9</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG04 · 父GraphExecutor.GroupBreak.Capture → 外部操作数与动态下标先冻结，内部/self保留引用描述</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Capture先解析IndexSource，要求Integer+Scalar且0..int.MaxValue，写入Index并清IndexSource；外部非Self有Source的操作数立即从父workflow.Resolve取Element，再序列化为Constant JsonElement新记录。Inside/Self则保留源描述，供轮前求值。InvalidDataException转成PreparationError记录，并非在Capture处直接终止父节点。Snapshot对原Constant另Clone；Validate约束Self必须指向当前Group节点输出且非Inside、外部索引必须来自前置scalar int。</p><p>循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态：这条既有事实明确核实“父GraphExecutor.GroupBreak.Capture → 外部操作数与动态下标先冻结，内部/self保留引用描述”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">需从范围参数到每轮实例/动态索引/输出替换的生命周期；独立long/迭代上限与原native算术差异不能隐去。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未从此声称Capture是所有类型的通用序列化；Group break当前只支持Integer/Number/Text。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a4cfcd86216f03289c135d3c003b5c6c74bd24e5c88b2fbcefc7b77655796a2b" href="../../证据/a4cfcd86216f03289c135d3c003b5c6c74bd24e5c88b2fbcefc7b77655796a2b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a4cfcd86216f</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9bc011e666a7ae3a0913a0968de2fc8d353810b25fde8925a92321941a14fd9" href="../../证据/b9bc011e666a7ae3a0913a0968de2fc8d353810b25fde8925a92321941a14fd9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9bc011e666a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="86267c622522d00ea0728263630a3d6369cce3116401745567aaba05a337970c" href="../../证据/86267c622522d00ea0728263630a3d6369cce3116401745567aaba05a337970c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>86267c622522</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG06 · 每轮GraphExecutor → WorkflowRunContext → 独立records/variables与浅输入字典副本</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每次GraphExecutor.RunAsync先scope.Enter，再建本轮records/calls/descriptors和WorkflowRunContext。context把inputs字典ToDictionary，保留原PortValue；校验输入名/Kind/Cardinality并初始化无SourceNode变量。本轮Record先写records再workflow.Update：绑定该节点的变量先Remove，只有Node成功或NoMatch且含端口时重置引用，源不可用则保持缺值，不沿用前轮变量。Complete另建WorkflowInputs/Outputs/LocalVariables字典，输出仍指向当前本轮PortValue，显示每项新一元素数组包装。</p><p>循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态：这条既有事实明确核实“每轮GraphExecutor → WorkflowRunContext → 独立records/variables与浅输入字典副本”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">需从范围参数到每轮实例/动态索引/输出替换的生命周期；独立long/迭代上限与原native算术差异不能隐去。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：这不是“所有缓存每轮清空”：root scope的node state/参数缓存跨轮仍存；具体工具payload内部可变性与释放依具体实现另证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="27b5f7cf26eb9555f4701164468e193f14277880721cbdf6ea5163868352fbe9" href="../../证据/27b5f7cf26eb9555f4701164468e193f14277880721cbdf6ea5163868352fbe9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>27b5f7cf26eb</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fb5296069051e836e78d39d033a7d52391b955118d52ea701ba7d98c4bcca50e" href="../../证据/fb5296069051e836e78d39d033a7d52391b955118d52ea701ba7d98c4bcca50e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fb5296069051</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="67f3dd81329952a1875380f4a805711c6bae34f31363a5c0c576959085bfd422" href="../../证据/67f3dd81329952a1875380f4a805711c6bae34f31363a5c0c576959085bfd422.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>67f3dd813299</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="01c2eb812fb80ab6ecf22a23e430f6fea93d279ffe01f2938b7660767d1aeb1c" href="../../证据/01c2eb812fb80ab6ecf22a23e430f6fea93d279ffe01f2938b7660767d1aeb1c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>01c2eb812fb8</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d91f59d36d028f76e0c469acee515749901743ebccb4ecbbf734716da662f4a5" href="../../证据/d91f59d36d028f76e0c469acee515749901743ebccb4ecbbf734716da662f4a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d91f59d36d02</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG09 · Group正常结束/中断/失败/取消 → 末轮session改写聚合，父调用保留Calls但门控输出</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>正常loop出口返回last或新Success空session，再with覆盖CompletedGroupIterations/GroupBroke/GroupBreakIndex/diagnostics/累积outputs与displays。零轮时last为null，Finish对可累积项产生空typed数组；成功break保留前轮节点记录。body返回非Success后先completed++再break，未Add该轮；返回状态仍取last，非累计输出可来自该last。父Graph收到child先存calls[id]，仅child.Success把WorkflowOutputs作为模块结果，否则输出Empty并SubprogramFailed。轮前Throw或Interval Delay抛取消会绕过Group最终聚合return，由父Graph catch/取消/超时门分类，不能宣称任何取消都保留部分累计结果。</p><p>循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态：这条既有事实明确核实“Group正常结束/中断/失败/取消 → 末轮session改写聚合，父调用保留Calls但门控输出”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">需从范围参数到每轮实例/动态索引/输出替换的生命周期；独立long/迭代上限与原native算术差异不能隐去。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：超时/外部取消/Scope.Stopping涉及不同token，不能从一个分支推出所有race结果；本切片仅静态核顺序，没有新运行探针。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="edb3d91bee1a3c59cf2a58ad059bca4d944a1dbe1a4f5a6ac6aac5d433491d91" href="../../证据/edb3d91bee1a3c59cf2a58ad059bca4d944a1dbe1a4f5a6ac6aac5d433491d91.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>edb3d91bee1a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="700cd74215bdf92d618e1baf80b16e6e23e1a89fed8580cfedb0b1716c497e20" href="../../证据/700cd74215bdf92d618e1baf80b16e6e23e1a89fed8580cfedb0b1716c497e20.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>700cd74215bd</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f" href="../../证据/2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2f3bad3dab71</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e59c8e573396c2e41cd7fd0b21c07e060bddbfd552e1db6bd436e74f2e16c724" href="../../证据/e59c8e573396c2e41cd7fd0b21c07e060bddbfd552e1db6bd436e74f2e16c724.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e59c8e573396</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>group-control:G04 · GroupParam 构造与属性 → ParamItem 读取/写入</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>构造以 EnableLoop、LoopTimeGap、EnableBreak、DataType、CmpType 建 ParamItem；属性分别使用 Bool/Int/Enum 读写。该包装体不包含完整循环算法。</p><p>计划将B03归入F-12，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/IMVSGroup.WorkflowAudit/IMVSGroupCs/GroupParam.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="60c5a06e0688fb37eeb6076ea82fc784ae09549dd50640e874c5a4511ec2fc8d" href="../../证据/60c5a06e0688fb37eeb6076ea82fc784ae09549dd50640e874c5a4511ec2fc8d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>60c5a06e0688</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/IMVSGroup.WorkflowAudit/IMVSGroupCs/GroupParam.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b6d7db942f83ad63bdda3718e2ee23ebcdef84ff8ed47802864775a0cf21b3cf" href="../../证据/b6d7db942f83ad63bdda3718e2ee23ebcdef84ff8ed47802864775a0cf21b3cf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b6d7db942f83</small></a></details></details><details><summary>group-control:G07 · GroupParam.DataTypeEnum / CmpTypeEnum → 数据类型1..3 / 比较符1..6</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>托管枚举确认为 Int/Float/String，GT/LT/EQ/NE/GE/LE；名称和值并不能证明 native 浮点容差或字符串比较算法。</p><p>计划将B03归入F-12，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/IMVSGroup.WorkflowAudit/IMVSGroupCs/GroupParam.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="be60460b85b13f8ee8fa45e824550ff35e3ebf6a0a3c37d1207fe80220d33181" href="../../证据/be60460b85b13f8ee8fa45e824550ff35e3ebf6a0a3c37d1207fe80220d33181.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>be60460b85b1</small></a></details></details><details><summary>group-control:C02 · GroupLoop.Read → 独立范围/间隔/步长规范</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>读取0..10000间隔，拒绝0步长；缺失步长兼容默认1。关闭循环同时规范范围[0,1)和 Step=1，避免保存负步长使独立单次重复。启用保留非零负步长；Increment 用 long。</p><p>计划将B03归入F-12，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupLoop.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9913a3568358893fa0d3f123f553e26c8e56aecd0afb456a57663680dfec851a" href="../../证据/9913a3568358893fa0d3f123f553e26c8e56aecd0afb456a57663680dfec851a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9913a3568358</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupLoop.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="53f87bab057f4bd2cbf4941d97f6609ea57e4b3618efba3dce66c2fc7f583b4c" href="../../证据/53f87bab057f4bd2cbf4941d97f6609ea57e4b3618efba3dce66c2fc7f583b4c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>53f87bab057f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>group-control:C04 · 独立 Group 循环轮体 → 取消/边界保护 → break → Execute → 累积/等待</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每轮先取消、int32范围及10000轮独立守卫，再判断中断，之后执行并加 completed；仅 Success 加累积，非成功退出；成功后有间隔就等待，包括末轮。completed 包含已执行的失败轮，不能称成功轮数。</p><p>计划将B03归入F-12，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“循环范围、signed步长、迭代索引与每轮状态”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4189971fff22f6812efefdd65284759a2320101015b47adb945c35d3bcebac1e" href="../../证据/4189971fff22f6812efefdd65284759a2320101015b47adb945c35d3bcebac1e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4189971fff22</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-13" id="F-13"><summary>F-13 · Group 中断 · 中断谓词、计数、退出时输出与清理</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：中断输入何时解析、缺值/异常/取消怎样影响最终输出和累积仓需与原native分支对账；单个参数副本不覆盖此语义。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>B03 · Group循环、中断与每轮生命周期</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>ModuleFrame.CGroupNode.DoWork与范围/中断函数</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>signed步长/溢出/每轮实例状态/动态索引的真实路径</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>REA沿原生函数逐分支和字段偏移追踪；受控正负零边界、嵌套、索引、取消与错误</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>源码算术/回调/状态变更可定位；本地long和上限策略不冒充native；运行输出与状态同验</dd></dl><p>Group参数/枚举和当前循环/比较消费者；native signed步长、溢出及每轮状态仍未知</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B03</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ffa39b815aa84d417469927bcac42d2da17c07e4d42a1aa2553518d8cd491fb6" href="../../证据/ffa39b815aa84d417469927bcac42d2da17c07e4d42a1aa2553518d8cd491fb6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ffa39b815aa8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B08 · 模型与Group组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>真实插件、嵌套Group、变量、ROI与历史持久化组合</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>单项通过后组合是否保持身份和数据一致</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>混合类型/多层/循环中断/累积/改型/撤销/保存重开/停止失败恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每场景对照原机输出和状态；失败不读陈旧结果；组合未知仍开放</dd></dl><p>模型/Group组合验收：需嵌套、变量、累积、保存重开和再次运行的同场景证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e" href="../../证据/4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f3a8f2e940f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>CP03 · 节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每个节点先从已复制n.Parameters建立新的字典，补Clone后的默认JSON值，再在执行到此节点时通过workflow.Resolve解析订阅；参数订阅经WorkflowSubscriptions.Parameter检查标量种类并SerializeToElement，覆盖该节点参数。普通连线则直接把上游PortValue赋入nodeInputs。ExecuteAsync收到两套ReadOnlyDictionary包装；ModuleExecutionContext构造器直接持有这两套只读接口。只读包装没有复制PortValue中图像/对象的含义。</p><p>中断谓词、计数、退出时输出与清理：这条既有事实明确核实“节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">中断输入何时解析、缺值/异常/取消怎样影响最终输出和累积仓需与原native分支对账；单个参数副本不覆盖此语义。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：DataKinds.Coerce及插件执行可有自己的转换/复制规则；仅凭框架字典不能推定任意具体图像在工具内零复制或深复制。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：下游动态读取服务与原生参数setter认可状态不在这条托管参数传递事实内。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633" href="../../证据/e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e137f34d98c9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464" href="../../证据/a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a2d27b66691d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662" href="../../证据/f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f51cff92f0bd</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484" href="../../证据/e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e79249d8651c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39" href="../../证据/c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c50568f01e32</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OG03 · 本轮索引发布后、执行前 → IsBreakLoop布尔门与首轮特殊准入</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoWork在a7190之后调用a55b0，汇编立即TEST AL并在非零时跳过本轮执行/输出段。a55b0原字符串为CGroupNode::IsBreakLoop；体先检查EnableBreak相关字节this+0x250，再检查this+0x22c==0和a6730返回的首轮保护门，随后才按this+0x248类型与+0x24c比较符处理。DoWork只在通过break门后增加this+0x22c，所以检测与已执行轮计数不可混用。</p><p>中断谓词、计数、退出时输出与清理：这条既有事实明确核实“本轮索引发布后、执行前 → IsBreakLoop布尔门与首轮特殊准入”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">中断输入何时解析、缺值/异常/取消怎样影响最终输出和累积仓需与原native分支对账；单个参数副本不覆盖此语义。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：a6730完整类型/作用域分支、比较source getter以及float容差/NaN/字符串全部比较合同不在本轮闭合；不以资源枚举代替各操作汇编。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：新伪码把a55b0显示void且部分返回值丢失；本事实用调用侧AL与所选返回汇编限定，不重写原行为。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f3353a089dff6c2118d4ff6c9c6b9aaa2f087d5de9e9bc112f241789bd7e30e0" href="../../证据/f3353a089dff6c2118d4ff6c9c6b9aaa2f087d5de9e9bc112f241789bd7e30e0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f3353a089dff</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92143ceb75c5dd13db5173565426ad589d53bd5bfad6cecc7ef711890577a91d" href="../../证据/92143ceb75c5dd13db5173565426ad589d53bd5bfad6cecc7ef711890577a91d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92143ceb75c5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a55b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="387d28ddac0cb7439b9a135d369cf1bb8013e9a482ee9cae3409ad68ff506e2d" href="../../证据/387d28ddac0cb7439b9a135d369cf1bb8013e9a482ee9cae3409ad68ff506e2d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>387d28ddac0c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a55b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3d65f5b84e1e838ee3eceb5ddb3a56a5c69181bf36351900e0f796aea46f6595" href="../../证据/3d65f5b84e1e838ee3eceb5ddb3a56a5c69181bf36351900e0f796aea46f6595.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3d65f5b84e1e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a6730.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5225d30ab260fcbeaf1d9900a8df990a7689c6124e85443497018353ff66c210" href="../../证据/5225d30ab260fcbeaf1d9900a8df990a7689c6124e85443497018353ff66c210.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5225d30ab260</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/selected-strings.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c" href="../../证据/d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d216d954d532</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OG06 · 输出处理失败与DoWork收尾 → 分开保存处理错误码、状态码和ModuStatus布尔值</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>a7830继续遍历描述；在尚未捕获错误时，来源状态分类为3且来源记录存在、其工作状态不在0x75掩码允许集合时，复制该来源错误码与工作状态到本次错误/状态输出。汇编最终MOV EAX,R13D返回累计错误。DoWork收尾以其最终错误寄存器是否0写ModuStatus(index0)，把错误码写this+0x7c、另一个状态码写this+0x84，清this+0x1b8执行中标记，并另发布ModuRunTime。成功布尔、错误码与状态枚举不是一个字段。</p><p>中断谓词、计数、退出时输出与清理：这条既有事实明确核实“输出处理失败与DoWork收尾 → 分开保存处理错误码、状态码和ModuStatus布尔值”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">中断输入何时解析、缺值/异常/取消怎样影响最终输出和累积仓需与原native分支对账；单个参数副本不覆盖此语义。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：所有上游失败映射、mask中每个状态的名称、异常与取消的全路径未枚举；不由数值猜业务枚举语义。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7830.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2bf7dd74d3d703648642bb749856979e57c8fd750b2b2eed334ce96e09aa7406" href="../../证据/2bf7dd74d3d703648642bb749856979e57c8fd750b2b2eed334ce96e09aa7406.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2bf7dd74d3d7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7830.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="84716093886a2e5db9fc760a7aa2a5b50cfea7c93066ce166921fe37f5f8c775" href="../../证据/84716093886a2e5db9fc760a7aa2a5b50cfea7c93066ce166921fe37f5f8c775.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>84716093886a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cd7e33b0bcb04af69bd9879876fc782c3a98571bf665b41d4cb1a0e2e98f02c4" href="../../证据/cd7e33b0bcb04af69bd9879876fc782c3a98571bf665b41d4cb1a0e2e98f02c4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cd7e33b0bcb0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3176190147c541e9014ecd5e6213386642f7ea8848441feed69795eccd8cad55" href="../../证据/3176190147c541e9014ecd5e6213386642f7ea8848441feed69795eccd8cad55.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3176190147c5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/selected-strings.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c" href="../../证据/d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d216d954d532</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG04 · 父GraphExecutor.GroupBreak.Capture → 外部操作数与动态下标先冻结，内部/self保留引用描述</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Capture先解析IndexSource，要求Integer+Scalar且0..int.MaxValue，写入Index并清IndexSource；外部非Self有Source的操作数立即从父workflow.Resolve取Element，再序列化为Constant JsonElement新记录。Inside/Self则保留源描述，供轮前求值。InvalidDataException转成PreparationError记录，并非在Capture处直接终止父节点。Snapshot对原Constant另Clone；Validate约束Self必须指向当前Group节点输出且非Inside、外部索引必须来自前置scalar int。</p><p>中断谓词、计数、退出时输出与清理：这条既有事实明确核实“父GraphExecutor.GroupBreak.Capture → 外部操作数与动态下标先冻结，内部/self保留引用描述”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">中断输入何时解析、缺值/异常/取消怎样影响最终输出和累积仓需与原native分支对账；单个参数副本不覆盖此语义。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未从此声称Capture是所有类型的通用序列化；Group break当前只支持Integer/Number/Text。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a4cfcd86216f03289c135d3c003b5c6c74bd24e5c88b2fbcefc7b77655796a2b" href="../../证据/a4cfcd86216f03289c135d3c003b5c6c74bd24e5c88b2fbcefc7b77655796a2b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a4cfcd86216f</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9bc011e666a7ae3a0913a0968de2fc8d353810b25fde8925a92321941a14fd9" href="../../证据/b9bc011e666a7ae3a0913a0968de2fc8d353810b25fde8925a92321941a14fd9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9bc011e666a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="86267c622522d00ea0728263630a3d6369cce3116401745567aaba05a337970c" href="../../证据/86267c622522d00ea0728263630a3d6369cce3116401745567aaba05a337970c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>86267c622522</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG05 · GroupBreak.Evaluate与Resolve → 本轮索引/输入、前轮内部值与累计self分开读取</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>break在本轮Execute前求值。previous=null且操作数为Self或Inside的生产者源时直接false，跳过首次内部比较；其他Inside LoopIndex取即将执行的index，WorkflowInput优先本次values，未绑定局部变量读声明初始值。绑定内部NodeOutput/LocalVariable在previous session读取，只允许相应可用源；Self由accumulator.ReadSelfElement读累计片段或last输出。Resolve失败记录最多32条去重diagnostics并返回false，继续执行，而非把缺值当0或自动break。break=true时记录broke/index，不再执行该轮也不增加completed。</p><p>中断谓词、计数、退出时输出与清理：这条既有事实明确核实“GroupBreak.Evaluate与Resolve → 本轮索引/输入、前轮内部值与累计self分开读取”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">中断输入何时解析、缺值/异常/取消怎样影响最终输出和累积仓需与原native分支对账；单个参数副本不覆盖此语义。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：运行时不支持/不可用数据仅按具体异常门处理；不从false推断用户配置有效或原版也是同策略。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c8fe0191c128ff5d14bfacf06f2189976f5e072108bec5c06c5efd2ed2bc68de" href="../../证据/c8fe0191c128ff5d14bfacf06f2189976f5e072108bec5c06c5efd2ed2bc68de.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c8fe0191c128</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="29247050b252f07cc67c2ca8fcf6afebb6c994147456f805a588660271324435" href="../../证据/29247050b252f07cc67c2ca8fcf6afebb6c994147456f805a588660271324435.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>29247050b252</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8065840237923a4d50f0b4f4644a499aa2b99981a5112ff9a7ae9245198df665" href="../../证据/8065840237923a4d50f0b4f4644a499aa2b99981a5112ff9a7ae9245198df665.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>806584023792</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cbf696640d78232d74cdca9df56a49c0ce5813801ee6162a3dd53f2bc9968752" href="../../证据/cbf696640d78232d74cdca9df56a49c0ce5813801ee6162a3dd53f2bc9968752.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cbf696640d78</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG09 · Group正常结束/中断/失败/取消 → 末轮session改写聚合，父调用保留Calls但门控输出</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>正常loop出口返回last或新Success空session，再with覆盖CompletedGroupIterations/GroupBroke/GroupBreakIndex/diagnostics/累积outputs与displays。零轮时last为null，Finish对可累积项产生空typed数组；成功break保留前轮节点记录。body返回非Success后先completed++再break，未Add该轮；返回状态仍取last，非累计输出可来自该last。父Graph收到child先存calls[id]，仅child.Success把WorkflowOutputs作为模块结果，否则输出Empty并SubprogramFailed。轮前Throw或Interval Delay抛取消会绕过Group最终聚合return，由父Graph catch/取消/超时门分类，不能宣称任何取消都保留部分累计结果。</p><p>中断谓词、计数、退出时输出与清理：这条既有事实明确核实“Group正常结束/中断/失败/取消 → 末轮session改写聚合，父调用保留Calls但门控输出”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">中断输入何时解析、缺值/异常/取消怎样影响最终输出和累积仓需与原native分支对账；单个参数副本不覆盖此语义。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：超时/外部取消/Scope.Stopping涉及不同token，不能从一个分支推出所有race结果；本切片仅静态核顺序，没有新运行探针。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="edb3d91bee1a3c59cf2a58ad059bca4d944a1dbe1a4f5a6ac6aac5d433491d91" href="../../证据/edb3d91bee1a3c59cf2a58ad059bca4d944a1dbe1a4f5a6ac6aac5d433491d91.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>edb3d91bee1a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="700cd74215bdf92d618e1baf80b16e6e23e1a89fed8580cfedb0b1716c497e20" href="../../证据/700cd74215bdf92d618e1baf80b16e6e23e1a89fed8580cfedb0b1716c497e20.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>700cd74215bd</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f" href="../../证据/2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2f3bad3dab71</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e59c8e573396c2e41cd7fd0b21c07e060bddbfd552e1db6bd436e74f2e16c724" href="../../证据/e59c8e573396c2e41cd7fd0b21c07e060bddbfd552e1db6bd436e74f2e16c724.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e59c8e573396</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>group-control:C06 · GroupBreak.Evaluate → 首轮内部来源跳过 / 诊断限流</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>未启用直接false；首轮没有 previous 且依赖内部生产者或 Self 时跳过比较；捕获 InvalidDataException 将去重诊断最多保留32条，并返回false继续执行。不能把解析失败写成必定中断。</p><p>计划将B03归入F-13，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“中断谓词、计数、退出时输出与清理”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbcfd275c04bcb43dd1dc920adc93ec4811326a1aabf392c7fa69bb8ac35d9e1" href="../../证据/fbcfd275c04bcb43dd1dc920adc93ec4811326a1aabf392c7fa69bb8ac35d9e1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbcfd275c04b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>group-control:C07 · GroupBreak.Compare → UTF-8 / float / int32 独立消费者</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前字符串按 UTF-8 字节排序；浮点压到float，等号用epsilon而不等号用直接!=；整数限制int32。此边只证明当前实现，不以注释或单元测试替代 native 汇编证据。</p><p>计划将B03归入F-13，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“中断谓词、计数、退出时输出与清理”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1d8e8db0e493d9a01b967e6760b60e3b83ee1ea49e334e94ff48035765d84fb5" href="../../证据/1d8e8db0e493d9a01b967e6760b60e3b83ee1ea49e334e94ff48035765d84fb5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1d8e8db0e493</small></a></details></details><details><summary>group-control:U01 · 资源未声明 LoopStep / 回收 setter → 隐藏步长与 native 循环</summary><p>unknown</p><p>历史伪代码可见 LoopStep 经 atoi 后只拒绝0，并写 this+0x234；DoWork 片段可见方向选择、末尾累加及 index&lt;end。这里保留精确锚点，尚不将伪代码本身升级为完整 ABI/边界语义证明。</p><p>计划将B03归入F-13，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“中断谓词、计数、退出时输出与清理”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。负步长、int32 溢出、atoi 超范围、空范围状态码与终止/释放需要原件身份和汇编/运行差分，不从 C 有符号表达式猜测。</p><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/group-native-audit/group-set-param-native.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f9e803b5ed3cc14621fa53507ea5ddae89d00a0b72f4f6a980f3f4598d1b061e" href="../../证据/f9e803b5ed3cc14621fa53507ea5ddae89d00a0b72f4f6a980f3f4598d1b061e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f9e803b5ed3c</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/group-native-audit/group-run.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b28422fc6c9c29bc5f5de4163b3c87def8818f778d062dae85eec9d1104ec561" href="../../证据/b28422fc6c9c29bc5f5de4163b3c87def8818f778d062dae85eec9d1104ec561.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b28422fc6c9c</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/group-native-audit/group-run.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="061142d38deda53640e52aeb43e5ee3a048a7bdcbd637fcfd3bb2c050acc3c39" href="../../证据/061142d38deda53640e52aeb43e5ee3a048a7bdcbd637fcfd3bb2c050acc3c39.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>061142d38ded</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-14" id="F-14"><summary>F-14 · Group 累积与结果 · Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：尚需每种复合类型、循环累积/替换和最后持有者的逐族链；不能把PortValue只读字典或单图buffer当全部累积模型。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>B04 · 原生类型、复合叶及累积</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>DynamicOutput/GetAllLeafIO/ProcessGroupOutputV44</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>类型形状、基数、float/ABI、叶模式和清理规则</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按类型族拆叶/根任务；scalar/array/pointset/POLYGON/Region/Fixture/Components逐个追生产者与消费者</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每种开放类型有原生产者→订阅→Group→存储→结果证据；缺失类型禁用或明确独立合同</dd></dl><p>结果getter、订阅与当前输出累积片段；原类型生产、float/ABI和全部清理规则未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B04</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="24a585b2078fc0f2489dc017267680d9dcf7cbad21d5f728c6bc25434f73c324" href="../../证据/24a585b2078fc0f2489dc017267680d9dcf7cbad21d5f728c6bc25434f73c324.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>24a585b2078f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B08 · 模型与Group组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>真实插件、嵌套Group、变量、ROI与历史持久化组合</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>单项通过后组合是否保持身份和数据一致</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>混合类型/多层/循环中断/累积/改型/撤销/保存重开/停止失败恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每场景对照原机输出和状态；失败不读陈旧结果；组合未知仍开放</dd></dl><p>模型/Group组合验收：需嵌套、变量、累积、保存重开和再次运行的同场景证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e" href="../../证据/4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f3a8f2e940f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>DP02 · VmIO.Value / GetValue(executeCount,index) → 关联值、主动拉取与本轮值门</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Value getter在输入叶订阅分支直接返回RelateIO.Value；否则按Root回调模式/流程执行计数决定RefreshResult，再MergeIOLoopValue。GetValue对非uint.MaxValue的计数进行匹配，既不匹配本身/关联计数且不是常量时清Value并返回null。数组索引越界在该体回退0，不按当前实现的验证门推断原版规则。</p><p>Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有：这条既有事实明确核实“VmIO.Value / GetValue(executeCount,index) → 关联值、主动拉取与本轮值门”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">尚需每种复合类型、循环累积/替换和最后持有者的逐族链；不能把PortValue只读字典或单图buffer当全部累积模型。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：MergeIOLoopValue的完整合并/组合树语义、并发值变更及所有索引类型仍单独取证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/data-lifecycle-cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8c451bff3b6aa826267f423f41bc7dcce91d92571628d4c690442fd199432904" href="../../证据/8c451bff3b6aa826267f423f41bc7dcce91d92571628d4c690442fd199432904.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8c451bff3b6a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/data-lifecycle-cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58d4a072ee2e45fd5822f8ea4426b2574688ed0a807460b3f7d867cc01e80aae" href="../../证据/58d4a072ee2e45fd5822f8ea4426b2574688ed0a807460b3f7d867cc01e80aae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58d4a072ee2e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/data-lifecycle-cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1f255b046bb730ea4c605ccda6e1f6219b39a2e8ee64a6970df18d4c81fe002d" href="../../证据/1f255b046bb730ea4c605ccda6e1f6219b39a2e8ee64a6970df18d4c81fe002d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1f255b046bb7</small></a></details></details><details><summary>DR04 · 当前模块ExecuteAsync返回 → 模块实例Dispose后校验/保存输出引用</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor在finally释放本次模块实例，之后才检查取消/超时/异常、输出类型及动态描述符，再把输出字典包装为ReadOnlyDictionary并Record。字典包装没有深复制PortValue。模块实例、scope持久state和输出图像是三种寿命，不能用一次模块Dispose概括三者。</p><p>Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有：这条既有事实明确核实“当前模块ExecuteAsync返回 → 模块实例Dispose后校验/保存输出引用”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">尚需每种复合类型、循环累积/替换和最后持有者的逐族链；不能把PortValue只读字典或单图buffer当全部累积模型。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：工具Dispose是否影响其输出需按工具证据核实；本体不证明外部资源在返回后安全。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4bff101f2bffcec6f5804bb707528f6bd57d55ebd85186a5e26ef5a8e9130c32" href="../../证据/4bff101f2bffcec6f5804bb707528f6bd57d55ebd85186a5e26ef5a8e9130c32.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4bff101f2bff</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c949c55173154cf1681510c25bbc056952aebf41af69b2cfd0e9ca2e7c592461" href="../../证据/c949c55173154cf1681510c25bbc056952aebf41af69b2cfd0e9ca2e7c592461.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c949c5517315</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CD04 · Point / Components复合结果 → 投影叶子是新数值容器，复合父载荷仍原样保留</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>CompoundOutputFields.Expand先浅复制原Outputs，再用TryAdd追加投影字段，已存在同名字段优先保留。Point标量投影X/Y新Number；Point数组的X/Y用Numbers分别物化为NumberArray+Scalar。Components父载荷是Component只读列表，投影BlobNum/TotalArea标量及Area/中心/矩形等Number+Array叶子，叶子数组逐列新建。因此父Point/Components与各投影列同时可被结果持有；不能称所有子字段只是父数组的零复制切片。</p><p>Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有：这条既有事实明确核实“Point / Components复合结果 → 投影叶子是新数值容器，复合父载荷仍原样保留”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">尚需每种复合类型、循环累积/替换和最后持有者的逐族链；不能把PortValue只读字典或单图buffer当全部累积模型。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不据恢复XML字段名推定native点集ABI；当前Region/Fixture等其它复合投影及全部插件自定义输出仍应独立核查。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/CompoundOutputFields.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d56a2412c7a48c4db852f898ab3ab725652e4cfef6aa2516b94b22ed8f5e90ca" href="../../证据/d56a2412c7a48c4db852f898ab3ab725652e4cfef6aa2516b94b22ed8f5e90ca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d56a2412c7a4</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/CompoundOutputFields.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="85ab80c833c797323d8c1e5eb3434215bd1911c866d937352ce9428a2e611063" href="../../证据/85ab80c833c797323d8c1e5eb3434215bd1911c866d937352ce9428a2e611063.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>85ab80c833c7</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5b431adcf041c1a9423ba308f8cbe28de1e4f4205963b0d5eab1ad5ea5e99e17" href="../../证据/5b431adcf041c1a9423ba308f8cbe28de1e4f4205963b0d5eab1ad5ea5e99e17.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5b431adcf041</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/PortArrays.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="82a394a8ee5006280fe88a9b0c4a232c1ad7443ec9e9ef7736a39e78b48aec1e" href="../../证据/82a394a8ee5006280fe88a9b0c4a232c1ad7443ec9e9ef7736a39e78b48aec1e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>82a394a8ee50</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CD08 · Group跨轮累积 → 先保留各轮PortValue，再JoinArray复制成最终集合</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GroupOutputAccumulator按输出名保存List&lt;PortValue>，仅对Accumulate且Accumulatable支持的Integer/Number/Text/Circle/Point/Fixture接收累积。Add直接list.Add(value)，不在每轮立即复制整个载荷，累计元素数受独立1000000上限。Finish先浅复制last.WorkflowOutputs，再对每个累积输出JoinArray，形成新数组容器；FinishDisplays也仅复制列表容器，保留各帧PortValue。SolutionExecutor每次Group调用新建accumulator，每次Execute产生新子session，只有成功iteration才Add；最终返回last with新的累积输出/显示。NumberArray与Components不在该累积种类白名单，不应假定能按相同算法累积。</p><p>Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有：这条既有事实明确核实“Group跨轮累积 → 先保留各轮PortValue，再JoinArray复制成最终集合”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">尚需每种复合类型、循环累积/替换和最后持有者的逐族链；不能把PortValue只读字典或单图buffer当全部累积模型。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：1000000元素/10000轮等为当前独立资源门，不当作原版保证；native Group跨轮清理及数值ABI的等价性未由本静态切片验证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a5980a337475fba58b313b59f3e2b35aaa414204d98ac059e6d1e8a3344d4d63" href="../../证据/a5980a337475fba58b313b59f3e2b35aaa414204d98ac059e6d1e8a3344d4d63.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a5980a337475</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bf78bc708389da1c5261ba2245de4b8891a3b4ef8ca4c76f53661186bcabe7c0" href="../../证据/bf78bc708389da1c5261ba2245de4b8891a3b4ef8ca4c76f53661186bcabe7c0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bf78bc708389</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="77639b10cfe9d94f281e89e3b66994433c0f5e1eb065252293212f546f7efaa6" href="../../证据/77639b10cfe9d94f281e89e3b66994433c0f5e1eb065252293212f546f7efaa6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>77639b10cfe9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="725118b578e61f002bd2d136d218daeecfead759f38c9941dd7d4c1cfea1a17b" href="../../证据/725118b578e61f002bd2d136d218daeecfead759f38c9941dd7d4c1cfea1a17b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>725118b578e6</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/PortArrays.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3a0e34779b40743879ef1f301fa762f7382cdff3c3b218e928d6895b8d190e13" href="../../证据/3a0e34779b40743879ef1f301fa762f7382cdff3c3b218e928d6895b8d190e13.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3a0e34779b40</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OG04 · 本轮执行对象与ProcessGroupOutputV44 → 执行后分型处理并按描述模式调用目标虚槽</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>通过break门后DoWork调用局部执行对象的虚表+8；随后不把相邻指令解释为未知线程池合同，而是保存实际关系：RCX=this、RDX=&amp;本次输出列表、R8=&amp;本轮状态字传入a7830，返回EAX被保存并检查。a7830逐描述按type分派：int/float/string仅mode字段==1时先调用相应目标虚表+8，再调用13450/139f0/13fa0；image及其它所见类型有无条件先调用+8的独立分支。不能把这些类型都画成相同的累积策略。</p><p>Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有：这条既有事实明确核实“本轮执行对象与ProcessGroupOutputV44 → 执行后分型处理并按描述模式调用目标虚槽”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">尚需每种复合类型、循环累积/替换和最后持有者的逐族链；不能把PortValue只读字典或单图buffer当全部累积模型。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：虚执行对象的具体调度与全部子节点状态传播未在本切片恢复。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：图像/复合类型累积、载荷租约与虚槽接收者需分别恢复，不从int路径外推。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1f99bd523568df0ee2a894108b8c24297cadf8d50e3cbaca00ec8ecf1814f9d2" href="../../证据/1f99bd523568df0ee2a894108b8c24297cadf8d50e3cbaca00ec8ecf1814f9d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1f99bd523568</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c80d9d34446afc02f2fe3932aa06292d3da8f4ea3df7021bee59ae7c262a4b71" href="../../证据/c80d9d34446afc02f2fe3932aa06292d3da8f4ea3df7021bee59ae7c262a4b71.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c80d9d34446a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7830.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="41ab8d4f6ff3bb15ce4ece32b77ca221ba531e34af54ac9128b125064318ac80" href="../../证据/41ab8d4f6ff3bb15ce4ece32b77ca221ba531e34af54ac9128b125064318ac80.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>41ab8d4f6ff3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7830.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="84716093886a2e5db9fc760a7aa2a5b50cfea7c93066ce166921fe37f5f8c775" href="../../证据/84716093886a2e5db9fc760a7aa2a5b50cfea7c93066ce166921fe37f5f8c775.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>84716093886a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OG05 · 三类标量输出helper的正常来源分支 → 按索引读取一个值，追加进目标；文本另有复制</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>13450/139f0/13fa0先检查目标typed指针。来源分类字段+0x98为1或2时使用描述中的字面值；为3时验证来源typed对象，再处理选择模式。普通索引分支先调用132e0取得索引，检查来源payload/count，从int/float各4字节元素或string指针数组取一个值，分别交fc50/fd30/100f0追加目标。string先经006470形成临时文本，再复制交100f0；不是把来源指针数组直接作为目标结果。模式+0x170==1另交fcb0/fe00/101a0处理，不能与单元素分支混称已证完整数组拷贝。</p><p>Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有：这条既有事实明确核实“三类标量输出helper的正常来源分支 → 按索引读取一个值，追加进目标；文本另有复制”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">尚需每种复合类型、循环累积/替换和最后持有者的逐族链；不能把PortValue只读字典或单图buffer当全部累积模型。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：132e0完整索引表达式求值、全数组helper与目标append的底层分配/最后读者未在Group专题闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：空来源、越界、不同失败后的先前累积值与原厂运行结果未做差分。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/180013450.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fe177673ff91b91118b87a4cbff6509125697a8aa83f6ddc7652e89594b20565" href="../../证据/fe177673ff91b91118b87a4cbff6509125697a8aa83f6ddc7652e89594b20565.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fe177673ff91</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/180013450.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e3eef3d2269cb14f781098bae988685dec44039b4d28696e7f856c87de3c1918" href="../../证据/e3eef3d2269cb14f781098bae988685dec44039b4d28696e7f856c87de3c1918.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e3eef3d2269c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800139f0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="25aa90aef03805e12f2b41385e27a84366f685220763659ed6302afe00ccb261" href="../../证据/25aa90aef03805e12f2b41385e27a84366f685220763659ed6302afe00ccb261.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>25aa90aef038</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/180013fa0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9d3ad2e56dec1bcb32dee08bb75e73f87cb7b04fa6ad4ecdd396a48817ea488a" href="../../证据/9d3ad2e56dec1bcb32dee08bb75e73f87cb7b04fa6ad4ecdd396a48817ea488a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9d3ad2e56dec</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800139f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d8c3102b6a44f5237a2132a1e6f5ff701cc4fd31321b55a61a61d07eb9352c05" href="../../证据/d8c3102b6a44f5237a2132a1e6f5ff701cc4fd31321b55a61a61d07eb9352c05.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d8c3102b6a44</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/180013fa0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a0d352df7ef3f8bd243ab820403404e8014ebfd22ab14c9c128d95ab39e28c69" href="../../证据/a0d352df7ef3f8bd243ab820403404e8014ebfd22ab14c9c128d95ab39e28c69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a0d352df7ef3</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OG06 · 输出处理失败与DoWork收尾 → 分开保存处理错误码、状态码和ModuStatus布尔值</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>a7830继续遍历描述；在尚未捕获错误时，来源状态分类为3且来源记录存在、其工作状态不在0x75掩码允许集合时，复制该来源错误码与工作状态到本次错误/状态输出。汇编最终MOV EAX,R13D返回累计错误。DoWork收尾以其最终错误寄存器是否0写ModuStatus(index0)，把错误码写this+0x7c、另一个状态码写this+0x84，清this+0x1b8执行中标记，并另发布ModuRunTime。成功布尔、错误码与状态枚举不是一个字段。</p><p>Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有：这条既有事实明确核实“输出处理失败与DoWork收尾 → 分开保存处理错误码、状态码和ModuStatus布尔值”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">尚需每种复合类型、循环累积/替换和最后持有者的逐族链；不能把PortValue只读字典或单图buffer当全部累积模型。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：所有上游失败映射、mask中每个状态的名称、异常与取消的全路径未枚举；不由数值猜业务枚举语义。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7830.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2bf7dd74d3d703648642bb749856979e57c8fd750b2b2eed334ce96e09aa7406" href="../../证据/2bf7dd74d3d703648642bb749856979e57c8fd750b2b2eed334ce96e09aa7406.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2bf7dd74d3d7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7830.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="84716093886a2e5db9fc760a7aa2a5b50cfea7c93066ce166921fe37f5f8c775" href="../../证据/84716093886a2e5db9fc760a7aa2a5b50cfea7c93066ce166921fe37f5f8c775.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>84716093886a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cd7e33b0bcb04af69bd9879876fc782c3a98571bf665b41d4cb1a0e2e98f02c4" href="../../证据/cd7e33b0bcb04af69bd9879876fc782c3a98571bf665b41d4cb1a0e2e98f02c4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cd7e33b0bcb0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3176190147c541e9014ecd5e6213386642f7ea8848441feed69795eccd8cad55" href="../../证据/3176190147c541e9014ecd5e6213386642f7ea8848441feed69795eccd8cad55.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3176190147c5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/selected-strings.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c" href="../../证据/d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d216d954d532</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG07 · 成功轮GroupOutputAccumulator.Add → 保留PortValue片段 → Finish时新JoinArray容器</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>仅last.Status==Success时Add。对body输出中Accumulate且Accumulatable(Integer/Number/Text/Circle/Point/Fixture)的项，按ElementCount计数、百万元素独立资源门，再list.Add(value)保留原PortValue引用，不立即复制元素。Finish先复制last.WorkflowOutputs字典；每个可累计输出即使未有片段也JoinArray(kind,values)，覆盖该名。JoinArray把Elements扁平ToArray，随后typed工厂再ToArray出新底层容器；string元素仍为原string引用，结构类型按值取出。</p><p>Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有：这条既有事实明确核实“成功轮GroupOutputAccumulator.Add → 保留PortValue片段 → Finish时新JoinArray容器”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">尚需每种复合类型、循环累积/替换和最后持有者的逐族链；不能把PortValue只读字典或单图buffer当全部累积模型。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：Struct元素内部若含引用不等于递归深拷贝；这里没有验证所有复合工具类型或原native累积所有权。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2050611182ab179c24209d2a45f425c3f04e66cbe6c28a2429f71120ffdc4ef4" href="../../证据/2050611182ab179c24209d2a45f425c3f04e66cbe6c28a2429f71120ffdc4ef4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2050611182ab</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="62d73d94bfb9e7c93af70ab3942a626b9b73b655d3362206ff3499fc12ee2aff" href="../../证据/62d73d94bfb9e7c93af70ab3942a626b9b73b655d3362206ff3499fc12ee2aff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>62d73d94bfb9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="77639b10cfe9d94f281e89e3b66994433c0f5e1eb065252293212f546f7efaa6" href="../../证据/77639b10cfe9d94f281e89e3b66994433c0f5e1eb065252293212f546f7efaa6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>77639b10cfe9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/PortArrays.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a9018865cfccb70ea69ee70da61ad9046995db440774089f554e59effe8439c6" href="../../证据/a9018865cfccb70ea69ee70da61ad9046995db440774089f554e59effe8439c6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a9018865cfcc</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/PortArrays.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ff506dbfa903452280cd829cc396cea34db5774c8225f1b806be8cc48ef67b51" href="../../证据/ff506dbfa903452280cd829cc396cea34db5774c8225f1b806be8cc48ef67b51.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ff506dbfa903</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG08 · Group显示累积与GroupDisplayLinks → GrayImage每轮替换及返回只读列表容器</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Add显示先找本轮WorkflowDisplays同名值，list不存在则创建；!spec.Accumulate或spec.Kind==GrayImage时先从displayCount减去旧元素数并frames.Clear，再执行百万元素资源门与AddRange(values)。条件仅精确GrayImage，不能泛称所有Image kind。Clear移除旧PortValue引用而不Dispose payload。FinishDisplays用每个frames.ToArray+Array.AsReadOnly并新字典。自动输出显示只支持GrayImage，LinkedOutputId对应输出稳定ID，同步NodeId/Port/Kind/Cardinality。</p><p>Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有：这条既有事实明确核实“Group显示累积与GroupDisplayLinks → GrayImage每轮替换及返回只读列表容器”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">尚需每种复合类型、循环累积/替换和最后持有者的逐族链；不能把PortValue只读字典或单图buffer当全部累积模型。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本slice没有运行UI，未证明Group图像帧与宿主renderer同次刷新、最后读者或灰度以外图像Kind的预期语义。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2050611182ab179c24209d2a45f425c3f04e66cbe6c28a2429f71120ffdc4ef4" href="../../证据/2050611182ab179c24209d2a45f425c3f04e66cbe6c28a2429f71120ffdc4ef4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2050611182ab</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3ee5478776bae14f5fd28f59cb0429f62f45a8961bdc93f26976e7be87312525" href="../../证据/3ee5478776bae14f5fd28f59cb0429f62f45a8961bdc93f26976e7be87312525.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3ee5478776ba</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupDisplayLinks.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="53c8672caca61d58cd3f692290125d5ef2085f6225d3d84c1d0e943eda934386" href="../../证据/53c8672caca61d58cd3f692290125d5ef2085f6225d3d84c1d0e943eda934386.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>53c8672caca6</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>group-control:G10 · IMVSGroupTool.ModuResult / GroupResult → 查询结果 / DynamicOutput getter</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ModuResult 每次新建 GroupResult(ID,this) 并 QueryModuleOneResult；GroupResult 指定模块对象时创建 DynamicOutput，整型 getter 有对象才委托，否则返回 default。不要把动态 getter 与实际累积算法混为一体。</p><p>计划将B04归入F-14，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/IMVSGroup.WorkflowAudit/IMVSGroupCs/IMVSGroupTool.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d6352506ff3a07780478a2ef8a91de5f0be59accd5b5b9a73306015490aba7dc" href="../../证据/d6352506ff3a07780478a2ef8a91de5f0be59accd5b5b9a73306015490aba7dc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d6352506ff3a</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/IMVSGroup.WorkflowAudit/IMVSGroupCs/GroupResult.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5d38e5d652b284528dcf3c45c3b005c89898fdb7a1ef447119dab010d142184e" href="../../证据/5d38e5d652b284528dcf3c45c3b005c89898fdb7a1ef447119dab010d142184e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5d38e5d652b2</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/IMVSGroup.WorkflowAudit/IMVSGroupCs/GroupResult.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e6b7e66a21f2628f7c5f0809a5aeca5173f1e801d9090b107966a8fe14f73c96" href="../../证据/e6b7e66a21f2628f7c5f0809a5aeca5173f1e801d9090b107966a8fe14f73c96.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e6b7e66a21f2</small></a></details></details><details><summary>group-control:C08 · GroupOutputAccumulator.Add → 输出累积 / display 图像替换</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>仅配置 Accumulate 且属支持类型的 workflow 输出进入累积列表；display 在不累积或 GrayImage 时先清再加。输出和 display 分别有1000000元素独立上限。</p><p>计划将B04归入F-14，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2050611182ab179c24209d2a45f425c3f04e66cbe6c28a2429f71120ffdc4ef4" href="../../证据/2050611182ab179c24209d2a45f425c3f04e66cbe6c28a2429f71120ffdc4ef4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2050611182ab</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="77639b10cfe9d94f281e89e3b66994433c0f5e1eb065252293212f546f7efaa6" href="../../证据/77639b10cfe9d94f281e89e3b66994433c0f5e1eb065252293212f546f7efaa6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>77639b10cfe9</small></a></details></details><details><summary>group-control:C09 · ReadSelfElement / Finish → 按逻辑元素索引读 self / JoinArray 发布</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>非累积读取 last 的输出元素；累积按各轮 ElementCount 找元素。Finish 先复制 last 输出，再用 JoinArray 覆盖配置累积项；没有 last 时从空字典开始，零轮不虚造图像。</p><p>计划将B04归入F-14，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5901b4dc75cf371ea0ed32d7ae39c8652bc7da8f7fe58c0623b2a712b61f099d" href="../../证据/5901b4dc75cf371ea0ed32d7ae39c8652bc7da8f7fe58c0623b2a712b61f099d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5901b4dc75cf</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="62d73d94bfb9e7c93af70ab3942a626b9b73b655d3362206ff3499fc12ee2aff" href="../../证据/62d73d94bfb9e7c93af70ab3942a626b9b73b655d3362206ff3499fc12ee2aff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>62d73d94bfb9</small></a></details></details><details><summary>group-control:U02 · 中断比较 / native 输出累积 → 原生全域行为</summary><p>unknown</p><p>本图尚未逐分支接入 native IsBreakLoop 与 ProcessGroupOutput 的汇编、调用实参和所有类型内存布局；现有回收文件不是空缺的替代规格。</p><p>计划将B04归入F-14，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“Group输出叶映射、基数与累积持有”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。复合输出、首轮内部来源保护、失败后结果归属、native 取消/异常及堆生命周期仍按分支补证。；资源操作执行器和循环入口到 native DoWork 的完整生产调用链未在本页闭合。</p></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-15" id="F-15"><summary>F-15 · Group 配置器 · 候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：公共候选缓存、Group代理字段和ROI字节/坐标消费属于不同合同；图像源参数/绑定仅是有限工具切片，不证明全部配置控件。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>B01 · 实际运行Tab与变量目标</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>GetParamRoot → BaseNode.Init → XmlLoaded → GetRunParamsTree → RunParamsSelectData</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>有效XmlPath/Data/Tabs、链接扩展和窗口缓存是什么</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>指定实例采集构造前/XmlLoaded前后/枚举返回；拼接两态、类型、占用、消失项、取消确认</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>原始类型及谓词逐项匹配目标树；更新FCR-019字段和生命周期，不凭CustomVisible推断</dd></dl><p>参数根缓存/失败、运行候选作用域、基础筛选与确认已分片；派生类、完整链接扩展和原机操作仍未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B01</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a498165b36c3aea0354590e92ff3f6447c4819bfb4964bebf87518e494f43979" href="../../证据/a498165b36c3aea0354590e92ff3f6447c4819bfb4964bebf87518e494f43979.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a498165b36c3</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B06 · Group配置、ROI和结果消费边界</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>GroupRunParam/RunParamConfigDecorate/RoiConfigControl/ROISelecter_GroupControl</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>代理候选、复杂字段编辑及ROI坐标消费的原生语义</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>核对FCR-018/019/021/022；仅main Group代理/消费端实现；复杂编辑由插件合同提供</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>原始候选/写入/执行可核对；实际ROI跨Group运行和保存重开；不另造插件配置模板</dd></dl><p>Group专用模板/回调/后台装载/关闭及共享ROI片段；候选过滤/回填和即时编辑已分片；复杂字段、SDK与完整往返未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B06</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2cf78ac75f937a0d8bba24df185e587d6d2012f1c89262eb56eb4f25dfc25a7a" href="../../证据/2cf78ac75f937a0d8bba24df185e587d6d2012f1c89262eb56eb4f25dfc25a7a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2cf78ac75f93</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B08 · 模型与Group组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>真实插件、嵌套Group、变量、ROI与历史持久化组合</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>单项通过后组合是否保持身份和数据一致</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>混合类型/多层/循环中断/累积/改型/撤销/保存重开/停止失败恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每场景对照原机输出和状态；失败不读陈旧结果；组合未知仍开放</dd></dl><p>模型/Group组合验收：需嵌套、变量、累积、保存重开和再次运行的同场景证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e" href="../../证据/4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f3a8f2e940f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C01 · 撤销root/part实际捕获</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>VM.UnRedo.Schedule.Register/UpdateActionData及ModuleParam/UserData</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>真实根身份、捕获时点、抑制及取消异常效果</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>独占工作副本/TempFiles；编辑同模块两次、不同模块、Group关闭、Undo/Redo；记录动作/值/栈</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>CIL/反编译与真实命中相互对应；临时文件原件保全；不构造服务清理他任务TempFiles</dd></dl><p>根/分片录入与当前历史引擎的有限对照</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C01</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="610bb0d99c71d688e9a0c37e2e4b299a119a1778498af2ef5eed531ebb7c00e8" href="../../证据/610bb0d99c71d688e9a0c37e2e4b299a119a1778498af2ef5eed531ebb7c00e8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>610bb0d99c71</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>SP02 · 原参数模型的值编辑与输入引用选择 → 字符串参数IParamsConfig索引器 或 ParamSubManager绑定</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>NameValueItem.SetParamUnit先检查AccessMode含w、取Value并Check，异常恢复OldValue并返回-2，成功进入SetParamUnitByZmq；其实际调用SetParamUnitDirect，将value写入userStringData[ComName]，不是因为方法名带Zmq就已证明传输协议。ModuleParam字符串索引器在模块未Dispose时记录撤销并调用SetValueBySDK，普通键最终为ModuleManager.SetParamValue(Parent.ID,key,value)，读则GetParamValue。另一路ValueBase.SubData构造GetFrontFilterTreeOperation与SetModuleParamBindOperation，后者区分清绑定、常量、全局和VmIO路径，调用ParamSubManager；值参数与输入源引用不可当成同一数据载荷。</p><p>候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“原参数模型的值编辑与输入引用选择 → 字符串参数IParamsConfig索引器 或 ParamSubManager绑定”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">公共候选缓存、Group代理字段和ROI字节/坐标消费属于不同合同；图像源参数/绑定仅是有限工具切片，不证明全部配置控件。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：所选托管链止于ModuleManager SDK调用，尚未取得其通信/服务端分发直至ImageSource原生SetParam的逐体桥，不能标为已闭合端到端。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：资源控件事件到ValueChangedCommand的全部模板绑定未在本条复核；ValueBase/Boolean操作模型不等于实际鼠标运行验收。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab/NameValueItem.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="72a635ae2f4c04fc18bf14881b4710101554c6874c7ac86af3233eb5d2b25fdb" href="../../证据/72a635ae2f4c04fc18bf14881b4710101554c6874c7ac86af3233eb5d2b25fdb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>72a635ae2f4c</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab/NameValueItem.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="864015f9c4aa0ad893cbd34a63181b25ab6a800ea20f349842e2e3acbddfa850" href="../../证据/864015f9c4aa0ad893cbd34a63181b25ab6a800ea20f349842e2e3acbddfa850.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>864015f9c4aa</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab/NameValueItem.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3d24ff326db91c7322700a826c92a7b3a5367d9c9797788cf4551a99427018ff" href="../../证据/3d24ff326db91c7322700a826c92a7b3a5367d9c9797788cf4551a99427018ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3d24ff326db9</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab/AlgorithmTabRoot.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="63a4ff585923976c1d7345a2ff91343c944ac59c7902328f15b07f200e178703" href="../../证据/63a4ff585923976c1d7345a2ff91343c944ac59c7902328f15b07f200e178703.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>63a4ff585923</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/ModuleParam.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dad134370ce1c1c05a669f7371fca188bb4245c96d7535ae34840951feece46e" href="../../证据/dad134370ce1c1c05a669f7371fca188bb4245c96d7535ae34840951feece46e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dad134370ce1</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/ModuleParam.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e2fca156bd1005287675392cc23cf4cea3d45ae4910ae5b9e7d9a8d1fcb57244" href="../../证据/e2fca156bd1005287675392cc23cf4cea3d45ae4910ae5b9e7d9a8d1fcb57244.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e2fca156bd10</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab/ValueBase.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d6923e9d7a58bf258ea4345bfdfdd2f0eb0c25d6dbfec7f50bbb7761e8eec40e" href="../../证据/d6923e9d7a58bf258ea4345bfdfdd2f0eb0c25d6dbfec7f50bbb7761e8eec40e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d6923e9d7a58</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab/SetModuleParamBindOperation.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7014db7149cb0642b258349334f3cffd2ba6cd85577dd07515f37bf34524e8a4" href="../../证据/7014db7149cb0642b258349334f3cffd2ba6cd85577dd07515f37bf34524e8a4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7014db7149cb</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PS04 · 原VmParamSubManager.SetModuleParamBinding → 绑定描述结构 → 临时HGlobal → IMVS_SetModuleParamBinding</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>引用订阅不走PS01的name/value setter。VmParamSubManager构建nNum=1且128槽数组：目标Owner.ID、参数类型、128字节参数名；绑定值另含变量类型、256字节常量、目标模块ID/128字节来源名、下标类型与256字节常量或下标来源。StringUtil.UTF8GetFixLenBytes先建定长数组，再复制min(UTF8字节长度,len)，超长是按字节截断，满长度不额外加NUL。ModuleManager.SetModuleParamBinding→ServerSDKAPI构造并复制描述列表，AllocHGlobal(Marshal.SizeOf(...))、StructureToPtr、PInvoke IMVS_SetModuleParamBinding(handle,ptr)，正常路径释放outer HGlobal；native错误由ModuleManager抛VmException，VmParamSubManager捕获并返回false。</p><p>候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“原VmParamSubManager.SetModuleParamBinding → 绑定描述结构 → 临时HGlobal → IMVS_SetModuleParamBinding”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">公共候选缓存、Group代理字段和ROI字节/坐标消费属于不同合同；图像源参数/绑定仅是有限工具切片，不证明全部配置控件。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不从描述复制推断来源像素深拷贝；native关系存储、订阅值更新时序和解绑所有权需实际nativecallee。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：定长UTF8在多字节边界的截断可能形成不完整编码；是否UI前置校验避免此输入，本条没有端到端证明。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/VmParamSubManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4e4ccdabd3f3f28e7ce330601127179aa625a3ab1dcba35bbb0c1e23c9367c1e" href="../../证据/4e4ccdabd3f3f28e7ce330601127179aa625a3ab1dcba35bbb0c1e23c9367c1e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4e4ccdabd3f3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/StringUtil.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c8c07b1b654c35204e40bbe3ff0f4b29f8f996df2b00ec5b676f42fe25743b80" href="../../证据/c8c07b1b654c35204e40bbe3ff0f4b29f8f996df2b00ec5b676f42fe25743b80.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c8c07b1b654c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="99c4dbb9a08a0a38a7c44503368a3ccc6da9e5a462b18ed3713117dc50163a85" href="../../证据/99c4dbb9a08a0a38a7c44503368a3ccc6da9e5a462b18ed3713117dc50163a85.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>99c4dbb9a08a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ServerSDKAPI.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="963fec7dd5c7cad93bc9041e9ee1431bc0801994f046a82a79cfd4f1a8a08ce1" href="../../证据/963fec7dd5c7cad93bc9041e9ee1431bc0801994f046a82a79cfd4f1a8a08ce1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>963fec7dd5c7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="64218321649fcff71ae2637248023e55e97d380df6e38418210d5d10514bae4f" href="../../证据/64218321649fcff71ae2637248023e55e97d380df6e38418210d5d10514bae4f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>64218321649f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CP01 · 工具配置Apply与编辑文档 → 经校验的JSON参数副本</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>常规工具配置窗口的Apply先核方案/目录/窗口与执行所有者，并在activeRun非null时拒绝修改，再取before、调用SetProcedureNodeParameters并更新有效参数缓存。CheckedParameters为每个JsonElement调用Clone，校验参数错误后交给文档编辑；Document getter又调用Copy，Copy重新分配节点参数字典并Clone各JSON值。因此正常全流程运行中不能把此Apply描述为允许实时修改本轮参数。</p><p>候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“工具配置Apply与编辑文档 → 经校验的JSON参数副本”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">公共候选缓存、Group代理字段和ROI字节/坐标消费属于不同合同；图像源参数/绑定仅是有限工具切片，不证明全部配置控件。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：此门只证明所选常规配置Apply路径；不能扩称所有API、插件内部状态和配置自执行期间都具有同一禁改门。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolConfigurationHost.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a09999e256e7d3f5243baa49d058628274441f93381c20c1638dc43bcb30c558" href="../../证据/a09999e256e7d3f5243baa49d058628274441f93381c20c1638dc43bcb30c558.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a09999e256e7</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4a9b1bacdb248b1a185f104853215d1a01da26c973fbe7067b23f675a1eee4a8" href="../../证据/4a9b1bacdb248b1a185f104853215d1a01da26c973fbe7067b23f675a1eee4a8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4a9b1bacdb24</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7e3dd26a78a6f3ad48dca542413add08c9d856a2466bf9521218391c64dca421" href="../../证据/7e3dd26a78a6f3ad48dca542413add08c9d856a2466bf9521218391c64dca421.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7e3dd26a78a6</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a847417041600ab2f5b154fb2ce08a9c2e4263894d69d712be4fb079e7d71ef8" href="../../证据/a847417041600ab2f5b154fb2ce08a9c2e4263894d69d712be4fb079e7d71ef8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a84741704160</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691" href="../../证据/dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dd3930e245ff</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CP03 · 节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每个节点先从已复制n.Parameters建立新的字典，补Clone后的默认JSON值，再在执行到此节点时通过workflow.Resolve解析订阅；参数订阅经WorkflowSubscriptions.Parameter检查标量种类并SerializeToElement，覆盖该节点参数。普通连线则直接把上游PortValue赋入nodeInputs。ExecuteAsync收到两套ReadOnlyDictionary包装；ModuleExecutionContext构造器直接持有这两套只读接口。只读包装没有复制PortValue中图像/对象的含义。</p><p>候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">公共候选缓存、Group代理字段和ROI字节/坐标消费属于不同合同；图像源参数/绑定仅是有限工具切片，不证明全部配置控件。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：DataKinds.Coerce及插件执行可有自己的转换/复制规则；仅凭框架字典不能推定任意具体图像在工具内零复制或深复制。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：下游动态读取服务与原生参数setter认可状态不在这条托管参数传递事实内。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633" href="../../证据/e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e137f34d98c9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464" href="../../证据/a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a2d27b66691d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662" href="../../证据/f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f51cff92f0bd</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484" href="../../证据/e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e79249d8651c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39" href="../../证据/c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c50568f01e32</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD08 · 原变量作用域和运行参数引用绑定 → DataSource.ID+变量名作为来源身份，参数类型匹配后绑定ALL</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>SetRunParamBindForName按目标模块ID获取模型，仅IsSupportSub且变量类型文本与参数Type相同的项继续；调用ParamSubManager.SetModuleParamBinding时来源模块是DataSource.ID、来源名varName、类型SUBSCRIBE_VAR_VARIABLE，下标模式ALL且常量文本All。成功才在目标模块UserData[&quot;@&quot;+参数名]存true并重置ISubInfo初始化状态。变量作用域不是单独一个裸字符串名；VarItem显示将Owner.ID==13000标为全局，其他模块标为局部，但显示标签不替代实际来源模块ID。</p><p>候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“原变量作用域和运行参数引用绑定 → DataSource.ID+变量名作为来源身份，参数类型匹配后绑定ALL”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">公共候选缓存、Group代理字段和ROI字节/坐标消费属于不同合同；图像源参数/绑定仅是有限工具切片，不证明全部配置控件。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原生局部变量模块创建/调用栈作用域、过程结束销毁与ALL订阅求值时序未取得原体。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8b92dd2335e7a1bbf46eadfb1d1380d1276bfd4c1912f2452ac5a0f89e8e754c" href="../../证据/8b92dd2335e7a1bbf46eadfb1d1380d1276bfd4c1912f2452ac5a0f89e8e754c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8b92dd2335e7</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.Variable/VarItem.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="104c7dda451561747e81c29785ff2028d4e9ea5702cbd60201c97a1a604cf1af" href="../../证据/104c7dda451561747e81c29785ff2028d4e9ea5702cbd60201c97a1a604cf1af.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>104c7dda4515</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CD06 · WorkflowSubscriptions常量/变量/参数与延迟读取 → 字节变量仍为文本，JSON复制与UTF8容量读另走</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>VariableKind把int映为Integer、float映为Number、string与byte都映为Text；NormalizeValue把byte限制为偶数长度十六进制并大写，Initial的byte落到Text(v.Value)，没有在这里转byte[]。NumberArrayConstant先JSON反序列化double[]、检查最多1000000元素且有限，再由Resolve调用Numbers复制一次。参数订阅要求Kind匹配且Scalar，并SerializeToElement生成JSON；Integer参数还checked转int32并按参数范围验证。延迟文本读另取Text元素，截到首个NUL，计算UTF8字节数+1，容量不足返回所需字节数；它返回string，不提供原生借用字节指针。</p><p>候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“WorkflowSubscriptions常量/变量/参数与延迟读取 → 字节变量仍为文本，JSON复制与UTF8容量读另走”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">公共候选缓存、Group代理字段和ROI字节/坐标消费属于不同合同；图像源参数/绑定仅是有限工具切片，不证明全部配置控件。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：这里不声称原版byte变量也如此传输；原SDK字节值与字符串指针寿命另列。读取器resolve回调是否捕获跨轮可变对象须按具体入口另核。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d8c65f72eae3daa3bf7cbec4b11f28fa068833602f9dff472a419f1897dca3dd" href="../../证据/d8c65f72eae3daa3bf7cbec4b11f28fa068833602f9dff472a419f1897dca3dd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d8c65f72eae3</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowConfiguration.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b2e1e26065160f34a4cbf6a7e202167ab144f4f74795d20c6ff16eeb1abf0dca" href="../../证据/b2e1e26065160f34a4cbf6a7e202167ab144f4f74795d20c6ff16eeb1abf0dca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b2e1e2606516</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="767ad7e092a73b8ec795acb96eaa64dcc4a560040e13d50f2b273363c95cd80a" href="../../证据/767ad7e092a73b8ec795acb96eaa64dcc4a560040e13d50f2b273363c95cd80a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>767ad7e092a7</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="08268452fb859167c303637d11b85f33bbd1a01514e61643a4b7d7241b9a48ec" href="../../证据/08268452fb859167c303637d11b85f33bbd1a01514e61643a4b7d7241b9a48ec.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>08268452fb85</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="90ebadc33bac5f6ff70bbc6c375ef022f029f69dd1f8c254877ed90bea740381" href="../../证据/90ebadc33bac5f6ff70bbc6c375ef022f029f69dd1f8c254877ed90bea740381.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>90ebadc33bac</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowNumericInputRead.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="10c2d6477e8bafac729b4987bf15ce732e733869cdac4364aa56e12bf4975318" href="../../证据/10c2d6477e8bafac729b4987bf15ce732e733869cdac4364aa56e12bf4975318.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>10c2d6477e8b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CD07 · 局部变量改型/删除/节点删除 → 断开文档订阅和来源不等于清历史运行值</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>局部变量窗口Commit改型时归一化或重置Value，并清该变量的SourceNode/SourcePort；类型变化还移除以此LocalVariable为来源的Subscriptions。DeleteVariable删除变量及其消费者订阅；删除分组类似批量移除。GraphEditorDocument.SetWorkflowConfiguration验证并Snapshot，识别删除/改型ID后交PropagateGroupInterface处理关联。删除节点时WorkflowConfiguration.RemoveNodes移除相应来源引用，并把绑定该节点的变量改为无来源，保留配置Value。所选UI写配置经WriteWorkflowConfiguration在activeRun非空时拒绝；改文档不会原地改写已经捕获的本轮配置或旧session.LocalVariables。</p><p>候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“局部变量改型/删除/节点删除 → 断开文档订阅和来源不等于清历史运行值”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">公共候选缓存、Group代理字段和ROI字节/坐标消费属于不同合同；图像源参数/绑定仅是有限工具切片，不证明全部配置控件。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：父Group比较操作数等传播规则不能仅由变量窗口推定完整，本条只证明确调用到传播清理；其它程序化编辑入口门及跨方案消费者需另核。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowLocalVariablesWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="254d5307504316470e9d00366d4b9a31b2fab700f029cf77c5c3215cc36c9b33" href="../../证据/254d5307504316470e9d00366d4b9a31b2fab700f029cf77c5c3215cc36c9b33.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>254d53075043</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowLocalVariablesWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="568d700f8e89a52801af09145e98332faf4f7a3ec4ba8c12ce38e584a2261b25" href="../../证据/568d700f8e89a52801af09145e98332faf4f7a3ec4ba8c12ce38e584a2261b25.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>568d700f8e89</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9181e4c6a0199f6f171249fbe4181d0345afa621ef525a4a9e46d3dfab44235c" href="../../证据/9181e4c6a0199f6f171249fbe4181d0345afa621ef525a4a9e46d3dfab44235c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9181e4c6a019</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowConfiguration.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6d008fca77fcf3637cbc222223e3be1be0c8c034c5b477f4e34ecc5b12012661" href="../../证据/6d008fca77fcf3637cbc222223e3be1be0c8c034c5b477f4e34ecc5b12012661.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6d008fca77fc</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowConfigurationHost.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="97937fb661c298b491b1a79deb541c77623984d541af951b012cb9b8a64c46ff" href="../../证据/97937fb661c298b491b1a79deb541c77623984d541af951b012cb9b8a64c46ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>97937fb661c2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GroupInterfacePropagation.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13692e9a896366cb89184a3d0c4b5939e8a3c8a0a2f77661fed0721536c799da" href="../../证据/13692e9a896366cb89184a3d0c4b5939e8a3c8a0a2f77661fed0721536c799da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13692e9a8963</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP05 · 原具体UI模型字段 → 字段级布局、默认值与缓存规则必须分列</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>IsReady使用1字节0/1，缺键保留nullable未知，null setter删除。GUID初始化先CheckUIParamExist，存在时new Guid(bytes)，不存在创建Guid.NewGuid().ToByteArray再写入。ProceZoomIndex缺键返回backing字段初值9；getter读取并int.Parse后不回填该字段，setter先改字段再尝试写入且吞为消息框，故字段与SDK值不必事务一致。IsSubscribeInWindow按nullable缓存首次读取，缺失或TryParse失败为false；setter先更新缓存和通知，再尝试写入且吞异常。</p><p>候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“原具体UI模型字段 → 字段级布局、默认值与缓存规则必须分列”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">公共候选缓存、Group代理字段和ROI字节/坐标消费属于不同合同；图像源参数/绑定仅是有限工具切片，不证明全部配置控件。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：Hik.Util两个编码helper完整体未在本片取得，因此缩放/订阅确切字节长度及尾零不宣称已证；异常载荷（空数组IsReady、无效GUID、不可解析缩放）不伪造容错。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8c71b0114886861819fcead4482fa4f20ea893c7e0b7391e470acb2a90c44afc" href="../../证据/8c71b0114886861819fcead4482fa4f20ea893c7e0b7391e470acb2a90c44afc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8c71b0114886</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d63370198c7bce1a0595bbf66eb11a1504baf5870b65e3b82c6be786c682a187" href="../../证据/d63370198c7bce1a0595bbf66eb11a1504baf5870b65e3b82c6be786c682a187.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d63370198c7b</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmSolution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="874043e25e052d7287a1eaba1799c98ab5774cb0945c5c246d4a36aeb9794637" href="../../证据/874043e25e052d7287a1eaba1799c98ab5774cb0945c5c246d4a36aeb9794637.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>874043e25e05</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmSolution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13716210ca56ae8aff48e500cd721395ea8f82806007424a0c49d1d6c9f24f08" href="../../证据/13716210ca56ae8aff48e500cd721395ea8f82806007424a0c49d1d6c9f24f08.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13716210ca56</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmSolution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e0cdebb3227a1f5299a6214d1d11e659a20340b6ec5939dc29d28bbd1ce5eaf2" href="../../证据/e0cdebb3227a1f5299a6214d1d11e659a20340b6ec5939dc29d28bbd1ce5eaf2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e0cdebb3227a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PST03 · 标定插件PrepareSave → 持久scope/fallback状态先同步，随后输出参数副本</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>ReadCalibFile.Save先GetState，再在state.Gate内Configure；Configure会先置Initialized/Requested，再按首次缓存、空路径或磁盘读取分支Apply，更新LoadError及按ReplaceData/CommitPath条件更新Data/Path/Cache。随后才克隆节点参数并按SaveCalibDataEnable输出CachedFileData。Rotate.PrepareSave同样Get并Synchronize：首次可从36字节CachedMatrix恢复9个float，否则按AppliedPath差异Session.Load并写AppliedPath，随后把当前Matrix序列化为新Base64 CachedMatrix及Loaded标志。故参数字典的隔离不等于插件state也隔离。</p><p>候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“标定插件PrepareSave → 持久scope/fallback状态先同步，随后输出参数副本”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">公共候选缓存、Group代理字段和ROI字节/坐标消费属于不同合同；图像源参数/绑定仅是有限工具切片，不证明全部配置控件。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本条只确认当前两个插件族；Session内部Load/Restore数值算法和全部异常不在本切片展开。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未执行保存失败探针；静态无回滚不等于所有失败都会改变state，取决于具体分支和旧状态。</p><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.Calibration/ReadCalibFilePlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bbae10fe71b02e51d47c5f6f15c27d88e59067cda408222b8ed5fd1869445381" href="../../证据/bbae10fe71b02e51d47c5f6f15c27d88e59067cda408222b8ed5fd1869445381.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bbae10fe71b0</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.Calibration/ReadCalibFilePlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ed767d72c4e2046c8c2cf8ec96aa9f571d42be1c80d6335dcd30a208f01a39ff" href="../../证据/ed767d72c4e2046c8c2cf8ec96aa9f571d42be1c80d6335dcd30a208f01a39ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ed767d72c4e2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.Calibration/RotateCalibrationPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3187a10c1db60663334a3c538dc703133deb43a8bd6b7942c1ba3402e72663ea" href="../../证据/3187a10c1db60663334a3c538dc703133deb43a8bd6b7942c1ba3402e72663ea.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3187a10c1db6</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.Calibration/RotateCalibrationPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8ddba4e7cd4fdaffb045685e38cb82ca1235f8c6227d86bab3c33a63c440474e" href="../../证据/8ddba4e7cd4fdaffb045685e38cb82ca1235f8c6227d86bab3c33a63c440474e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8ddba4e7cd4f</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.Calibration/RotateCalibrationPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b412e7153c4aa5da2bdfe354d6432d0bb4c40d7a81a32538b67dcd4aa0056339" href="../../证据/b412e7153c4aa5da2bdfe354d6432d0bb4c40d7a81a32538b67dcd4aa0056339.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b412e7153c4a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f" href="../../证据/9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9ed5d7beed27</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>parameter-candidates:P00 · ModuleParam.GetParamRoot / AlgorithmTabRoot构造 → Data缓存门 / XmlPath与Owner / 装载失败后的根缓存</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>GetParamRoot仅param.Data==null时new AlgorithmTabRoot(param)并写Data；否则直接as AlgorithmTabRoot返回，错误类型缓存不自动重建。IParamsConfig构造传XmlPath/Parent；路径构造设UserStringData/Owner，Owner.InitLoad位于装载try前。try内loadXml(path,true)失败只记录日志并返回，因此外层仍可能缓存未完整装载的根，不能以Data非空证明成功。</p><p>计划将B01归入F-15，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。实际XmlPath/Owner来源、缓存其它写入/释放/失效、装载失败后消费者和派生行为仍未关闭；不补自动重试或回滚。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-candidates-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="73b13ef7d1df1b49c3708c2a0e879a37c32d3e9cb2a00af2e414df0d8737d1c5" href="../../证据/73b13ef7d1df1b49c3708c2a0e879a37c32d3e9cb2a00af2e414df0d8737d1c5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>73b13ef7d1df</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-candidates-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0be1f588d8f43ac316da8a470968e30a40b602e2a3842807a6415f002a1885c0" href="../../证据/0be1f588d8f43ac316da8a470968e30a40b602e2a3842807a6415f002a1885c0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0be1f588d8f4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-candidates-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3136342dfcc86d02ae2fcf1ad93249b7578c0c01a06c7fae790efa58b15aa358" href="../../证据/3136342dfcc86d02ae2fcf1ad93249b7578c0c01a06c7fae790efa58b15aa358.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3136342dfcc8</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser/Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab.VmModuleExtern.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="efc3223c7c93fe180ca339ba876a71a8f2e33aa5062919412907695ae2acc692" href="../../证据/efc3223c7c93fe180ca339ba876a71a8f2e33aa5062919412907695ae2acc692.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>efc3223c7c93</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser/Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab.AlgorithmTabRoot.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="62dbbbd5e289367c2c88e9d55e5940b8fdae23b36ec668a3a81831facef02280" href="../../证据/62dbbbd5e289367c2c88e9d55e5940b8fdae23b36ec668a3a81831facef02280.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>62dbbbd5e289</small></a></details></details><details><summary>parameter-candidates:P05 · GetSubRunParamsTree / AllModuleRunParams → 按int模块ID缓存 / 首次全类型建表 / 后续类型过滤</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>缓存缺该模块ID时取Params.GetParamRoot和根候选树；只在isAllType=true时构建RunParamsBaseNode列表并Add到字典。已有缓存时才按valueType.Contains(DisplayType.ToLower())过滤或直接取全列表，再重写ParentTree；非空列表才写Holder.EnumEntrysA。首次直接请求非全类型未见同等建表分支，不将缓存存在与不存在的结果混为一谈。</p><p>计划将B01归入F-15，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。缓存失效/模块ID跨方案重用、派生GetSubRunParamsTree、变量绑定排除/保留lambda及虚拟属性的全部语义仍需逐项核。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-candidates-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9adb628f12ce606d08de5360b0484b7e9c8451d048818a862fece932fab8527a" href="../../证据/9adb628f12ce606d08de5360b0484b7e9c8451d048818a862fece932fab8527a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9adb628f12ce</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlUI/Apps.XmlUI.ParamTab/RunParamsSelectData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="262156db11780260b0ae16484727b999a35d6ca0bae639de1194145f5817fae6" href="../../证据/262156db11780260b0ae16484727b999a35d6ca0bae639de1194145f5817fae6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>262156db1178</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlUI/Apps.XmlUI.ParamTab/RunParamsSelectData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2e4113dac74dccd63d9efd8f8241850d8d5d9891afe071b79b518718f1be9c91" href="../../证据/2e4113dac74dccd63d9efd8f8241850d8d5d9891afe071b79b518718f1be9c91.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2e4113dac74d</small></a></details></details><details><summary>parameter-candidates:P07 · GetSelectedRunParams / Confirm handler → OutputEnabled集合 → 数量/重复/类型门 → 替换SelectRunParams</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>先汇总所有缓存中OutputEnabled项；基础MaxCheckedCount通常32，IsFromVarBind时int.MaxValue。变量绑定另检查OtherSelectedRunParmas按ModuleID+Name重复、以及IsSupportSub且RunParamIoType!=SelectedVarType的项，失败提示并false。通过后先Clear旧SelectRunParams列表，再把属性替换为新list；调用者保留旧列表引用不等于自动拿到新结果。确认处理器仅true时DialogResult=true并Close。</p><p>计划将B01归入F-15，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。重复/类型筛选的全部捕获lambda本轮未逐体CIL核验；派生MaxCheckedCount、取消/关闭路径和调用者读取结果/持久化另待核。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-candidates-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2c2caabde730ae1080d47f8b0d25011752a56f832b76d707727ec55a141cf5fc" href="../../证据/2c2caabde730ae1080d47f8b0d25011752a56f832b76d707727ec55a141cf5fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2c2caabde730</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-candidates-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8150ce8dc80d8e49a83d541c3f48d0608b5a5ed0afb982a734676fabb1e3fd82" href="../../证据/8150ce8dc80d8e49a83d541c3f48d0608b5a5ed0afb982a734676fabb1e3fd82.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8150ce8dc80d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-candidates-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="837c7b8bd4cff2ccae31943a97a5a6efcf42efb7be4607f716427dfee800a267" href="../../证据/837c7b8bd4cff2ccae31943a97a5a6efcf42efb7be4607f716427dfee800a267.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>837c7b8bd4cf</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-candidates-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d5d4d0585f7fa5c6d0733b6c9a5d49ef6d2855dec6feeebac69634b834e8e0af" href="../../证据/d5d4d0585f7fa5c6d0733b6c9a5d49ef6d2855dec6feeebac69634b834e8e0af.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d5d4d0585f7f</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlUI/Apps.XmlUI.ParamTab/RunParamsSelectData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="78fc1a3c0782bc72f511df4318d374579204bd89cedbfe71ec494a94f5e99d12" href="../../证据/78fc1a3c0782bc72f511df4318d374579204bd89cedbfe71ec494a94f5e99d12.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>78fc1a3c0782</small></a></details></details><details><summary>results-roi:V09 · ROISelecter.SetValue → 写权限 / 字节变化 → 参数/序列/预执行</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>AccessMode必须含w；NormalizeReversParse后与PreValue字节序列比较，变化才写PreValue/CurValueA、可选图像尺寸、SetParamUnit、SetRoiSeq、PreExecuteRun。没有变化不走预执行，不虚构每次鼠标事件都会执行。</p><p>计划将B06归入F-15，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab/ROISelecter.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9152c1eda48ae6add4d444acd032aa2261595454887b45ad12ab817926756edd" href="../../证据/9152c1eda48ae6add4d444acd032aa2261595454887b45ad12ab817926756edd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9152c1eda48a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>results-roi:C06 · GeometryCommitted → Commit → 验证 → apply几何 → run → Refresh</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>事件已由GroupRoiEditor提交后才进入服务；检查active/可编辑、验证能力，先apply源名/参数/regions，再标running并调用run；finally清running，外层finally强制刷新几何。原ROISelecter的字节去重规则不直接外推到此服务。</p><p>计划将B06归入F-15，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“候选树、代理参数、ROI坐标与历史”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionPluginContracts/ToolConfigurationRoiService.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e9adb9e0a62cf47b6ed7fc5e63d3086dca853ef96e57a0263bcf87e81adee380" href="../../证据/e9adb9e0a62cf47b6ed7fc5e63d3086dca853ef96e57a0263bcf87e81adee380.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e9adb9e0a62c</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-16" id="F-16"><summary>F-16 · 执行调度 · 单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>C02 · 单次/连续/停止调度与参数准备</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>VmProcedure/VmSolution → ModuleManager/CollectionManager → 原生调度</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>调度顺序、上游准备、等待超时、停止回调和状态码</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>REA追native边界；空流程、禁用、失败、连续、停止、超时与重入各记回调/输出/状态</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>不是只对按钮状态；确定每轮清理配置有效值及结果；设备路径缺证据单列</dd></dl><p>连续/停止、等待与独立执行入口；native调度未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C02</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="051c92177bd5f7e599b8e1634fe1bc807d4c0ca0be246adbbaf045cea496242a" href="../../证据/051c92177bd5f7e599b8e1634fe1bc807d4c0ca0be246adbbaf045cea496242a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>051c92177bd5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C03 · 结果历史与方案替换生命周期</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>IsClearLastExecuteResult/结果缓存/耗时/方案替换回调</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>何时清缓存、历史、耗时和订阅引用</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>切流程/新建/加载/失败加载/关闭/取消/再次运行；追对象、事件解绑、最后结果</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>配置默认及入口有来源；失败加载状态可核对；旧方案回调不污染新方案</dd></dl><p>当前结果发布/方案替换，以及原切源、解订阅、自执行与流程回调、managed三仓路由/清理的有限链；计数生产者、native像素寿命和实际交错未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C03</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0bf12c1587d8af01e5fab9492b23f7485a4fa49ee43f44c8d05db34d012ae457" href="../../证据/0bf12c1587d8af01e5fab9492b23f7485a4fa49ee43f44c8d05db34d012ae457.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0bf12c1587d8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C06 · 外部服务调度与故障隔离</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>全局触发/脚本/通信/设备服务的实际入口到执行链</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>服务由谁创建、触发流程、停止和保存</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>对A05每个服务建立子任务并REA取得原实现；无设备时先闭合managed/native调用，真实设备矩阵待资源</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每服务有显式证据/合同/错误和资源边界；没有设备证据不得标硬件闭合；不默认操作连接设备</dd></dl><p>函数源/MQ及通信换方案、触发即时写入和通信文件保护的有界调查；SDK生产/native与全服务仍未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C06</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="805ad58f7626bc5d5443e009993ac0439a586f104a7c488613d7b0d5547e6205" href="../../证据/805ad58f7626bc5d5443e009993ac0439a586f104a7c488613d7b0d5547e6205.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>805ad58f7626</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C07 · 长稳、并发与异常恢复</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>连续调度/Dispatcher/SDK callbacks/关闭与恢复路径</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>长跑、并发编辑、失败后继续和退出的实际状态</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>预先定义负载/时长/内存线程句柄基线；故障用自有副本；记录全部失败与恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>测量窗口与阈值有依据；无无界增长/悬挂任务；失败记录不删除；不虚报全平台无泄漏</dd></dl><p>停止等待、消息重入和当前租约释放的风险/状态分支；不包含长稳负载、阈值或无泄漏实测</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C07</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="911fd935548a0972b2b6e8e3ad6fa8c5d52ca80fb03284c0531e1c0d0124b47d" href="../../证据/911fd935548a0972b2b6e8e3ad6fa8c5d52ca80fb03284c0531e1c0d0124b47d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>911fd935548a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C08 · 执行与历史组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>原机同状态流程/Group/配置/历史综合链</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>运行编辑保存切换撤销之间是否存在状态污染</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>运行→编辑→停止→撤销→保存重开→再次运行；含嵌套、错误、取消和关闭</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每步结果/历史/文件/资源同时核对；独立重构差异显式保留</dd></dl><p>执行/历史组合验收：需运行、编辑、停止、撤销、保存重开和关闭的连续状态证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13fc665d3cc7e8867e5ff2c971b4aba671e67a2b2d42dc0cefeb1e14159816fc" href="../../证据/13fc665d3cc7e8867e5ff2c971b4aba671e67a2b2d42dc0cefeb1e14159816fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13fc665d3cc7</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>CP02 · 主流程启动与子流程调用 → 本次请求的JSON配置快照</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>MainWindow.RunCore先在调用线程用doc.Document构建SolutionWorkspace，再将workspace交Task.Run。SolutionExecutor.RunAsync再复制全部过程/节点参数，内部Execute和Group循环从这个document查子流程；GraphExecutor入口再复制目标图的参数。编辑文档后来替换JSON字段，不会替换已经捕获的本轮参数字典。ContinuousRun每次重新调用RunCore，故各轮具有各自的配置获取点；这不解除CP01的UI禁改门。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“主流程启动与子流程调用 → 本次请求的JSON配置快照”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：插件还可读取scope服务、运行状态、延迟输入读取器；这里只闭合JSON配置隔离，不能宣称整个执行环境不可变。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未执行线程竞争探针；不把静态复制链称为所有并发插件行为的运行证明。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="448e694dc315a2730a7d77260a9ee7ac5288f64fc4f58b95c4ffbeb90b71fb65" href="../../证据/448e694dc315a2730a7d77260a9ee7ac5288f64fc4f58b95c4ffbeb90b71fb65.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>448e694dc315</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="de8499c9502e975acd054f9babcb7931d2c02049a383ee86721d3ea436e73cff" href="../../证据/de8499c9502e975acd054f9babcb7931d2c02049a383ee86721d3ea436e73cff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>de8499c9502e</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9602b57c3aa8e64b1eb53daba79021f417e543ba392dfa007d5f7d07dd9479b" href="../../证据/b9602b57c3aa8e64b1eb53daba79021f417e543ba392dfa007d5f7d07dd9479b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9602b57c3aa</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e3c15660c826a8ad92f40bb1f45eb1dca0243ef458319ac966218ce2982698a5" href="../../证据/e3c15660c826a8ad92f40bb1f45eb1dca0243ef458319ac966218ce2982698a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e3c15660c826</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CP03 · 节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每个节点先从已复制n.Parameters建立新的字典，补Clone后的默认JSON值，再在执行到此节点时通过workflow.Resolve解析订阅；参数订阅经WorkflowSubscriptions.Parameter检查标量种类并SerializeToElement，覆盖该节点参数。普通连线则直接把上游PortValue赋入nodeInputs。ExecuteAsync收到两套ReadOnlyDictionary包装；ModuleExecutionContext构造器直接持有这两套只读接口。只读包装没有复制PortValue中图像/对象的含义。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：DataKinds.Coerce及插件执行可有自己的转换/复制规则；仅凭框架字典不能推定任意具体图像在工具内零复制或深复制。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：下游动态读取服务与原生参数setter认可状态不在这条托管参数传递事实内。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633" href="../../证据/e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e137f34d98c9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464" href="../../证据/a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a2d27b66691d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662" href="../../证据/f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f51cff92f0bd</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484" href="../../证据/e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e79249d8651c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39" href="../../证据/c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c50568f01e32</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CP05 · 进入ExecuteAsync前的有效参数 → scope按过程/模块/节点保存Seed和Values</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor在ExecuteAsync之前调用RememberExecutionParameters；该方法分别Clone seed与applied，所以缓存不依赖模块执行结束才写入，失败/取消也可能留下本次入参。ReadEffectiveParameters先Clone缓存Values，再把当前配置中与Seed的GetRawText不同的字段覆盖进去；RememberConfigurationParameters又可更新已变字段。因此“有效参数”是供编辑器继续配置的托管视图，不能直接标成上次成功算法实际使用的精确历史记录或原生setter确认。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“进入ExecuteAsync前的有效参数 → scope按过程/模块/节点保存Seed和Values”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：没有逐工具核其如何消费每个参数、是否忽略字段、何时复制到native；这些不能从托管入参缓存替代取证。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：删除节点与旧在飞请求的全部竞争仍需具体调用时序验证，缓存删除不等于全局排空。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f" href="../../证据/2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2f3bad3dab71</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.Parameters.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c827a1b26669642473dd9503c7ecb82a7717b78fc37ff6822c8b360650721236" href="../../证据/c827a1b26669642473dd9503c7ecb82a7717b78fc37ff6822c8b360650721236.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c827a1b26669</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a718146e6141fe220b1543247b919e2340a695a52f504d083d0e0e7b70c241dc" href="../../证据/a718146e6141fe220b1543247b919e2340a695a52f504d083d0e0e7b70c241dc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a718146e6141</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9372e51b811508f8adfc9b4eb36b249716410bd671fd070fcb17e4eec1426fe4" href="../../证据/9372e51b811508f8adfc9b4eb36b249716410bd671fd070fcb17e4eec1426fe4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9372e51b8115</small></a></details></details><details><summary>RQ01 · ModuleParam字符串/二进制参数读取 → GetParamValue字符串返回与GetBinaryData固定托管数组的独立通道</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ModuleParam字符串索引getter在Parent未Dispose时，普通参数调用GetParamValue并要求错误抛出；VmModuleSet且键以%开头则走动态运行参数查询。ModuleManager.GetParamValue无长度重载传4096给显式长度重载，再把ref string交IMVS_GetParamValue；它没有查询模块结果或构造ImageData。ModuleParam二进制索引另走GetBinaryData：普通路径先查长度、new byte[length]并固定该数组，把数组地址交IMVS_GetBinaryData写入；调用返回后解除固定，finally再次检查保证异常也解除固定。native错误时把data置null。参数二进制读取不能被画成SDK结果chunk/共享图像名返回的同一路径。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“ModuleParam字符串/二进制参数读取 → GetParamValue字符串返回与GetBinaryData固定托管数组的独立通道”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：动态参数、out IntPtr二进制重载以及native参数存储的寿命不由此ref byte[]路径代替；未执行native查询。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.Core.ModuleParam.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a7ac40bbe127dcc28bcd8dd97f9d4cd464e21dd1df5e9c7a34a3124bb2b0177b" href="../../证据/a7ac40bbe127dcc28bcd8dd97f9d4cd464e21dd1df5e9c7a34a3124bb2b0177b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a7ac40bbe127</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.Core.ModuleParam.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1d51ce17b6bda1e10469f235c23664d6d7eafb9bd5ae283c2f0e25f8abd46101" href="../../证据/1d51ce17b6bda1e10469f235c23664d6d7eafb9bd5ae283c2f0e25f8abd46101.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1d51ce17b6bd</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d55cafb159b697e98f035af7a5c3f283ea0ce7e55043865331c3898a681bdec4" href="../../证据/d55cafb159b697e98f035af7a5c3f283ea0ce7e55043865331c3898a681bdec4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d55cafb159b6</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d24dc8b5016834c1ba613a7433afaba89965866a2a06907173e7a833d1304d41" href="../../证据/d24dc8b5016834c1ba613a7433afaba89965866a2a06907173e7a833d1304d41.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d24dc8b50168</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2135621a0179d357ced6ae23dac2e965c3a6b4f06d8724c4209a3f3265006b60" href="../../证据/2135621a0179d357ced6ae23dac2e965c3a6b4f06d8724c4209a3f3265006b60.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2135621a0179</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1fb4c56132c2d862ac5a87c3fac9f7a98603451d46bbf06148ea2613406a493b" href="../../证据/1fb4c56132c2d862ac5a87c3fac9f7a98603451d46bbf06148ea2613406a493b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1fb4c56132c2</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f3dbfb43af0ac8a21f4e82b20557de6f3bed0ce5fa7ff61ff6cc8decec0a679" href="../../证据/0f3dbfb43af0ac8a21f4e82b20557de6f3bed0ce5fa7ff61ff6cc8decec0a679.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f3dbfb43af0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9525e2b36c84802ab71404cac5efe48a4047616316ba2e9100192f4446273b79" href="../../证据/9525e2b36c84802ab71404cac5efe48a4047616316ba2e9100192f4446273b79.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9525e2b36c84</small></a></details></details><details><summary>RQ02 · QueryModuleHistoryResultData主动查询 → PreProData托管结果数组与正常尾释放；不是无条件像素深拷贝</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>此方法明确以bResBuffFirst=false、bNeedImage=true、bUseResStructMap=false查询历史页。成功且根指针非零后读取结构、展开原结果数组，为每项调用ModuleManager.PreProData，再调用IMVS_ReleaseDynamicMemory释放历史结果列表，错误码非零则抛异常，最后返回托管结果数组。尽管注释称“深拷贝”，方法没有逐图强制GetData或复制共享映射：图像是否借用、保留共享名或已物化仍由DI04/DI07中LargeObject与chunk分支决定。预处理或结构展开抛异常时，该体没有finally保证走到正常尾Release。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“QueryModuleHistoryResultData主动查询 → PreProData托管结果数组与正常尾释放；不是无条件像素深拷贝”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：native释放种类的递归释放范围、借用像素在根容器释放后的有效期及异常外部清理尚未闭合；不能仅因无finally就声称原机已发生泄漏。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="86e0f325307325daa85c7846831d801c6ab48f4286156eac2cfdfc9865ffca82" href="../../证据/86e0f325307325daa85c7846831d801c6ab48f4286156eac2cfdfc9865ffca82.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>86e0f3253073</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="187d58e9ce3d7eb112455110f20077573446e6ee730789ce1e3cd0df0fd3a5b7" href="../../证据/187d58e9ce3d7eb112455110f20077573446e6ee730789ce1e3cd0df0fd3a5b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>187d58e9ce3d</small></a></details></details><details><summary>RQ03 · 历史分页查询 / QueryModuleOneResult → 显式所有权页句柄与映射结构返回的不同契约</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>历史分页重载以bUseResStructMap=false查询，成功时把根pQueryModuResInfoList交ref pstModuleResBuff，并返回浅结构；成功释放才把传入ref置零（容器Release的非幂等边界见DR02）。QueryModuleOneResult则请求index0、count1，只显式传bResBuffFirst（默认true）；ServerSDKAPI默认bNeedImage=true、bUseResStructMap=true。OneResult成功且nNum==1时只返回array[0]，其余正常情况返回null；未把本地查询根指针传给调用方，也没有本体显式Release。两条路径的映射模式不同，不能要求或推定调用方用同一容器释放协议。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“历史分页查询 / QueryModuleOneResult → 显式所有权页句柄与映射结构返回的不同契约”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：映射结果是否借用缓存、何时换帧/覆盖、是否按模块保存根容器及并发查询失效规则仍是native未知；不能把映射true等同历史页false的malloc所有权。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="22e42e4729053801da442608785a635c7534e75a9863f7294bbadb3a6b3c6f31" href="../../证据/22e42e4729053801da442608785a635c7534e75a9863f7294bbadb3a6b3c6f31.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>22e42e472905</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="14b9e7febde95e99bc4b1979b413012358a4cf25d47d1344eb6a8f64c581020c" href="../../证据/14b9e7febde95e99bc4b1979b413012358a4cf25d47d1344eb6a8f64c581020c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>14b9e7febde9</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bbdba49062664b31164209325e2365142d96d6c27fb5a73c384dc56e447ac8d2" href="../../证据/bbdba49062664b31164209325e2365142d96d6c27fb5a73c384dc56e447ac8d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bbdba4906266</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.PlatformSDKCS.ServerSDKAPI.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="040fdfaca94dbc467801206229b519b7681189ad1be194fb5f17bb1f8594f816" href="../../证据/040fdfaca94dbc467801206229b519b7681189ad1be194fb5f17bb1f8594f816.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>040fdfaca94d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ca45f94a3ad025951ba0b020d8232334e836a01226e68e773a731dcf0b90055b" href="../../证据/ca45f94a3ad025951ba0b020d8232334e836a01226e68e773a731dcf0b90055b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ca45f94a3ad0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="94d48f0ff82995fa28a55a9f4a5788fcfc044bc3d579c0d05d6a29be58591422" href="../../证据/94d48f0ff82995fa28a55a9f4a5788fcfc044bc3d579c0d05d6a29be58591422.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>94d48f0ff829</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e5a0ecd67839e5d083622c6efa8665023bb26f7fa408b0daf6f68a82f74159aa" href="../../证据/e5a0ecd67839e5d083622c6efa8665023bb26f7fa408b0daf6f68a82f74159aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e5a0ecd67839</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6d5dd1a0fd1316cf6fe7b612012e6177b0e1cf8b4411d9ddf10246ea1dc559a2" href="../../证据/6d5dd1a0fd1316cf6fe7b612012e6177b0e1cf8b4411d9ddf10246ea1dc559a2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6d5dd1a0fd13</small></a></details></details><details><summary>RQ04 · DynamicOutput.GetOutputImage / GetOutputImageV2 → 主动OneResult物化字节与已有IO载荷按模式构造SDK图像两分支</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>旧GetOutputImage先验证输出IO存在，再QueryModuleOneResult→PreProData；按type4及去%后的参数名找图像，nValueNum>0时只取第0个chunk.GetData(false)，把所得byte[]及长度直接赋ByteArrayData。V2不走该旧入口：它调用VmModule.GetImageByteData读取IMAGE父IO的第0子项chunk及宽高格式子项；浅复制模式只在MemoryType0/2时取共享名，其余模式调用GetData(false)。V2浅复制新建ImageBaseData、填宽高格式，有共享名才InitImageObjBySharedMem（new SharedMemoryItemVM(name,模块ExecuteCount)）；非浅复制用得到的数组构造ImageBaseData。IO.Value可能先触发DR01按计数刷新，不能把V2误画成无条件重新OneResult或PB回调路径。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“DynamicOutput.GetOutputImage / GetOutputImageV2 → 主动OneResult物化字节与已有IO载荷按模式构造SDK图像两分支”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原机同次宽高格式与共享图像的帧一致性、模块ExecuteCount与共享头当前计数的完整校验规则仍需运行/native证据；名字相同不证明同一实例。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.Core.DynamicOutput.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7efee3df4fe9ebb2f406d09a4c3a8ddd71e5062d87401ae06b341a91478f2068" href="../../证据/7efee3df4fe9ebb2f406d09a4c3a8ddd71e5062d87401ae06b341a91478f2068.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7efee3df4fe9</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.Core.DynamicOutput.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1c7209936752771a78d6c3f3a04242ef6e8180d340c698f6792a583d5871ffa4" href="../../证据/1c7209936752771a78d6c3f3a04242ef6e8180d340c698f6792a583d5871ffa4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1c7209936752</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.Core.VmModule.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e86c168fb6ca9e6853a368128d3064f6e32555c404688d4dbe5b980c69b45b68" href="../../证据/e86c168fb6ca9e6853a368128d3064f6e32555c404688d4dbe5b980c69b45b68.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e86c168fb6ca</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.resources/VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleResultManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="24ee30be1ca8c4b910cb7c200142dc966fd0b8992e19e562a98a958fbb3a93ac" href="../../证据/24ee30be1ca8c4b910cb7c200142dc966fd0b8992e19e562a98a958fbb3a93ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>24ee30be1ca8</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2910d3997941d39ca8408ebf6fc0f49f33c5b835f7474b93d336523dea3749fa" href="../../证据/2910d3997941d39ca8408ebf6fc0f49f33c5b835f7474b93d336523dea3749fa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2910d3997941</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="623d06dd63929488980487a73aee9c607fdd8f7f7acf3694c7a5d1a75b6cff52" href="../../证据/623d06dd63929488980487a73aee9c607fdd8f7f7acf3694c7a5d1a75b6cff52.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>623d06dd6392</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1437f2fd4c0228ab69ac9dc5516b5973ae8c6dc95e7bac74199d95d2886e6b04" href="../../证据/1437f2fd4c0228ab69ac9dc5516b5973ae8c6dc95e7bac74199d95d2886e6b04.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1437f2fd4c02</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-query-ownership.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="32ad21545f9a74b82b518097f9dc634fb5afe0c8296c92d753f183f2be55108a" href="../../证据/32ad21545f9a74b82b518097f9dc634fb5afe0c8296c92d753f183f2be55108a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>32ad21545f9a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CR01 · 新一轮开始 / 停止 / 抛取消异常 → 隐藏旧结果视图与保存旧会话是两个动作</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>BeginWorkflowResults增加过程执行计数，仅在count>1、workStatus非0且清旧结果偏好开启时，标记该过程及所调用子过程为cleared并清当前results视图；它不删除workflowSessions。RunCore返回session才StoreWorkflowCallResults覆盖对应会话并移除cleared标记。若Task.Run被取消或执行抛异常而没有返回session，catch只改状态文字，旧session仍在；偏好开启时可处于隐藏状态，未开启时也未由这个catch主动清除。工具栏停止只Cancel activeRun，FinishWorkflowRun清运行标记并Dispose该取消源，不清会话或插件scope状态。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“新一轮开始 / 停止 / 抛取消异常 → 隐藏旧结果视图与保存旧会话是两个动作”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：此事实仅区分返回session与抛异常两条路径，不把所有取消都判成保留旧会话；返回Cancelled session的覆盖路径见CR02。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/FrameworkExecutionPolicy.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f965f7e263d653379f09bb930ceffc1fd6b1db7b20df943285b27c215d28c8f" href="../../证据/4f965f7e263d653379f09bb930ceffc1fd6b1db7b20df943285b27c215d28c8f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f965f7e263d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/FrameworkExecutionPreferences.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8da1ce2ab5e98323b00b9a9e8eb7fdd47bb223e96ae34ec9499becea4e0cbfaf" href="../../证据/8da1ce2ab5e98323b00b9a9e8eb7fdd47bb223e96ae34ec9499becea4e0cbfaf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8da1ce2ab5e9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fe1cfce3cab105b405e736e1761f55727337ed8c18902455dc98b8e7bbba0751" href="../../证据/fe1cfce3cab105b405e736e1761f55727337ed8c18902455dc98b8e7bbba0751.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fe1cfce3cab1</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e6fb8499c2fb835c48d65b00944cf5ce1367b5afad61a5fb0d684b597688cce4" href="../../证据/e6fb8499c2fb835c48d65b00944cf5ce1367b5afad61a5fb0d684b597688cce4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e6fb8499c2fb</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3b3d33346a93968dde484b3816ea3552d288550b0cd0fabf19d02126f412d1b3" href="../../证据/3b3d33346a93968dde484b3816ea3552d288550b0cd0fabf19d02126f412d1b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3b3d33346a93</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f1555f4822151b0a56296c8cd9f8f3d38dea19055e2e48d6538369284f27fba4" href="../../证据/f1555f4822151b0a56296c8cd9f8f3d38dea19055e2e48d6538369284f27fba4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f1555f482215</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a5ec401f5dc603f1c1aa11208b567072cd67c74c72b42da3ec63d31b5069f16a" href="../../证据/a5ec401f5dc603f1c1aa11208b567072cd67c74c72b42da3ec63d31b5069f16a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a5ec401f5dc6</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e943375651b62f48f5f3c59e47fda53c2bed722dda5a0650e40bf894aa95277a" href="../../证据/e943375651b62f48f5f3c59e47fda53c2bed722dda5a0650e40bf894aa95277a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e943375651b6</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CR02 · GraphExecutor本轮取消 / 失败 / 跳过 → 本轮混合结果可替换上轮会话；旧插件状态另留</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor每轮新建records，不拿上一轮NodeRunRecord补失败节点。节点开始前发现取消会Record(Cancelled)且输出默认Empty；前驱失败或不可用会Record(Skipped)且输出Empty。单节点执行后取消/超时/异常与失败输出过滤按TD04生成本轮记录，已经成功完成的前序节点记录不因此统一清空。最终把全部本轮记录组成session，状态可为Cancelled/Failed/TimedOut。RunCore只检查owner、未以session成功作为发布前提，所以正常返回的取消/失败session也可替换workflowSessions，包含本轮早先成功节点图像与后续空输出。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“GraphExecutor本轮取消 / 失败 / 跳过 → 本轮混合结果可替换上轮会话；旧插件状态另留”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：Task.Run调度前取消或外层异常可能不产生session，需与CR01分别判断；未执行竞争、GC或内存峰值探针。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2082e9d411a4a1a24281e823dfce4b1fb47ddcaa18b7ec6f7289d79206574553" href="../../证据/2082e9d411a4a1a24281e823dfce4b1fb47ddcaa18b7ec6f7289d79206574553.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2082e9d411a4</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4a15fa5fe2346ec06b94f6f37f0d8c9fe42a4d9716719983bf953a2cac42f7d0" href="../../证据/4a15fa5fe2346ec06b94f6f37f0d8c9fe42a4d9716719983bf953a2cac42f7d0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4a15fa5fe234</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="416de0e82d27dffd4d0b19f69a6ea8f4c10011c3be64b9d4301f11429d793582" href="../../证据/416de0e82d27dffd4d0b19f69a6ea8f4c10011c3be64b9d4301f11429d793582.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>416de0e82d27</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3e4a043a6b139af31b1db3c6c72754feef3e05d76081bcdb1b1f812127a3de2e" href="../../证据/3e4a043a6b139af31b1db3c6c72754feef3e05d76081bcdb1b1f812127a3de2e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3e4a043a6b13</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e59c8e573396c2e41cd7fd0b21c07e060bddbfd552e1db6bd436e74f2e16c724" href="../../证据/e59c8e573396c2e41cd7fd0b21c07e060bddbfd552e1db6bd436e74f2e16c724.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e59c8e573396</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d05534cb90f898784350ce239f30d8b88468688dbfe8c8b60c5cc8b129ebda95" href="../../证据/d05534cb90f898784350ce239f30d8b88468688dbfe8c8b60c5cc8b129ebda95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d05534cb90f8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CR06 · 切方案 / 关闭主窗 → 先阻止旧owner发布，scope等待租约；主窗关闭不等于全持有者清零</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>切方案ReplaceExecutionScope先使执行owner失效、取消当前请求，显式Clear调试记录、configurationResults、workflowSessions、results等，再Dispose旧scope并创建新scope。scope.Dispose先closing并Cancel，只有取消完成且leases==0才Release；Release清state/services/参数字典，再逐个Dispose可释放资源，失败资源额外存failedResources。主窗关闭与切方案不同：DrainWorkflowBeforeClose先取消活动流程并等activeRun换出；独立调试session由OnClosing等停。OnClosed关闭owner/回调队列、关配置并Dispose scope，但该体没有Clear workflowSessions/results/configurationResults或逐个清控件图像。只可说关闭启动退役，不能说所有外部对象已同步归零。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“切方案 / 关闭主窗 → 先阻止旧owner发布，scope等待租约；主窗关闭不等于全持有者清零”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：没有强制GC、原机内存峰值或最终外部读者测量；不得由静态Dispose路径推断释放的精确时刻、无泄漏或native等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="05f31e74763c9ab3c96c10a6f6e3d1159a01f5fdde6de5656335cb37afb8c675" href="../../证据/05f31e74763c9ab3c96c10a6f6e3d1159a01f5fdde6de5656335cb37afb8c675.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>05f31e74763c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2fb74670d574a271d0cb5235bcc52177ff5b4839e9c22fdcb02759751e179343" href="../../证据/2fb74670d574a271d0cb5235bcc52177ff5b4839e9c22fdcb02759751e179343.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2fb74670d574</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188" href="../../证据/310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>310faafd8596</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="964864aa21e58faf7a7b428113c7ab05132acdd2407ce54206ab7388147a21c8" href="../../证据/964864aa21e58faf7a7b428113c7ab05132acdd2407ce54206ab7388147a21c8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>964864aa21e5</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="520d0404f6be3fed6c2c287d2836b7d84f3528d2fdb24976cb170ce5bb51f140" href="../../证据/520d0404f6be3fed6c2c287d2836b7d84f3528d2fdb24976cb170ce5bb51f140.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>520d0404f6be</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolEditorHost.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b510d51bd818baedc968bd760d9fb0bcf442ec283de5e8494f8d718a233a757f" href="../../证据/b510d51bd818baedc968bd760d9fb0bcf442ec283de5e8494f8d718a233a757f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b510d51bd818</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d0d0acf4a14fb7e8c481ab31aacc00a124a3375031bc5afc1365a8eb395fe3cb" href="../../证据/d0d0acf4a14fb7e8c481ab31aacc00a124a3375031bc5afc1365a8eb395fe3cb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d0d0acf4a14f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>WL03 · 原平台callback外层type=23 → RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX → PreProData的身份与计数复制</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>callback先PtrToStructure解外层，case23u再将pData按RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX解包，传ref moduleResultExInfo。ModuleManager.GetModuleResultCallBack直接以PreProData(moduleResInfo)触发托管结果事件；PreProData复制status/error/cycleID/moduleID/pubAddress/时间/self/executeCount/resultNum到托管header，按resultNum从pInfo取描述并逐项转换。executeCount来自结果header，而LargeObject只接CHUNK_VALUE_EX、目标对象和异常标记，没有header计数实参；所选链未比较映射头计数或据其拒绝过期帧。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“原平台callback外层type=23 → RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX → PreProData的身份与计数复制”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：尚未证明result header executeCount与对应共享图像映射头计数的native同帧关系。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：仅所选PreProData/LargeObject链没有该比较，不扩大为全应用任何地方都不比较计数。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/sdk-result-layout.resources/CVmObjectBase.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="edb2388ea6c10af5893f047e8e2242519e3424558a4f7e73c81fc3ae3de7724f" href="../../证据/edb2388ea6c10af5893f047e8e2242519e3424558a4f7e73c81fc3ae3de7724f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>edb2388ea6c1</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="91ef08700e4a5764c7bdd8ac27d35dc321e3e2108032a94a9e7ea502bb61040f" href="../../证据/91ef08700e4a5764c7bdd8ac27d35dc321e3e2108032a94a9e7ea502bb61040f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>91ef08700e4a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="31b8389d2871c89c03da1162466229a0f68b97816ff72fed56481b949e42f2e5" href="../../证据/31b8389d2871c89c03da1162466229a0f68b97816ff72fed56481b949e42f2e5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>31b8389d2871</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f1a3ee32c5ee31948595b378df465fb3a7b53ab4bfee8d605311c8d16608cdba" href="../../证据/f1a3ee32c5ee31948595b378df465fb3a7b53ab4bfee8d605311c8d16608cdba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f1a3ee32c5ee</small></a></details></details><details><summary>SN02 · 原历史查询→0x69df50→0x6b9950 → 构造结果记录并写入header执行计数字段</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>IMVS_QueryModuleHistoryResult通过句柄门后转0x69df50；该路径按0xe8字节构造每模块记录，并逐项调用0x6b9950。转换体把中间字段uStack_68高32位写piVar32[0x2d]，即结果记录偏移0xb4=180；原汇编0x1806b9cdf也明确写[RDI+0xb4]。这与WL03实取的x64托管nExecuteCount偏移一致，定位了结果header的一处原生写入；它没有在这里证明图像映射头+80也同时写入相同值。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“原历史查询→0x69df50→0x6b9950 → 构造结果记录并写入header执行计数字段”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：中间执行计数的业务生成、与映射头的同帧一致性、回调路径的全部版本分支仍待核。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/sdk-image-publication.resources/18064c650.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d04dae17db47f6b446fb2865bbb9d9752c3b61f546887587058a33cb92dc0d0b" href="../../证据/d04dae17db47f6b446fb2865bbb9d9752c3b61f546887587058a33cb92dc0d0b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d04dae17db47</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/sdk-image-publication.resources/18069df50.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eee0cb379780be7ddb455f76928c93bc2e3d71d98f4f2770d0662004399df800" href="../../证据/eee0cb379780be7ddb455f76928c93bc2e3d71d98f4f2770d0662004399df800.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eee0cb379780</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/sdk-image-publication.resources/1806b9950.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8b0f1f88062a6adf47dcb0718f9afa3102ebca7312c0458dab0bb33fc816ae15" href="../../证据/8b0f1f88062a6adf47dcb0718f9afa3102ebca7312c0458dab0bb33fc816ae15.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8b0f1f88062a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/sdk-image-publication.resources/1806b9950.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="36416c4aa132e40244069584450d789e686cb708a78de873b76fee80021ecf6a" href="../../证据/36416c4aa132e40244069584450d789e686cb708a78de873b76fee80021ecf6a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>36416c4aa132</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OG04 · 本轮执行对象与ProcessGroupOutputV44 → 执行后分型处理并按描述模式调用目标虚槽</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>通过break门后DoWork调用局部执行对象的虚表+8；随后不把相邻指令解释为未知线程池合同，而是保存实际关系：RCX=this、RDX=&amp;本次输出列表、R8=&amp;本轮状态字传入a7830，返回EAX被保存并检查。a7830逐描述按type分派：int/float/string仅mode字段==1时先调用相应目标虚表+8，再调用13450/139f0/13fa0；image及其它所见类型有无条件先调用+8的独立分支。不能把这些类型都画成相同的累积策略。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“本轮执行对象与ProcessGroupOutputV44 → 执行后分型处理并按描述模式调用目标虚槽”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：虚执行对象的具体调度与全部子节点状态传播未在本切片恢复。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：图像/复合类型累积、载荷租约与虚槽接收者需分别恢复，不从int路径外推。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1f99bd523568df0ee2a894108b8c24297cadf8d50e3cbaca00ec8ecf1814f9d2" href="../../证据/1f99bd523568df0ee2a894108b8c24297cadf8d50e3cbaca00ec8ecf1814f9d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1f99bd523568</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c80d9d34446afc02f2fe3932aa06292d3da8f4ea3df7021bee59ae7c262a4b71" href="../../证据/c80d9d34446afc02f2fe3932aa06292d3da8f4ea3df7021bee59ae7c262a4b71.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c80d9d34446a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7830.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="41ab8d4f6ff3bb15ce4ece32b77ca221ba531e34af54ac9128b125064318ac80" href="../../证据/41ab8d4f6ff3bb15ce4ece32b77ca221ba531e34af54ac9128b125064318ac80.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>41ab8d4f6ff3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7830.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="84716093886a2e5db9fc760a7aa2a5b50cfea7c93066ce166921fe37f5f8c775" href="../../证据/84716093886a2e5db9fc760a7aa2a5b50cfea7c93066ce166921fe37f5f8c775.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>84716093886a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OG06 · 输出处理失败与DoWork收尾 → 分开保存处理错误码、状态码和ModuStatus布尔值</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>a7830继续遍历描述；在尚未捕获错误时，来源状态分类为3且来源记录存在、其工作状态不在0x75掩码允许集合时，复制该来源错误码与工作状态到本次错误/状态输出。汇编最终MOV EAX,R13D返回累计错误。DoWork收尾以其最终错误寄存器是否0写ModuStatus(index0)，把错误码写this+0x7c、另一个状态码写this+0x84，清this+0x1b8执行中标记，并另发布ModuRunTime。成功布尔、错误码与状态枚举不是一个字段。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“输出处理失败与DoWork收尾 → 分开保存处理错误码、状态码和ModuStatus布尔值”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：所有上游失败映射、mask中每个状态的名称、异常与取消的全路径未枚举；不由数值猜业务枚举语义。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7830.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2bf7dd74d3d703648642bb749856979e57c8fd750b2b2eed334ce96e09aa7406" href="../../证据/2bf7dd74d3d703648642bb749856979e57c8fd750b2b2eed334ce96e09aa7406.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2bf7dd74d3d7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a7830.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="84716093886a2e5db9fc760a7aa2a5b50cfea7c93066ce166921fe37f5f8c775" href="../../证据/84716093886a2e5db9fc760a7aa2a5b50cfea7c93066ce166921fe37f5f8c775.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>84716093886a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cd7e33b0bcb04af69bd9879876fc782c3a98571bf665b41d4cb1a0e2e98f02c4" href="../../证据/cd7e33b0bcb04af69bd9879876fc782c3a98571bf665b41d4cb1a0e2e98f02c4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cd7e33b0bcb0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3176190147c541e9014ecd5e6213386642f7ea8848441feed69795eccd8cad55" href="../../证据/3176190147c541e9014ecd5e6213386642f7ea8848441feed69795eccd8cad55.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3176190147c5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/selected-strings.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c" href="../../证据/d216d954d5328b880c185ceba38729b56b5bfaa4865886c97c2e7f7fb200cb9c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d216d954d532</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG09 · Group正常结束/中断/失败/取消 → 末轮session改写聚合，父调用保留Calls但门控输出</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>正常loop出口返回last或新Success空session，再with覆盖CompletedGroupIterations/GroupBroke/GroupBreakIndex/diagnostics/累积outputs与displays。零轮时last为null，Finish对可累积项产生空typed数组；成功break保留前轮节点记录。body返回非Success后先completed++再break，未Add该轮；返回状态仍取last，非累计输出可来自该last。父Graph收到child先存calls[id]，仅child.Success把WorkflowOutputs作为模块结果，否则输出Empty并SubprogramFailed。轮前Throw或Interval Delay抛取消会绕过Group最终聚合return，由父Graph catch/取消/超时门分类，不能宣称任何取消都保留部分累计结果。</p><p>单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史：这条既有事实明确核实“Group正常结束/中断/失败/取消 → 末轮session改写聚合，父调用保留Calls但门控输出”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">有效值缓存与成功结果历史不能混用；仍需原调度准备/停止返回、超时、失败保留与服务触发的统一每轮状态矩阵。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：超时/外部取消/Scope.Stopping涉及不同token，不能从一个分支推出所有race结果；本切片仅静态核顺序，没有新运行探针。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="edb3d91bee1a3c59cf2a58ad059bca4d944a1dbe1a4f5a6ac6aac5d433491d91" href="../../证据/edb3d91bee1a3c59cf2a58ad059bca4d944a1dbe1a4f5a6ac6aac5d433491d91.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>edb3d91bee1a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="700cd74215bdf92d618e1baf80b16e6e23e1a89fed8580cfedb0b1716c497e20" href="../../证据/700cd74215bdf92d618e1baf80b16e6e23e1a89fed8580cfedb0b1716c497e20.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>700cd74215bd</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f" href="../../证据/2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2f3bad3dab71</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e59c8e573396c2e41cd7fd0b21c07e060bddbfd552e1db6bd436e74f2e16c724" href="../../证据/e59c8e573396c2e41cd7fd0b21c07e060bddbfd552e1db6bd436e74f2e16c724.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e59c8e573396</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>execution-storage:Q04 · VmProcedure.ContinuousRunEnable setter → 先SDK开始/等待停止，再按变化更新缓存与父通知</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>true调ContinousRunStart(ID)，false调RefreshUIStopExecute(ID)，之后才判断缓存!=value决定SetProperty和父通知。因此重复false也会进入所选停止路径，不是同值即跳过SDK。</p><p>计划将C02归入F-16，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。Parent为空、通知异常或前一步停止失败后的剩余流程状态未证回滚。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/run-exit-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e50a4ba1ad66598c291583e6f5e5876a8c23ed4a2d818b967ddd453ea4e3e5f" href="../../证据/1e50a4ba1ad66598c291583e6f5e5876a8c23ed4a2d818b967ddd453ea4e3e5f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e50a4ba1ad6</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmProcedure.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ba70916cafd992f818bad4fd848a680b58aa0627994223233b7c0f96a954a2a5" href="../../证据/ba70916cafd992f818bad4fd848a680b58aa0627994223233b7c0f96a954a2a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ba70916cafd9</small></a></details></details><details><summary>execution-storage:Q06 · RefreshUIStopExecute → Task.Run → StopExecute正常返回才置旗标 / SyncWaitor.Wait</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>isStopEnd初始false；后台StopExecute正常返回才赋true，调用者Hik.Util.SyncWaitor.Wait(ref flag)。原委托无finally，StopExecute抛错时没有这次true写入。旗标由托管调用返回产生，原native停止是否同步完成仍未知。</p><p>计划将C02/C07归入F-16，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。Wait单参体见Q09：无本地超时、会分发消息；实际线程、内存可见性、重入与native完成仍未知。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/run-exit-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bf3a54da50b75d47b60c02513f77031fc8e43a7dd5086efeef69a5553956e0d5" href="../../证据/bf3a54da50b75d47b60c02513f77031fc8e43a7dd5086efeef69a5553956e0d5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bf3a54da50b7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/run-exit-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fb22905caa8c5dee96af61887880a88f08744c495ef53e75560c06807f9c8a56" href="../../证据/fb22905caa8c5dee96af61887880a88f08744c495ef53e75560c06807f9c8a56.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fb22905caa8c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/sync-wait-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2b9fb2384c7560bc0637cf88d511e0589cad281fdc515050780fe2d4f10a122c" href="../../证据/2b9fb2384c7560bc0637cf88d511e0589cad281fdc515050780fe2d4f10a122c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2b9fb2384c75</small></a></details></details><details><summary>execution-storage:M04 · RunCore await 返回 → WorkflowCallbacks.PublishModuleResult</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>所有者失效即拒绝发布；通过后提交结果与运行历史，并更新当前流程视图。OperationCanceledException 和其它异常仅在当前所有者下更新状态。</p><p>计划将C03归入F-16，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“单次/连续/停止、参数准备、回调代次与历史”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。具体发布次序见M06/M07；托管缓存不是原native回调生产、线程或设备停止的等价证明。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowExecution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8efefffab2fcdff89c3c3cd1d79745d4a8b19bbf88aaf824fc302879d6a9896" href="../../证据/f8efefffab2fcdff89c3c3cd1d79745d4a8b19bbf88aaf824fc302879d6a9896.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8efefffab2f</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-17" id="F-17"><summary>F-17 · 流程 IO 与变量 · 流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>B01 · 实际运行Tab与变量目标</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>GetParamRoot → BaseNode.Init → XmlLoaded → GetRunParamsTree → RunParamsSelectData</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>有效XmlPath/Data/Tabs、链接扩展和窗口缓存是什么</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>指定实例采集构造前/XmlLoaded前后/枚举返回；拼接两态、类型、占用、消失项、取消确认</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>原始类型及谓词逐项匹配目标树；更新FCR-019字段和生命周期，不凭CustomVisible推断</dd></dl><p>参数根缓存/失败、运行候选作用域、基础筛选与确认已分片；派生类、完整链接扩展和原机操作仍未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B01</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a498165b36c3aea0354590e92ff3f6447c4819bfb4964bebf87518e494f43979" href="../../证据/a498165b36c3aea0354590e92ff3f6447c4819bfb4964bebf87518e494f43979.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a498165b36c3</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B05 · 流程IO、局部/全局变量与gvar</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>GlobalVariableItem/DynamicInput/DynamicOutput与导入导出命令</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>变量作用域、初始化、订阅、删除改型和gvar规则</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>追原服务与序列化；父子传参、重复占用、改名改型、复制、导入导出及运行重开</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>入口/身份/持久化/执行闭合；全局与局部不混用；未知gvar不改名JSON代替</dd></dl><p>原全局变量迁移/读取和当前局部typed数据消费；gvar与全局完整执行/持久化仍未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B05</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9b593ac896d0f8c37f6a0f098ab90a625307f06d5874b350abf8c8ff9065b21a" href="../../证据/9b593ac896d0f8c37f6a0f098ab90a625307f06d5874b350abf8c8ff9065b21a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9b593ac896d0</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B08 · 模型与Group组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>真实插件、嵌套Group、变量、ROI与历史持久化组合</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>单项通过后组合是否保持身份和数据一致</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>混合类型/多层/循环中断/累积/改型/撤销/保存重开/停止失败恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每场景对照原机输出和状态；失败不读陈旧结果；组合未知仍开放</dd></dl><p>模型/Group组合验收：需嵌套、变量、累积、保存重开和再次运行的同场景证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e" href="../../证据/4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f3a8f2e940f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D03 · 原生容器与对象数据映射</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>VmServer/UI/mdata/绑定/策略/流程记录原始读写成员</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>字段类型、身份、默认、缺失与未知段如何表达</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按方案/流程/Group/变量/资源拆原函数级子任务；生成字段→成员→操作映射与正反例</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每已识别字段有读写链和差分；原始未知字节保留；不凭相似编码命名格式</dd></dl><p>仅UserData字节写入与模块落地子路径；VmServer/UI/mdata全字段读写映射未恢复</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D03</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eec94f8663ac39f7af480808c24d1d16364523a1121d4390d6f748a064c0b43e" href="../../证据/eec94f8663ac39f7af480808c24d1d16364523a1121d4390d6f748a064c0b43e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eec94f8663ac</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>DP01 · ModuleParam[string key] → ModuleManager.SetParamValue / SetDynamicRunParamValue</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Parent.IsOnDispose时不读写；全局模块setter直接SDK写后return。普通模块先RecordParamUnRedo再SetValueBySDK，最后OnModuleParamChanged。Group且key以%开头走动态API；其余走普通参数API并要求bThrowException:true。SDK写失败时通知尚未发生，但历史捕获可能已发生。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“ModuleParam[string key] → ModuleManager.SetParamValue / SetDynamicRunParamValue”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：编辑器所有具体模板到此setter的绑定不在本体证明内；native参数拷贝/保留和写入完成时机仍须另证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/data-lifecycle-cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d25a07df0c1e5dd8fa06141fbf42f3eb38246dd88f374fa6929f7a2124b01764" href="../../证据/d25a07df0c1e5dd8fa06141fbf42f3eb38246dd88f374fa6929f7a2124b01764.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d25a07df0c1e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/data-lifecycle-cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02ff917adc18139288e9e168e7078760581d39190e492e7bec7e8b06b86ed381" href="../../证据/02ff917adc18139288e9e168e7078760581d39190e492e7bec7e8b06b86ed381.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02ff917adc18</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/data-lifecycle-cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6b2271cac0b4d620877e74995868de0414738ad9fb15f7c831766214d2ad9084" href="../../证据/6b2271cac0b4d620877e74995868de0414738ad9fb15f7c831766214d2ad9084.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6b2271cac0b4</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/ModuleParam.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0ad38c2359e0ee9d2bcd9295ff993e43fd7efb26790184462093f1ec5c889db1" href="../../证据/0ad38c2359e0ee9d2bcd9295ff993e43fd7efb26790184462093f1ec5c889db1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0ad38c2359e0</small></a></details></details><details><summary>DP02 · VmIO.Value / GetValue(executeCount,index) → 关联值、主动拉取与本轮值门</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Value getter在输入叶订阅分支直接返回RelateIO.Value；否则按Root回调模式/流程执行计数决定RefreshResult，再MergeIOLoopValue。GetValue对非uint.MaxValue的计数进行匹配，既不匹配本身/关联计数且不是常量时清Value并返回null。数组索引越界在该体回退0，不按当前实现的验证门推断原版规则。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“VmIO.Value / GetValue(executeCount,index) → 关联值、主动拉取与本轮值门”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：MergeIOLoopValue的完整合并/组合树语义、并发值变更及所有索引类型仍单独取证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/data-lifecycle-cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8c451bff3b6aa826267f423f41bc7dcce91d92571628d4c690442fd199432904" href="../../证据/8c451bff3b6aa826267f423f41bc7dcce91d92571628d4c690442fd199432904.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8c451bff3b6a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/data-lifecycle-cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58d4a072ee2e45fd5822f8ea4426b2574688ed0a807460b3f7d867cc01e80aae" href="../../证据/58d4a072ee2e45fd5822f8ea4426b2574688ed0a807460b3f7d867cc01e80aae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58d4a072ee2e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/data-lifecycle-cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1f255b046bb730ea4c605ccda6e1f6219b39a2e8ee64a6970df18d4c81fe002d" href="../../证据/1f255b046bb730ea4c605ccda6e1f6219b39a2e8ee64a6970df18d4c81fe002d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1f255b046bb7</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CP03 · 节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每个节点先从已复制n.Parameters建立新的字典，补Clone后的默认JSON值，再在执行到此节点时通过workflow.Resolve解析订阅；参数订阅经WorkflowSubscriptions.Parameter检查标量种类并SerializeToElement，覆盖该节点参数。普通连线则直接把上游PortValue赋入nodeInputs。ExecuteAsync收到两套ReadOnlyDictionary包装；ModuleExecutionContext构造器直接持有这两套只读接口。只读包装没有复制PortValue中图像/对象的含义。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：DataKinds.Coerce及插件执行可有自己的转换/复制规则；仅凭框架字典不能推定任意具体图像在工具内零复制或深复制。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：下游动态读取服务与原生参数setter认可状态不在这条托管参数传递事实内。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633" href="../../证据/e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e137f34d98c9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464" href="../../证据/a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a2d27b66691d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662" href="../../证据/f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f51cff92f0bd</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484" href="../../证据/e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e79249d8651c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39" href="../../证据/c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c50568f01e32</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PS04 · 原VmParamSubManager.SetModuleParamBinding → 绑定描述结构 → 临时HGlobal → IMVS_SetModuleParamBinding</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>引用订阅不走PS01的name/value setter。VmParamSubManager构建nNum=1且128槽数组：目标Owner.ID、参数类型、128字节参数名；绑定值另含变量类型、256字节常量、目标模块ID/128字节来源名、下标类型与256字节常量或下标来源。StringUtil.UTF8GetFixLenBytes先建定长数组，再复制min(UTF8字节长度,len)，超长是按字节截断，满长度不额外加NUL。ModuleManager.SetModuleParamBinding→ServerSDKAPI构造并复制描述列表，AllocHGlobal(Marshal.SizeOf(...))、StructureToPtr、PInvoke IMVS_SetModuleParamBinding(handle,ptr)，正常路径释放outer HGlobal；native错误由ModuleManager抛VmException，VmParamSubManager捕获并返回false。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原VmParamSubManager.SetModuleParamBinding → 绑定描述结构 → 临时HGlobal → IMVS_SetModuleParamBinding”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不从描述复制推断来源像素深拷贝；native关系存储、订阅值更新时序和解绑所有权需实际nativecallee。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：定长UTF8在多字节边界的截断可能形成不完整编码；是否UI前置校验避免此输入，本条没有端到端证明。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/VmParamSubManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4e4ccdabd3f3f28e7ce330601127179aa625a3ab1dcba35bbb0c1e23c9367c1e" href="../../证据/4e4ccdabd3f3f28e7ce330601127179aa625a3ab1dcba35bbb0c1e23c9367c1e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4e4ccdabd3f3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/StringUtil.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c8c07b1b654c35204e40bbe3ff0f4b29f8f996df2b00ec5b676f42fe25743b80" href="../../证据/c8c07b1b654c35204e40bbe3ff0f4b29f8f996df2b00ec5b676f42fe25743b80.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c8c07b1b654c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="99c4dbb9a08a0a38a7c44503368a3ccc6da9e5a462b18ed3713117dc50163a85" href="../../证据/99c4dbb9a08a0a38a7c44503368a3ccc6da9e5a462b18ed3713117dc50163a85.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>99c4dbb9a08a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ServerSDKAPI.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="963fec7dd5c7cad93bc9041e9ee1431bc0801994f046a82a79cfd4f1a8a08ce1" href="../../证据/963fec7dd5c7cad93bc9041e9ee1431bc0801994f046a82a79cfd4f1a8a08ce1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>963fec7dd5c7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="64218321649fcff71ae2637248023e55e97d380df6e38418210d5d10514bae4f" href="../../证据/64218321649fcff71ae2637248023e55e97d380df6e38418210d5d10514bae4f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>64218321649f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD01 · 原VariableManager绑定的DataSource模块 → VarCount/GlobalValueList快照与显示值</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>构造函数只在dataSource为VmModule时保存DataSource。GetAllVar(ref IMVS_VARIABLE[])通过DataSource.Params先取VarCount：只有正整数才读GlobalValueList，且非空、字节长度可整除IMVS_VARIABLE大小才覆盖调用者ref数组；不是数量相等校验，其他分支保留旧ref。List&lt;VarItem>重载逐条附加元数据，int/float将native数组复制到byte[]再BlockCopy成数值数组，但显示Value只取第0项；string读取描述数组后，仅复制第0项指向的字符串payload作显示。不能把Value文本当成完整数组。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原VariableManager绑定的DataSource模块 → VarCount/GlobalValueList快照与显示值”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：native变量模块GlobalValueList的生产、稳定快照/锁与内嵌payload回收协议缺体；不能由外层byte[]推断内层pointer已深拷贝。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="943b60adf0aa435016be817cc972300be3d0511f106b969ce267cf8f540d0ca9" href="../../证据/943b60adf0aa435016be817cc972300be3d0511f106b969ce267cf8f540d0ca9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>943b60adf0aa</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5eba28c661697c8b07365c4e3c0d26cb33e08b49e37c0ddb85687d3095342dbf" href="../../证据/5eba28c661697c8b07365c4e3c0d26cb33e08b49e37c0ddb85687d3095342dbf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5eba28c66169</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="63745f03db58ac7a81abfd3bea8b22a09513e551eb9bd4e7d2645ac1939d6929" href="../../证据/63745f03db58ac7a81abfd3bea8b22a09513e551eb9bd4e7d2645ac1939d6929.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>63745f03db58</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.Variable/VarItem.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e620a76eece5fee85a5d273ac303a806a0f9aebc3e9103a5513257f08f3125aa" href="../../证据/e620a76eece5fee85a5d273ac303a806a0f9aebc3e9103a5513257f08f3125aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e620a76eece5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD02 · 原SetVarIntValue/SetVarFloatValue数组写入口 → ModifyVar描述+临时HGlobal数值块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>两个setter拒绝空名、null和空数组，修复名字后设置VAR_VALUE动作、类型文本int/float及nValueNum。逐数值BitConverter.GetBytes→List&lt;byte>→ToArray，再AllocHGlobal并Marshal.Copy，pBinaryValue指向该临时块；序列化的是IMVS_MODIFY_VAR描述，调用SetBinaryData(&quot;ModifyVar&quot;,描述bytes)。进入try后finally释放临时块，但分配、复制、StructToBytes位于try之前，不能宣称所有构造异常都会释放。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原SetVarIntValue/SetVarFloatValue数组写入口 → ModifyVar描述+临时HGlobal数值块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModifyVar的native接收、解析、同步复制/异步消费、底层旧值释放及多线程原子性未取得原体。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="49d1325c103be60b2ed33c739fc8612dfde7abb9c8ec54568e9f59808efe4d3e" href="../../证据/49d1325c103be60b2ed33c739fc8612dfde7abb9c8ec54568e9f59808efe4d3e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>49d1325c103b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fc3eb63cedb01ac59c9a3231bc5ee5e070ed1d347208a48b4bda7e86c336046c" href="../../证据/fc3eb63cedb01ac59c9a3231bc5ee5e070ed1d347208a48b4bda7e86c336046c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fc3eb63cedb0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d236513cac113626256966d4829a5f8b8aef2fd1270cdaf55a6410edc576a330" href="../../证据/d236513cac113626256966d4829a5f8b8aef2fd1270cdaf55a6410edc576a330.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d236513cac11</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD03 · 原字符串变量写入口 → 短文本SDK路径、长文本binary路径与string[]嵌套块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>SetVarValue按UTF8字节数&lt;=256选择ServerSDKAPI.IMVS_SetParamValue，超过256改用SetBinaryData与补零UTF8数组，键的固定前缀为GlobalScipt-（按原拼写）。SetVarStringValue则为每个字符串创建补零UTF8数组、独立HGlobal，写入ByteDataArray(pData/nDataLen/nDataSize)；再为整个描述数组分配HGlobal，最后把其地址写到ModifyVar。finally逐项Free再Free外层；分配与序列化在try之前。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原字符串变量写入口 → 短文本SDK路径、长文本binary路径与string[]嵌套块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：精确键见源引用；native文本/二进制两入口的一致性、截断/编码与存储深拷贝需接收方原体。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f95e5db663eeb7c187e2f4c70755d4bf7b563061b62cc449d991778fd7ce481f" href="../../证据/f95e5db663eeb7c187e2f4c70755d4bf7b563061b62cc449d991778fd7ce481f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f95e5db663ee</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="321c3d313f04dc9c8e31d73988d4af489b473d2fdde536e8a2a7a6679b13882d" href="../../证据/321c3d313f04dc9c8e31d73988d4af489b473d2fdde536e8a2a7a6679b13882d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>321c3d313f04</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD04 · 原ModuleManager非图像结果转换 → VmIO保留数值副本或托管字符串数组引用</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>NativeData2Data对status=0的int/float构造单元素零值数组，字符串构造单元素空字符串数组；非0调用相应pointer→数值数组helper，字符串将固定UTF8 byte字段逐项解码成新string数组。VmIO.SetValueFromServer对int/float再Array.ConvertAll为nullable数组，对string直接把pStringValue传SetValue。SetValue写_value=newValue并将同一个对象追加或替换到_valueList，不能把这一步描述为统一Clone全部payload。SetNoneValueWithoutRaiseEvent只清_value，没有清_valueList。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModuleManager非图像结果转换 → VmIO保留数值副本或托管字符串数组引用”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：数值转换helper的全部异常/长度合法域、循环列表的完整退休门与native结果产生规则不由本切片闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="858aa2a65e71066d542edd54733a7ec12e43689535d17b037f9eb3b4bdef01fb" href="../../证据/858aa2a65e71066d542edd54733a7ec12e43689535d17b037f9eb3b4bdef01fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>858aa2a65e71</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="620902f7df24de96c9a592abffd4c890a8fe9028dd7722464c87f55fd15756d8" href="../../证据/620902f7df24de96c9a592abffd4c890a8fe9028dd7722464c87f55fd15756d8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>620902f7df24</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VmIO.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d8896356b8601e46764c7a50dedf8b1e92ccb8efa4ef34ca1c87220a9721ca2" href="../../证据/0d8896356b8601e46764c7a50dedf8b1e92ccb8efa4ef34ca1c87220a9721ca2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d8896356b86</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VmIO.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="01b4f04ce7ea3fae545bf5d165185745f8844bec869649b1b1340a33dff85506" href="../../证据/01b4f04ce7ea3fae545bf5d165185745f8844bec869649b1b1340a33dff85506.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>01b4f04ce7ea</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VmIO.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="444cabf5a3b9310a0cec57701caea453a64dd01662978a620190b488a61bb043" href="../../证据/444cabf5a3b9310a0cec57701caea453a64dd01662978a620190b488a61bb043.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>444cabf5a3b9</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD05 · 原PointSet变量接口 → ByteDataArray复制→MatchPoint列表；专用setter为空体</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>GetVarPointset读取VarValue-null-加名字的binary结构，检查变量类型pointset；若nValueNum非0，从pByteValue取ByteDataArray[]，仅第0块nDataLen非0才复制其pData到byte[]。随后按Marshal.SizeOf(MatchPoint)步进，将每段复制到单个临时HGlobal再PtrToStructure并Add到MatchOutlinePoints；正常末尾Free临时块。对应SetVarPointset(string,List&lt;MatchOutline>)本轮新静态提取确认为空方法，不能从getter或POINT坐标数组的setter补造pointset写入协议。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原PointSet变量接口 → ByteDataArray复制→MatchPoint列表；专用setter为空体”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：native pointset生产者序列格式/版本、MatchPoint ABI和写入入口仍缺体；原空setter不等于整个产品所有pointset入口均不支持。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="848f77af62d187312ec6c4dfa31bc83198d5fd1cfa18e4c40e664ba6432f6044" href="../../证据/848f77af62d187312ec6c4dfa31bc83198d5fd1cfa18e4c40e664ba6432f6044.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>848f77af62d1</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9846f219a08a8c60409b9c24ffe7ef095ac04eb024433cc5b6dc0dceeed1ea15" href="../../证据/9846f219a08a8c60409b9c24ffe7ef095ac04eb024433cc5b6dc0dceeed1ea15.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9846f219a08a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD06 · 原DeleteVar/删除IO入口 → native删除命令与托管解绑/节点移除分开执行</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DeleteVar先验证非空并RepairVarName，withVar=true才向DataSource.Params[&quot;DeleteVar&quot;]写变量名，再调用DeleteIO；withVar=false仍做托管清理。DeleteIO取得输出的Index/TypeName，按可见输出且index更大的规则递减索引，再尝试UnBindGlobarVarItem和RemoveSelf，两个异常各记录后继续ChangeToSendReceiveData与SetRunParamBind。删除不是一个统一Dispose(payload)动作，原顺序也不是先全验证再原子提交。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原DeleteVar/删除IO入口 → native删除命令与托管解绑/节点移除分开执行”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：DataSource.Params删除命令在native的检查/存储释放/绑定失效语义未证；不要由节点移除推出像素或非图像数组已释放。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8cb5a88d7dadc07e285d3572cd9e5e0b617ad611a6f431d65e06ec1216dd9e76" href="../../证据/8cb5a88d7dadc07e285d3572cd9e5e0b617ad611a6f431d65e06ec1216dd9e76.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8cb5a88d7dad</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0ec7a27802d41b3844748d763a5b108ec3ead3d2f7a93dbc8954a988f149fa14" href="../../证据/0ec7a27802d41b3844748d763a5b108ec3ead3d2f7a93dbc8954a988f149fa14.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0ec7a27802d4</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD07 · 原ModifyType入口 → 组合类型重建或标量改TypeName，然后发送ModifyVar</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ModifyType验证名字/类型、查现有输出及支持类型，相同类型直接返回。新旧任一为组合枚举时先DeleteIO(isChangeIndex:false)，按新类型重建并恢复Index；否则先修改现有TypeName，再尝试解绑、更新通信与运行参数绑定。随后序列化VAR_TYPE动作、名称和目标类型发送ModifyVar；新组合类型还附带子IO名称/类型描述块，finally仅释放这个临时块。发送前托管状态已经改变，所选catch没有回滚TypeName或重建节点。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModifyType入口 → 组合类型重建或标量改TypeName，然后发送ModifyVar”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：native VAR_TYPE实际值转换/默认初始化/引用失效与失败回滚仍未知；不得以常规产品设计补齐。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="36c4733c5497f7f987e68173a1d59b53e61f6598187094751e629fe86d73d6b3" href="../../证据/36c4733c5497f7f987e68173a1d59b53e61f6598187094751e629fe86d73d6b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>36c4733c5497</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VD08 · 原变量作用域和运行参数引用绑定 → DataSource.ID+变量名作为来源身份，参数类型匹配后绑定ALL</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>SetRunParamBindForName按目标模块ID获取模型，仅IsSupportSub且变量类型文本与参数Type相同的项继续；调用ParamSubManager.SetModuleParamBinding时来源模块是DataSource.ID、来源名varName、类型SUBSCRIBE_VAR_VARIABLE，下标模式ALL且常量文本All。成功才在目标模块UserData[&quot;@&quot;+参数名]存true并重置ISubInfo初始化状态。变量作用域不是单独一个裸字符串名；VarItem显示将Owner.ID==13000标为全局，其他模块标为局部，但显示标签不替代实际来源模块ID。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原变量作用域和运行参数引用绑定 → DataSource.ID+变量名作为来源身份，参数类型匹配后绑定ALL”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原生局部变量模块创建/调用栈作用域、过程结束销毁与ALL订阅求值时序未取得原体。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-nonimage-data.resources/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8b92dd2335e7a1bbf46eadfb1d1380d1276bfd4c1912f2452ac5a0f89e8e754c" href="../../证据/8b92dd2335e7a1bbf46eadfb1d1380d1276bfd4c1912f2452ac5a0f89e8e754c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8b92dd2335e7</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.Variable/VarItem.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="104c7dda451561747e81c29785ff2028d4e9ea5702cbd60201c97a1a604cf1af" href="../../证据/104c7dda451561747e81c29785ff2028d4e9ea5702cbd60201c97a1a604cf1af.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>104c7dda4515</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VN01 · 原GlobalVariableModule key分发体RVA0x1f8c0 → ModifyVar载荷字段读取与动作跳表</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原PE字符串ModifyVar/DeleteVar的RIP-LEA候选落同一runtime范围0x1f8c0..0x25b80；本轮实际取得对应伪码和解码汇编后，确认其比较参数key并进入ModifyVar分支。入口汇编保存RCX=context、RDX=key、R8=payload、R9D=第四整数参数，分支把payload作为描述读取：名称+4、目标文本+0x204、动作+0、数量+0x304、数据pointer+0x308。动作跳表位于RVA0x25b58，原字节直接确认1→0x245bd、3→0x249ea，与托管VAR_TYPE=1/VAR_VALUE=3的描述枚举相对照。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原GlobalVariableModule key分发体RVA0x1f8c0 → ModifyVar载荷字段读取与动作跳表”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原SDK/ModuleFrame如何选到此虚成员、该成员正式符号和实际进程DLL解析未闭合；不因key一致宣称端到端调用已证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e966ba54b6dce4f2a731c1d2a5c6aed23db44805e2505a52d51c5de72c20cdec" href="../../证据/e966ba54b6dce4f2a731c1d2a5c6aed23db44805e2505a52d51c5de72c20cdec.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e966ba54b6dc</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f6c5a580b030ff6ed54c6fbc61fffeab9a490c967a71a890e53ae7f2f2a3bd88" href="../../证据/f6c5a580b030ff6ed54c6fbc61fffeab9a490c967a71a890e53ae7f2f2a3bd88.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f6c5a580b030</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ef4270aad9fd78219dd180da287dd068c9b6295d93ad1bd4284e0990105f4bb6" href="../../证据/ef4270aad9fd78219dd180da287dd068c9b6295d93ad1bd4284e0990105f4bb6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ef4270aad9fd</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c33f4499f9df6cc4259371f76fb5c3b821a7bbba0108387b7bdbfbb398c5b66" href="../../证据/7c33f4499f9df6cc4259371f76fb5c3b821a7bbba0108387b7bdbfbb398c5b66.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c33f4499f9d</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VN02 · 原VAR_VALUE动作3 → 已有类型核验 → pBinaryValue/数量传入typed值分发</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>case3从payload+0x304读数量，记录+0x448非0时将payload+0x308与数量直接交0x28250；另一分支核目标类型文本：payload+0x204非空且与记录+0x129类型不符时返回0xe000030f。通过门后调用0x28c30，汇编明确RDX=记录名称+0x29、R8=类型文本、R9=payload+0x308内的pointer，第五栈参数为数量；还在调用前stack+0x28写入字节1，不能按伪码五参数显示丢掉这个调用点事实。0x28c30原体按int/float/string分别向0x295b0/0x29eb0/0x2a7b0转发；本轮没取这些最终存储体。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原VAR_VALUE动作3 → 已有类型核验 → pBinaryValue/数量传入typed值分发”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：0x28250组合值体及0x295b0/0x29eb0/0x2a7b0 typed存储体尚未取得；copy、旧值释放和越界行为不推测。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：额外第六字节的业务含义未取得原符号，不将其命名成copy/ownership标志。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800249ea.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd26736750989f51a531369b644ee3521a7d48dc2b5bbd021894568209a2b6bd" href="../../证据/bd26736750989f51a531369b644ee3521a7d48dc2b5bbd021894568209a2b6bd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd2673675098</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800249ea.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ab2227453298c5a9d4b660964bb8937ae7087db25ae80cdf063f9b26d34f169b" href="../../证据/ab2227453298c5a9d4b660964bb8937ae7087db25ae80cdf063f9b26d34f169b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ab2227453298</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800249ea.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4541332abd9292871278901864796e35aa2942d9b3926f1c5a9030c022a17ef9" href="../../证据/4541332abd9292871278901864796e35aa2942d9b3926f1c5a9030c022a17ef9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4541332abd92</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9df3908c4d2ed9487283a192bfed2b52c376aadac922ec387cb457217086bc29" href="../../证据/9df3908c4d2ed9487283a192bfed2b52c376aadac922ec387cb457217086bc29.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9df3908c4d2e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VN03 · 原VAR_TYPE动作1 → 删除旧值成功门 → 新类型文本与0x130子描述复制</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>case1先调用0x28110，返回0才继续；随后清记录+0x139的0x100字节与+0x129的0x10字节，并将payload+0x204的类型文本写入记录。数量非0时按nValueNum×0x130构造数组并保存在记录+0x470，目标为空则返回0xe0000002；分配非空时清数组并调用memcpy_s，从payload+0x308指向区域请求复制同样字节数；所选代码未分支检查其返回值，随后设记录+0x448=1、+0x450=数量。数量0分支另调用0x27080并置+0x448=0。原IAT0x180055568绑定MSVCR120.dll::memcpy_s，原汇编核到RCX目标、RDX容量、R8源pointer、R9长度。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原VAR_TYPE动作1 → 删除旧值成功门 → 新类型文本与0x130子描述复制”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：0x25c40/0x27080初始化清理体、数组构造失败与回滚、嵌套数据深拷贝仍未闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bcfa30253c519667a81ed446938d148d0c69a8710989c5562cad3124afd53e3f" href="../../证据/bcfa30253c519667a81ed446938d148d0c69a8710989c5562cad3124afd53e3f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bcfa30253c51</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6748c12f9603f62d81dc5559a3079f072fc03d9448eb31549374ec6bb0dc6eae" href="../../证据/6748c12f9603f62d81dc5559a3079f072fc03d9448eb31549374ec6bb0dc6eae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6748c12f9603</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02941cd60a3cba0deb6cfd3499d702fcb97760a10282e39ec8c3b3a65a2ec7ee" href="../../证据/02941cd60a3cba0deb6cfd3499d702fcb97760a10282e39ec8c3b3a65a2ec7ee.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02941cd60a3c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="07194a3175f971fa79b0f97f477557ff52ec98112165b8cd0631f0f3d98a0e70" href="../../证据/07194a3175f971fa79b0f97f477557ff52ec98112165b8cd0631f0f3d98a0e70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>07194a3175f9</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6aba67054835d3cfc5fceee02d854c6e6b1a940042247ed1c6307c1e834baf43" href="../../证据/6aba67054835d3cfc5fceee02d854c6e6b1a940042247ed1c6307c1e834baf43.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6aba67054835</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VN04 · 原DeleteVar分支与0x28110 DeleteVarValue体 → ModuleFrame删除通知 → 成功才移除名称记录</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DeleteVar先按payload字符串查名称容器，未找到返回0xe000001f；找到后保存原索引，调用0x28110，只有返回0才擦除名称记录并递减其他记录中更大索引。0x28110对记录+0x448为0调用VM_M_DelGlobalVar(context+8,记录+0x29名称)，组合记录则按+0x450数量、+0x470数组0x130步长逐项调用同一导出；返回码在循环中逐项覆盖，返回的是最终保存值，不能说已聚合所有子项失败。原PE IAT0x1800556f0核为ModuleFrame.dll::VM_M_DelGlobalVar。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原DeleteVar分支与0x28110 DeleteVarValue体 → ModuleFrame删除通知 → 成功才移除名称记录”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModuleFrame.VM_M_DelGlobalVar原体与保留结果/绑定最后读者未恢复；最终码0不证明组合每个子项都成功。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="822072e15389f3edcf7f74632bda82aa507e7098fda78e1ce5d4361a624075e8" href="../../证据/822072e15389f3edcf7f74632bda82aa507e7098fda78e1ce5d4361a624075e8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>822072e15389</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028110.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5ada5cc32490c3646a5739f4806dfaef7e214c4619aebd9460a13fac880737ac" href="../../证据/5ada5cc32490c3646a5739f4806dfaef7e214c4619aebd9460a13fac880737ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5ada5cc32490</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028110.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="10795cc76285ee40260e52541055bb491c0af07f1f18a0752c49a0cf0386a825" href="../../证据/10795cc76285ee40260e52541055bb491c0af07f1f18a0752c49a0cf0386a825.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>10795cc76285</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VN05 · 原0x28c30值类型包装的额外参数与锁状态调用 → 显式覆盖后续callee栈字节，不由显示签名推ABI</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>0x28c30汇编保存前四入参并读取第五数量；先调用VM_M_SetGlobalVarLockStatus(moduleID,moduleID,1)，保存返回AL，分发int/float/string时将该AL作为第五字节参数、显式把第六字节参数写0，再把原数量置R9D、原payload置R8。所选体结束处调用同一锁状态导出(moduleID,moduleID,0)。因此case3调用前写入的第六字节1不能直接当作最终typed存储callee接收到1；包装有具体覆盖写。这个事实只限已读分支，不能从函数名断言它建立了完整线程互斥。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原0x28c30值类型包装的额外参数与锁状态调用 → 显式覆盖后续callee栈字节，不由显示签名推ABI”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：VM_M_SetGlobalVarLockStatus返回值语义及typedcallee的额外字节含义未取得原体/符号；不造copy标志解释。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="102a819b2dec187a7f37ee2a1326b9358602db993613815581469021739dd27e" href="../../证据/102a819b2dec187a7f37ee2a1326b9358602db993613815581469021739dd27e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>102a819b2dec</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f3f669102bce7f990ea614bc0027ae07a24602de9ff0ca1973e669e6839f0542" href="../../证据/f3f669102bce7f990ea614bc0027ae07a24602de9ff0ca1973e669e6839f0542.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f3f669102bce</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ee57695245612366b73ecb1bd902a38c7a5365b0aa433f6dc29e17ece1c95ddc" href="../../证据/ee57695245612366b73ecb1bd902a38c7a5365b0aa433f6dc29e17ece1c95ddc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ee5769524561</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="88bb0ace7f834b4cddc446f3b33782990cb424a76585fe2cd37d2922f197f666" href="../../证据/88bb0ace7f834b4cddc446f3b33782990cb424a76585fe2cd37d2922f197f666.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>88bb0ace7f83</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a195b63b2b6bacaf215b2586a31b74b174abca31af66804cd8414ec51835be5c" href="../../证据/a195b63b2b6bacaf215b2586a31b74b174abca31af66804cd8414ec51835be5c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a195b63b2b6b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VS01 · 原typed int@0x295b0 / float@0x29eb0 → 带第五栈字节的ModuleFrame batch调用</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>两个原体对名称或payload指针为0返回0xe0000001，否则先调用ModuleFrame.VM_M_BatchSetGlobalVarInt/Float。原汇编明确RCX=context+8对象、RDX=变量名、R8=原payload指针、R9D=数量，并从typed入口第五字节实参写到调用前stack+0x20；不能因伪码只显示四个参数就称第五标志未传。IAT分别0x180055638和0x1800556c8绑定同名ModuleFrame导出。所选wrapper没有在batch调用前为数值数组分配/逐字节复制新的本地存储，传的是输入数组地址。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原typed int@0x295b0 / float@0x29eb0 → 带第五栈字节的ModuleFrame batch调用”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModuleFrame.VM_M_BatchSetGlobalVarInt RVA0x134710及Float RVA0x134880为已绑定下一种子，本轮未取它们原体，底层存储所有权仍未知。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c24cbecd8f21c26cd78e67acd24062403deb7851d84ac21ae5eb673e56af9501" href="../../证据/c24cbecd8f21c26cd78e67acd24062403deb7851d84ac21ae5eb673e56af9501.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c24cbecd8f21</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dc288a95ba15520517963dbb4380bdbe762f68f0a76f38cc7c902da23eedc525" href="../../证据/dc288a95ba15520517963dbb4380bdbe762f68f0a76f38cc7c902da23eedc525.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dc288a95ba15</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/180029eb0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="28cebe035e23cc0b660c06d71f2d73b2312a17ca437845af35dccd9eab3a41fa" href="../../证据/28cebe035e23cc0b660c06d71f2d73b2312a17ca437845af35dccd9eab3a41fa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>28cebe035e23</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VS02 · 原typed string@0x2a7b0 → 0x60字节输入描述 → 0x10字节STRING_UNIT临时数组</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原体按数量×0x10分配临时数组；逐项从输入记录i×0x60的+0 pointer、+8长度、+0xc容量字段，写到输出i×0x10的同三字段。复制的是pointer/length/size描述，没有在这个循环复制指向的字符串字节。调用ModuleFrame.VM_M_BatchSetGlobalVarString时R8传临时数组、R9D传数量，另传第五栈字节；保存返回码后，无论返回码0还是非0，正常控制流立即对该临时数组delete[]，随后才判断结果/继续联动。IAT0x1800556a0绑定batch string，0x180055540绑定MSVCR120.dll::??_V@YAXPEAX@Z。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原typed string@0x2a7b0 → 0x60字节输入描述 → 0x10字节STRING_UNIT临时数组”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModuleFrame.VM_M_BatchSetGlobalVarString RVA0x1349f0是否同步复制字符串内容、是否保留临时描述pointer、旧值free与失败回滚仍缺原体。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="10e1879bcd6f83d073f0d4467978a46958645a06b395f9c4e144d627a5e53e03" href="../../证据/10e1879bcd6f83d073f0d4467978a46958645a06b395f9c4e144d627a5e53e03.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>10e1879bcd6f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e5392cdab49603bde7a41b4a3e2327ecf9c9f7ac387f2ac809494f07c3ea6e8a" href="../../证据/e5392cdab49603bde7a41b4a3e2327ecf9c9f7ac387f2ac809494f07c3ea6e8a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e5392cdab496</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ac5e545406949eb25d355d2bc82658598532e7b45d953ded0da31f6d674e8413" href="../../证据/ac5e545406949eb25d355d2bc82658598532e7b45d953ded0da31f6d674e8413.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ac5e54540694</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VS03 · 原typed设置成功后的运行参数联动 → 只取第0个值，发送到记录中的linked模块/参数</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>三个typed原体都仅在batch返回0、数量>0且typed入口第六字节为0时进入linked记录循环；记录中+0x43c是链接数量、+0x440按0x94字节步进，每项取目标模块ID及+0x14的参数名。int在调用格式helper0x1b450前，汇编实际从原payload第0项读EDX；伪码遗漏该实参，不能说无值输入。float同样读第0项到XMM1再调用0x1b650。字符串联动用原输入第0条描述的pData/nDataLen直接调用VM_M_SetBinayData，未按每个linked目标选择不同数组元素。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原typed设置成功后的运行参数联动 → 只取第0个值，发送到记录中的linked模块/参数”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：第六字节精确控制是否联动，但其正式参数名/业务语义未取符号；不泛称订阅/copy开关。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModuleFrame.VM_M_SetBinayData对这些linked参数文本的接收和租约仍未闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="43f988348765c1a311662763785a903a0cc6ebfc4fddf2ac84958ebaaa34d4d0" href="../../证据/43f988348765c1a311662763785a903a0cc6ebfc4fddf2ac84958ebaaa34d4d0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>43f988348765</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5db18d9820cbfa4b0a584240d6112e8686427470ffa5e417ca498cb37a5f5bf7" href="../../证据/5db18d9820cbfa4b0a584240d6112e8686427470ffa5e417ca498cb37a5f5bf7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5db18d9820cb</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/180029eb0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cfbedccc0b64ef8d7a5f1740024b831ae63519fa4be1658ad840d253c763a676" href="../../证据/cfbedccc0b64ef8d7a5f1740024b831ae63519fa4be1658ad840d253c763a676.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cfbedccc0b64</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4071b4e835b04171274c2bdaf6debed308b28fc20bb7d81f759c9abaa753f24f" href="../../证据/4071b4e835b04171274c2bdaf6debed308b28fc20bb7d81f759c9abaa753f24f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4071b4e835b0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ea1b8d0d35e5cb8f5fa2fb947b1e3fff7d0df0c5469bf4a621269d901a433f41" href="../../证据/ea1b8d0d35e5cb8f5fa2fb947b1e3fff7d0df0c5469bf4a621269d901a433f41.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ea1b8d0d35e5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VS04 · 原typed返回码与后续链接异常门 → batch结果与各linked更新结果分开保留</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>int/float保存在local_c8的batch结果，string保存在local_c4；batch非0时直接返回该码。batch成功后的linked VM_M_SetBinayData错误保存到另一个local_a0/local_98，仅在日志门下记录，不覆盖最终batch返回值。链接参数名为空时记录后提前返回的也仍是原batch码，剩余链接不再处理。因此函数返回0不能证明每个linked运行参数都已更新；这一结论来自实际局部赋值和返回门，不能把日志存在当作错误向上传播。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原typed返回码与后续链接异常门 → batch结果与各linked更新结果分开保留”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：native最终存储/引用表一致性与跨线程执行顺序未运行验证；正常返回0仅能按所选返回码来源解释。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="abc882c2e17c666c0daaaa97465c9e23fcdb67f513dd95a3ec0e459d86aba3c1" href="../../证据/abc882c2e17c666c0daaaa97465c9e23fcdb67f513dd95a3ec0e459d86aba3c1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>abc882c2e17c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da3b7dfadcce51b7f9ab1ff9e2499c8406bc085a6c995f5b91d8e5407fe41f61" href="../../证据/da3b7dfadcce51b7f9ab1ff9e2499c8406bc085a6c995f5b91d8e5407fe41f61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da3b7dfadcce</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a257c6d6743b95015097d0d4943984352e701eee751ff1aa4ed1c86d0ff47e69" href="../../证据/a257c6d6743b95015097d0d4943984352e701eee751ff1aa4ed1c86d0ff47e69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a257c6d6743b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e88ddec9f944933d4ac657a87f4d692b4df9a64530ca9046235dce7352aa0408" href="../../证据/e88ddec9f944933d4ac657a87f4d692b4df9a64530ca9046235dce7352aa0408.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e88ddec9f944</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3c5fb8f9636219313b09ad6fa74d798d9d517508da8fce4c72d2851e700e9aad" href="../../证据/3c5fb8f9636219313b09ad6fa74d798d9d517508da8fce4c72d2851e700e9aad.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3c5fb8f96362</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ01 · 原ModuleFrame的Batch int/float/string导出 → 原指针/数量/第五字节进入各内部接收者</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原PE导出表分别确认BatchInt=0x134710、BatchFloat=0x134880、BatchString=0x1349f0，三者不是独立SetGlobalVarInt/Float/String导出。三wrapper汇编保存原RCX/RDX/R8/R9，检查句柄、名称和payload非null；调用内部126f10/127050/127340时，RDX=原句柄指针、R8=原名称、R9=原payload，数量写栈+0x20，原第五字节从当前栈+0xc0读出并写栈+0x28。内部接收体再从句柄首int取得键；不能因伪码callee少显示参数就说原指针或隐藏字节已丢弃。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModuleFrame的Batch int/float/string导出 → 原指针/数量/第五字节进入各内部接收者”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：实际从GlobalVariableModule typed调用进入这些导出的运行实例未执行；已有静态IAT与caller链和本导出体分别保存。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：第五字节的具体业务命名不由ABI位置推定；后续非零分支可据所取体说明，但不命名为通用copy或ownership标志。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180134710.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d0fba8f2fd3f43c8b893abcfa54bc9f0177d3f21ca783153b904ae9a23bb36aa" href="../../证据/d0fba8f2fd3f43c8b893abcfa54bc9f0177d3f21ca783153b904ae9a23bb36aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d0fba8f2fd3f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180134880.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5414fa228e3e76743b123625c90c7f207af3fa1f8e4599bf2e102318b94afbbd" href="../../证据/5414fa228e3e76743b123625c90c7f207af3fa1f8e4599bf2e102318b94afbbd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5414fa228e3e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1801349f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5cff4e556a475c48c26ffbd880449c696518cc35a1804be9339e530e94a9e0c1" href="../../证据/5cff4e556a475c48c26ffbd880449c696518cc35a1804be9339e530e94a9e0c1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5cff4e556a47</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180126f10.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c718b0de5572a3f6b7d0ba570e09b387bc4ecfb34bc159fc8d492c5e32d7d522" href="../../证据/c718b0de5572a3f6b7d0ba570e09b387bc4ecfb34bc159fc8d492c5e32d7d522.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c718b0de5572</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127050.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e5ab0cf15e8875f07074ff9a426fa90377fd934b697e880b2e5271bd3c040ae5" href="../../证据/e5ab0cf15e8875f07074ff9a426fa90377fd934b697e880b2e5271bd3c040ae5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e5ab0cf15e88</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127340.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="48d0d2d5245469dd81ee311bc544064a76fb0e0506ec8444abe5cdb63a7fd9a3" href="../../证据/48d0d2d5245469dd81ee311bc544064a76fb0e0506ec8444abe5cdb63a7fd9a3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>48d0d2d52454</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ02 · Batch内部992e0/99550的附加分支与主仓读取 → 非零字节分支逐值记录，随后取共享模块记录</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>int与float接收体均仅把count==0直接判错；字节参数非零时，按上下文键查另一记录，更新标记/名称，然后仅在count>0时循环从原payload按4字节读取并写各自数值列表。之后仍执行公共检查并进入全局共享模块记录查找：记录为空返回0xe0000003，否则交f4d10/f4dc0处理。这里附加记录与主typed存储是两条持有关系，且负数量不等于被count==0门拒绝。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“Batch内部992e0/99550的附加分支与主仓读取 → 非零字节分支逐值记录，随后取共享模块记录”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：负数量、附加记录与主记录一致性及0x09a7e0完整准入合同没有运行验证；不从本片段推通用线程安全或失败原子性。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800992e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b23ad560142b53472b6c32e3001f55645f1df2c0a6256f3e25ac01c3cea08317" href="../../证据/b23ad560142b53472b6c32e3001f55645f1df2c0a6256f3e25ac01c3cea08317.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b23ad560142b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180099550.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1c9487feac1b03dbe34e5cbbdc5781d0615975f1821541062ff1b5666b311b0b" href="../../证据/1c9487feac1b03dbe34e5cbbdc5781d0615975f1821541062ff1b5666b311b0b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1c9487feac1b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800992e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a5ea0a8c22e033f5412af311fdf32673c2680877c8155cd4fe852ade1a326b77" href="../../证据/a5ea0a8c22e033f5412af311fdf32673c2680877c8155cd4fe852ade1a326b77.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a5ea0a8c22e0</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ03 · f4d10/f4dc0的数值主写入 → 输入每个4字节值复制进所取值记录的内部数组</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>int写入先经f74b0取得共享值对象，空则返回0xe0000003；非空先调用其虚表+8槽，再对正count循环从原pointer+i*4读取4字节并交fc50。fc50经准备函数后取对象+0x10中的载荷，必要时扩容，并向其数组base+8+当前数目*4写入该值、增加计数。float的f4dc0对应fd30，写入另一组+0x40/+0x44/+0x48数组字段。这个层级已有实际标量复制，不能继续说数值始终只是原pointer转发；也不能把虚表+8未解体的行为擅称完整旧值清空。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“f4d10/f4dc0的数值主写入 → 输入每个4字节值复制进所取值记录的内部数组”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：值对象创建、虚表+8目标、扩容失败和所有其它读者的退役仍需独立追体；本轮未运行数值或并发验证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800f4d10.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e648227a5e1775656123c8a489ab2ec8d9901d735bd992251d97fa44a8ce8190" href="../../证据/e648227a5e1775656123c8a489ab2ec8d9901d735bd992251d97fa44a8ce8190.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e648227a5e17</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800f4dc0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ffb1de5af647f1687ba3d663fd984ff2a8ad09a652d29fcd51e36a82480e71a4" href="../../证据/ffb1de5af647f1687ba3d663fd984ff2a8ad09a652d29fcd51e36a82480e71a4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ffb1de5af647</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18000fc50.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13de87f63bfa6f1ab1a08a6112764443401f712e0000ebc0983286a957291bc2" href="../../证据/13de87f63bfa6f1ab1a08a6112764443401f712e0000ebc0983286a957291bc2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13de87f63bfa</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18000fd30.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c546634755a16fdf1e80473d32ddfcff222499c1dd6acc61d85508682f8d919" href="../../证据/5c546634755a16fdf1e80473d32ddfcff222499c1dd6acc61d85508682f8d919.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c546634755a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800f4d10.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b08ad24aae3c3fca07c68a4973f1ab2cf003c6ca1364cc38c4b28d2bddbbb389" href="../../证据/b08ad24aae3c3fca07c68a4973f1ab2cf003c6ca1364cc38c4b28d2bddbbb389.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b08ad24aae3c</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ04 · BatchString接收体997c0 → 描述步长16字节→局部字符串→内部字符串记录副本</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>接收体在正count循环中每次读取16字节描述的首pointer，再按尾零扫描构造局部字符串；还存在字节参数非零时向辅助列表复制字符串的分支。主分支按模块/名称取得字符串值对象后，汇编明确把当前索引和局部字符串作为参数交00ffe0。该体按索引选择已有或新增的内部字符串，再调用006470复制字符；006470在非同对象分支按实际字符串长度调用原IAT memcpy、更新长度并写尾零。00ffe0随后对临时字符串大容量块调用operator delete并重置它。此处释放的是临时字符串存储，不能当作调用者STRING_UNIT数组或其原pointer的释放。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“BatchString接收体997c0 → 描述步长16字节→局部字符串→内部字符串记录副本”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：STRING_UNIT长度/容量字段没有在这些读取分支中作为统一边界消费；不能把它们推成全部字符串均带长度安全读取。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：空指针、嵌入尾零、分配失败和字符串剩余分支没有原机运行验证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800997c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ad9f9ce0c19dea05a04fa72fda3fade01b92bcdfac5a599dd9a5ac2908070709" href="../../证据/ad9f9ce0c19dea05a04fa72fda3fade01b92bcdfac5a599dd9a5ac2908070709.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ad9f9ce0c19d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800997c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="11333a1f99378032925c9d990ce9bae621b367f8436d41a488bb8b8d8994f453" href="../../证据/11333a1f99378032925c9d990ce9bae621b367f8436d41a488bb8b8d8994f453.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>11333a1f9937</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800997c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5b449236c5381aa47f70095407da8efdd615e750a85ee54805b1813e6f9dea63" href="../../证据/5b449236c5381aa47f70095407da8efdd615e750a85ee54805b1813e6f9dea63.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5b449236c538</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18000ffe0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f6088371e11903993f19394e2e6e540bbc2ae537bdb94ec9ecc66a79d987a642" href="../../证据/f6088371e11903993f19394e2e6e540bbc2ae537bdb94ec9ecc66a79d987a642.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f6088371e119</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180006470.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f7639568604227fbf64dd23ab699f88806690c07b8bb1f888a2b9b0efbae301c" href="../../证据/f7639568604227fbf64dd23ab699f88806690c07b8bb1f888a2b9b0efbae301c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f76395686042</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ05 · VM_M_DelGlobalVar → 127e60 → 依次按七个类型值查名称，再交带锁的共享模块仓</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Del导出伪码显示void/少参数，但汇编明确把原句柄和名称重排到RDX/R8交127e60，并保存EAX作为返回值。内部读取句柄首int，非-1时对同名依次调用cb820，类型整数次序1/2/7/3/4/5/6。cb820对仓库+0x58执行实际_Mtx_lock，取得模块共享记录，非空才交f82f0；f82f0把七个类型映射到记录内不同map偏移，再调用f9aa0按name求范围、交6eb00擦除。普通返回的0并不包含逐个erase结果聚合证明，map不存在也不等于所有历史结果引用消失。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“VM_M_DelGlobalVar → 127e60 → 依次按七个类型值查名称，再交带锁的共享模块仓”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：句柄有效性、所有map语义、删除后的已发布结果和native绑定最后读者未运行确认；正常控制流mutex操作不是所有异常分支排空证明。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180135660.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c672a26219aadfdefb3bec96d42fa5f2c472fa761bb464b547a65ebc8f6081f7" href="../../证据/c672a26219aadfdefb3bec96d42fa5f2c472fa761bb464b547a65ebc8f6081f7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c672a26219aa</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180135660.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5469b95269369572f0c28970f50fbd19bd7cde18b4672325cda96cde627b2f71" href="../../证据/5469b95269369572f0c28970f50fbd19bd7cde18b4672325cda96cde627b2f71.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5469b9526936</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3829bcaca329d6e9a9c7732fec6642ac96c22b868e8e3acea41a3cb282212b32" href="../../证据/3829bcaca329d6e9a9c7732fec6642ac96c22b868e8e3acea41a3cb282212b32.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3829bcaca329</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2e0a92f3653f7ce14393acc15d9d3e241c4974536cf8b94030b107b7d8136b31" href="../../证据/2e0a92f3653f7ce14393acc15d9d3e241c4974536cf8b94030b107b7d8136b31.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2e0a92f3653f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="83f5fcf7b5ced3ca7890e387ed139dde5135970c442d611659172bd8ae7204eb" href="../../证据/83f5fcf7b5ced3ca7890e387ed139dde5135970c442d611659172bd8ae7204eb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>83f5fcf7b5ce</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d2f7b38ed63b94d923d7a70226ff361522c04ee05a137257f7d88e023ee48d8c" href="../../证据/d2f7b38ed63b94d923d7a70226ff361522c04ee05a137257f7d88e023ee48d8c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d2f7b38ed63b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d1c9895dc35849cc63f4c050cece323e3d83fca16b1c1d20145689ca7ad01a80" href="../../证据/d1c9895dc35849cc63f4c050cece323e3d83fca16b1c1d20145689ca7ad01a80.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d1c9895dc358</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="959d49bd262d6e1d8ee7fd0ac0efab70738afec35db9e86df05f1347a1fea9ce" href="../../证据/959d49bd262d6e1d8ee7fd0ac0efab70738afec35db9e86df05f1347a1fea9ce.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>959d49bd262d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0b57d200679d48277f0de69ae93f869b320ace0c1ea0527bd25e8960b051fe5e" href="../../证据/0b57d200679d48277f0de69ae93f869b320ace0c1ea0527bd25e8960b051fe5e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0b57d200679d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800cb820.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="917182ee369afe16399e66e7bbb03bbfa4d5018966e7f39c982a7f8c98fe65b1" href="../../证据/917182ee369afe16399e66e7bbb03bbfa4d5018966e7f39c982a7f8c98fe65b1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>917182ee369a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800f82f0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="23e331c6d91f498a799996eaf3c17f78aa0772293a521a7cfad357e61bc0e50c" href="../../证据/23e331c6d91f498a799996eaf3c17f78aa0772293a521a7cfad357e61bc0e50c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>23e331c6d91f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ06 · typed map擦除6eb00→6f290/6e570 → 释放节点名称/节点内存；载荷经控制块条件虚析构</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>范围erase在全范围时交6e570递归处理并复位根/计数，局部范围逐节点交6f290。已恢复两叶实际体与汇编：节点+0x48的共享控制块强计数递减，只有降为0才调用其虚表首槽，再递减弱计数，弱计数为0再调用+8槽。节点名称容量>=16时delete其名称堆块，之后重置字符串字段并operator delete节点本身；局部erase还递减容器数目。因此节点与名称的真实释放已可证明，而payload虚析构的动态接收者未定位，不能把该条件虚调用等同于每份数值/字符串buffer都已销毁。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“typed map擦除6eb00→6f290/6e570 → 释放节点名称/节点内存；载荷经控制块条件虚析构”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未恢复这些shared控制块在每个typed map中的具体虚表实例与payload析构体；不宣称已证明全局无悬挂引用、无泄漏或所有存储已回收。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18006eb00.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="483e061bd48c8c11f7f3eec6a4d4ad48adb76b0ab453984249da44ea0490fac4" href="../../证据/483e061bd48c8c11f7f3eec6a4d4ad48adb76b0ab453984249da44ea0490fac4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>483e061bd48c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18006eb00.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c00725c81f94316e96840c96e72afb4c25fe1571bba4dc8dc4344ad65ba04cad" href="../../证据/c00725c81f94316e96840c96e72afb4c25fe1571bba4dc8dc4344ad65ba04cad.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c00725c81f94</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18006f290.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e8e1098ace68f5b159684e74f88d51be2f917c24de041db432060e5c935173b0" href="../../证据/e8e1098ace68f5b159684e74f88d51be2f917c24de041db432060e5c935173b0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e8e1098ace68</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18006e570.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c68bf0b137c840ac4843cae3acf8ee3d0b4a440da7af3185c38204129ff8d4dd" href="../../证据/c68bf0b137c840ac4843cae3acf8ee3d0b4a440da7af3185c38204129ff8d4dd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c68bf0b137c8</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18006f290.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a7bd88a46ba6a83d0e6276f93a602384db9e951c01d693cfce39a27c8039c7f9" href="../../证据/a7bd88a46ba6a83d0e6276f93a602384db9e951c01d693cfce39a27c8039c7f9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a7bd88a46ba6</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18006e570.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3a34933bf6ae2918420d808661243ec0b4119223c36384709968a69f73176d8f" href="../../证据/3a34933bf6ae2918420d808661243ec0b4119223c36384709968a69f73176d8f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3a34933bf6ae</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ07 · VM_M_SetGlobalVarLockStatus → 9a140 → 按键查状态记录，再调用真实mutex与标志写入</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>导出正常分支把两整数参数与原字节传入静态对象的9a140。该体先读对象+0x10，汇编明确TEST该字段后SETZ临时字节，再与请求字节作TEST决定早返0；不能照伪码含糊的位运算优先级另造布尔公式。成功查到键后，非零请求还需对象启用字节与记录首字节通过门，才_Mtx_lock记录+8并写记录+1=1。零请求在记录+1非零时才做额外准备/清理调用、写+1=0后_Mtx_unlock；重复零/不存在记录另有返回1分支。锁/解锁确为原MSVCP120导入，但只有这些分支被静态核实，不把导出名当全局同步或所有异常必解锁保证。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“VM_M_SetGlobalVarLockStatus → 9a140 → 按键查状态记录，再调用真实mutex与标志写入”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：mutex所属线程、重入/重复请求、异常处理以及9a300/69c0对暂存的具体语义未闭合；未运行并发或原始设备。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180148130.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eadbf2a0064c6ef46c6e03bd65abca09af39146c2074cdfc6cddd9db047ab1f2" href="../../证据/eadbf2a0064c6ef46c6e03bd65abca09af39146c2074cdfc6cddd9db047ab1f2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eadbf2a0064c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18009a140.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e6fced1ece828e9a4675913b2e4f615bc716ac4e217361cb00fbcbfeddfc7991" href="../../证据/e6fced1ece828e9a4675913b2e4f615bc716ac4e217361cb00fbcbfeddfc7991.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e6fced1ece82</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18009a140.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="aad51b5799f0148915fef8577c78a21ed9d9ff4f950fefb1130dcd68e4c8b095" href="../../证据/aad51b5799f0148915fef8577c78a21ed9d9ff4f950fefb1130dcd68e4c8b095.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>aad51b5799f0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18009a140.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8ed9bfdf77938fd7e795ee3aff473f97bad7884beddfc7d3c9fa3cc8fad8d13d" href="../../证据/8ed9bfdf77938fd7e795ee3aff473f97bad7884beddfc7d3c9fa3cc8fad8d13d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8ed9bfdf7793</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18009a140.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a53bb145cb49744a5867dc5369b86f584e840e4a2d42b189ebc7fe93687104f2" href="../../证据/a53bb145cb49744a5867dc5369b86f584e840e4a2d42b189ebc7fe93687104f2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a53bb145cb49</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CD05 · WorkflowRunContext每轮变量、参数与节点结果 → 本轮引用解析、生产者失败移除与会话快照</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前逐轮数据容器名为WorkflowRunContext；未定位到名为WorkflowValueScope的同一路由实体。构造器复制inputs字典但保留每个PortValue，严格核输入Kind/Cardinality；未绑定生产者的局部变量每轮由Initial重新建值。Resolve节点输出只读本轮Success/NoMatch记录；局部变量直接返回variables中的同一PortValue。Update在生产者记录后先Remove对应变量，再尝试从本轮Node读值，失败则不恢复上轮/旧值。Complete为Inputs/Outputs/LocalVariables新建只读字典，为显示创建新单元素列表，但内层PortValue不复制；局部变量从ID键转换成名称键后保存在ExecutionSessionResult。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“WorkflowRunContext每轮变量、参数与节点结果 → 本轮引用解析、生产者失败移除与会话快照”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本事实只证明这个主执行路由；配置自执行/调试可另外使用旧结果作为输入，不能移植成所有入口都只允许本轮生产者。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fdde6d4d9b9088ba03e2707ac2eee08dbbb47b336fee2bc4f3206e995ada168d" href="../../证据/fdde6d4d9b9088ba03e2707ac2eee08dbbb47b336fee2bc4f3206e995ada168d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fdde6d4d9b90</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="647bacd664b27f7151bb6339eed4ea8d1248a596e06cacf7c0701510941f4e9e" href="../../证据/647bacd664b27f7151bb6339eed4ea8d1248a596e06cacf7c0701510941f4e9e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>647bacd664b2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3ad7bc9f125083dba4f0a6ce27c7a6c9349651d9651e9d9bae2cd85e9e5cec3f" href="../../证据/3ad7bc9f125083dba4f0a6ce27c7a6c9349651d9651e9d9bae2cd85e9e5cec3f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3ad7bc9f1250</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="67f3dd81329952a1875380f4a805711c6bae34f31363a5c0c576959085bfd422" href="../../证据/67f3dd81329952a1875380f4a805711c6bae34f31363a5c0c576959085bfd422.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>67f3dd813299</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8a01a9f4564a19bfc9df69de17a1abd4855d13a4795da228f60fc365e18a28e0" href="../../证据/8a01a9f4564a19bfc9df69de17a1abd4855d13a4795da228f60fc365e18a28e0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8a01a9f4564a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="23385d01ec16bdeacebbbe7e52aa50f3c5dcb13592cc77859f3e989a4478eb3c" href="../../证据/23385d01ec16bdeacebbbe7e52aa50f3c5dcb13592cc77859f3e989a4478eb3c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>23385d01ec16</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CD06 · WorkflowSubscriptions常量/变量/参数与延迟读取 → 字节变量仍为文本，JSON复制与UTF8容量读另走</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>VariableKind把int映为Integer、float映为Number、string与byte都映为Text；NormalizeValue把byte限制为偶数长度十六进制并大写，Initial的byte落到Text(v.Value)，没有在这里转byte[]。NumberArrayConstant先JSON反序列化double[]、检查最多1000000元素且有限，再由Resolve调用Numbers复制一次。参数订阅要求Kind匹配且Scalar，并SerializeToElement生成JSON；Integer参数还checked转int32并按参数范围验证。延迟文本读另取Text元素，截到首个NUL，计算UTF8字节数+1，容量不足返回所需字节数；它返回string，不提供原生借用字节指针。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“WorkflowSubscriptions常量/变量/参数与延迟读取 → 字节变量仍为文本，JSON复制与UTF8容量读另走”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：这里不声称原版byte变量也如此传输；原SDK字节值与字符串指针寿命另列。读取器resolve回调是否捕获跨轮可变对象须按具体入口另核。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d8c65f72eae3daa3bf7cbec4b11f28fa068833602f9dff472a419f1897dca3dd" href="../../证据/d8c65f72eae3daa3bf7cbec4b11f28fa068833602f9dff472a419f1897dca3dd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d8c65f72eae3</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowConfiguration.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b2e1e26065160f34a4cbf6a7e202167ab144f4f74795d20c6ff16eeb1abf0dca" href="../../证据/b2e1e26065160f34a4cbf6a7e202167ab144f4f74795d20c6ff16eeb1abf0dca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b2e1e2606516</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="767ad7e092a73b8ec795acb96eaa64dcc4a560040e13d50f2b273363c95cd80a" href="../../证据/767ad7e092a73b8ec795acb96eaa64dcc4a560040e13d50f2b273363c95cd80a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>767ad7e092a7</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="08268452fb859167c303637d11b85f33bbd1a01514e61643a4b7d7241b9a48ec" href="../../证据/08268452fb859167c303637d11b85f33bbd1a01514e61643a4b7d7241b9a48ec.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>08268452fb85</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="90ebadc33bac5f6ff70bbc6c375ef022f029f69dd1f8c254877ed90bea740381" href="../../证据/90ebadc33bac5f6ff70bbc6c375ef022f029f69dd1f8c254877ed90bea740381.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>90ebadc33bac</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowNumericInputRead.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="10c2d6477e8bafac729b4987bf15ce732e733869cdac4364aa56e12bf4975318" href="../../证据/10c2d6477e8bafac729b4987bf15ce732e733869cdac4364aa56e12bf4975318.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>10c2d6477e8b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CD07 · 局部变量改型/删除/节点删除 → 断开文档订阅和来源不等于清历史运行值</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>局部变量窗口Commit改型时归一化或重置Value，并清该变量的SourceNode/SourcePort；类型变化还移除以此LocalVariable为来源的Subscriptions。DeleteVariable删除变量及其消费者订阅；删除分组类似批量移除。GraphEditorDocument.SetWorkflowConfiguration验证并Snapshot，识别删除/改型ID后交PropagateGroupInterface处理关联。删除节点时WorkflowConfiguration.RemoveNodes移除相应来源引用，并把绑定该节点的变量改为无来源，保留配置Value。所选UI写配置经WriteWorkflowConfiguration在activeRun非空时拒绝；改文档不会原地改写已经捕获的本轮配置或旧session.LocalVariables。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“局部变量改型/删除/节点删除 → 断开文档订阅和来源不等于清历史运行值”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：父Group比较操作数等传播规则不能仅由变量窗口推定完整，本条只证明确调用到传播清理；其它程序化编辑入口门及跨方案消费者需另核。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowLocalVariablesWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="254d5307504316470e9d00366d4b9a31b2fab700f029cf77c5c3215cc36c9b33" href="../../证据/254d5307504316470e9d00366d4b9a31b2fab700f029cf77c5c3215cc36c9b33.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>254d53075043</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowLocalVariablesWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="568d700f8e89a52801af09145e98332faf4f7a3ec4ba8c12ce38e584a2261b25" href="../../证据/568d700f8e89a52801af09145e98332faf4f7a3ec4ba8c12ce38e584a2261b25.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>568d700f8e89</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9181e4c6a0199f6f171249fbe4181d0345afa621ef525a4a9e46d3dfab44235c" href="../../证据/9181e4c6a0199f6f171249fbe4181d0345afa621ef525a4a9e46d3dfab44235c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9181e4c6a019</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowConfiguration.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6d008fca77fcf3637cbc222223e3be1be0c8c034c5b477f4e34ecc5b12012661" href="../../证据/6d008fca77fcf3637cbc222223e3be1be0c8c034c5b477f4e34ecc5b12012661.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6d008fca77fc</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowConfigurationHost.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="97937fb661c298b491b1a79deb541c77623984d541af951b012cb9b8a64c46ff" href="../../证据/97937fb661c298b491b1a79deb541c77623984d541af951b012cb9b8a64c46ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>97937fb661c2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GroupInterfacePropagation.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13692e9a896366cb89184a3d0c4b5939e8a3c8a0a2f77661fed0721536c799da" href="../../证据/13692e9a896366cb89184a3d0c4b5939e8a3c8a0a2f77661fed0721536c799da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13692e9a8963</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX01 · 原GlobalVariableModule复合设置0x28250 → 0x130描述逐项分发至已绑定typed入口</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>入口RDX是描述数组、R8D是条数，按0x130步进读取+0x100类型与+0x104数量。类型0/1/2分别用+0x108/+0x110/+0x118的payload指针调用295b0/29eb0/2a7b0。汇编确认typed第五栈字节来自VM_M_SetGlobalVarLockStatus返回AL，第六栈字节固定1；据VS03已见第六字节非0跳过typed联动分支。起始SetGlobalVarLockStatus(moduleID,moduleID,1)，正常末尾同入口第三参0；这里只证API及实参，不能等同原生互斥锁实现。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原GlobalVariableModule复合设置0x28250 → 0x130描述逐项分发至已绑定typed入口”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：负条数经MOVSXD后无符号比较的异常输入安全性未运行验证；不据正常条数循环推断边界校验。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：复合条目的创建/命名及不同订阅者看到更新的原子性没有由此证明。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180028250.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="055473846a95f55149afdcd543d0c4bff8f73638368e2477f1a846abd95be06c" href="../../证据/055473846a95f55149afdcd543d0c4bff8f73638368e2477f1a846abd95be06c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>055473846a95</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180028250.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="51f10ad48da32e80dd0f4af7b01d755c17c509c844b2b1b777457d74cc2bfca8" href="../../证据/51f10ad48da32e80dd0f4af7b01d755c17c509c844b2b1b777457d74cc2bfca8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>51f10ad48da3</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX02 · record退役0x25c40 → 清零计数，释放+0x440/+0x458/+0x460/+0x468/+0x470</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>0x25c40真实原体是缓冲清理，不是初始化：先写+0x43c=0、+0x450=0；非空+0x440、+0x458、+0x460分别delete[]，清pointer；+0x468调用1ba20(pointer,3)，+0x470调用1bc70(pointer,3)，返回后清pointer及+0x450。它未调用ModuleFrame删除变量值，不能把record缓冲清理等同全局最终存储删除。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“record退役0x25c40 → 清零计数，释放+0x440/+0x458/+0x460/+0x468/+0x470”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：record整体析构、并发最后读者和调用0x25c40的全部路径未在本切片遍历。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180025c40.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="63e274c94625f277e6d286a7f5af032c2a2c0a3c4c8953f105d2b00262a85b6b" href="../../证据/63e274c94625f277e6d286a7f5af032c2a2c0a3c4c8953f105d2b00262a85b6b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>63e274c94625</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180025c40.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="83bfe57ae454769a4194fff2f0b15fdf73ffaa838443596dfb48fefe7192c0d2" href="../../证据/83bfe57ae454769a4194fff2f0b15fdf73ffaa838443596dfb48fefe7192c0d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>83bfe57ae454</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX03 · record+0x470数组析构1bc70(pointer,3) → 逐0x130子描述析构，再释放cookie前的数组分配</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>1bc70参数3同时启用vector析构与delete[]：从pointer-8读数量，以0x130步长调用1b900，然后delete[](pointer-8)。每个1b900对子描述+0x108/+0x110非空指针直接delete[]，清pointer与+0x104；+0x118非空则调用1ba20(pointer,3)。1ba20以0x60步长调用1b830并delete[]其pointer-8。1b830只有描述+0x50的int非0且+0pointer非0时才delete[]内容、清pointer与+8长度，最后始终清+0xc容量。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“record+0x470数组析构1bc70(pointer,3) → 逐0x130子描述析构，再释放cookie前的数组分配”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：+0x50正式所有权语义、每个生产分支如何置位/转移仍未闭合；不由delete条件猜字段名。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001bc70.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb146ba90b7409f4710bed80d27ee8ed733c5651fb5fcf0515f67461e760db7d" href="../../证据/cb146ba90b7409f4710bed80d27ee8ed733c5651fb5fcf0515f67461e760db7d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb146ba90b74</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001bc70.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="36b12553da384ed3fa61819c1ab8db81dc7e4ae461dd8dfc8df5db9ac037527c" href="../../证据/36b12553da384ed3fa61819c1ab8db81dc7e4ae461dd8dfc8df5db9ac037527c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>36b12553da38</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b900.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161" href="../../证据/d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d55b696b7636</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b900.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="68e726aee9d5048c9b0f861be252a835373dc7d2af298852f8192cc20cf63225" href="../../证据/68e726aee9d5048c9b0f861be252a835373dc7d2af298852f8192cc20cf63225.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>68e726aee9d5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001ba20.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7a2b430230145c8abc26e777b89212b81b23ce6735b86452685683001ac8da07" href="../../证据/7a2b430230145c8abc26e777b89212b81b23ce6735b86452685683001ac8da07.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7a2b43023014</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b830.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="85a3e5e558b5033c23fe210411421e293bd471f74b4ab97816a8c1bd4071e6b3" href="../../证据/85a3e5e558b5033c23fe210411421e293bd471f74b4ab97816a8c1bd4071e6b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>85a3e5e558b5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b830.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="775f61ca653ec23a67610e68a4205aaf99080666438a87f257f6fdd4481a1816" href="../../证据/775f61ca653ec23a67610e68a4205aaf99080666438a87f257f6fdd4481a1816.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>775f61ca653e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX04 · 复合描述构造1b890与先前VAR_TYPE浅描述复制 → 初始化与后续嵌套释放边界分开</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>本次取到1b890：清名称0x100字节、+0x104=0、+0x100类型=6、+0x108/+0x110/+0x118=0。先前VAR_TYPE分支已见按条数分配带cookie的0x130数组、逐项构造、随后整段memcpy_s输入描述；该整段复制包含指针字段，不能因调用memcpy_s就称嵌套payload已复制。新增析构体证明这些复制进来的非空数值pointer将进入delete[]，内层内容则受+0x50控制。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“复合描述构造1b890与先前VAR_TYPE浅描述复制 → 初始化与后续嵌套释放边界分开”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：VAR_TYPE case是大函数内片段，in_stack字段依赖原整体栈语义，不当成独立函数正式参数。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：输入嵌套地址来源与借用/转移协议尚缺，不能直接断言原版存在double-free。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b890.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c0a84c7530a5d7f8117329c51c2eb2f8c5b3626399b32f9ebd5f90258272ab7c" href="../../证据/c0a84c7530a5d7f8117329c51c2eb2f8c5b3626399b32f9ebd5f90258272ab7c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c0a84c7530a5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="abe329fd6070bf0a3f4cbb279191fb7a4e30fba18a1a4c816ad5b4f958c40bf9" href="../../证据/abe329fd6070bf0a3f4cbb279191fb7a4e30fba18a1a4c816ad5b4f958c40bf9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>abe329fd6070</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b900.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161" href="../../证据/d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d55b696b7636</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX05 · 原SetGlobalValue0x27080 → record中数值数组或紧凑字符串描述发布到ModuleFrame</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>0x27080日志实名CVariableModuBase::SetGlobalValue，实际是发布体，不是清理体。record+0x450非0时先调用SetGlobalVarLockStatus(...,1)，int/float分支分别传+0x458/+0x460地址、数量、返回AL到BatchSet；string且+0x468非空时，分配数量×0x10临时数组，把每个0x60描述的pointer/+8长度/+0xc容量复制进去，调用BatchString后正常路径delete[]临时描述，随后SetGlobalVarLockStatus(...,0)。临时分配返回null分支记录日志并提前return，未经过正常末尾的status(...,0)；这只是所见控制流，不断言status就是实际mutex。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原SetGlobalValue0x27080 → record中数值数组或紧凑字符串描述发布到ModuleFrame”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：锁状态API本身的同步含义及分配异常unwind尚未恢复；不由null失败分支推断所有异常路径。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本体末尾链接参数发送使用record+0x139初始文本，不能据数组设置成功推断每个链接拿到完整数组。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180027080.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1b2c60ee4296f2dff327ae3e601caa80723ccee8244f84376fd0135c3df055d9" href="../../证据/1b2c60ee4296f2dff327ae3e601caa80723ccee8244f84376fd0135c3df055d9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1b2c60ee4296</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180027080.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6bf09bd16cdcbefb483cdb42f54196f88421c0c1b7f9829a1017234b153e9c71" href="../../证据/6bf09bd16cdcbefb483cdb42f54196f88421c0c1b7f9829a1017234b153e9c71.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6bf09bd16cdc</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX06 · 复合type4分支 → 图像字节进入2b2e0及VM_M_SetGlobalVarImageEx，排除PointSet误归类</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>28250的类型4将+0x118视作0x60描述数组，逐项取pointer/+8长度与下标，调用2b2e0。该helper日志set image start/end，正常申请0x145c0缓冲成功且pointer/handle均非0后，memcpy_s复制输入长度字节到新buffer，并设置局部描述长度。汇编确认调用ImageEx前RCX=context+8、RDX名称、R8D下标、R9=&amp;局部描述；第五栈参数是0x145c0返回的handle，第六字节继承helper入口第六字节（上游由LockStatus返回AL写入）。伪码显示四参不等于handle/第六字节丢失。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“复合type4分支 → 图像字节进入2b2e0及VM_M_SetGlobalVarImageEx，排除PointSet误归类”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：0x145c0分配/复用、ImageEx对handle的保留与释放未取；无原版设备/SDK运行佐证。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：PointSet原生最终存储路径仍未知，不能由类型4或图像分支补齐。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180028250.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="055473846a95f55149afdcd543d0c4bff8f73638368e2477f1a846abd95be06c" href="../../证据/055473846a95f55149afdcd543d0c4bff8f73638368e2477f1a846abd95be06c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>055473846a95</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180028250.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="51f10ad48da32e80dd0f4af7b01d755c17c509c844b2b1b777457d74cc2bfca8" href="../../证据/51f10ad48da32e80dd0f4af7b01d755c17c509c844b2b1b777457d74cc2bfca8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>51f10ad48da3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18002b2e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="30b86306e19395d6e4f90a0f5ca150fe1d26c5e800bb0e88dd46e9768caa0b36" href="../../证据/30b86306e19395d6e4f90a0f5ca150fe1d26c5e800bb0e88dd46e9768caa0b36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>30b86306e193</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18002b2e0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2a0295241428c364e4b39908d28a0c299c50a594bbaf5108a1a5bd5ee7901423" href="../../证据/2a0295241428c364e4b39908d28a0c299c50a594bbaf5108a1a5bd5ee7901423.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2a0295241428</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP01 · VZ03/04 typed map factory f74b0/f7650/f7260 → 明确构造的0x88值对象与另一份0x18共享控制块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>名称未命中时三个factory分别分配0x88对象并写vtable 22e690/22e6b8/22e6e0；命中则复制已有节点+0x40共享对。包装体fa090/fa100/fa020另分配0x18控制块，强/弱计数均初始1，保存对象指针+0x10，写22e538/22e560/22e5b0。原PE字节校验这些实际表槽，不能把typed对象虚表与shared控制块虚表混成同一析构入口。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“VZ03/04 typed map factory f74b0/f7650/f7260 → 明确构造的0x88值对象与另一份0x18共享控制块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：初始化所复制callable的动态分配器目标未在本切片定位。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f74b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb91909534d4f84ab527516d41f5f029b5b05a666c180823d29a0712ddee1a99" href="../../证据/cb91909534d4f84ab527516d41f5f029b5b05a666c180823d29a0712ddee1a99.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb91909534d4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f7650.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c195902f1ee88ad4129cdacb8cd63138c9e7ab49174ee79bb4b9e81684cef907" href="../../证据/c195902f1ee88ad4129cdacb8cd63138c9e7ab49174ee79bb4b9e81684cef907.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c195902f1ee8</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f7260.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="85c9884a479f11dfaa0eab71e83f878165d29860dd52d40e2712ad01f36f9f97" href="../../证据/85c9884a479f11dfaa0eab71e83f878165d29860dd52d40e2712ad01f36f9f97.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>85c9884a479f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa090.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="56f01e8413c4c5565ac5d16a6389911b997c8f1729c036aea7002f8c72552b1a" href="../../证据/56f01e8413c4c5565ac5d16a6389911b997c8f1729c036aea7002f8c72552b1a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>56f01e8413c4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa100.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="34cde5ff72b3e6f3075f057a8d04ff817030aea50de849aed89407acf7c641bf" href="../../证据/34cde5ff72b3e6f3075f057a8d04ff817030aea50de849aed89407acf7c641bf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>34cde5ff72b3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa020.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d70e937437973cf687bc12ee18cc2081093a9977b89cfa7426696e18936536c3" href="../../证据/d70e937437973cf687bc12ee18cc2081093a9977b89cfa7426696e18936536c3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d70e93743797</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP02 · typed对象虚表+8 → 清逻辑长度，保留既有数值/字符串分配</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原表明确int/float/string的+8槽为f3fb0/f40b0/f42e0。int/float在当前数量大于0时仅把payload+0x68/+0x40写0；string逐项将内部字符串长度写0并首字符置零（按capacity选择SSO或heap），最后把payload+0x30计数写0。所选体没有delete/free；VZ03所调用的+8现在可细化为逻辑清空，不能称完整释放。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“typed对象虚表+8 → 清逻辑长度，保留既有数值/字符串分配”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：所有消费者最后读者以及何时触发最终载荷析构仍未知。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3fb0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2a188934e53b1d2ab5b67e78889d4c3ec5b0115615a35d4659be3e790a238558" href="../../证据/2a188934e53b1d2ab5b67e78889d4c3ec5b0115615a35d4659be3e790a238558.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2a188934e53b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f40b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9a6d1845477ec819bfcb39c052ef1010e1cb8cd3a8aa2b63971f1bad6c080be1" href="../../证据/9a6d1845477ec819bfcb39c052ef1010e1cb8cd3a8aa2b63971f1bad6c080be1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9a6d1845477e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f42e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="764d603111ef7d55c0e071cdb9983edd1b004da6ec7ad835d57b521e4062e731" href="../../证据/764d603111ef7d55c0e071cdb9983edd1b004da6ec7ad835d57b521e4062e731.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>764d603111ef</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3f90.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d6c6dbf32cfdc9db8a070ba0c71187b7e8ea0dabfc1773b508288d7bd379b60" href="../../证据/0d6c6dbf32cfdc9db8a070ba0c71187b7e8ea0dabfc1773b508288d7bd379b60.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d6c6dbf32cf</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3fa0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="19b76cd83bfe520a59fa58b3f8727486236d5de04398be6837f4faa15b8c40b3" href="../../证据/19b76cd83bfe520a59fa58b3f8727486236d5de04398be6837f4faa15b8c40b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>19b76cd83bfe</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f40a0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="695ba0dc66e664b4b142e9ed8a3ca9b722b412781c99f7b624436d33ec19d8b0" href="../../证据/695ba0dc66e664b4b142e9ed8a3ca9b722b412781c99f7b624436d33ec19d8b0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>695ba0dc66e6</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f42d0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dad4af1710b9cb2029d7407ab7dda63883d0c41297f279e37ed8e18476220bcd" href="../../证据/dad4af1710b9cb2029d7407ab7dda63883d0c41297f279e37ed8e18476220bcd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dad4af1710b9</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP03 · 00fb90一次准备门 → callable产生原始载荷后调用typed容量准备槽</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>仅对象+0x78非零时检查callable；空则抛bad_function_call，非空调用其虚槽+0x10并把返回指针写对象+0x10。随后载荷flags写入1/2、处理名称/类型文本，再调用typed对象虚槽+0x10，成功正常返回才将待准备字节写0。该typed槽由原表绑定到f3f80/f4080/f42b0。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“00fb90一次准备门 → callable产生原始载荷后调用typed容量准备槽”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：callable实际虚表与其返回载荷的分配/共享仓所有权未定位；不补常见智能指针语义。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/18000fb90.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e63b696322859fe45ceaab105ec353839834d28a162f829f0083a6189b810392" href="../../证据/e63b696322859fe45ceaab105ec353839834d28a162f829f0083a6189b810392.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e63b69632285</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/18000fb90.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3d34a1c3d42886b3d627f155cab9df13f94978cd8a4bb7aee87e14f97edad1d9" href="../../证据/3d34a1c3d42886b3d627f155cab9df13f94978cd8a4bb7aee87e14f97edad1d9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3d34a1c3d428</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP04 · typed虚槽+0x10的数值准备 → 扩容复制旧值，并有条件退役旧数组</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>int/float仅capacity小于对象请求量时扩容，目标容量取请求量、旧容量两倍与最小4的最大值。新块前8字节保存旧块header；数据初始化后按旧count复制4字节值。旧块非null且旧header==0才delete[]，否则本体不释放旧块。string槽仅在数量不足时调用1a39f0追加差额，未将该callee未取体补成数组析构。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“typed虚槽+0x10的数值准备 → 扩容复制旧值，并有条件退役旧数组”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：00f3a0与1a39f0未取体；非零header的最终持有/退役责任未闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3f80.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="516d879359ab56148c3231d7456b54d21b3d2365f2c5790d35b17952ad0196d1" href="../../证据/516d879359ab56148c3231d7456b54d21b3d2365f2c5790d35b17952ad0196d1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>516d879359ab</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f4080.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="82fbd5eba549e448ea2b569bfa18f5c0fa1e9f6616ab9208854a46cc1fd693bf" href="../../证据/82fbd5eba549e448ea2b569bfa18f5c0fa1e9f6616ab9208854a46cc1fd693bf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>82fbd5eba549</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3f80.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="95e2ca0496f7f44532eb793ac34843afced7a0fd7f2b53170a29bfb936a36d4e" href="../../证据/95e2ca0496f7f44532eb793ac34843afced7a0fd7f2b53170a29bfb936a36d4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>95e2ca0496f7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f42b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7027861988d462e151a27d955fac3527f1018ce09430244073cbdbcb6c0e9298" href="../../证据/7027861988d462e151a27d955fac3527f1018ce09430244073cbdbcb6c0e9298.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7027861988d4</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP05 · VZ06强计数归零后的真实控制块slot0 → fa730清理包装对象，再delete包装对象本身</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>三个实际控制块表首槽均为fa730：读取控制块+0x10对象，非null调用f7410，然后汇编把同一对象放RCX并尾跳operator delete IAT180204580。f7410对名称/类型capacity>=16分别delete其堆块，复位字段；若callable存在，RCX传callable、DL=(callable!=对象内联区+0x18)，调用其虚槽+0x20后置null。本体未直接读取对象+0x10以free原始载荷。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“VZ06强计数归零后的真实控制块slot0 → fa730清理包装对象，再delete包装对象本身”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：callable实际虚表+0x20接收者未定位；不能由f7410的清理形态推断返回载荷被销毁。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa730.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3a74010e42ecc18ac1211c518cd5fe96153db74be48f61673b1e64a4dfc05df9" href="../../证据/3a74010e42ecc18ac1211c518cd5fe96153db74be48f61673b1e64a4dfc05df9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3a74010e42ec</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa730.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d6a67cb1de41193bd98dcba8403de590d701628fea70fc7f2d71f1d994684fc2" href="../../证据/d6a67cb1de41193bd98dcba8403de590d701628fea70fc7f2d71f1d994684fc2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d6a67cb1de41</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f7410.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8aca91fdad2c8226d8b2f445e57ad4ca0beec57a574f797ee21134b731a80499" href="../../证据/8aca91fdad2c8226d8b2f445e57ad4ca0beec57a574f797ee21134b731a80499.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8aca91fdad2c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f7410.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2b6f6b2be5cfdf4f86d0513789bc25fad0443acea31f489cec33219b8dd563a0" href="../../证据/2b6f6b2be5cfdf4f86d0513789bc25fad0443acea31f489cec33219b8dd563a0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2b6f6b2be5cf</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP06 · VZ06弱计数归零后的真实控制块slot+8 → 0210d0再派发slot+0x10并按DL低位delete控制块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>三个控制块表+8均为0210d0；它把同一控制块作为RCX、第二参数1转交自身vtable+0x10。原表该槽均为0210f0；其汇编TEST DL,1，非零调用operator delete IAT180204580，RCX仍为控制块。本证据补齐弱归零时控制块本身退役，不把包装对象与原始载荷混同。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“VZ06弱计数归零后的真实控制块slot+8 → 0210d0再派发slot+0x10并按DL低位delete控制块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：最终读者、跨仓共享、异常回收与原机运行未确认。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800210d0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9d8734be956bedc5f43fcc929f9ee53f0e14c80513b8236656e07d35c2b0a826" href="../../证据/9d8734be956bedc5f43fcc929f9ee53f0e14c80513b8236656e07d35c2b0a826.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9d8734be956b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800210f0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="476f3d988e1951c9636d7b44909ad63f135da2550b28b38a1c82ce6fd4baa1b7" href="../../证据/476f3d988e1951c9636d7b44909ad63f135da2550b28b38a1c82ce6fd4baa1b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>476f3d988e19</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800210f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cdabfa36a5a6f00faa54073d9f2b392a2c2bb81f30c32a2d09d812b1323e45cc" href="../../证据/cdabfa36a5a6f00faa54073d9f2b392a2c2bb81f30c32a2d09d812b1323e45cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cdabfa36a5a6</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VB01 · 原GlobalVariableModule.CreateModule RVA0x4f9b0 → 同一factory返回对象首虚表 → slot+0x18 → VN01接收体0x1f8c0</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>本轮取得实际CreateModule/构造器原体：factory请求0x10630字节，非空时以同一分配地址为RCX调用0x4fc30；构造器先调用0x1bf40，再把原PE虚表0x5ad60写到该对象首指针，返回同一地址。factory成功路径返回该对象。原PE逐qword核0x5ad60+0x18=0x18001f8c0；基础构造体0x1bf40较早写入的0x5ab38+0x18也指向同一接收体。两表COL/RTTI分别为CMyAlgorithmManager与CVariableModuBase；这不是仅凭类型或key名字拼接。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原GlobalVariableModule.CreateModule RVA0x4f9b0 → 同一factory返回对象首虚表 → slot+0x18 → VN01接收体0x1f8c0”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：仅证该已识别DLL的静态factory返回类型与接收槽；实际进程采用哪个DLL副本、加载成功的moduleID与活实例未做运行印证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global-4f9b0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f0dc289a4bb139a4edc969e603d56214401886e64570a992e254934656bb0ce4" href="../../证据/f0dc289a4bb139a4edc969e603d56214401886e64570a992e254934656bb0ce4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f0dc289a4bb1</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global-4f9b0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a4ad30abc47b10da6021f11dfa08b6ae01821080722d694a68655aabc9de64f8" href="../../证据/a4ad30abc47b10da6021f11dfa08b6ae01821080722d694a68655aabc9de64f8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a4ad30abc47b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global-4f9b0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3689d6cf6fcbf1995970dc29d4dcd66f8a77be1dd11265af21866de2b5d17574" href="../../证据/3689d6cf6fcbf1995970dc29d4dcd66f8a77be1dd11265af21866de2b5d17574.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3689d6cf6fcb</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global-4f9b0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5acce45be0797743cdcbc5f257be9f6c7fa8ca8b05e2003a3d2f79f4fad93630" href="../../证据/5acce45be0797743cdcbc5f257be9f6c7fa8ca8b05e2003a3d2f79f4fad93630.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5acce45be079</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global-4f9b0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b5822edd25e2beddfa9a79ebf7763e0553516bb5d02d9a87df8c86c9d3025aff" href="../../证据/b5822edd25e2beddfa9a79ebf7763e0553516bb5d02d9a87df8c86c9d3025aff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b5822edd25e2</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global/18004fc30.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92fa45d240c623d77eb57da505a1ba111ec2ea1c3d4f6d72a2bd06da37bfb747" href="../../证据/92fa45d240c623d77eb57da505a1ba111ec2ea1c3d4f6d72a2bd06da37bfb747.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92fa45d240c6</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global-1bf40.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c70f23f9e64f6bb529bf69d6e7ff27cabd9795fbf5a279cffce6e543848d5adf" href="../../证据/c70f23f9e64f6bb529bf69d6e7ff27cabd9795fbf5a279cffce6e543848d5adf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c70f23f9e64f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/globalvariable-vtable-layout.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b40fe0c13daabfc53e763711500fec06f6e0ca9d949e568f0b75fee775f7b48a" href="../../证据/b40fe0c13daabfc53e763711500fec06f6e0ca9d949e568f0b75fee775f7b48a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b40fe0c13daa</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VB02 · 原ModuleFrame模块创建0x112f40 → loader0xb54e0 → factory返回对象注册 → 0xb6b70按moduleID取原pointer → 模块record+0x128</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原0xb54e0对选定路径LoadLibraryW，按原字节字符串CreateModule/DestroyModule调用GetProcAddress；两个地址非空时，以创建参数记录调用取得的CreateModule函数，将返回RAX保存在loader记录+8，非0时向返回对象+8写入创建参数pointer。所选注册路径把同一loader记录及控制块放入manager容器。0xb6b70在manager+0x38的真实_Mtx_lock/unlock内遍历：创建参数首int等于传入moduleID且loader记录非空时返回loader记录+8的原factory对象pointer。0x112f40以相同moduleID调用loader成功后调用该getter，保存RAX到R15，再按moduleID查本框架记录，将同一R15写入record+0x128。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModuleFrame模块创建0x112f40 → loader0xb54e0 → factory返回对象注册 → 0xb6b70按moduleID取原pointer → 模块record+0x128”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：loader接受通用模块路径；只有选到VB01识别的GlobalVariableModule原DLL时才把其factory/vtable代入本通用链，不能把每次创建都命名为全局变量模块。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：真实SDK对象handle与该ModuleFrame moduleID/record的上游注册关系尚未闭合；没有活进程同实例运行断言。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b54e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c1f77c2d5276554e4669ffdd7eb42fc077d998aec39604c1a7cdc2d0cd3d16c0" href="../../证据/c1f77c2d5276554e4669ffdd7eb42fc077d998aec39604c1a7cdc2d0cd3d16c0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c1f77c2d5276</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b54e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a50f962f99d1e784ece19f4021d52cdb88a1427cb4ad8fa95b5014ebf656633f" href="../../证据/a50f962f99d1e784ece19f4021d52cdb88a1427cb4ad8fa95b5014ebf656633f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a50f962f99d1</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b54e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8496ccf98cc4474d113e3a215c865ac2004a93c5c6fb4b64d6b9b36c8b74899" href="../../证据/f8496ccf98cc4474d113e3a215c865ac2004a93c5c6fb4b64d6b9b36c8b74899.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8496ccf98cc</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b54e0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="62613ecfa3a37b1fecb08d40669c458f3dc8a064c46f762964a4f02b4e7274d8" href="../../证据/62613ecfa3a37b1fecb08d40669c458f3dc8a064c46f762964a4f02b4e7274d8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>62613ecfa3a3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b54e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d52bbf40a0175879af8743423a70dfe5037247b17265dd3497fa57b287ff8c0b" href="../../证据/d52bbf40a0175879af8743423a70dfe5037247b17265dd3497fa57b287ff8c0b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d52bbf40a017</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b54e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d0481cbcb2e08f2fe2476273c68c35bb621ac7e0b4dbd85f0f022d2d5ee0fdfe" href="../../证据/d0481cbcb2e08f2fe2476273c68c35bb621ac7e0b4dbd85f0f022d2d5ee0fdfe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d0481cbcb2e0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b6b70.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cd7ad162bfd48aa53b3262a29ebf186f5ace581ba59fd53ba352ad219a16a25a" href="../../证据/cd7ad162bfd48aa53b3262a29ebf186f5ace581ba59fd53ba352ad219a16a25a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cd7ad162bfd4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/180112f40.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4d9fa32eb4d7026167798b204c78ad43c94144aeed50542155158a12e71d75ef" href="../../证据/4d9fa32eb4d7026167798b204c78ad43c94144aeed50542155158a12e71d75ef.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4d9fa32eb4d7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/180112f40.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b31154fd06805590b142141050be77a8c5a243362b7df9f84793666a8f9307f2" href="../../证据/b31154fd06805590b142141050be77a8c5a243362b7df9f84793666a8f9307f2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b31154fd0680</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/moduleframe.pe.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="67e5c821b385e074860af1962ae75f61c25893100e8cdee58ed1faa8d21be3a5" href="../../证据/67e5c821b385e074860af1962ae75f61c25893100e8cdee58ed1faa8d21be3a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>67e5c821b385</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VB03 · 原ModuleFrame.VM_M_SetBinayData 0x13aad0 → 一般参数分支 → moduleID查record → record+0x128主虚表+0x18直接派发</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>导出0x13aad0保存ECX=moduleID、RDX=key、R8=payload、R9D=length；调用0x43120时改为RCX=manager(0x2b12d0)、EDX=原moduleID、R8=原key、R9=原payload、第五栈参数=原length。0x43120先验证key非空及manager+0x22状态；特殊key ##ImportModuleData##、DynamicInData、DynamicOutData有各自路线，一般key经0x10a690按moduleID取得record/控制块。若record+0x128非0，原汇编以RCX=该factory对象pointer，RDX=同一key、R8=同一payload、R9D=同一length调用其首虚表+0x18。因此在VB02注册的是VB01工厂对象这一条件下，实际调用目标静态闭合为VN01的0x1f8c0，而非按SetBinaryData同名推定。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModuleFrame.VM_M_SetBinayData 0x13aad0 → 一般参数分支 → moduleID查record → record+0x128主虚表+0x18直接派发”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModifyVar/DeleteVar不等于上述三个特殊key，因此属于所选一般分支；全体key、错误码和fallback语义未穷举。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：上游SDK的0xbd2 callback如何调用到此ModuleFrame导出仍是VB04明确断点；本条不宣称整个SDK→插件链已闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-13aad0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6b25cd85a3098344c79dc4383ddf2419119a303ee2e3eb01d945c7a0d3d95087" href="../../证据/6b25cd85a3098344c79dc4383ddf2419119a303ee2e3eb01d945c7a0d3d95087.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6b25cd85a309</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-13aad0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ed248e3d3dd4e9421aee20c0db77cd1c17d09ff3d62673dcfa297702be9b47ba" href="../../证据/ed248e3d3dd4e9421aee20c0db77cd1c17d09ff3d62673dcfa297702be9b47ba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ed248e3d3dd4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/180043120.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2059f4977ad5f78d0ca79b0bf203c74b1350c28129700ba6da42fb9d2e961d71" href="../../证据/2059f4977ad5f78d0ca79b0bf203c74b1350c28129700ba6da42fb9d2e961d71.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2059f4977ad5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-10a690.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ec56029fb2bf269137af3957e9ffb6ecb3f9064e572cb5ee5d27f14818fa3d4b" href="../../证据/ec56029fb2bf269137af3957e9ffb6ecb3f9064e572cb5ee5d27f14818fa3d4b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ec56029fb2bf</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-43120.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c2e389c0d572e4435815e55aac9cacf1b55ee2e5f7cf0b213dece3f7e3e58daa" href="../../证据/c2e389c0d572e4435815e55aac9cacf1b55ee2e5f7cf0b213dece3f7e3e58daa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c2e389c0d572</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-43120.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dce574f93dbbd44a25ae995a71608c7ac1862cf35aa3a6a154a29dd877a165e1" href="../../证据/dce574f93dbbd44a25ae995a71608c7ac1862cf35aa3a6a154a29dd877a165e1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dce574f93dbb</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-43120.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="890e70bf470c56370d3dd50fc69d10064fb30d7674b13de47ac2d91a48f5039d" href="../../证据/890e70bf470c56370d3dd50fc69d10064fb30d7674b13de47ac2d91a48f5039d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>890e70bf470c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-43120.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1702d3175d4a9c812d1cb8380f877e7c37ac7a5c9f5a31346d20de7790266e7a" href="../../证据/1702d3175d4a9c812d1cb8380f877e7c37ac7a5c9f5a31346d20de7790266e7a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1702d3175d4a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VB04 · 原托管ModuleManager.SetBinaryData → iMVS-6000PlatformSDK.IMVS_SetBinaryData → SDK实际callback边界0x66f090：opcode0xbd2、binary pointer/length；未证等于ModuleFrame同名接口</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>托管ModuleManager构造IMVS_SET_BINARY_DATA_INFO并调用ServerSDKAPI→NativeMethods，DllImport实际目标是iMVS-6000PlatformSDK.dll。本轮对同SHA原PE重新截取IMVS_SetBinaryData 0x6471f0与直接callee0x66f090原runtime范围及字节：导出先校验handle记录，再把moduleID、描述pointer、timeout交0x66f090；callee从描述+0x100读取binary pointer，从+0x108读取32位长度，读取this+0x23a8函数pointer。函数pointer非空时，以ECX=0xbd2、RDX=临时格式串、R8=描述中的binary pointer、R9D=描述中的length、第五/第六参数0进行间接调用。该调用的真实callee注册和跨组件接收者尚未取得，不能把它和ModuleFrame.VM_M_SetBinayData仅凭名字合并。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“原托管ModuleManager.SetBinaryData → iMVS-6000PlatformSDK.IMVS_SetBinaryData → SDK实际callback边界0x66f090：opcode0xbd2、binary pointer/length；未证等于ModuleFrame同名接口”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：尚缺SDK this+0x23a8 callback的赋值来源、opcode0xbd2真实处理者、它到ModuleFrame.VM_M_SetBinayData的具体调用桥及binary载荷租约；不可用SDK/ModuleFrame/插件三个相似方法名替代该缺口。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原进程handle/moduleID、动态加载路径和内存地址未做运行观测；有限静态对象链不等于运行全等。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="de85f087a58ac7930170b273a5ffc6e8092c01a3a27b6706533c2bf2eaad2ed9" href="../../证据/de85f087a58ac7930170b273a5ffc6e8092c01a3a27b6706533c2bf2eaad2ed9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>de85f087a58a</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89cc7bdd75b4208aba447fe2f53b7703a268fd8c712548fc505d03460bfc7e5b" href="../../证据/89cc7bdd75b4208aba447fe2f53b7703a268fd8c712548fc505d03460bfc7e5b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89cc7bdd75b4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/sdk-6471f0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c55a4a1c06d6f273d2965d03e143182d405a6bb1cdc73e5e9fbca52e641d4207" href="../../证据/c55a4a1c06d6f273d2965d03e143182d405a6bb1cdc73e5e9fbca52e641d4207.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c55a4a1c06d6</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/sdk-66f090.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9029779583e1b125dd5ab8982f6fa8f77aad09fd8794243ac049703634c13853" href="../../证据/9029779583e1b125dd5ab8982f6fa8f77aad09fd8794243ac049703634c13853.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9029779583e1</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG02 · 父GraphExecutor的workflow.subprogram节点 → 参数/输入处理后进入owned body Call闭包</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>父GraphExecutor先从本轮records建立nodeInputs，再解析Subscriptions覆盖输入或参数、执行Coerce，之后才创建节点linked token。workflow.subprogram分支不registry.Create普通模块，而把Parameters=本轮参数字典及GroupBreak.Capture所得绑定放入node副本，传只读包装nodeInputs交callProcedure。SolutionExecutor.Call按node.Call.ProcedureId找body；GroupOwner为null直接单次Execute，有owner才进入Task.Run的Group循环。Task.Run包整个循环，不是ReadyQueue或各轮并行。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“父GraphExecutor的workflow.subprogram节点 → 参数/输入处理后进入owned body Call闭包”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：父nodeInputs与payload本身是否可变取决于具体PortValue/工具数据类型；只读字典不代表深不可变图像内存。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b74c494bfaa76018bdedeefa2aef2a23fbdce9ae9b5df36f0bdb910f34fb433d" href="../../证据/b74c494bfaa76018bdedeefa2aef2a23fbdce9ae9b5df36f0bdb910f34fb433d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b74c494bfaa7</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="894ec88445bf80f6520757a6d193b2d130a7051f985140a3e554d1d8f0d89191" href="../../证据/894ec88445bf80f6520757a6d193b2d130a7051f985140a3e554d1d8f0d89191.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>894ec88445bf</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="707f8ba6e860d6cc03bbb4b47126cd3e3fc57514ef78e284339feae2d851353d" href="../../证据/707f8ba6e860d6cc03bbb4b47126cd3e3fc57514ef78e284339feae2d851353d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>707f8ba6e860</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG04 · 父GraphExecutor.GroupBreak.Capture → 外部操作数与动态下标先冻结，内部/self保留引用描述</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Capture先解析IndexSource，要求Integer+Scalar且0..int.MaxValue，写入Index并清IndexSource；外部非Self有Source的操作数立即从父workflow.Resolve取Element，再序列化为Constant JsonElement新记录。Inside/Self则保留源描述，供轮前求值。InvalidDataException转成PreparationError记录，并非在Capture处直接终止父节点。Snapshot对原Constant另Clone；Validate约束Self必须指向当前Group节点输出且非Inside、外部索引必须来自前置scalar int。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“父GraphExecutor.GroupBreak.Capture → 外部操作数与动态下标先冻结，内部/self保留引用描述”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未从此声称Capture是所有类型的通用序列化；Group break当前只支持Integer/Number/Text。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a4cfcd86216f03289c135d3c003b5c6c74bd24e5c88b2fbcefc7b77655796a2b" href="../../证据/a4cfcd86216f03289c135d3c003b5c6c74bd24e5c88b2fbcefc7b77655796a2b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a4cfcd86216f</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9bc011e666a7ae3a0913a0968de2fc8d353810b25fde8925a92321941a14fd9" href="../../证据/b9bc011e666a7ae3a0913a0968de2fc8d353810b25fde8925a92321941a14fd9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9bc011e666a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="86267c622522d00ea0728263630a3d6369cce3116401745567aaba05a337970c" href="../../证据/86267c622522d00ea0728263630a3d6369cce3116401745567aaba05a337970c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>86267c622522</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG05 · GroupBreak.Evaluate与Resolve → 本轮索引/输入、前轮内部值与累计self分开读取</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>break在本轮Execute前求值。previous=null且操作数为Self或Inside的生产者源时直接false，跳过首次内部比较；其他Inside LoopIndex取即将执行的index，WorkflowInput优先本次values，未绑定局部变量读声明初始值。绑定内部NodeOutput/LocalVariable在previous session读取，只允许相应可用源；Self由accumulator.ReadSelfElement读累计片段或last输出。Resolve失败记录最多32条去重diagnostics并返回false，继续执行，而非把缺值当0或自动break。break=true时记录broke/index，不再执行该轮也不增加completed。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“GroupBreak.Evaluate与Resolve → 本轮索引/输入、前轮内部值与累计self分开读取”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：运行时不支持/不可用数据仅按具体异常门处理；不从false推断用户配置有效或原版也是同策略。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c8fe0191c128ff5d14bfacf06f2189976f5e072108bec5c06c5efd2ed2bc68de" href="../../证据/c8fe0191c128ff5d14bfacf06f2189976f5e072108bec5c06c5efd2ed2bc68de.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c8fe0191c128</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupBreak.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="29247050b252f07cc67c2ca8fcf6afebb6c994147456f805a588660271324435" href="../../证据/29247050b252f07cc67c2ca8fcf6afebb6c994147456f805a588660271324435.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>29247050b252</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8065840237923a4d50f0b4f4644a499aa2b99981a5112ff9a7ae9245198df665" href="../../证据/8065840237923a4d50f0b4f4644a499aa2b99981a5112ff9a7ae9245198df665.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>806584023792</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cbf696640d78232d74cdca9df56a49c0ce5813801ee6162a3dd53f2bc9968752" href="../../证据/cbf696640d78232d74cdca9df56a49c0ce5813801ee6162a3dd53f2bc9968752.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cbf696640d78</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG06 · 每轮GraphExecutor → WorkflowRunContext → 独立records/variables与浅输入字典副本</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每次GraphExecutor.RunAsync先scope.Enter，再建本轮records/calls/descriptors和WorkflowRunContext。context把inputs字典ToDictionary，保留原PortValue；校验输入名/Kind/Cardinality并初始化无SourceNode变量。本轮Record先写records再workflow.Update：绑定该节点的变量先Remove，只有Node成功或NoMatch且含端口时重置引用，源不可用则保持缺值，不沿用前轮变量。Complete另建WorkflowInputs/Outputs/LocalVariables字典，输出仍指向当前本轮PortValue，显示每项新一元素数组包装。</p><p>流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar：这条既有事实明确核实“每轮GraphExecutor → WorkflowRunContext → 独立records/variables与浅输入字典副本”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">已有VD/VN/VS/VZ/VX/VP/VB/CD有限专题；模块加载注册到receiver槽已有条件静态链；SDK callback桥、订阅求值、gvar格式和最后读者仍未闭合。局部JSON变量或参数绑定不证明gvar兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：这不是“所有缓存每轮清空”：root scope的node state/参数缓存跨轮仍存；具体工具payload内部可变性与释放依具体实现另证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="27b5f7cf26eb9555f4701164468e193f14277880721cbdf6ea5163868352fbe9" href="../../证据/27b5f7cf26eb9555f4701164468e193f14277880721cbdf6ea5163868352fbe9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>27b5f7cf26eb</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fb5296069051e836e78d39d033a7d52391b955118d52ea701ba7d98c4bcca50e" href="../../证据/fb5296069051e836e78d39d033a7d52391b955118d52ea701ba7d98c4bcca50e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fb5296069051</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="67f3dd81329952a1875380f4a805711c6bae34f31363a5c0c576959085bfd422" href="../../证据/67f3dd81329952a1875380f4a805711c6bae34f31363a5c0c576959085bfd422.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>67f3dd813299</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="01c2eb812fb80ab6ecf22a23e430f6fea93d279ffe01f2938b7660767d1aeb1c" href="../../证据/01c2eb812fb80ab6ecf22a23e430f6fea93d279ffe01f2938b7660767d1aeb1c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>01c2eb812fb8</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d91f59d36d028f76e0c469acee515749901743ebccb4ecbbf734716da662f4a5" href="../../证据/d91f59d36d028f76e0c469acee515749901743ebccb4ecbbf734716da662f4a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d91f59d36d02</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>parameter-candidates:P09 · GlobalVariableDialog资源 / ModifiyRunParamsCommand → 旧关联快照 → 基础选择数据 → 变量绑定重载</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>资源按钮/鼠标绑定ModifiyRunParamsCommand，getter懒建命令到ModifyRunParamsExecute。处理器先从现有选择生成_OldSelectedRunParams，再检查DecorateSource；新RunParamsSelectData以(DecorateSource as VmIO).Root为源，收集父列表中Name不同项的已有选择，传入窗口变量绑定重载。只有ShowDialog==true才读取GetSelectedParams赋回；快照发生在窗口打开之前。</p><p>计划将B05归入F-17，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。实际DataContext/鼠标路由和空/错误DecorateSource、父列表身份未验；非true结果不重赋选择，但本地旧快照字段已经更新，不能画成完全无状态变化。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-consumers-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0ed9f0c2a456744104977699d63a61cd075b768abdeefa20795c21d314030832" href="../../证据/0ed9f0c2a456744104977699d63a61cd075b768abdeefa20795c21d314030832.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0ed9f0c2a456</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-consumers-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8e6fefcba829bead7bdb940e305127b10754e6e6e998a7bc35cfb22b73f7cc26" href="../../证据/8e6fefcba829bead7bdb940e305127b10754e6e6e998a7bc35cfb22b73f7cc26.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8e6fefcba829</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-consumers-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3b8d4857b8e29c93b8e5f70a57eeb3eb0dd31f8becaadaed8fef922e401246bb" href="../../证据/3b8d4857b8e29c93b8e5f70a57eeb3eb0dd31f8becaadaed8fef922e401246bb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3b8d4857b8e2</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.GlobalUI/GlobalVariableItem.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="db058466628fe4d38ce48555f28967f5c6798374ce951f962d42978bbdfbfd6e" href="../../证据/db058466628fe4d38ce48555f28967f5c6798374ce951f962d42978bbdfbfd6e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>db058466628f</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.GlobalUI/GlobalVariableDialog.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="447c96dd86d0ba0000d43f950915965616c69475907f527fb6a1682d74fcb273" href="../../证据/447c96dd86d0ba0000d43f950915965616c69475907f527fb6a1682d74fcb273.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>447c96dd86d0</small></a></details></details><details><summary>parameter-candidates:P10 · GlobalVariableItem.SelectedRunParams setter → 显示字段先改 → PropertyChanged → ValueChanged后端消费</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>setter先换字段并更新显示名/可见状态，最后通知SelectedRunParams。GlobalVariableDialog.AddNewItem通过WeakEventManager挂ValueChanged；此属性分支把新选择转VarRunParamInfo数组，再交ModifyLinkModuleForSub并传旧快照。投影含ModuleID、Name、RunParamIoType、IsSupportSub及TargetObject引用；不是序列化独立深拷贝。所选后端调用不在ValueChanged本地try区间内，失败不能推已改显示/选择自动回滚。</p><p>计划将B05归入F-17，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。其它初始化/重新挂接路径、弱事件实际投递、属性重入和异常上抛后的窗口状态未验；数组旧值与Owner对象引用生命周期分列。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-consumers-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7b747c0f7d80ba9b9de24bd42bb8e6d056326fb0dda1e2d102b5e39299b0cc52" href="../../证据/7b747c0f7d80ba9b9de24bd42bb8e6d056326fb0dda1e2d102b5e39299b0cc52.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7b747c0f7d80</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-consumers-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d55ffaae338f534cb43f0952630a3b3b929fd8614d38a7680780c313d04b54c8" href="../../证据/d55ffaae338f534cb43f0952630a3b3b929fd8614d38a7680780c313d04b54c8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d55ffaae338f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-consumers-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="afd1e8e333f73aed5d32b9c991126ebeccfe4828ed82db4ae52faa911161b87b" href="../../证据/afd1e8e333f73aed5d32b9c991126ebeccfe4828ed82db4ae52faa911161b87b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>afd1e8e333f7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-consumers-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9d9219f896b7123aeb4e8c25c76ab431921d3d41e4878592ac73391989aacced" href="../../证据/9d9219f896b7123aeb4e8c25c76ab431921d3d41e4878592ac73391989aacced.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9d9219f896b7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-consumers-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3b8d4857b8e29c93b8e5f70a57eeb3eb0dd31f8becaadaed8fef922e401246bb" href="../../证据/3b8d4857b8e29c93b8e5f70a57eeb3eb0dd31f8becaadaed8fef922e401246bb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3b8d4857b8e2</small></a></details></details><details><summary>parameter-candidates:P11 · VariableManager.ModifyLinkModuleForSub → 先ModifyVar关联载荷 → 旧解绑 → 新绑定 / UserData标志</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ModifyLinkModuleForSub顺序调用ModifyLinkModule再SetRunParamBind。前者按关联数组构造ModifyVar字节载荷，写DataSource.Params并在finally释放所分配缓冲；这不证明native已完成全部绑定。后者先对旧IsSupportSub项尝试DelModuleParamBinding，成功写@参数名=false并SetInit；再对新IsSupportSub且Type匹配项尝试SetModuleParamBinding，成功写true并SetInit。中间还处理既有局部/全局变量关联；这些步骤没有统一回滚。</p><p>计划将B05归入F-17，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。载荷结构/指针ABI、既有绑定字符串解析分支、所有lambda、ParamSubManager和native写入效果未全闭合；Alloc/Copy/StructToBytes位于写入try之前，不能以finally宣称覆盖前序失败释放；局部失败可能留下部分更新，不用确认true冒充事务成功。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-consumers-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e7aaaa08e30940116909cfd812ba064496c27ef355bbe0c2b7c33777126b4a25" href="../../证据/e7aaaa08e30940116909cfd812ba064496c27ef355bbe0c2b7c33777126b4a25.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e7aaaa08e309</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-consumers-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89ae7e9283ef65c85784e9048a0af655b4d8ceab2962bf38334232066281ce68" href="../../证据/89ae7e9283ef65c85784e9048a0af655b4d8ceab2962bf38334232066281ce68.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89ae7e9283ef</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-consumers-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d3ca1a8034aa570b51f1170ea9c75b75ecf129f342aefccaf486206562b2583e" href="../../证据/d3ca1a8034aa570b51f1170ea9c75b75ecf129f342aefccaf486206562b2583e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d3ca1a8034aa</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.Variable/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="428ec00ecd340ffafec06317748e43aeb9ab751cfa5ac7a2a6652e40970346c8" href="../../证据/428ec00ecd340ffafec06317748e43aeb9ab751cfa5ac7a2a6652e40970346c8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>428ec00ecd34</small></a></details></details><details><summary>compatibility-tool:G09 · 兼容工具VariableManager TypeRef / 构造 → 选定Apps.XmlParser定义 / DataSource模型</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原CompatibleTool三项调用的MemberRef父TypeRef0x01000045指向Apps.XmlParser.Variable.VariableManager；程序集引用name/version/token与选定原Apps.XmlParser.dll定义一致。带object构造只有VmModule才设DataSource，无参构造不设；迁移使用全局变量模块构造，不把无DataSource回退当作本路径必走。</p><p>计划将B05归入F-17，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。引用身份不证明运行绑定；完整身份与CIL另见variable-manager-review，依赖的Core/SDK体本轮未重核原件。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.Variable/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="46f42dffa168b9e9b6da6f98031878095d72e2366948c2cf220ee8b56ebc81f8" href="../../证据/46f42dffa168b9e9b6da6f98031878095d72e2366948c2cf220ee8b56ebc81f8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>46f42dffa168</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-manager-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f3af21eda6ed86589ae3f279586a080a33aedb47f5e809fd0213546f02437b0f" href="../../证据/f3af21eda6ed86589ae3f279586a080a33aedb47f5e809fd0213546f02437b0f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f3af21eda6ed</small></a></details></details><details><summary>compatibility-tool:G10 · GetAllVar(ref IMVS_VARIABLE[]) → VarCount门 / GlobalValueList结构数组 / 保留传入ref</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>先读DataSource.Params的VarCount，只有TryParse且>0才读GlobalValueList；非null且长度整除Marshal.SizeOf(IMVS_VARIABLE)才转结构并覆盖ref。没有保证VarCount等于解析记录数，其余分支不清空传入数组。迁移调用者初始给空数组，不能据无异常认定已读取全部变量或嵌入链接指针已复制/释放。</p><p>计划将B05归入F-17，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。结构字节转换、嵌入pLinkModuleList的所有权/寿命、Params读取及实际ABI未验证；List&lt;VarItem>重载未接成迁移调用。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.Variable/VariableManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ec363ec3eb958046953dcc29352d761769dd0cce7d51c46b3f54f22fbea20fbe" href="../../证据/ec363ec3eb958046953dcc29352d761769dd0cce7d51c46b3f54f22fbea20fbe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ec363ec3eb95</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-manager-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b6cee01017c33857e5acf3898709ef54f0c67b8c3993a47878e6b89a072edb90" href="../../证据/b6cee01017c33857e5acf3898709ef54f0c67b8c3993a47878e6b89a072edb90.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b6cee01017c3</small></a></details></details><details><summary>workflow-data:C04 · WorkflowInterfaceItem / WorkflowLocalVariable → 稳定 ID、类型、绑定与快照</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前接口项区分 Id/Name、Kind、NodeId/Port、Display/Accumulate、Cardinality；局部变量有独立 Id、值/类型和来源。结构不是原 VmIO/native 指针布局，按独立数据契约记录。</p><p>计划将B05归入F-17，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowConfiguration.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="91c0617ed17e156701c9ab9083319a1ee95081f84e1b5c6b5063202a7dc2e3aa" href="../../证据/91c0617ed17e156701c9ab9083319a1ee95081f84e1b5c6b5063202a7dc2e3aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>91c0617ed17e</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowConfiguration.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92e18cd0106ca485d56b6d2c44332c6e8312bf4ff91ddcdb87ed12fbc93f9dcd" href="../../证据/92e18cd0106ca485d56b6d2c44332c6e8312bf4ff91ddcdb87ed12fbc93f9dcd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92e18cd0106c</small></a></details></details><details><summary>workflow-data:C07 · WorkflowRunContext 构造 → 复制输入 / 校验名称类型 / 初始化变量</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每次 RunAsync 新建 context，输入拷贝并核声明名字、Kind、Cardinality；被使用且无生产绑定的 workflow input 必须有实参。无 SourceNode 的变量由声明初值初始化。</p><p>计划将B05归入F-17，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fb5296069051e836e78d39d033a7d52391b955118d52ea701ba7d98c4bcca50e" href="../../证据/fb5296069051e836e78d39d033a7d52391b955118d52ea701ba7d98c4bcca50e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fb5296069051</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2082e9d411a4a1a24281e823dfce4b1fb47ddcaa18b7ec6f7289d79206574553" href="../../证据/2082e9d411a4a1a24281e823dfce4b1fb47ddcaa18b7ec6f7289d79206574553.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2082e9d411a4</small></a></details></details><details><summary>workflow-data:C08 · WorkflowRunContext.Resolve / Node / Input → 仅本轮记录与实参取值</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>节点来源要求记录为 Success 或 NoMatch 且存在输出；局部变量要求本轮字典已有值。流程输入优先显式实参，否则读绑定节点；常量按当前解析器，索引输入必须走 opt-in primitive reader。</p><p>计划将B05归入F-17，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“流程输入输出、局部/全局变量、订阅及gvar”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="647bacd664b27f7151bb6339eed4ea8d1248a596e06cacf7c0701510941f4e9e" href="../../证据/647bacd664b27f7151bb6339eed4ea8d1248a596e06cacf7c0701510941f4e9e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>647bacd664b2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="09dc3f587774afcb411ba2c55902269fd1c08fb77e44e0152523258ac6f17968" href="../../证据/09dc3f587774afcb411ba2c55902269fd1c08fb77e44e0152523258ac6f17968.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>09dc3f587774</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f24bdb12d004c58d5441cea4b06de024c3861f3806ad945d50212b288e38d653" href="../../证据/f24bdb12d004c58d5441cea4b06de024c3861f3806ad945d50212b288e38d653.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f24bdb12d004</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-18" id="F-18"><summary>F-18 · 独立方案存储 · 独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：方案JSON原子替换与插件资产副作用是两个事务范围；逐资源迁移/失败补偿、加载替换及未知格式拒绝需另列，独立vmx不证明sol兼容。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>D02 · 独立存储与资源事务补齐</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>SolutionStore/GraphEditorDocument保存加载及资源迁移</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>独立vmx格式失败原子性/版本/私有资源边界</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>基于现有30项及编辑器检查补真正缺口：迁移/未知字段/大小/锁/中断；插件私有数据仅合同</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每类失败文件和编辑器状态有证据；明确独立格式，不追求与sol字节一致</dd></dl><p>当前独立存储的入口、投影、写盘和提交后状态</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D02</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7b1217812164cfeb4c7e8fbcc4bfe3d45f4900346fdb14fbc1ddbd6df5a4ae76" href="../../证据/7b1217812164cfeb4c7e8fbcc4bfe3d45f4900346fdb14fbc1ddbd6df5a4ae76.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7b1217812164</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D05 · 原生兼容最小实现与往返</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>已确认原生读写链与未知字段保留模型</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>最小兼容范围能否原机打开/执行/再保存</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>先只读模型并验证，再限定格式写回；原件副本、未知字段/附件保留；原机与重构往返执行</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>按格式/版本逐格关闭；数值/引用/资源/执行均匹配；范围外明确拒绝；密码与私有插件不能假完成</dd></dl><p>仅连接原生writer与载入未知边界；尚无本矩阵证明的兼容写回/原机执行往返</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D05</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e4f7e36cbf88d8d918c0453797df97cdd1f091394c5e1e982383b578538397e4" href="../../证据/e4f7e36cbf88d8d918c0453797df97cdd1f091394c5e1e982383b578538397e4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e4f7e36cbf88</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>CP06 · 用户保存方案 → 插件持久化投影→JSON方案文件→编辑器提交</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>MainWindow将doc.PrepareSave接到plugins.PrepareSave(document,baseDirectory,executionScope)。GraphEditorDocument.Save向PrepareSave传入Copy(document)，插件注册表只对IToolAssetPersistence参与者调用其PrepareSave(node,catalog,procedureScope)，回收这些插件前缀资源并采用返回Node/Resources。随后重基路径、SolutionStore验证和序列化方案，经同目录临时文件Flush(true)+Move覆盖成功后编辑器才提交rebased文档。框架没有把scope有效参数或运行结果字典统一自动拷回所有节点。</p><p>独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放：这条既有事实明确核实“用户保存方案 → 插件持久化投影→JSON方案文件→编辑器提交”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">方案JSON原子替换与插件资产副作用是两个事务范围；逐资源迁移/失败补偿、加载替换及未知格式拒绝需另列，独立vmx不证明sol兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本片段不展开每个IToolAssetPersistence参与者；不能宣称所有最后运行参数、缓存图像、SDK内部状态都能保存和重开恢复。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：插件PrepareSave在最终方案文件提交前可能有自身资产写入副作用；此处只证明方案文件提交顺序，不宣称全资产跨文件事务。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4cc28c3847610e14ba36a44eb663c05de11b3dc92d1ef8e32f727a9df0da8f8b" href="../../证据/4cc28c3847610e14ba36a44eb663c05de11b3dc92d1ef8e32f727a9df0da8f8b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4cc28c384761</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f" href="../../证据/9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9ed5d7beed27</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPluginContracts/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b2bf628ee4ba486c7fbcfdee3e2415c7500e722fd23ab5e41b6eb6270108c297" href="../../证据/b2bf628ee4ba486c7fbcfdee3e2415c7500e722fd23ab5e41b6eb6270108c297.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b2bf628ee4ba</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="df7dca5bb4adc6503a57abd82d22c53b76afed5b93a675e219260708e6f671c0" href="../../证据/df7dca5bb4adc6503a57abd82d22c53b76afed5b93a675e219260708e6f671c0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>df7dca5bb4ad</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PST01 · ToolPluginRegistry.PrepareSave旧资源目录 → 逐节点资产投影与新Resources容器</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>先以输入document.Resources构造ResourceCatalog，之后另建resources字典：过滤所有已注册IToolAssetPersistence插件的plugin:&lt;Manifest.Id>:前缀资源，不要求这些插件当前一定还有节点。逐procedure/node调用participant.PrepareSave，并传scope.ForProcedure；每个snapshot.Resources按Id覆盖新字典，snapshot.Node成为新节点。旧catalog仍允许后面的参与者读取输入资源。任何参与者异常会中断ToArray与return，但此前参与者对scope或自身state的副作用没有跨参与者回滚代码。</p><p>独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放：这条既有事实明确核实“ToolPluginRegistry.PrepareSave旧资源目录 → 逐节点资产投影与新Resources容器”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">方案JSON原子替换与插件资产副作用是两个事务范围；逐资源迁移/失败补偿、加载替换及未知格式拒绝需另列，独立vmx不证明sol兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未枚举所有已注册参与者的副作用；PST02/03只给两个实际插件族的具体分支。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：当前独立实现的静态合同，未以真实保存失败运行注入验证，不证明原版等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionPluginContracts/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b2bf628ee4ba486c7fbcfdee3e2415c7500e722fd23ab5e41b6eb6270108c297" href="../../证据/b2bf628ee4ba486c7fbcfdee3e2415c7500e722fd23ab5e41b6eb6270108c297.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b2bf628ee4ba</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GeometryResources.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3a00e1c015edc4e228ce5d5aaab7532ac5983f40fc322982b88be4a694d3287c" href="../../证据/3a00e1c015edc4e228ce5d5aaab7532ac5983f40fc322982b88be4a694d3287c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3a00e1c015ed</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PST02 · ImageSourcePlugin.PrepareSave路径选择 → 编码资源副本、Base64文档字段及scope状态</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>先Clone默认值及节点参数。订阅文件夹模式会通过scope.State取得或创建State；路径来自匹配目录的state.FolderPaths，否则读取存在的目录，否则空表。SolSaveImageData为true时仅paths.Take(120)嵌入：优先现存磁盘文件，文件不存在才经旧节点EmbeddedImageResources/旧catalog回读；单个编码流超过256MiB即抛错。CopyTo内存流后ToArray产生byte[]，SHA256及Base64得到ResourceDocument与路径→Id映射。ImagePaths仍写入全部paths的绝对路径，故120条嵌入上限不等于路径表截断。</p><p>独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放：这条既有事实明确核实“ImageSourcePlugin.PrepareSave路径选择 → 编码资源副本、Base64文档字段及scope状态”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">方案JSON原子替换与插件资产副作用是两个事务范围；逐资源迁移/失败补偿、加载替换及未知格式拒绝需另列，独立vmx不证明sol兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：文件夹监控并发更新与120条外图的可移植性未运行验证；不能声称所有路径均已嵌入。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不会从本分支推断GrayImage最终释放；编码临时分配与像素/结果持有分属不同链。</p><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.ImageSource/ImageSourceAssets.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b7899451ed3d47d71822feea2f7bc375049b3ea4a45196f0011b7699fdefecd1" href="../../证据/b7899451ed3d47d71822feea2f7bc375049b3ea4a45196f0011b7699fdefecd1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b7899451ed3d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.ImageSource/ImageSourceAssets.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd992e4dce0dd0c3b8fd4d6da627dacfbe2c5f022214edaa597e7f9e7d757b29" href="../../证据/bd992e4dce0dd0c3b8fd4d6da627dacfbe2c5f022214edaa597e7f9e7d757b29.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd992e4dce0d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GeometryResources.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ee1196723adc738eb22e96650f838946c5f563300272288276ce2a6256fad8ac" href="../../证据/ee1196723adc738eb22e96650f838946c5f563300272288276ce2a6256fad8ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ee1196723adc</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a23434c51066e9ceceb3f9aa5a1974961608b8c315168113e404eba343362b1e" href="../../证据/a23434c51066e9ceceb3f9aa5a1974961608b8c315168113e404eba343362b1e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a23434c51066</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PST03 · 标定插件PrepareSave → 持久scope/fallback状态先同步，随后输出参数副本</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>ReadCalibFile.Save先GetState，再在state.Gate内Configure；Configure会先置Initialized/Requested，再按首次缓存、空路径或磁盘读取分支Apply，更新LoadError及按ReplaceData/CommitPath条件更新Data/Path/Cache。随后才克隆节点参数并按SaveCalibDataEnable输出CachedFileData。Rotate.PrepareSave同样Get并Synchronize：首次可从36字节CachedMatrix恢复9个float，否则按AppliedPath差异Session.Load并写AppliedPath，随后把当前Matrix序列化为新Base64 CachedMatrix及Loaded标志。故参数字典的隔离不等于插件state也隔离。</p><p>独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放：这条既有事实明确核实“标定插件PrepareSave → 持久scope/fallback状态先同步，随后输出参数副本”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">方案JSON原子替换与插件资产副作用是两个事务范围；逐资源迁移/失败补偿、加载替换及未知格式拒绝需另列，独立vmx不证明sol兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本条只确认当前两个插件族；Session内部Load/Restore数值算法和全部异常不在本切片展开。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未执行保存失败探针；静态无回滚不等于所有失败都会改变state，取决于具体分支和旧状态。</p><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.Calibration/ReadCalibFilePlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bbae10fe71b02e51d47c5f6f15c27d88e59067cda408222b8ed5fd1869445381" href="../../证据/bbae10fe71b02e51d47c5f6f15c27d88e59067cda408222b8ed5fd1869445381.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bbae10fe71b0</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.Calibration/ReadCalibFilePlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ed767d72c4e2046c8c2cf8ec96aa9f571d42be1c80d6335dcd30a208f01a39ff" href="../../证据/ed767d72c4e2046c8c2cf8ec96aa9f571d42be1c80d6335dcd30a208f01a39ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ed767d72c4e2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.Calibration/RotateCalibrationPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3187a10c1db60663334a3c538dc703133deb43a8bd6b7942c1ba3402e72663ea" href="../../证据/3187a10c1db60663334a3c538dc703133deb43a8bd6b7942c1ba3402e72663ea.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3187a10c1db6</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.Calibration/RotateCalibrationPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8ddba4e7cd4fdaffb045685e38cb82ca1235f8c6227d86bab3c33a63c440474e" href="../../证据/8ddba4e7cd4fdaffb045685e38cb82ca1235f8c6227d86bab3c33a63c440474e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8ddba4e7cd4f</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.Calibration/RotateCalibrationPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b412e7153c4aa5da2bdfe354d6432d0bb4c40d7a81a32538b67dcd4aa0056339" href="../../证据/b412e7153c4aa5da2bdfe354d6432d0bb4c40d7a81a32538b67dcd4aa0056339.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b412e7153c4a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f" href="../../证据/9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9ed5d7beed27</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PST04 · SaveAs的Copy/Rebase与SolutionStore.Save → 路径字段变换、文件提交、编辑器提交分离</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Copy给Resources建立新数组但仍使用原资源record引用；参数JsonElement.Clone、ROI顶点数组等另行快照。Rebase再次Copy，只改每个ResourceDocument.Path及ModuleId恰为vision.image-file的字符串Path参数：绝对路径原样保留，相对路径先按旧base解析，再相对新base表示。任意插件私有路径不被通用Rebase扫描；ImageSource自己的绝对化来自PST02。Rebase不复制外部图像或标定文件。SolutionStore.Save完成结构/JSON检查、临时文件写入Flush(true)、Move覆盖且finally正常结束后，doc才写document/BaseDirectory/FilePath/IsDirty/Revision并发Changed。</p><p>独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放：这条既有事实明确核实“SaveAs的Copy/Rebase与SolutionStore.Save → 路径字段变换、文件提交、编辑器提交分离”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">方案JSON原子替换与插件资产副作用是两个事务范围；逐资源迁移/失败补偿、加载替换及未知格式拒绝需另列，独立vmx不证明sol兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原子覆盖的文件系统/崩溃持久性未在本切片实测；源码Flush/Move不能证明多文件事务。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：通用路径规则不保证每个插件资源的跨机器可移植性；只能按其具体参与者分支判断。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691" href="../../证据/dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dd3930e245ff</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d4648a8a412d138d0fb649560fd14fdf1e3a27237c7840666cb16b2ca444ecdd" href="../../证据/d4648a8a412d138d0fb649560fd14fdf1e3a27237c7840666cb16b2ca444ecdd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d4648a8a412d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f" href="../../证据/9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9ed5d7beed27</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a23434c51066e9ceceb3f9aa5a1974961608b8c315168113e404eba343362b1e" href="../../证据/a23434c51066e9ceceb3f9aa5a1974961608b8c315168113e404eba343362b1e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a23434c51066</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.ShellSaveSolution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8cfa41ffcb20e1ac55931082dac6b8a9424d52b4734d3012be8a9e4a2aee3bf1" href="../../证据/8cfa41ffcb20e1ac55931082dac6b8a9424d52b4734d3012be8a9e4a2aee3bf1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8cfa41ffcb20</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PST05 · GraphEditorDocument.Save保留既有history → 旧BaseDirectory快照与SaveAs之后的RestoreSnapshot</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Save没有history.Clear、solutionGeneration递增或SolutionReplaced事件，而Load在提交时明确执行这些操作。Snapshot保留ProcedureId与创建时BaseDirectory，并持有MemoryDocument或payload；Capture把Copy(document)作为快照输入。因此已有历史快照可继续保留旧Resources/嵌入Base64，即使保存投影的新Resources已过滤或替换；并非每次Save必有这样的快照。RestoreSnapshot用snapshot.Document及snapshot.BaseDirectory按当前BaseDirectory重新Rebase，然后替换document/选择流程/标dirty/Revision/Changed，不修改当前FilePath/BaseDirectory，也不写方案文件。</p><p>独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放：这条既有事实明确核实“GraphEditorDocument.Save保留既有history → 旧BaseDirectory快照与SaveAs之后的RestoreSnapshot”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">方案JSON原子替换与插件资产副作用是两个事务范围；逐资源迁移/失败补偿、加载替换及未知格式拒绝需另列，独立vmx不证明sol兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：历史中是否实际存在含旧嵌入资源的快照取决于此前操作，未把条件持有推成所有Save的必然内存驻留。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：这里只确认文档历史与路径边界；payload文件租约/删除失败、GUI回放与原版行为分别保留其独立证据。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a64a42e30e38baee4efcf7db242a1bf79ba4b3828407e0bf1bd6c941820f352f" href="../../证据/a64a42e30e38baee4efcf7db242a1bf79ba4b3828407e0bf1bd6c941820f352f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a64a42e30e38</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4dc95e0a6349fbb0a84a6f728c5ce9ac3a3801585543766179277d1499d2803" href="../../证据/f4dc95e0a6349fbb0a84a6f728c5ce9ac3a3801585543766179277d1499d2803.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4dc95e0a634</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b4cf1c21b98b38823e790df0273588734fb8a00f21effb83f674971f8059246f" href="../../证据/b4cf1c21b98b38823e790df0273588734fb8a00f21effb83f674971f8059246f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b4cf1c21b98b</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="52ea4c767bf701f3e4d50a9e21a741b83c0a21f030046ea2da1f8920b61d5284" href="../../证据/52ea4c767bf701f3e4d50a9e21a741b83c0a21f030046ea2da1f8920b61d5284.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>52ea4c767bf7</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="646cc4268bf3d69f42b5b28c68e6bd80e27243f739b563fcf00941fa5a8e8e12" href="../../证据/646cc4268bf3d69f42b5b28c68e6bd80e27243f739b563fcf00941fa5a8e8e12.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>646cc4268bf3</small></a></details></details><details><summary>HP01 · GraphEditorDocument.Capture → CaptureSnapshot → 配置文档副本 → 内存快照或独占JSON文件载荷</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Capture先Copy(document)，再SerializeToUtf8Bytes。仅当没有显式historyPayloadParentDirectory且字节数小于64KiB时，Snapshot直接保存传入的文档副本；其余情况创建HistoryPayloadStore并写独占.payload。Snapshot还保存ProcedureId和BaseDirectory。Restore通过Snapshot.Document读取/反序列化，再从旧BaseDirectory重基到当前BaseDirectory，替换document并Dirty/Revision/Changed；没有把workflowSessions、scope或工具像素FIFO装进这个Snapshot。</p><p>独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放：这条既有事实明确核实“GraphEditorDocument.Capture → CaptureSnapshot → 配置文档副本 → 内存快照或独占JSON文件载荷”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">方案JSON原子替换与插件资产副作用是两个事务范围；逐资源迁移/失败补偿、加载替换及未知格式拒绝需另列，独立vmx不证明sol兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：仅源码级配置快照合同；不证明原版undo载荷或当前完整GUI操作等价，也未据此测量内存峰值。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4c3ac12d3435cf9956a0527c054a7d5c0e6d1bfdd336bf65e5198c2fab936e51" href="../../证据/4c3ac12d3435cf9956a0527c054a7d5c0e6d1bfdd336bf65e5198c2fab936e51.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4c3ac12d3435</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="edfe94ff86a2eabb61c6c15c4ba88cbe93ce01e17cf0b1f8cad8ca37ae4c9774" href="../../证据/edfe94ff86a2eabb61c6c15c4ba88cbe93ce01e17cf0b1f8cad8ca37ae4c9774.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>edfe94ff86a2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="646cc4268bf3d69f42b5b28c68e6bd80e27243f739b563fcf00941fa5a8e8e12" href="../../证据/646cc4268bf3d69f42b5b28c68e6bd80e27243f739b563fcf00941fa5a8e8e12.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>646cc4268bf3</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691" href="../../证据/dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dd3930e245ff</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="93ca0cb3fa9c240d2ebca8145901c780625aa5379af2368887cfdc097f0210f8" href="../../证据/93ca0cb3fa9c240d2ebca8145901c780625aa5379af2368887cfdc097f0210f8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>93ca0cb3fa9c</small></a></details></details><details><summary>HP03 · HistoryPayloadLease.Dispose → Store.Release → 先删除owned文件再撤Entry；失败可保留可重试租约</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Entry.References>1时只减计数；最后引用若OwnedFile先File.Delete，成功后才entries.Remove、Bytes=null、References=0。删除抛错时Entry仍live，Lease.Dispose保留owner并重抛；如果Entry已移除而随后目录清理抛错，catch依据IsLive=false把owner清空，不能把两类异常都当文件仍有可重试租约。Store.Dispose只closing，尚有Entry时等待最后租约，不强制遍历删除。</p><p>独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放：这条既有事实明确核实“HistoryPayloadLease.Dispose → Store.Release → 先删除owned文件再撤Entry；失败可保留可重试租约”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">方案JSON原子替换与插件资产副作用是两个事务范围；逐资源迁移/失败补偿、加载替换及未知格式拒绝需另列，独立vmx不证明sol兼容。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：源码中两个Dispose方法处于不同类型，引用会保留各自完整区段；未用真实文件占用、权限故障或GUI并发作本轮运行验证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/HistoryPayloadStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e0ff4a5f2df745288a9acf94380219366668fb7e1032dd9d6b0d7b98a355c2c" href="../../证据/1e0ff4a5f2df745288a9acf94380219366668fb7e1032dd9d6b0d7b98a355c2c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e0ff4a5f2df</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/HistoryPayloadStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c0d35923c459fd5a522aea41911c3d28038a2102f3d0e2928240d1593d28b709" href="../../证据/c0d35923c459fd5a522aea41911c3d28038a2102f3d0e2928240d1593d28b709.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c0d35923c459</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/HistoryPayloadStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a4e0b3f5f4b18b658a9b3b232aaecf46cb38e0129423be7918387dd466a8b232" href="../../证据/a4e0b3f5f4b18b658a9b3b232aaecf46cb38e0129423be7918387dd466a8b232.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a4e0b3f5f4b1</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>execution-storage:J02 · GraphEditorDocument.Save → SolutionStore.Save</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>PrepareSave 接收文档副本，随后 Rebase 并落盘；返回后才替换 document、基目录、路径、Dirty、Revision 并发 Changed。</p><p>计划将D02归入F-18，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。PrepareSave / Rebase 的插件私有资源及历史一致性不由这一方法证明。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13e0f10c001e0e446a4a5e6a738b39808c57e2d55d3b96a124b91131cdd718ac" href="../../证据/13e0f10c001e0e446a4a5e6a738b39808c57e2d55d3b96a124b91131cdd718ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13e0f10c001e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>execution-storage:J03 · SolutionStore.Save → 临时文件 → Flush(true) → File.Move</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>先校验/序列化、限制 32MiB、检查重复键；同目录独占新临时文件写入和 Flush(true)，Move(overwrite:true)，finally 清临时文件。</p><p>计划将D02归入F-18，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。不证明断电、跨卷、native 保存事务或全部插件资产兼容。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="df7dca5bb4adc6503a57abd82d22c53b76afed5b93a675e219260708e6f671c0" href="../../证据/df7dca5bb4adc6503a57abd82d22c53b76afed5b93a675e219260708e6f671c0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>df7dca5bb4ad</small></a></details></details><details><summary>execution-storage:J04 · GraphEditorDocument.PrepareSave → ToolPluginRegistry参与者投影 → Rebase → JSON存储</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>MainWindow构造将PrepareSave委托连到plugins.PrepareSave并传当前executionScope。ToolPluginRegistry先按已注册持久化参与者前缀排除旧资源，再逐节点调用IToolAssetPersistence.PrepareSave，资源按Id覆盖；没有参与者的节点直接保留。Rebase复制投影，保留绝对路径，仅重算资源相对路径及vision.image-file的Path参数，不递归改写任意插件参数。</p><p>计划将D02归入F-18，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。各插件私有资产/缓存副作用和失败回滚未由框架投影证明；只读当前main源码，不更改插件框架或其它worktree。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4cc28c3847610e14ba36a44eb663c05de11b3dc92d1ef8e32f727a9df0da8f8b" href="../../证据/4cc28c3847610e14ba36a44eb663c05de11b3dc92d1ef8e32f727a9df0da8f8b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4cc28c384761</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPluginContracts/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b2bf628ee4ba486c7fbcfdee3e2415c7500e722fd23ab5e41b6eb6270108c297" href="../../证据/b2bf628ee4ba486c7fbcfdee3e2415c7500e722fd23ab5e41b6eb6270108c297.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b2bf628ee4ba</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d4648a8a412d138d0fb649560fd14fdf1e3a27237c7840666cb16b2ca444ecdd" href="../../证据/d4648a8a412d138d0fb649560fd14fdf1e3a27237c7840666cb16b2ca444ecdd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d4648a8a412d</small></a></details></details><details><summary>execution-storage:J06 · GraphEditorDocument.Load / PrepareLoad → 解析/分离/恢复/校验 → 文档提交 → scope替换事件</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Load先读独立格式、ProcedureGraph.Separate和Copy，再PrepareLoad及ValidateStructure；ToolPluginRegistry恢复提供者必须保持Id/ModuleId/ModuleVersion，否则抛错。提交字段、清历史、Dirty=false并增Revision后才发SolutionReplaced/Changed。MainWindow订阅SolutionReplaced到ReplaceExecutionScope，后者失效旧owner、取消activeRun、清缓存、Dispose旧scope、创建并挂新scope；事件异常没有跨上述步骤的事务回滚。</p><p>计划将D02归入F-18，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“独立方案版本、资源迁移、失败提交与释放”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。旧scope Dispose、所有SolutionReplaced/Changed订阅者与每个工具恢复体另待逐项核；原版Task/SDK加载生命周期保持分列，不由当前事件链证明原生等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d3839949d9d0f2849176002f36d23e32c2d5aefdfee438a0a2fcdf190bc69abb" href="../../证据/d3839949d9d0f2849176002f36d23e32c2d5aefdfee438a0a2fcdf190bc69abb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d3839949d9d0</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPluginContracts/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4cd3aaec7c31a8811379268399b90dfe553c84c32d7fd7534df0976df2373b4a" href="../../证据/4cd3aaec7c31a8811379268399b90dfe553c84c32d7fd7534df0976df2373b4a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4cd3aaec7c31</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a333368bf7566b60bbdec3aac017c388df80f7579a8f98c64136fbae20796952" href="../../证据/a333368bf7566b60bbdec3aac017c388df80f7579a8f98c64136fbae20796952.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a333368bf756</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4cc28c3847610e14ba36a44eb663c05de11b3dc92d1ef8e32f727a9df0da8f8b" href="../../证据/4cc28c3847610e14ba36a44eb663c05de11b3dc92d1ef8e32f727a9df0da8f8b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4cc28c384761</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="05f31e74763c9ab3c96c10a6f6e3d1159a01f5fdde6de5656335cb37afb8c675" href="../../证据/05f31e74763c9ab3c96c10a6f6e3d1159a01f5fdde6de5656335cb37afb8c675.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>05f31e74763c</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-19" id="F-19"><summary>F-19 · 原生 .sol 兼容 · 原生容器字段、密码、版本路由与往返</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：原生writer与VmServer/UI/mdata字段读写、未知段保留、密码/版本矩阵及原机往返仍开放；图像源配置保存入口不能闭合方案容器。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>D01 · sol单操作保存与native写入点</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>VmSolution.InternalExport → SDK保存 → MoudleFrame打包/写入函数</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>一次节点/连接/绑定/改名对应哪些真实字节和函数</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>同最小方案各次另存；REA定位native writer/reader、函数调用与数据流；保留8样本122记录基线</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>变化记录可归因具体操作和写入点；mdata未知字段不猜；不把外层解析器作为产品导入器</dd></dl><p>托管保存边界与尚未恢复的native writer</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D01</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2312c5ac66f0bae24197b90f4faefb7d56d06842e746d1770c80dcf6bc7a3b2f" href="../../证据/2312c5ac66f0bae24197b90f4faefb7d56d06842e746d1770c80dcf6bc7a3b2f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2312c5ac66f0</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D03 · 原生容器与对象数据映射</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>VmServer/UI/mdata/绑定/策略/流程记录原始读写成员</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>字段类型、身份、默认、缺失与未知段如何表达</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>按方案/流程/Group/变量/资源拆原函数级子任务；生成字段→成员→操作映射与正反例</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每已识别字段有读写链和差分；原始未知字节保留；不凭相似编码命名格式</dd></dl><p>仅UserData字节写入与模块落地子路径；VmServer/UI/mdata全字段读写映射未恢复</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D03</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eec94f8663ac39f7af480808c24d1d16364523a1121d4390d6f748a064c0b43e" href="../../证据/eec94f8663ac39f7af480808c24d1d16364523a1121d4390d6f748a064c0b43e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eec94f8663ac</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D04 · 版本、密码和迁移</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>GetGroVersion/CompatibleTool/密码校验与sol/solx/gro/pro加载</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>版本路由/加密/升级器/异步失败恢复</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>REA取得迁移/压缩/加密相关原实现；旧新配对样本、正确错误取消密码、升级失败</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每格式/版本/密码组合有样本和运行记录；缺样本标等待；不运行会终止他任务的升级路径</dd></dl><p>选定方案密码/取消分支；版本迁移和格式组合仍未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D04</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="97d0bd60d66384c368924638e0559e9b5e8eb8f169a8feaf54c6b5f46569d712" href="../../证据/97d0bd60d66384c368924638e0559e9b5e8eb8f169a8feaf54c6b5f46569d712.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>97d0bd60d663</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D05 · 原生兼容最小实现与往返</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>已确认原生读写链与未知字段保留模型</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>最小兼容范围能否原机打开/执行/再保存</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>先只读模型并验证，再限定格式写回；原件副本、未知字段/附件保留；原机与重构往返执行</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>按格式/版本逐格关闭；数值/引用/资源/执行均匹配；范围外明确拒绝；密码与私有插件不能假完成</dd></dl><p>仅连接原生writer与载入未知边界；尚无本矩阵证明的兼容写回/原机执行往返</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D05</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e4f7e36cbf88d8d918c0453797df97cdd1f091394c5e1e982383b578538397e4" href="../../证据/e4f7e36cbf88d8d918c0453797df97cdd1f091394c5e1e982383b578538397e4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e4f7e36cbf88</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>SP05 · 原模块参数快照与保存/加载入口 → 配置列表获取、加载回放及基类保存边界</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>GetAllParamList通过VM_M_GetCurrentConfigByFile(...,&quot;ImageSourceModuleAlgorithm.xml&quot;,param_1,0)返回当前配置。LoadModuleData明确先调用SetAllParamList(this,(PARAM_VALUE_INFO_LIST*)param_1)，其检查非空，按0x584字节条目步进，最多处理256项；除SetCameraParamWaitTime外，向虚表+0x18传入name@条目+4、value@+0x108及0x400长度。SaveModuleData明确调用CAbstractUserModule::SaveModuleData，再设置保存完成回调和owner等字段。三者证明可定位的快照/回放/保存边界，但未取基类保存原体，不能声称已逐项证明PathCache与拼接参数落盘编码。</p><p>原生容器字段、密码、版本路由与往返：这条既有事实明确核实“原模块参数快照与保存/加载入口 → 配置列表获取、加载回放及基类保存边界”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">原生writer与VmServer/UI/mdata字段读写、未知段保留、密码/版本矩阵及原机往返仍开放；图像源配置保存入口不能闭合方案容器。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：虚表+0x18实际目标/ABI需按完整虚表/汇编核；本调用点具name/value实参，不能只按名称擅称每一条setter成功。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：SetAllParamList伪码忽略单项setter返回码；全局返回0不能证明每个参数已有效应用。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：CAbstractUserModule保存序列化实现与存档实际字节未在本轮恢复，配置保存/重开原版验收仍独立。</p><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/image-source-native-extra-11.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fa623a2cfcfb4fd4fab144d2f64430e533d46a40464a27e747d48568bc267cb0" href="../../证据/fa623a2cfcfb4fd4fab144d2f64430e533d46a40464a27e747d48568bc267cb0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fa623a2cfcfb</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/image-source-native-extra-8.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="70d184c2b0b0db447f77fec0b00d16d4c926f5dbea1b1d53f8058260fb1bd336" href="../../证据/70d184c2b0b0db447f77fec0b00d16d4c926f5dbea1b1d53f8058260fb1bd336.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>70d184c2b0b0</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/image-source-native-extra-10.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4d2b781e2e9f7d19a20b6b4509f2adae9fcb4e72a3583abc77a49479b237eeea" href="../../证据/4d2b781e2e9f7d19a20b6b4509f2adae9fcb4e72a3583abc77a49479b237eeea.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4d2b781e2e9f</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/image-source-native-extra-7.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7089c628fba5cdb3e87cb4f9138433cbf0e8ba1bd7a304c78998f84280a812e2" href="../../证据/7089c628fba5cdb3e87cb4f9138433cbf0e8ba1bd7a304c78998f84280a812e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7089c628fba5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP01 · 原UserData[key] → 按Parent.ID普通键或动态复合键读写SDK界面数据</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>UserData不是一个本地Dictionary。getter在Parent非活动或正在Dispose时返回null，否则调用SDK；setter在Parent为空或Dispose时直接返回。isUsedForDynamicUIParam决定路由：动态key用字面分隔符&amp;?;?拆分，array[0]为名字、array[1]（若有）为optional，更多片段没有继续传递；普通路由传完整key和Parent.ID。Parent.IsDynamicModu控制撤销分支，是另一项判断，不能等同isUsedForDynamicUIParam。</p><p>原生容器字段、密码、版本路由与往返：这条既有事实明确核实“原UserData[key] → 按Parent.ID普通键或动态复合键读写SDK界面数据”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">原生writer与VmServer/UI/mdata字段读写、未知段保留、密码/版本矩阵及原机往返仍开放；图像源配置保存入口不能闭合方案容器。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：SDK界面数据的最终native容器/落盘结构不在这些托管体内；不把写入等同.sol保存完成。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5d5f72b163877a62e3b615b2f9fb99aa1518ecf4b9b3c3d99ffa903a6a1c6515" href="../../证据/5d5f72b163877a62e3b615b2f9fb99aa1518ecf4b9b3c3d99ffa903a6a1c6515.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5d5f72b16387</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="021de486f6931368f5bca8a45ade703eef229bbca4a0fb48cfe498ddf7d8fb74" href="../../证据/021de486f6931368f5bca8a45ade703eef229bbca4a0fb48cfe498ddf7d8fb74.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>021de486f693</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8f307bdc44b2ef96adcc362459be499c77588d06695e5cd326e800b9ed2025e7" href="../../证据/8f307bdc44b2ef96adcc362459be499c77588d06695e5cd326e800b9ed2025e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8f307bdc44b2</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP02 · 原ModuleManager.SetUIParamValue / SetDynamicUIParamValue → 临时非托管字节副本 → native setter；空载荷改走删除</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>两setter对非null且Length非0的byte[]按实际Length分配HGlobal并Marshal.Copy，传pointer和uint Length调用native；调用正常返回后FreeHGlobal，再检查返回码抛错。null和空数组都走对应删除方法，不能保存为可区分的零长度值。普通路由另有IsForbidden特殊分支：非null载荷先BytesToStruct&lt;bool>再EnableModule，绕过一般UI键存储。</p><p>原生容器字段、密码、版本路由与往返：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModuleManager.SetUIParamValue / SetDynamicUIParamValue → 临时非托管字节副本 → native setter；空载荷改走删除”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">原生writer与VmServer/UI/mdata字段读写、未知段保留、密码/版本矩阵及原机往返仍开放；图像源配置保存入口不能闭合方案容器。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：native setter保存副本或租用pointer的协议、删除最终析构、原.sol打包时点未闭合；本片不重新推断Writer/mdata。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="896e501aa27687ea4d5cce53ee4dadf1c2d3ad6ce17be012d13b507396ef70d6" href="../../证据/896e501aa27687ea4d5cce53ee4dadf1c2d3ad6ce17be012d13b507396ef70d6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>896e501aa276</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="16fba9f8f2bbae08f52324d50cfdf8ad3253e6ddf3c71f311fcb43793bd8da51" href="../../证据/16fba9f8f2bbae08f52324d50cfdf8ad3253e6ddf3c71f311fcb43793bd8da51.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>16fba9f8f2bb</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="09d12348522282e89b68151244116de2755027be286928e55c26f4ddce562cb4" href="../../证据/09d12348522282e89b68151244116de2755027be286928e55c26f4ddce562cb4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>09d123485222</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP03 · 原普通/动态UserData读取 → native pointer+nDataLen → 新托管byte[]；正常尾请求释放返回块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>普通GetUIParamValueByKey成功时new byte[nDataLen]并在pData非0时Marshal.Copy；复制异常被吞，随后仍请求RELEASE_MEMORY_BASE_ARRAY，释放失败抛VmException。错误码-536870911返回null，其他非0抛错。动态ModuleManager getter经ServerSDKAPI展开：成功时同样按返回nDataLen新建数组及复制，但Release调用位于pData非0条件内，不能合并成同一无条件尾释放。动态wrapper将byte[]返回给调用者。</p><p>原生容器字段、密码、版本路由与往返：这条既有事实明确核实“原普通/动态UserData读取 → native pointer+nDataLen → 新托管byte[]；正常尾请求释放返回块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">原生writer与VmServer/UI/mdata字段读写、未知段保留、密码/版本矩阵及原机往返仍开放；图像源配置保存入口不能闭合方案容器。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不能由Release成功推断SDK权威存储已删除；本slice未执行SDK，也未恢复该释放类型内部allocator。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="040127f8a7fa0bfd03e501eec77f26c79d1167c395deaf2eb9236347f205cf7f" href="../../证据/040127f8a7fa0bfd03e501eec77f26c79d1167c395deaf2eb9236347f205cf7f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>040127f8a7fa</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="393587e633a044c73457ca65e0bfe4ffdf1d4c12ee1c2a4c71a86a2c091a5582" href="../../证据/393587e633a044c73457ca65e0bfe4ffdf1d4c12ee1c2a4c71a86a2c091a5582.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>393587e633a0</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ServerSDKAPI.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c5c2d283f34efba0d09c4875a819be3a7b2a8fd01466a027e9a72322701f1862" href="../../证据/c5c2d283f34efba0d09c4875a819be3a7b2a8fd01466a027e9a72322701f1862.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c5c2d283f34e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP05 · 原具体UI模型字段 → 字段级布局、默认值与缓存规则必须分列</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>IsReady使用1字节0/1，缺键保留nullable未知，null setter删除。GUID初始化先CheckUIParamExist，存在时new Guid(bytes)，不存在创建Guid.NewGuid().ToByteArray再写入。ProceZoomIndex缺键返回backing字段初值9；getter读取并int.Parse后不回填该字段，setter先改字段再尝试写入且吞为消息框，故字段与SDK值不必事务一致。IsSubscribeInWindow按nullable缓存首次读取，缺失或TryParse失败为false；setter先更新缓存和通知，再尝试写入且吞异常。</p><p>原生容器字段、密码、版本路由与往返：这条既有事实明确核实“原具体UI模型字段 → 字段级布局、默认值与缓存规则必须分列”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">原生writer与VmServer/UI/mdata字段读写、未知段保留、密码/版本矩阵及原机往返仍开放；图像源配置保存入口不能闭合方案容器。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：Hik.Util两个编码helper完整体未在本片取得，因此缩放/订阅确切字节长度及尾零不宣称已证；异常载荷（空数组IsReady、无效GUID、不可解析缩放）不伪造容错。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8c71b0114886861819fcead4482fa4f20ea893c7e0b7391e470acb2a90c44afc" href="../../证据/8c71b0114886861819fcead4482fa4f20ea893c7e0b7391e470acb2a90c44afc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8c71b0114886</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d63370198c7bce1a0595bbf66eb11a1504baf5870b65e3b82c6be786c682a187" href="../../证据/d63370198c7bce1a0595bbf66eb11a1504baf5870b65e3b82c6be786c682a187.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d63370198c7b</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmSolution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="874043e25e052d7287a1eaba1799c98ab5774cb0945c5c246d4a36aeb9794637" href="../../证据/874043e25e052d7287a1eaba1799c98ab5774cb0945c5c246d4a36aeb9794637.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>874043e25e05</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmSolution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13716210ca56ae8aff48e500cd721395ea8f82806007424a0c49d1d6c9f24f08" href="../../证据/13716210ca56ae8aff48e500cd721395ea8f82806007424a0c49d1d6c9f24f08.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13716210ca56</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmSolution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e0cdebb3227a1f5299a6214d1d11e659a20340b6ec5939dc29d28bbd1ce5eaf2" href="../../证据/e0cdebb3227a1f5299a6214d1d11e659a20340b6ec5939dc29d28bbd1ce5eaf2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e0cdebb3227a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP06 · 原CalibrationGuideData / VmProcedure.CalibData → 保存前UI flush到UserData，再进入独立方案Export阶段</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>VmProcedure恢复时将UserData[CalibData]数组直接赋calibrationData；缺失则清该字段返回，存在则isBootMode=true。SaveCalibData在calibrationData为null时写null删除，否则仅调用可空delegate，不能保证必有写入。CalibrationGuideData.Parent为VmProcedure时去重追加SaveData，SaveData将ToXmlStringWithHead()经ByteUtil.GetBytes写入该键。ProjectManager.SaveSolution在Dispatcher同步遍历各流程SaveCalibData后，才调用VmSolution.Export；仅Export为true后才更新路径通知/启动后续Task。</p><p>原生容器字段、密码、版本路由与往返：这条既有事实明确核实“原CalibrationGuideData / VmProcedure.CalibData → 保存前UI flush到UserData，再进入独立方案Export阶段”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">原生writer与VmServer/UI/mdata字段读写、未知段保留、密码/版本矩阵及原机往返仍开放；图像源配置保存入口不能闭合方案容器。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：CalibData XML schema、ByteUtil具体编码和长度、delegate在全部关闭路径的解除以及原native writer对userdata的磁盘打包仍未知；既有S01–S06与save-native-boundary保持独立。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmProcedure.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="77922e9503acebdbbd5a26f1c0258fddf22b40de9b3cf13581e9ee20a94ff055" href="../../证据/77922e9503acebdbbd5a26f1c0258fddf22b40de9b3cf13581e9ee20a94ff055.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>77922e9503ac</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmProcedure.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d63f7e42d36621fe2022050889882d2ddb8194a660c18b8ad4b42e37a3abe779" href="../../证据/d63f7e42d36621fe2022050889882d2ddb8194a660c18b8ad4b42e37a3abe779.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d63f7e42d366</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.CalibGuide/CalibrationGuideData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f14e22e102628543a0f531dcdb5a756d7cd0e9becbcc4dc94b9a57c1c8462303" href="../../证据/f14e22e102628543a0f531dcdb5a756d7cd0e9becbcc4dc94b9a57c1c8462303.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f14e22e10262</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.CalibGuide/CalibrationGuideData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3171458ccdfc11ec9fa0be7451bdba1898934b89e5314003bf3a45a0d71607ba" href="../../证据/3171458ccdfc11ec9fa0be7451bdba1898934b89e5314003bf3a45a0d71607ba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3171458ccdfc</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VisionMaster.Exe.Audit/VisionMaster.Project/ProjectManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d61f4b05c98f3642ceb4d188f26cde4d40b7ccc598f8cd637fc47c1f7c797921" href="../../证据/d61f4b05c98f3642ceb4d188f26cde4d40b7ccc598f8cd637fc47c1f7c797921.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d61f4b05c98f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>execution-storage:S06 · IMVS_SaveSolution → 原生 .sol writer / 持久化事务</summary><p>unknown</p><p>托管保存入口不是磁盘格式定义；native 内部打包、密码、事务和状态回调生产仍需原函数证据。</p><p>计划将D01/D03/D05归入F-19，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“原生容器字段、密码、版本路由与往返”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。未取回本边原生函数体；不声明兼容或断电安全。</p></details><details><summary>solution-lifecycle:O03 · 格式与密码门 → CheckSolution / nullable对话框结果 / 显式密码检查</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>CheckSolution的VmException被提示并返回false；nValidFormat!=1返回false。nHasPwd==1且solPassWord==null时显示Decryption，返回非true置flag2但仍读AccessAdministatorCode；显式密码走CheckPassword，错误直接throw VmException(-536868864)。只有!flag2才创建加载Task。</p><p>计划将D04归入F-19，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“原生容器字段、密码、版本路由与往返”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。显式密码异常在本地CheckSolution catch之外；不能把它改写为统一false。密码窗和native校验算法见安全页，未执行。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VisionMaster.Exe.Audit/VisionMaster.Project/ProjectManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f5bbaa5b83d9e0cdfe223e5e5d02531fce089cdb9392a8235465d63f1986425c" href="../../证据/f5bbaa5b83d9e0cdfe223e5e5d02531fce089cdb9392a8235465d63f1986425c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f5bbaa5b83d9</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/solution-lifecycle-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d287f368ed7b3d3e062d1ae00eb014fb3ee35f4efadd72f3e9bc31d508ca6ee7" href="../../证据/d287f368ed7b3d3e062d1ae00eb014fb3ee35f4efadd72f3e9bc31d508ca6ee7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d287f368ed7b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>entry-routing-security:E66 · UserData.set_Item → SetUIParamValue → 生命周期/历史门 → 动态或普通SDK设置</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>UserData写入有Parent/Dispose与全局/动态模块、历史分支；实际SetUIParamValue按isUsedForDynamicUIParam选择SDK动态或普通函数。普通ModuleManager对非空数据Alloc/Copy/SDK/Free，空数据走DeleteUIParamValue，非零返回抛VmException。密码清空的UTF8为空数组，因此普通分支可删除键，不是写入字符串对象。</p><p>计划将D03归入F-19，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“原生容器字段、密码、版本路由与往返”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。native函数体、结构/内存异常清理、UserData全部历史语义及方案落盘/受保护.grp导出仍开放，不从UI字节存取推定磁盘加密。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="adaedf09cd0fc33be1c8ca756e91e99f43f63bbef1062afe73287ffb6bb42188" href="../../证据/adaedf09cd0fc33be1c8ca756e91e99f43f63bbef1062afe73287ffb6bb42188.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>adaedf09cd0f</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="24c007eee325175ebf0749a49766ddf3424a3e15f4472076ab34f06d09602fd4" href="../../证据/24c007eee325175ebf0749a49766ddf3424a3e15f4472076ab34f06d09602fd4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>24c007eee325</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d3289b6db0469ffaf15bb0a75f7ab04cbade0d7ec9c12f43653724114bbcbccf" href="../../证据/d3289b6db0469ffaf15bb0a75f7ab04cbade0d7ec9c12f43653724114bbcbccf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d3289b6db046</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/StringUtil.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="239400b9f03d1dd8b65683e97e4a7b9c6a094312882bd693a653bfa632e8c1f1" href="../../证据/239400b9f03d1dd8b65683e97e4a7b9c6a094312882bd693a653bfa632e8c1f1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>239400b9f03d</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-20" id="F-20"><summary>F-20 · 图像结果与 ROI · ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>A06 · 运行界面编辑与显示布局</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>EditFrontendUI → EditFrontendWindow/FrontendWindowData → FrontendEdit.Close</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>BAML绑定、编辑保存取消及运行态数据消费</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>REA提取BAML/资源和精确成员；布局编辑、关闭两态、存储、重开与运行值追踪</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>布局与真实结果绑定闭合；未知控件单列；插件显示只消费交付合同</dd></dl><p>设计器创建/关闭、保存与取消、三缓冲及UserData写回、运行窗ParseXaml消费已取有限原件体；原BAML激活、完整控件绑定/结果及SDK保存仍未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A06</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d3f1be5d9f658a2b1f57955e9ba404c4ed5a396a104e5cec98dccfcb85d2c6b8" href="../../证据/d3f1be5d9f658a2b1f57955e9ba404c4ed5a396a104e5cec98dccfcb85d2c6b8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d3f1be5d9f65</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B06 · Group配置、ROI和结果消费边界</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>GroupRunParam/RunParamConfigDecorate/RoiConfigControl/ROISelecter_GroupControl</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>代理候选、复杂字段编辑及ROI坐标消费的原生语义</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>核对FCR-018/019/021/022；仅main Group代理/消费端实现；复杂编辑由插件合同提供</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>原始候选/写入/执行可核对；实际ROI跨Group运行和保存重开；不另造插件配置模板</dd></dl><p>Group专用模板/回调/后台装载/关闭及共享ROI片段；候选过滤/回填和即时编辑已分片；复杂字段、SDK与完整往返未齐</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B06</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2cf78ac75f937a0d8bba24df185e587d6d2012f1c89262eb56eb4f25dfc25a7a" href="../../证据/2cf78ac75f937a0d8bba24df185e587d6d2012f1c89262eb56eb4f25dfc25a7a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2cf78ac75f93</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B07 · 插件交接合同与真实消费</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>FCR生产者/消费者、提交级接口和真实工具</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>已交付插件是否满足框架的身份/数据/会话合同</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>等待用户选择提交；只审已提交差异，逐字段兼容；根流程与Group验证真实端口/参数/ROI</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>明确实际采用SHA与合同；待集成和已实现分开；不搬未提交文件</dd></dl><p>仅映射当前provider、编辑所有者与scope合同消费；提交级采用SHA及真实工具交付验收未在此矩阵证明</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B07</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="240fda248171a769d3c39c3ea86545b7618b69e4e159ad991114ae0f2fb8c229" href="../../证据/240fda248171a769d3c39c3ea86545b7618b69e4e159ad991114ae0f2fb8c229.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>240fda248171</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B08 · 模型与Group组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>真实插件、嵌套Group、变量、ROI与历史持久化组合</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>单项通过后组合是否保持身份和数据一致</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>混合类型/多层/循环中断/累积/改型/撤销/保存重开/停止失败恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每场景对照原机输出和状态；失败不读陈旧结果；组合未知仍开放</dd></dl><p>模型/Group组合验收：需嵌套、变量、累积、保存重开和再次运行的同场景证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e" href="../../证据/4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f3a8f2e940f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>TD01 · GraphExecutor连接/订阅解析 → ModuleExecutionContext → 工具输入</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前图连接先要求上游状态为Success或NoMatch并找到指定输出，随后nodeInputs[c.ToPort]=v保存同一个PortValue。订阅解析也把解析值写入参数或输入字典，类型/基数检查后才构造只读上下文。对当前图像类型，DataKinds.Coerce走可流通时返回原PortValue；ModuleExecutionContext.Input&lt;T>通过As&lt;T>返回同一Value对象。因此图像从记录经输入字典交给工具时，这些包装层没有逐像素复制。配置JSON/ROI的本轮克隆不能代证图像也被克隆。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“GraphExecutor连接/订阅解析 → ModuleExecutionContext → 工具输入”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：这里只确认当前托管IMAGE路径；其它标量转换、数组构造和原生租约不能统一描述为零复制。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="157c6a19c396d0de2f5ea58e26e5cf67a38835808586d20f4b9898c89a0c93bb" href="../../证据/157c6a19c396d0de2f5ea58e26e5cf67a38835808586d20f4b9898c89a0c93bb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>157c6a19c396</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="edd7f947fb10ab6e96ca4102a851737eec0034a24840740707373bc7540223e2" href="../../证据/edd7f947fb10ab6e96ca4102a851737eec0034a24840740707373bc7540223e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>edd7f947fb10</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="894ec88445bf80f6520757a6d193b2d130a7051f985140a3e554d1d8f0d89191" href="../../证据/894ec88445bf80f6520757a6d193b2d130a7051f985140a3e554d1d8f0d89191.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>894ec88445bf</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fb0d4ac8db7fbb41abe4ca7bbfcfac83dfebb8c51708560edaf1cfbb649c3b68" href="../../证据/fb0d4ac8db7fbb41abe4ca7bbfcfac83dfebb8c51708560edaf1cfbb649c3b68.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fb0d4ac8db7f</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7f0088b544931b69670549e92a19b88cb7a4cb917aeba4702b5eef4d4b5b5818" href="../../证据/7f0088b544931b69670549e92a19b88cb7a4cb917aeba4702b5eef4d4b5b5818.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7f0088b54493</small></a></details></details><details><summary>TD02 · ImageBinaryPlugin.Runtime硬阈值处理 → 工作数组 → 独立GrayImage输出</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>二值化运行体仅支持BinaryType=1；它从上下文取GrayImage和可选mask的引用，分配output字节数组及outMask，逐行检查取消并读输入、写工作数组。成功构造GrayImage时，构造器再次data.ToArray：算法工作output到结果像素是一次实际复制；可选OutMask也经过同样构造。输入像素不在该循环原地改写。ProcessedPixels是inside像素数，不是图像对象。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“ImageBinaryPlugin.Runtime硬阈值处理 → 工作数组 → 独立GrayImage输出”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：只确认硬阈值当前体；其它模式、native算法体、实际分配峰值和取消时序不由此证明。</p><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.ImageBinary/ImageBinaryPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="10cc80cb09a3dd7ff387df4c51c8649c7298dde9bfbab49791f4daabbcb4df10" href="../../证据/10cc80cb09a3dd7ff387df4c51c8649c7298dde9bfbab49791f4daabbcb4df10.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>10cc80cb09a3</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.ImageBinary/ImageBinaryPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="15e3b2ce688450da894a439b08d1fb98071882db49f2e5f1b07ab68ef73fda2e" href="../../证据/15e3b2ce688450da894a439b08d1fb98071882db49f2e5f1b07ab68ef73fda2e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>15e3b2ce6884</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionData/ImageGeometry.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="403d14a201289fd3aaf93f994839c99d8e7a9137e678675148207c5f40a7f167" href="../../证据/403d14a201289fd3aaf93f994839c99d8e7a9137e678675148207c5f40a7f167.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>403d14a20128</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.ImageBinary/ImageBinaryPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bff59b6b98a3fb008f99d90e9bce2e0e91688248b76ef61006722ed689d4c33f" href="../../证据/bff59b6b98a3fb008f99d90e9bce2e0e91688248b76ef61006722ed689d4c33f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bff59b6b98a3</small></a></details></details><details><summary>TD03 · ImageBufferPlugin刷新/发布 → FIFO图像 → 多轮结果引用</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>缓存图像在刷新标志等于1时复制支持的Gray/Rgb/Raw图像入队，再按数量裁剪；成功输出枚举队列并PortValue.Image(image)，这里不再次复制像素。后续暂停刷新可以让多轮结果包装同一缓存图像对象。队首淘汰仅Dequeue，不能使仍被旧结果引用的对象消失。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“ImageBufferPlugin刷新/发布 → FIFO图像 → 多轮结果引用”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ImageBuffer原生队列及其析构需要原函数体；此处与既有IB事实相互补充，非原版完全等价结论。</p><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.ImageSource/ImageBufferPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7415504d93df3b555d58f79ae69419be25c4c2b23f76199f86beb5c2ee2ffc5f" href="../../证据/7415504d93df3b555d58f79ae69419be25c4c2b23f76199f86beb5c2ee2ffc5f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7415504d93df</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.ImageSource/ImageBufferPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c0caa8cdac577ea6c6e54276a77c06dd482b254cdc40c31bd23ca23b571a9a1c" href="../../证据/c0caa8cdac577ea6c6e54276a77c06dd482b254cdc40c31bd23ca23b571a9a1c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c0caa8cdac57</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.ImageSource/ImageBufferPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ca94e4271249a7f0fa40b3c8a55e03c514b910e19e604fed41610edb0d0296a9" href="../../证据/ca94e4271249a7f0fa40b3c8a55e03c514b910e19e604fed41610edb0d0296a9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ca94e4271249</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPlugins.ImageSource/ImageBufferPlugin.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4404cfa35a2d74e5fe1b48218d4479f5d0c34d0c08e2a0a5f75880a7a0f8102b" href="../../证据/4404cfa35a2d74e5fe1b48218d4479f5d0c34d0c08e2a0a5f75880a7a0f8102b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4404cfa35a2d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="98681d187f80eda0d1b4ef5ee002c84b80eafcb5dcac6d761d1c0e3069098f3e" href="../../证据/98681d187f80eda0d1b4ef5ee002c84b80eafcb5dcac6d761d1c0e3069098f3e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>98681d187f80</small></a></details></details><details><summary>TD04 · ModuleResult返回与运行器清理 → GraphExecutor过滤 / 校验 → NodeRunRecord</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor先在finally释放实现IDisposable/IAsyncDisposable的单轮module，随后检查取消、超时、异常、结果状态以及输出描述符。失败且PreserveFailedOutputs=false时直接Record失败，未传Outputs，记录使用Empty；所以插件字典里曾构造的状态输出不一定发布。通过检查的成功/NoMatch结果（以及显式保留失败输出的路径）复制输出字典并包ReadOnlyDictionary，值仍是同一PortValue；CompoundOutputFields.Expand也先浅复制已有键值，只为适用的复合值追加投影字段。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“ModuleResult返回与运行器清理 → GraphExecutor过滤 / 校验 → NodeRunRecord”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不会据清理函数名推断所有输出载荷释放；实际原子性、并发读者和native最后读者仍须按真实对象追踪。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="894ec88445bf80f6520757a6d193b2d130a7051f985140a3e554d1d8f0d89191" href="../../证据/894ec88445bf80f6520757a6d193b2d130a7051f985140a3e554d1d8f0d89191.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>894ec88445bf</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3e4a043a6b139af31b1db3c6c72754feef3e05d76081bcdb1b1f812127a3de2e" href="../../证据/3e4a043a6b139af31b1db3c6c72754feef3e05d76081bcdb1b1f812127a3de2e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3e4a043a6b13</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c949c55173154cf1681510c25bbc056952aebf41af69b2cfd0e9ca2e7c592461" href="../../证据/c949c55173154cf1681510c25bbc056952aebf41af69b2cfd0e9ca2e7c592461.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c949c5517315</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="08f79ec46af95efcd0898637024adf46a5a85631ebde45dafcd455b26c43f213" href="../../证据/08f79ec46af95efcd0898637024adf46a5a85631ebde45dafcd455b26c43f213.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>08f79ec46af9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/CompoundOutputFields.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="69f416daa91dc7d371044a07e1daefc8096a6f8e81ad8fa5f3004495c6f3bbd0" href="../../证据/69f416daa91dc7d371044a07e1daefc8096a6f8e81ad8fa5f3004495c6f3bbd0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>69f416daa91d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowRunContext.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3b17c5a34bc645e429522d95c62e8dc7172f7a87f82a29134b8de87ac7597ca7" href="../../证据/3b17c5a34bc645e429522d95c62e8dc7172f7a87f82a29134b8de87ac7597ca7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3b17c5a34bc6</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PB01 · CVmObjectBase.OnModuleResultExCallBack → ModuleManager → TempVmSolution订阅 → VmSolution回调</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ModuleManager构造订阅CVmObjectBase.OnModuleResultExCallBack；GetModuleResultCallBack对原生结果描述符调用PreProData，再发布OnModuleResultCallBack。TempVmSolution静态构造把此事件明确订阅到VmSolution.MModuleManager_OnModuleResultCallBack。VmSolution单参入口先调用OnModuleResultCallbackEvent，再进入ref重载按模块ID查AllModules并写IO，最后调用GetFrameMeanCount。因此外部结果事件发布发生在本入口本轮IO提交之前，不应把两个观察时点画成同一原子提交。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“CVmObjectBase.OnModuleResultExCallBack → ModuleManager → TempVmSolution订阅 → VmSolution回调”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：此处闭合的是CVmObjectBase已发布事件后的托管桥；VM_M_SetImageEx接收端如何形成该次事件、该次查询的描述符仍未闭合。外部事件处理器异常也不能由ref重载内部catch替代覆盖。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.resources/VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b03fd791819f6634bf166625252aa2f5ae5fc1af976aeea2a46dbb8081f59c41" href="../../证据/b03fd791819f6634bf166625252aa2f5ae5fc1af976aeea2a46dbb8081f59c41.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b03fd791819f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.resources/VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3967391c878613b91a3a5a11229ab22b3d9efcf5dadb2448e90ae3bb16716280" href="../../证据/3967391c878613b91a3a5a11229ab22b3d9efcf5dadb2448e90ae3bb16716280.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3967391c8786</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.resources/VM.Core.TempVmSolution.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="33fe77f3f8d586cf13926bd431d30dd14df439f09fe64879637313f696294b73" href="../../证据/33fe77f3f8d586cf13926bd431d30dd14df439f09fe64879637313f696294b73.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>33fe77f3f8d5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.resources/VM.Core.VmSolution.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f393322fd26d8a12d26911f09a9194d42d00b386ae63e2c74a4c5c59c7aeb85e" href="../../证据/f393322fd26d8a12d26911f09a9194d42d00b386ae63e2c74a4c5c59c7aeb85e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f393322fd26d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.resources/VM.Core.VmSolution.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7abd461be54b13c621dddaaf48760ba2dc27fa15e0d439ee951384c42293ad80" href="../../证据/7abd461be54b13c621dddaaf48760ba2dc27fa15e0d439ee951384c42293ad80.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7abd461be54b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="96b770176490177ff610278d21030566aab6fdeeee9482e1ef585ebffee83051" href="../../证据/96b770176490177ff610278d21030566aab6fdeeee9482e1ef585ebffee83051.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>96b770176490</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a2cdc4db43e37e3067c0e9f959621d09963bbbf30ea0353d384e3d54be12db1e" href="../../证据/a2cdc4db43e37e3067c0e9f959621d09963bbbf30ea0353d384e3d54be12db1e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a2cdc4db43e3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1a5a5d62cae635d227309dfd4e2d091bcac4a1c6e8ca493c44bf955ab734d5b2" href="../../证据/1a5a5d62cae635d227309dfd4e2d091bcac4a1c6e8ca493c44bf955ab734d5b2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1a5a5d62cae6</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5b10f73a97dd8903ed4a7ca2710e713d75dbee42ae67dc6e5f43c40e4440f741" href="../../证据/5b10f73a97dd8903ed4a7ca2710e713d75dbee42ae67dc6e5f43c40e4440f741.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5b10f73a97dd</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="869aa9947b1ead414ed5346fa28c2cb6015d80d1bf3fdadcc97e2a22e91010af" href="../../证据/869aa9947b1ead414ed5346fa28c2cb6015d80d1bf3fdadcc97e2a22e91010af.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>869aa9947b1e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PB02 · 结果nModuleID / pInfo[].strParamName / nExecuteCount → 模块输出VmIO的批次重置、循环合并及事件闸门</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ref回调先按nModuleID找模块；SetValue按模块是否IVmModuleSet选择叶IO字典，再以参数名GetHashCode查找各结果目标。计数改变、自执行、禁止循环合并或VmProcedure时，先给每个目标IO更新计数、清_value/_valueList并恢复RaiseValueChanged；同批合并且isCallBack时则先禁止叶IO事件。已匹配参数调用VmIO.SetValueFromServer并置isNull=false；缺失参数走SetValueFromDefault。循环未结束继续抑制事件，结束分支才按门恢复并通知。不能把每次原生结果都等同立即显示一张新图。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“结果nModuleID / pInfo[].strParamName / nExecuteCount → 模块输出VmIO的批次重置、循环合并及事件闸门”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：参数名哈希冲突及全部Group嵌套调度不是本有限切片的验证范围；外部持有者不能由IO批次重置自动清理。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.resources/VM.Core.VmSolution.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89d2fb10c95bdd9ff54a535b4f97c9fcc987f1327fdc16d9e7314cfb75feabe9" href="../../证据/89d2fb10c95bdd9ff54a535b4f97c9fcc987f1327fdc16d9e7314cfb75feabe9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89d2fb10c95b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2d6f6f11a9680b6ffb4ea8675135599b7dac7b1535107202c827f5b04b956eb6" href="../../证据/2d6f6f11a9680b6ffb4ea8675135599b7dac7b1535107202c827f5b04b956eb6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2d6f6f11a968</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PB03 · pImageValue / pChunkValue → VmIO.SetValue → 图像跳过FillData，chunk先填充；同引用入值与排队</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>静态SetValueFromServer按ImageType直接把pImageValue传给SetValue，ChunkType传pChunkValue，ByteType传pByteValue。SetValue只在newValue是chunk描述符枚举且TypeName != image时逐项FillData；图像类型跳过这一步。随后_value=newValue，_valueList首次Add同引用，IsImageIOParent时覆盖第0项，否则追加并标记待合并。needRaiseEvent为true才进入InvokeValueChangedEvent；后者还要RaiseValueChanged且IsOpenSetValueToDisplay，调用MergeIOLoopValue后将_value、ExecuteCount、TypeName装进事件参数并排队。该桥不是把所有图像都先转成独立byte[]再通知。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“pImageValue / pChunkValue → VmIO.SetValue → 图像跳过FillData，chunk先填充；同引用入值与排队”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：MergeIOLoopValue的合并复制与特定图像父节点配置需独立跟踪；这里不把readonly、队列对象或计数相同作为像素稳定保证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.resources/VM.Core.VmIO.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4abe96d7d08d9c3bf9eea1101b6181d923bcf28901bd93391746141d80fcd24c" href="../../证据/4abe96d7d08d9c3bf9eea1101b6181d923bcf28901bd93391746141d80fcd24c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4abe96d7d08d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.resources/VM.Core.VmIO.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fb82810a00fdf90818b819fc84c65e827cba7c40535f978462536c0aa4a8815f" href="../../证据/fb82810a00fdf90818b819fc84c65e827cba7c40535f978462536c0aa4a8815f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fb82810a00fd</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.resources/VM.Core.VmIO.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a38a77ad55f9c9cac1f7bd27332290f8b398165ab78a429295e14dd295c0598c" href="../../证据/a38a77ad55f9c9cac1f7bd27332290f8b398165ab78a429295e14dd295c0598c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a38a77ad55f9</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="409156200ff5c597996caae030992297a4ef8244afe609ccc41e3fe801aa87d0" href="../../证据/409156200ff5c597996caae030992297a4ef8244afe609ccc41e3fe801aa87d0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>409156200ff5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="26ffc9bd7560d3f87d41a3e0e6479f3448554ccedf169178c808a41d1e9706dc" href="../../证据/26ffc9bd7560d3f87d41a3e0e6479f3448554ccedf169178c808a41d1e9706dc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>26ffc9bd7560</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9703828d1a10c3c3888eb36b97a0d3fe11655063a356ee0537df7b1ef0cb00d" href="../../证据/b9703828d1a10c3c3888eb36b97a0d3fe11655063a356ee0537df7b1ef0cb00d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9703828d1a1</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PB04 · SDK NativeData2Data的nParamType 4 / 5 / 6 → 图像描述符、chunk描述符与普通字节结果三种载荷</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>NativeData2Data把type4的pImageValue和type5的pChunkValue分别解析为原生chunk描述符数组，再逐项new托管chunk并调用LargeObject；两者都受isFilter影响。type5在LargeObject报告isExcOccur后把nValueNum置0并break，type4虽传该标志却没有同样清计数分支。type6普通ByteData则逐项new byte[nLen]并Marshal.Copy，把完整数组存hexValue，strValue最多转换前4096字节。因此“结果里有byte[]”必须区分普通ByteData、chunk.GetData物化及ImageData.Buffer，不可混为同一个原生图像对象或统一所有权。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“SDK NativeData2Data的nParamType 4 / 5 / 6 → 图像描述符、chunk描述符与普通字节结果三种载荷”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：VM_M_SetImageEx的第五实参、native缓存描述符、SDK chunk的strValue/pData与ImageData.ExecuteCount之间尚缺同次生产/消费实例的直接桥证据；共享头偏移相似不能填补该缺口。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.resources/VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="75982ae681560945f417bcdbff6a737a2ef9ed951ba7019103b1c7e77dea838f" href="../../证据/75982ae681560945f417bcdbff6a737a2ef9ed951ba7019103b1c7e77dea838f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>75982ae68156</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c9c902246fd4d32a2a93adfbe018a04fe7c2e361f804f05cf9074dd3c77800f" href="../../证据/7c9c902246fd4d32a2a93adfbe018a04fe7c2e361f804f05cf9074dd3c77800f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c9c902246fd</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-payload-bridge.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9e2d89aa6eed812989eee23dc99b4e0c39264a738157bb1299474eeeb4ebb5dc" href="../../证据/9e2d89aa6eed812989eee23dc99b4e0c39264a738157bb1299474eeeb4ebb5dc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9e2d89aa6eed</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OD01 · 原ImageViewBox.ImageDataSource / DoImageSourceChanged → 实际Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource::BuiltImageSourceA</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ImageViewBox的_byte2Image字段与SetImageSource中的CIL调用均指向Apps.BaseData程序集的Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource，不能用VM.Controls或HikPcUI.ImageView同名类替代。ImageSourceChanged调用DoImageSourceChanged，扩展ImageBoxAddition可先处理并返回；默认路径按IsDirectDownSampling进入SetImageSource。SetImageSource根据尺寸/高质量/裁剪分支调用带ref status的9参数BuiltImageSourceA，status=false时提前返回，不赋新Source。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“原ImageViewBox.ImageDataSource / DoImageSourceChanged → 实际Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource::BuiltImageSourceA”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：RenderDataCenter具体对象经哪个binding/桥接成员送进哪一个活ImageViewBox.ImageDataSource，本专项尚未闭合；不能由相同IImageData接口证明实例相同。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ImageBoxAddition扩展覆盖路径、具体运行模式与原生生产者的实例/帧身份仍未知。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-chain.resources/VMBaseControls.il</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dbbeb4d4b3c5bc45230a7726d9a6a8438f9fdb201e43b7ab716296a613b4be36" href="../../证据/dbbeb4d4b3c5bc45230a7726d9a6a8438f9fdb201e43b7ab716296a613b4be36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dbbeb4d4b3c5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-chain.resources/VMBaseControls.ImageViewBox.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="14be856ff4ceb9946be6a1b413f614339cf089f9c0a7ecb048f767ed8d369831" href="../../证据/14be856ff4ceb9946be6a1b413f614339cf089f9c0a7ecb048f767ed8d369831.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>14be856ff4ce</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-chain.resources/VMBaseControls.ImageViewBox.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fe248641baf3eb7b511945285332691b53c731781b0364232b587a57eac19da7" href="../../证据/fe248641baf3eb7b511945285332691b53c731781b0364232b587a57eac19da7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fe248641baf3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-chain.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c50283bdfdbba002f8561060829e43ddad198fe330ff769c26db92d286839a09" href="../../证据/c50283bdfdbba002f8561060829e43ddad198fe330ff769c26db92d286839a09.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c50283bdfdbb</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OD04 · 非direct共享映射读取 → 新byte[]回填同一个IImageData.Buffer</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>9参数BuiltImageSourceA在非direct且像素量可容纳的路径，把GetImageBufferByFileName(...,isDirect:false)返回值直接赋给image.Buffer。该5参数读取体检查映射头busy标记、长度、尺寸及偏移，但不接收期望执行计数；调用HikExternalCall.Common.ExternalCallHelper.IntPtr2Bytes。已另核该真实程序集函数体：new byte[size]后Marshal.Copy，故这是共享像素到独立托管数组的复制。后续Buffer已非null时复用该数组，不因MemoryAddress不变自动重新读取映射。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“非direct共享映射读取 → 新byte[]回填同一个IImageData.Buffer”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：同一Apps.Data.ImageData若跨轮复用，其Buffer由谁清空/替换、是否在其它桥接层比较ExecuteCount仍需追；不能称该普通读取具备direct分支相同计数保护。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：其它4/6参数读取重载、彩色类别转换和3D范围转换有不同内存路径，本事实不扩成全部路径同策略。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-chain.resources/Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6f50906026430792a480d3d8a3dd10d0379aa92cf0481a178f910eb8bc0ba34d" href="../../证据/6f50906026430792a480d3d8a3dd10d0379aa92cf0481a178f910eb8bc0ba34d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6f5090602643</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-chain.resources/Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1b0b27646ef7f14254e5f9824d55200bb624a8c7cac9cb763ee6dee021181e66" href="../../证据/1b0b27646ef7f14254e5f9824d55200bb624a8c7cac9cb763ee6dee021181e66.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1b0b27646ef7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-chain.resources/HikExternalCall.Common.ExternalCallHelper.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2a18e7434fcaf1bd83ae356b30e76055dae632180400b4c8bcbe7ae677e872c0" href="../../证据/2a18e7434fcaf1bd83ae356b30e76055dae632180400b4c8bcbe7ae677e872c0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2a18e7434fca</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-chain.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9d8bbd2dfd506ab5d849ec30dc714b5c772fdfc1ae1dd0f95d91bc26dc0497ae" href="../../证据/9d8bbd2dfd506ab5d849ec30dc714b5c772fdfc1ae1dd0f95d91bc26dc0497ae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9d8bbd2dfd50</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-chain.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ba1bdd67a80905a74addff21b1c5f509c400ad9e35e0cc9f0d1b6d3b5996714e" href="../../证据/ba1bdd67a80905a74addff21b1c5f509c400ad9e35e0cc9f0d1b6d3b5996714e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ba1bdd67a809</small></a></details></details><details><summary>IF05 · ClearImageView / RenderControlBase_Unloaded / DeInitRenderControl → 清引用、退委托不撤销已经排队的工作</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>已核选定ClearImageView调用Init/UpdateImageView(null)或清输入图属性，Unloaded退掉OnSetImageEnd与OnFreshExtendContent委托，DeInitRenderControl解除显示事件/过滤并清临时字典。对应CIL中没有等待此前两条Task.Run返回句柄、DispatcherOperation.Abort或取消token操作；Task调用点又没有保留该句柄。这些动作因此不能作为已排队闭包不再持有控件、不能再读当前状态/调用更新的证明。下一次源为空的ImageViewBox回调仍是自己的同步清显示/通知旧新图像事件链，不构成上游工作排空屏障。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“ClearImageView / RenderControlBase_Unloaded / DeInitRenderControl → 清引用、退委托不撤销已经排队的工作”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不能仅凭选定体没有取消调用断言原程序全局不存在排空；进程/父窗口关闭及其它所有者仍需独立追踪。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未观察原机清空/卸载与回调竞争，实际过期呈现、异常或内存滞留是否发生及概率均未知。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-bridge.resources/VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7d7afaa970ff293867d8433b7a2c928034fcc825014319e70217311efca824c6" href="../../证据/7d7afaa970ff293867d8433b7a2c928034fcc825014319e70217311efca824c6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7d7afaa970ff</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-bridge.resources/VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="082a0c5ec0406be63609eef5d74c6986ad54d58573b288b7a1b79c91ef63c6e0" href="../../证据/082a0c5ec0406be63609eef5d74c6986ad54d58573b288b7a1b79c91ef63c6e0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>082a0c5ec040</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-bridge.resources/VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4a0e69fc64e8d8bc3928e2823cf101adb9afce695fff0925bb654003f20ecd73" href="../../证据/4a0e69fc64e8d8bc3928e2823cf101adb9afce695fff0925bb654003f20ecd73.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4a0e69fc64e8</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-chain.resources/VMBaseControls.ImageViewBox.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f79b7aa4dd3be6f1aaf38f2e4165e935a728084fe9234860e2aa01d0fcccd62" href="../../证据/0f79b7aa4dd3be6f1aaf38f2e4165e935a728084fe9234860e2aa01d0fcccd62.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f79b7aa4dd3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/display-inflight.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b6182a448c5c6c986f312d9ecb7aadb3990f97f9a0268888a74e8adbeedc6c8f" href="../../证据/b6182a448c5c6c986f312d9ecb7aadb3990f97f9a0268888a74e8adbeedc6c8f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b6182a448c5c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/display-inflight.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d5728187da701944d236a970b43a86c0e474b7329b6f7cec8d3ba3295bf3887d" href="../../证据/d5728187da701944d236a970b43a86c0e474b7329b6f7cec8d3ba3295bf3887d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d5728187da70</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/display-inflight.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="988f78a56eea29d995487d2f0b741458cd3d008a43602b65935910c2cbb1cbe8" href="../../证据/988f78a56eea29d995487d2f0b741458cd3d008a43602b65935910c2cbb1cbe8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>988f78a56eea</small></a></details></details><details><summary>MF01 · 原VM_M_SetImageEx导出 → 像素指针、长度与第五实参共享名继续向内转发</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>安装目录ModuleProxy/x64/ModuleFrame.dll的原PE将VM_M_SetImageEx绑定RVA0x1312f0。入口检查context、参数名、图像描述和第五实参均非空；从描述+0取像素指针、+8取uint长度。0x180131377–1392汇编把第五入口实参转为后续调用第七参数（调用前[RSP+0x30]），长度放[RSP+0x20]，计算的flag放[RSP+0x28]，随后调用0x122a40。它不是只有伪码显示的四参调用；NB03的额外共享名在这个静态接收候选中未被丢弃。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“原VM_M_SetImageEx导出 → 像素指针、长度与第五实参共享名继续向内转发”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：两DLL导入/导出名和ABI建立静态候选关系；原运行实例的装载解析、同帧/同计数及SDK接收对象仍未闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1801312f0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="21977c3babe7256b43cf918eb4ef92f9be33b5a0a216f78b07cd01e49ffc56fc" href="../../证据/21977c3babe7256b43cf918eb4ef92f9be33b5a0a216f78b07cd01e49ffc56fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>21977c3babe7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1801312f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c39220ac9f972d07bc79581747aa311024b2feb141fb81289a82bb530c48904d" href="../../证据/c39220ac9f972d07bc79581747aa311024b2feb141fb81289a82bb530c48904d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c39220ac9f97</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1801312f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="71737fd27421fdeb784265158cefd4783d9c6c907f1bb97c3ab65dc27feccf89" href="../../证据/71737fd27421fdeb784265158cefd4783d9c6c907f1bb97c3ab65dc27feccf89.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>71737fd27421</small></a></details></details><details><summary>MF04 · 原导出与内部函数返回值 → 按汇编保留错误码，不按伪码void解释成无返回</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>本次Ghidra把若干带安全cookie尾调用的函数显示成void；SetImageEx汇编却在内部调用后把EAX保存到R14D，尾部恢复EAX，非法入口分支置0xe0000001，再调用cookie校验。已恢复的0x1e8810在正常返回分支只操作RCX/标志，不改EAX。0xc99f0也显式返回错误码，模块查不到返回0xe0000003。故不能依据void伪码丢失错误传播；本条不补异常/fast-fail返回的假值。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“原导出与内部函数返回值 → 按汇编保留错误码，不按伪码void解释成无返回”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：正常返回路径的EAX已核；异常、cookie失败、日志异常和完整回滚仍未验证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1801312f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="986deb603a08e69d310eedb875c2706bcaac643f28f1e9359c663db7a2f1fae1" href="../../证据/986deb603a08e69d310eedb875c2706bcaac643f28f1e9359c663db7a2f1fae1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>986deb603a08</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1801e8810.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="285353db9d73a49f2fe7a9cc023c18f21d88c437b7c6f6a06a52456134e2e99b" href="../../证据/285353db9d73a49f2fe7a9cc023c18f21d88c437b7c6f6a06a52456134e2e99b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>285353db9d73</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1800c99f0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e78966107c87955e1d8befc29130d32b07d6fb5d64b6ea1d68e95401cd7db4f8" href="../../证据/e78966107c87955e1d8befc29130d32b07d6fb5d64b6ea1d68e95401cd7db4f8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e78966107c87</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/180131190.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="50b86915164bf0972692a365cdf3c9131c1b3640f6a06aef1b770ca2a77874a8" href="../../证据/50b86915164bf0972692a365cdf3c9131c1b3640f6a06aef1b770ca2a77874a8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>50b86915164b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX06 · 复合type4分支 → 图像字节进入2b2e0及VM_M_SetGlobalVarImageEx，排除PointSet误归类</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>28250的类型4将+0x118视作0x60描述数组，逐项取pointer/+8长度与下标，调用2b2e0。该helper日志set image start/end，正常申请0x145c0缓冲成功且pointer/handle均非0后，memcpy_s复制输入长度字节到新buffer，并设置局部描述长度。汇编确认调用ImageEx前RCX=context+8、RDX名称、R8D下标、R9=&amp;局部描述；第五栈参数是0x145c0返回的handle，第六字节继承helper入口第六字节（上游由LockStatus返回AL写入）。伪码显示四参不等于handle/第六字节丢失。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“复合type4分支 → 图像字节进入2b2e0及VM_M_SetGlobalVarImageEx，排除PointSet误归类”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：0x145c0分配/复用、ImageEx对handle的保留与释放未取；无原版设备/SDK运行佐证。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：PointSet原生最终存储路径仍未知，不能由类型4或图像分支补齐。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180028250.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="055473846a95f55149afdcd543d0c4bff8f73638368e2477f1a846abd95be06c" href="../../证据/055473846a95f55149afdcd543d0c4bff8f73638368e2477f1a846abd95be06c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>055473846a95</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180028250.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="51f10ad48da32e80dd0f4af7b01d755c17c509c844b2b1b777457d74cc2bfca8" href="../../证据/51f10ad48da32e80dd0f4af7b01d755c17c509c844b2b1b777457d74cc2bfca8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>51f10ad48da3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18002b2e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="30b86306e19395d6e4f90a0f5ca150fe1d26c5e800bb0e88dd46e9768caa0b36" href="../../证据/30b86306e19395d6e4f90a0f5ca150fe1d26c5e800bb0e88dd46e9768caa0b36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>30b86306e193</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18002b2e0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2a0295241428c364e4b39908d28a0c299c50a594bbaf5108a1a5bd5ee7901423" href="../../证据/2a0295241428c364e4b39908d28a0c299c50a594bbaf5108a1a5bd5ee7901423.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2a0295241428</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG08 · Group显示累积与GroupDisplayLinks → GrayImage每轮替换及返回只读列表容器</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Add显示先找本轮WorkflowDisplays同名值，list不存在则创建；!spec.Accumulate或spec.Kind==GrayImage时先从displayCount减去旧元素数并frames.Clear，再执行百万元素资源门与AddRange(values)。条件仅精确GrayImage，不能泛称所有Image kind。Clear移除旧PortValue引用而不Dispose payload。FinishDisplays用每个frames.ToArray+Array.AsReadOnly并新字典。自动输出显示只支持GrayImage，LinkedOutputId对应输出稳定ID，同步NodeId/Port/Kind/Cardinality。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“Group显示累积与GroupDisplayLinks → GrayImage每轮替换及返回只读列表容器”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本slice没有运行UI，未证明Group图像帧与宿主renderer同次刷新、最后读者或灰度以外图像Kind的预期语义。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2050611182ab179c24209d2a45f425c3f04e66cbe6c28a2429f71120ffdc4ef4" href="../../证据/2050611182ab179c24209d2a45f425c3f04e66cbe6c28a2429f71120ffdc4ef4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2050611182ab</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupOutputAccumulator.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3ee5478776bae14f5fd28f59cb0429f62f45a8961bdc93f26976e7be87312525" href="../../证据/3ee5478776bae14f5fd28f59cb0429f62f45a8961bdc93f26976e7be87312525.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3ee5478776ba</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GroupDisplayLinks.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="53c8672caca61d58cd3f692290125d5ef2085f6225d3d84c1d0e943eda934386" href="../../证据/53c8672caca61d58cd3f692290125d5ef2085f6225d3d84c1d0e943eda934386.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>53c8672caca6</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR01 · ProcedureConfigControl.OnSolutionChanged → 关闭当前参数窗后替换DecoratorSolution</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Solution依赖属性变化回调先看curTabControlBase是否为IsClosing=false的BaseWindow，仅该门通过才Close当前参数窗；新方案非null时创建新的VmSolutionDecorator并设DecorateSource，否则把DecoratorSolution置null。所选体对old solution的if块为空，没有直接调用旧decorator.Dispose、ClearDataStore或图像释放。这个外层入口不可用窗口关闭名补成渲染对象全部回收。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“ProcedureConfigControl.OnSolutionChanged → 关闭当前参数窗后替换DecoratorSolution”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：当前活宿主是否发生该DP变化、窗口是否确实关闭及该窗口卸载后的显示源解绑顺序未运行确认。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：旧DecoratorSolution是否另由集合/容器清理，尚未取得完整caller到payload退出的绑定链。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c2b817b6d084684144af5adda8ed4677df62b39912b63164bb1bb2c23264719" href="../../证据/7c2b817b6d084684144af5adda8ed4677df62b39912b63164bb1bb2c23264719.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c2b817b6d08</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR02 · ProcedureConfigControl流程容器更换/Remove/Reset → 解除集合订阅、移除装饰项与条件清选中项</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>OnProceduresChanged对旧集合RemoveHandler并ClearProcedures，对新集合先Remove再Add CollectionChanged handler，随后按复制状态重新AddProcedures。ClearProcedures调用ResetDisposeStatus把IsDisposeNotify先true再false，再清DecoratedProcedures/DecoratedModules。Remove通知逐来源移除匹配装饰项，并仅在OldItems含当前DecorateSource时把SelectedItem/SelectedTabItem置null；Reset调用ClearProcedures。所选体没有逐装饰项调用Dispose。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“ProcedureConfigControl流程容器更换/Remove/Reset → 解除集合订阅、移除装饰项与条件清选中项”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：已定位SearchDryPopup一个消费者及其退搜索事件行为；其它消费者与Release包装Dispose的更外层caller仍未闭合；包装层到MainViewControl的直接调用另见OR07。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：单模块删除的所有选择同步和全部UI消费者未闭合；不能以流程集合Remove代表所有模块删除都已清屏。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="00d457f9c26d3f5ab484cec8cd7b4ae35ef605a9760cb4d48263d8ca3fa1d4c1" href="../../证据/00d457f9c26d3f5ab484cec8cd7b4ae35ef605a9760cb4d48263d8ca3fa1d4c1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>00d457f9c26d</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b3898d7c62c8cb38b954ff3b62dac37630237c6e5ff9f3461568c2812e066a90" href="../../证据/b3898d7c62c8cb38b954ff3b62dac37630237c6e5ff9f3461568c2812e066a90.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b3898d7c62c8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR03 · 参数窗Closed → CurTabControlBase_Closed → 清窗引用/Tag，关闭参数与ROI状态</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>参数窗创建后以WeakEventManager登记Closed。Closed处理使用Dispatcher.Invoke把curTabControlBase置null；ROIPartUI若是ModuleResultView只把其Tag置null，随后IsOpenParams=false、SetRoiVisible(false)，再让Undo服务RemoveEmptyOperation。这个所见关闭尾部没有把ModuleSource或ImageDataSource置null，也没有调用ClearDataStore/Decorator.Dispose。关参数窗不能直接读成清除主界面图像/历史结果。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“参数窗Closed → CurTabControlBase_Closed → 清窗引用/Tag，关闭参数与ROI状态”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：专用配置窗口内部Unloaded/DisposeFunction以及已排队的显示任务退出，必须按对应控件另核；本轮不扩为所有插件配置窗通用合同。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="93898410662c6b97fb675542cd19b3e39cfad78e2cb67aea50b2cddfd76a5ead" href="../../证据/93898410662c6b97fb675542cd19b3e39cfad78e2cb67aea50b2cddfd76a5ead.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>93898410662c</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9f7a6dac7969a6a699b7329d1771030b2068b76c0ee858677fc684624b2dd3e2" href="../../证据/9f7a6dac7969a6a699b7329d1771030b2068b76c0ee858677fc684624b2dd3e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9f7a6dac7969</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3a8cdd39e8b6fc1b41ee906288da9c31581ea6ea1c903cb69b06b5bb5aabcc50" href="../../证据/3a8cdd39e8b6fc1b41ee906288da9c31581ea6ea1c903cb69b06b5bb5aabcc50.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3a8cdd39e8b6</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR04 · VmModule.Dispose → CommonDispose → VmIO.Dispose → 撤关联/移出模型及交SDK关闭模块；IO值字段不由Dispose直接清空</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>VmModule.Dispose先设置IsOnDispose并拒绝重复disposedValue；清变量关联、可选导出Undo数据、删除内部模块、解除前后继与参数绑定，然后CommonDispose。CommonDispose反向删除NextModules、调用父UnSubInnerModule，再逆序Dispose每个Inputs/Outputs。VmIO.Dispose对子项递归Dispose，CollectionParent.Remove(this)、RelateIO=null、disposedValue=true；所选体没有直接写_value或_valueList。模块随后移出父Modules与AllModules，再CloseModuleInterface→SDK CloseOneModule。删除结构/断IO关系和结果载荷最后读者不是同一保证。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“VmModule.Dispose → CommonDispose → VmIO.Dispose → 撤关联/移出模型及交SDK关闭模块；IO值字段不由Dispose直接清空”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：CloseOneModule底层句柄/缓冲退出、删除后旧显示装饰器是否收到换源通知及所有最后读者未在本切片闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：异常时IsOnDispose复位不等于前面已完成的IO/模型移除具有事务回滚。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="98325eb622fb846ab24011862147528546677679475fbaa0f290d95a8fff8b14" href="../../证据/98325eb622fb846ab24011862147528546677679475fbaa0f290d95a8fff8b14.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>98325eb622fb</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="192d0c48cf23b0dfb6648ad107c5d2d0bb30c7dbc9a00e81e39231fc5ead23ad" href="../../证据/192d0c48cf23b0dfb6648ad107c5d2d0bb30c7dbc9a00e81e39231fc5ead23ad.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>192d0c48cf23</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmIO.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4ee346131170998897f7bc32318819e5ad8d4076be063cf50cab1056eaec4d9" href="../../证据/f4ee346131170998897f7bc32318819e5ad8d4076be063cf50cab1056eaec4d9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4ee34613117</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR06 · MainViewControl.Dispose可调用入口 → 仅将其模板ModuleResultView.ModuleSource设null</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>OnApplyTemplate把m_ModuleView取为ModuleResultView，Dispose仅在mrv非null时将ModuleSource置null。该属性后续若实际发生变化，可关联已有V02的旧decorator清理；本体没有调用RenderThreadPool.ShutDown，也没有直接清所有图层/历史仓。本轮已定位Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose的直接调用（OR07）；该Release.Dispose在具体退出/换方案场景中的更外层caller仍未闭合，不能宣称每次切方案/主窗关闭都必经。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“MainViewControl.Dispose可调用入口 → 仅将其模板ModuleResultView.ModuleSource设null”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：初始三个PE的5630个有体方法查得0直接引用，仅是有限scope；随后补入Release层986个方法并定位VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose直接调用（OR07）。它的更外层caller、224个接口候选和动态分派仍未知，不能声称每次切方案/关主窗都已释放图像。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/MainViewControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5589d054d5bc9b53856ce77058a6e8bc400162bebb22cb8dbb69df6978fb70ab" href="../../证据/5589d054d5bc9b53856ce77058a6e8bc400162bebb22cb8dbb69df6978fb70ab.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5589d054d5bc</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/MainViewControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="638d5cb8db93a568ccddf6f2efc05a5c7f53ab0685a70768b75a1ba15239360b" href="../../证据/638d5cb8db93a568ccddf6f2efc05a5c7f53ab0685a70768b75a1ba15239360b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>638d5cb8db93</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-retirement.resources/caller-scan.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f84264f50a87cc472c6d5251bb01e2fc01298aaa4da39d2f54f37548e583c7f" href="../../证据/4f84264f50a87cc472c6d5251bb01e2fc01298aaa4da39d2f54f37548e583c7f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f84264f50a8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR02 · RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes批量裁剪 → 删除记录在Dispose之前完成；首个异常中断剩余裁剪</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>RemoveNode在root.gate内先删除effectiveParameters键，再从states.Remove取出value；离锁后仅当value实现IDisposable才Dispose，没有catch和RecordCleanupFailure。Dispose抛错时该node状态及参数已从这些字典移除，调用直接失败；重复RemoveNode找不到state就return，不自动重试旧对象。RetainProcedureNodes先批量删除不在keep中的全部参数键，再快照待移state键并foreach RemoveNode；其中一项抛错将中断剩余foreach，后续state仍可留在states，而其参数键可能已在第一阶段删除。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes批量裁剪 → 删除记录在Dispose之前完成；首个异常中断剩余裁剪”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：WPF doc.Changed等上层对传播异常如何显示/恢复需按调用者另追；本切片不宣称文档编辑或整个solution关闭必然失败。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe已观测有限顺序Remove/Retain异常；并发与真实资源异常未观测，本条仍按源码关系取证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="80b4324b185bc5c252fc1a846b24bf4987606dc2a6bd71d5158b013e72497566" href="../../证据/80b4324b185bc5c252fc1a846b24bf4987606dc2a6bd71d5158b013e72497566.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>80b4324b185b</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0bbb7367df0c905d24020ff5ff34dbeba70df59ec4e7bbde034b690f21abeb95" href="../../证据/0bbb7367df0c905d24020ff5ff34dbeba70df59ec4e7bbde034b690f21abeb95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0bbb7367df0c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="38deced2927f8aa66655a09c85876f006fe64220ac9e266292c5008d9042b661" href="../../证据/38deced2927f8aa66655a09c85876f006fe64220ac9e266292c5008d9042b661.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>38deced2927f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR03 · root closing置位与API准入 / 租约 → 立即拒新状态与租约，不等于所有查询/删除都禁用</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>root Dispose在gate下先设置closing=true再调用stopping.Cancel；State&lt;T>、RegisterService、Enter与参数Parameters入口均以closing抛ObjectDisposedException。与之不同，Service&lt;T>只锁gate查询，无closing检查：若活跃租约阻止Release清字典，它仍可在closing期间返回旧服务；Release清空后则返回null。ForProcedure只验证procedure字符串，可以继续生成borrowed view；RequestRun/RequestRefresh在closing直接返回。RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes没有closing或leases门，故root完整Release等待租约不能被概括成任何节点移除/替换都受同一租约保护。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“root closing置位与API准入 / 租约 → 立即拒新状态与租约，不等于所有查询/删除都禁用”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：代码未给出所有方法的全域并发安全保证；不将允许调用某查询/Remove的事实解释为对资源在用状态必然安全。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：stopping.Token在CancellationTokenSource已Dispose之后的外部访问合同未在这里运行验证，不作应用级行为推断。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b00ffd9614c944e8c9a5abb9477401b86b04667d03783a92c8ba7c428d2f24e5" href="../../证据/b00ffd9614c944e8c9a5abb9477401b86b04667d03783a92c8ba7c428d2f24e5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b00ffd9614c9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c1fdec128386617fb806271f04cf9c49ebc3ffb414286470b3d305f549a896a6" href="../../证据/c1fdec128386617fb806271f04cf9c49ebc3ffb414286470b3d305f549a896a6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c1fdec128386</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9b1bc69960793ee8cd7c99ab26caa9bb4333ad6075fb47d931d735f7494e5e5e" href="../../证据/9b1bc69960793ee8cd7c99ab26caa9bb4333ad6075fb47d931d735f7494e5e5e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9b1bc6996079</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9bdb5ada7a12a4eb3889a4bf900f9c7482008d0490a4d04017f3d5118683c81" href="../../证据/b9bdb5ada7a12a4eb3889a4bf900f9c7482008d0490a4d04017f3d5118683c81.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9bdb5ada7a1</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4091fd40ad598f1bef1ca79035d29af8d004e4c17e7f12659d90fd5e779afeba" href="../../证据/4091fd40ad598f1bef1ca79035d29af8d004e4c17e7f12659d90fd5e779afeba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4091fd40ad59</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2fb74670d574a271d0cb5235bcc52177ff5b4839e9c22fdcb02759751e179343" href="../../证据/2fb74670d574a271d0cb5235bcc52177ff5b4839e9c22fdcb02759751e179343.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2fb74670d574</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.Parameters.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da16abd392367c1273981da0cd67a30389675f77d48ba998c04ea64931f8e9b1" href="../../证据/da16abd392367c1273981da0cd67a30389675f77d48ba998c04ea64931f8e9b1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da16abd39236</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR04 · 取消或资源Dispose异常后的root Dispose / Lease.Exit → root清理是一次性尝试；failedResources保留不等于排队重试</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Dispose设置closing后，stopping.Cancel抛Exception会RecordCleanupFailure(cancel,stopping,error)，finally仍设置cancellationComplete并TryRelease；不是因取消回调异常就跳过该finally。TryRelease要求closing、cancellationComplete、leases==0且!releaseStarted，在真正Release前置releaseStarted=true。Release对各IDisposable的Exception分别记录后继续下一资源，并单独尝试stopping.Dispose；这点现有CR06已有，本事实新增明确重试边界：root重复Dispose因closing立即return，后续Exit也因releaseStarted不再启动第二遍，failedResources只保留对象，所选类没有重试/清空该表的方法。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“取消或资源Dispose异常后的root Dispose / Lease.Exit → root清理是一次性尝试；failedResources保留不等于排队重试”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不把源码Exception catch扩大为任何OOM、进程退出或任意RecordCleanupFailure自身失败时也必完整清理。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本条是源码静态事实；另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限异常与重复Dispose。GC、真实资源/GUI/设备及native释放未观测，不以幂等调用门推成功释放/原版等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="25130754904625cadcdad559712b1e9298d053ebf76c32aa1fd99c72476ca2de" href="../../证据/25130754904625cadcdad559712b1e9298d053ebf76c32aa1fd99c72476ca2de.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>251307549046</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f2e6a8876eda1fe94b3bfcc7876c5a9418ec89c22b3f630b0946e517cf0c13a0" href="../../证据/f2e6a8876eda1fe94b3bfcc7876c5a9418ec89c22b3f630b0946e517cf0c13a0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f2e6a8876eda</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="61daf69cd32d9631373aa1e2980f2bcdfb5c67b3667360b8d8ac2aca74c61898" href="../../证据/61daf69cd32d9631373aa1e2980f2bcdfb5c67b3667360b8d8ac2aca74c61898.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>61daf69cd32d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188" href="../../证据/310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>310faafd8596</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd2d67c66bdbf31088a906a44fad23a3cec8952a95b0b9cae68c729032eb3644" href="../../证据/bd2d67c66bdbf31088a906a44fad23a3cec8952a95b0b9cae68c729032eb3644.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd2d67c66bdb</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ca8fde56b8897ea11321f59623422ce5471c7fe1eda7a67886f3d360b0e0a7ba" href="../../证据/ca8fde56b8897ea11321f59623422ce5471c7fe1eda7a67886f3d360b0e0a7ba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ca8fde56b889</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0564c5545b60182cc37a0c1578d6e328f22f0eb5693b954dd058b2adf97291f7" href="../../证据/0564c5545b60182cc37a0c1578d6e328f22f0eb5693b954dd058b2adf97291f7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0564c5545b60</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR07 · Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose → 退宿主事件 → MainViewControl.Dispose → Content=null</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>已恢复的Release包装层Dispose先调用自身Unloaded处理以解除方案事件，再解除RestoreDefaultDisplay，mainViewControl非null才调用其Dispose，最后Content=null。新PE扫描确认其method token 0x06000038、IL offset 40的call目标正是VMControls.WPF.MainViewControl.Dispose（MemberRef 0x0a000086），不是接口候选猜测。保留shell MainWindow.xaml实例化Release控件、该控件XAML嵌入普通MainViewControl的声明，原三份对应BAML资源已重取。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose → 退宿主事件 → MainViewControl.Dispose → Content=null”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：谁在具体关闭主窗/切方案操作中调用Release.Dispose尚未定位，不能由XAML构造或IDisposable实现推自动调用。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原生像素与显示最后读者、全部异常退出和主宿主实际运行顺序仍未知。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF.Release/VMControls.WPF.Release/VmMainViewConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="83ecb93cd769f476908429cb9afae47c53089dcb0427541083e4fa6da98437d2" href="../../证据/83ecb93cd769f476908429cb9afae47c53089dcb0427541083e4fa6da98437d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>83ecb93cd769</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF.Release/VMControls.WPF.Release/VmMainViewConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="73ecf41af0f60dcfd6a249a43574603d39062fc1dca784a4f009a7b5018bb077" href="../../证据/73ecf41af0f60dcfd6a249a43574603d39062fc1dca784a4f009a7b5018bb077.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>73ecf41af0f6</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF.Release/VMControls.WPF.Release/VmMainViewConfigControl.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e9067eaea4f5e89982cc527d195dbe1f78ee22579d692b30cdca13df2dc3bbd8" href="../../证据/e9067eaea4f5e89982cc527d195dbe1f78ee22579d692b30cdca13df2dc3bbd8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e9067eaea4f5</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VisionMasterMain/VisionMasterMain/MainWindow.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0ebc66bd488b52189414bc307634f3d5e79ce68f3cff777b8ced50e1e029fec0" href="../../证据/0ebc66bd488b52189414bc307634f3d5e79ce68f3cff777b8ced50e1e029fec0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0ebc66bd488b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-retirement.resources/caller-scan.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4abac833528f5b0715a470f4cc497e7bcf6d56e9d6a9e3c17f2c333745fae47f" href="../../证据/4abac833528f5b0715a470f4cc497e7bcf6d56e9d6a9e3c17f2c333745fae47f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4abac833528f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR08 · ResetDisposeStatus → ZoomArea SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify → true通知只解除搜索控件事件，不调用图像Dispose</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ProcedureConfigControl.ResetDisposeStatus将IsDisposeNotify先true再false。保留ZoomArea.xaml将祖先ProcedureConfigControl的该属性绑定到DryPopup.IsDisposeNotify；该DP注册OnDisposeStatusChanged，只有NewValue=true才DeleteSelf。DeleteSelf解除TextBox的TextChanged/LostFocus/GotFocus、清除按钮Click及宿主Window的LocationChanged/Deactivated，再_window=null。所选完整体没有调用MainViewControl.Dispose，不清图像或模块结果；这条通知不能再被当成图像释放触发器。</p><p>ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者：这条既有事实明确核实“ResetDisposeStatus → ZoomArea SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify → true通知只解除搜索控件事件，不调用图像Dispose”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像链已有大量有限事实，但两个原版显示分支、ROI字节/坐标、设计运行控件和native生产者不能按同名对象拼接；未闭合跨实例边继续未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：当前只闭合一个静态模板消费者；原模板是否在特定宿主激活、其它IsDisposeNotify消费者与重复模板应用生命周期未穷举。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bcb889050a265f1870abb13b3ab1b318eed6a9eb06785198195020b8a080c0ff" href="../../证据/bcb889050a265f1870abb13b3ab1b318eed6a9eb06785198195020b8a080c0ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bcb889050a26</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/ZoomArea.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6c123919bc5efd7c2bdc048e1b8cb9cf4d6c476870c450d4d7bef4af9d2d0e4a" href="../../证据/6c123919bc5efd7c2bdc048e1b8cb9cf4d6c476870c450d4d7bef4af9d2d0e4a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6c123919bc5e</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/SearchDryPopup.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ed6af86cce4a8dd11a4097977d5462e346a80b108c355664866e83db91c8ca68" href="../../证据/ed6af86cce4a8dd11a4097977d5462e346a80b108c355664866e83db91c8ca68.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ed6af86cce4a</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/SearchDryPopup.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="065d575258ee3d838663c92a4fdaa6b4f35eccf1552d936ff60156b8555665cd" href="../../证据/065d575258ee3d838663c92a4fdaa6b4f35eccf1552d936ff60156b8555665cd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>065d575258ee</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>results-roi:V09 · ROISelecter.SetValue → 写权限 / 字节变化 → 参数/序列/预执行</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>AccessMode必须含w；NormalizeReversParse后与PreValue字节序列比较，变化才写PreValue/CurValueA、可选图像尺寸、SetParamUnit、SetRoiSeq、PreExecuteRun。没有变化不走预执行，不虚构每次鼠标事件都会执行。</p><p>计划将B06归入F-20，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab/ROISelecter.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9152c1eda48ae6add4d444acd032aa2261595454887b45ad12ab817926756edd" href="../../证据/9152c1eda48ae6add4d444acd032aa2261595454887b45ad12ab817926756edd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9152c1eda48a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>results-roi:V19 · SetImageToStore → 选中图、叠加键、输入图及共享ImageData.Tag</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>SelectedImage.DisplayObject同一obj时按SelectedImage键写入Value as ImageData；非null图直接修改其Tag为当时DisplayName，没有图像克隆。否则按obj.Owner模块Name+本地化obj.Name形成键，仅CheckImagesName包含时入仓。输入图判断是独立if，因此同一事件可另写SelectedInputImage键。可写null图像，TryGetImage成功不等于值非null。</p><p>此边在C03任务正式映射中；这里跨域引用其明确数据动作“SetImageToStore → 选中图、叠加键、输入图及共享ImageData.Tag”用于ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者，不是把这些任务重新归入F-20或宣称该域完成。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。图像缓冲/像素所有权、Owner实际类型、名称/语言变化和Tag其他消费者未知。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ba906885db291c76e32a1063a1d2480d24b75bd6fdf32d7d425277b000c7721a" href="../../证据/ba906885db291c76e32a1063a1d2480d24b75bd6fdf32d7d425277b000c7721a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ba906885db29</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a63b2746561ff8433224fbe18a504d47be72f4d29b7aa902d28d5eef33f96e95" href="../../证据/a63b2746561ff8433224fbe18a504d47be72f4d29b7aa902d28d5eef33f96e95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a63b2746561f</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/RenderDataCenter.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1a5944b78f616cbe44a41cdfe33839591b72ef152b766f66680cbcfc4cab5ff0" href="../../证据/1a5944b78f616cbe44a41cdfe33839591b72ef152b766f66680cbcfc4cab5ff0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1a5944b78f61</small></a></details></details><details><summary>results-roi:V20 · BeforeExchange / IsBusy → 固定标记与三组字典引用交换</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>BeforeExchange先比较executeCount==SpareExecuteCount，再写FixedExcuteCount，仅置对应NeedFixedSpare或NeedFixed为true，不主动清另一个标记；IsBusy是二者或值。ExchangeBuffer按isSpare交换显示仓与备用/缓冲仓的两个字典引用，没有深拷贝、清空旧显示仓或交换执行计数。该结构是显示/缓冲/备用三组，不称只有双仓。</p><p>此边在C03任务正式映射中；这里跨域引用其明确数据动作“BeforeExchange / IsBusy → 固定标记与三组字典引用交换”用于ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者，不是把这些任务重新归入F-20或宣称该域完成。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。所有跨线程时序与同时置位的实际可达状态未证明。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="665bce9ff628bb20313502fff369383954bf3b3cc400d80b89d6dc346c142288" href="../../证据/665bce9ff628bb20313502fff369383954bf3b3cc400d80b89d6dc346c142288.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>665bce9ff628</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="61327634607ce72982e3e0db375640a5bcc2c3595d112dcf49dc0f573051b1ec" href="../../证据/61327634607ce72982e3e0db375640a5bcc2c3595d112dcf49dc0f573051b1ec.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>61327634607c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="127919c01368afdd12430a2a8c8204d5960fc3b168ee8005a4da2897df50f4ba" href="../../证据/127919c01368afdd12430a2a8c8204d5960fc3b168ee8005a4da2897df50f4ba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>127919c01368</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/RenderDataCenter.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d9267b6d8d280f0faccd760a09ca6b7ecaec34e48de0fb52115b19b8d3734bdd" href="../../证据/d9267b6d8d280f0faccd760a09ca6b7ecaec34e48de0fb52115b19b8d3734bdd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d9267b6d8d28</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/RenderDataCenter.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="06cb0ba373d04097d9bce3d0953781e83b84ba666cde57fbfdd63f59efbdc9ea" href="../../证据/06cb0ba373d04097d9bce3d0953781e83b84ba666cde57fbfdd63f59efbdc9ea.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>06cb0ba373d0</small></a></details></details><details><summary>results-roi:V24 · UpdateRender / RenderThreadPool.AsyncRun闭包 → 流程分支的装饰器身份门与各UI闭包差异</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>入口图像源null则清isRendering，先BeforeExchange，再把当前m_CurrentInfo作为AsyncRun状态参数。worker先比较moduleDecorator==当前装饰器才Exchange；等待结束后未立即重查身份，随后核!isclose且当前装饰器非null。主图仓须TryGetImage成功且图不同，不核Tag；两个主图Invoke都再比较装饰器身份，不同时清isRendering，相同时赋图/扩展回调并置hasRendered=true，均无关闭复检。回退门是!hasRendered且SelectedImage.DisplayObject为Object，并非image==null；GetValue(uint.MaxValue)所得图变化才Invoke，第二主图Invoke另置needActiveUpdateShapes=true。输入图须!hasRendered、双图、取图成功且图变化，其Invoke只赋当前输入图，不核身份/关闭，也不置hasRendered，因此仍可随后清DisplayStore。列表/树BeginInvoke只核!isclose。worker catch仅日志，无finally清状态；不能把主图身份门推广到整链。</p><p>此边在C03任务正式映射中；这里跨域引用其明确数据动作“UpdateRender / RenderThreadPool.AsyncRun闭包 → 流程分支的装饰器身份门与各UI闭包差异”用于ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者，不是把这些任务重新归入F-20或宣称该域完成。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。线程池/完成回调已有V25–V32有限恢复；完整取消、Worker等待期间切源以及最终呈现仍未知；当前实现generation门不等同原版此分支。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f8315e1cf366ab19087b4981a8334f9262cb0d0935778d6453582f4ba7aba5a" href="../../证据/0f8315e1cf366ab19087b4981a8334f9262cb0d0935778d6453582f4ba7aba5a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f8315e1cf36</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f3208c0a9ff164efad9167df40894bbf4854182c8d120f69f8e1211081dfa57e" href="../../证据/f3208c0a9ff164efad9167df40894bbf4854182c8d120f69f8e1211081dfa57e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f3208c0a9ff1</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="539425960088ec337de1d37b3734e1a7403b72d8fe5be2f3409b47262f2c93be" href="../../证据/539425960088ec337de1d37b3734e1a7403b72d8fe5be2f3409b47262f2c93be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>539425960088</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87eee17e980defbc365be8d47e7d7b07d110d1519029f06702c3254d75cd1fbb" href="../../证据/87eee17e980defbc365be8d47e7d7b07d110d1519029f06702c3254d75cd1fbb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87eee17e980d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3731429e7c05a5fa366364d677175084dce5fb5368d978e66a988b91c0d2b683" href="../../证据/3731429e7c05a5fa366364d677175084dce5fb5368d978e66a988b91c0d2b683.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3731429e7c05</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a186cb8b8141c22ccccc144ff10de57410715fd48001ccdb618786549407449c" href="../../证据/a186cb8b8141c22ccccc144ff10de57410715fd48001ccdb618786549407449c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a186cb8b8141</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ModuleResultView.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9c5a0b4819f5fff9f11e71d1da205220268e3a066f0a2504c119c175ba5cfb34" href="../../证据/9c5a0b4819f5fff9f11e71d1da205220268e3a066f0a2504c119c175ba5cfb34.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9c5a0b4819f5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>configuration-hosts:H15 · FrontendWindowData.InitRunWindowFromDesignData → Running状态 → SolutionDesignerBuffer → ParseXaml/Window → 完成事件</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>方法先设DisplayMode=Running，再在try内取DocumentManager.InstanceP.SolutionDesignerBuffer交CommonMethod.ParseXaml并as Window，随后发OnInitDesignerSurfaceEndChanged。非Window的正常返回也可继续发事件；抛异常则记Error，返回当前result。此链表明编辑保存缓冲与运行窗载荷连接，但不证明控制数据绑定、执行结果刷新或窗口显示成功。</p><p>计划将A06归入F-20，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“ROI、图像、结果与设计布局的多消费者”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。ParseXaml具体成员体、控件/事件/结果绑定、返回窗口实际宿主和资源加载仍缺证；未实例化XAML或执行厂商对象。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/frontend-design-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9057a875bc38164d222415bf5756d5a8239a8f612ef600a2c12b2625ec99b151" href="../../证据/9057a875bc38164d222415bf5756d5a8239a8f612ef600a2c12b2625ec99b151.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9057a875bc38</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/frontend-design-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="96edd232d57b82c21b810a398d8d571504cf32477ce9dcb035eec2833af39b5a" href="../../证据/96edd232d57b82c21b810a398d8d571504cf32477ce9dcb035eec2833af39b5a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>96edd232d57b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/frontend-design-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cf07a5240810fef70db7d389c22cdb3e08accbe6bd756587005d63fdc1c3ba32" href="../../证据/cf07a5240810fef70db7d389c22cdb3e08accbe6bd756587005d63fdc1c3ba32.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cf07a5240810</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/original-managed/frontend-design/FrontendUI.Design.FrontendWindowData.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6ef032758c13e925ce9ccb147ca74bdc3fb9ebb0c27f20c4d8961454d195ee37" href="../../证据/6ef032758c13e925ce9ccb147ca74bdc3fb9ebb0c27f20c4d8961454d195ee37.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6ef032758c13</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-21" id="F-21"><summary>F-21 · 撤销与生命周期 · 历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>C01 · 撤销root/part实际捕获</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>VM.UnRedo.Schedule.Register/UpdateActionData及ModuleParam/UserData</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>真实根身份、捕获时点、抑制及取消异常效果</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>独占工作副本/TempFiles；编辑同模块两次、不同模块、Group关闭、Undo/Redo；记录动作/值/栈</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>CIL/反编译与真实命中相互对应；临时文件原件保全；不构造服务清理他任务TempFiles</dd></dl><p>根/分片录入与当前历史引擎的有限对照</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C01</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="610bb0d99c71d688e9a0c37e2e4b299a119a1778498af2ef5eed531ebb7c00e8" href="../../证据/610bb0d99c71d688e9a0c37e2e4b299a119a1778498af2ef5eed531ebb7c00e8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>610bb0d99c71</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C03 · 结果历史与方案替换生命周期</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>IsClearLastExecuteResult/结果缓存/耗时/方案替换回调</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>何时清缓存、历史、耗时和订阅引用</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>切流程/新建/加载/失败加载/关闭/取消/再次运行；追对象、事件解绑、最后结果</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>配置默认及入口有来源；失败加载状态可核对；旧方案回调不污染新方案</dd></dl><p>当前结果发布/方案替换，以及原切源、解订阅、自执行与流程回调、managed三仓路由/清理的有限链；计数生产者、native像素寿命和实际交错未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C03</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0bf12c1587d8af01e5fab9492b23f7485a4fa49ee43f44c8d05db34d012ae457" href="../../证据/0bf12c1587d8af01e5fab9492b23f7485a4fa49ee43f44c8d05db34d012ae457.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0bf12c1587d8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C04 · 撤销恢复与临时文件所有权</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>Module/Model/UserData/SolutionUnRedoOperation与Import/Export</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>内存/临时gro/流程/sol载荷和密码取消如何恢复</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐根类型覆写/清redo/栈溢出/关闭/密码取消；被动记录文件创建引用删除和数据回放</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>数据恢复、栈显示和文件所有权分别验收；异常假设不当通用回滚；按根类型选择本地适配</dd></dl><p>历史密码取消、动作回放顺序与当前失败/释放边界</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C04</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5561454372ad01773e952122c3db0e0e7e649d2e5f489a78d6cab5250c427f87" href="../../证据/5561454372ad01773e952122c3db0e0e7e649d2e5f489a78d6cab5250c427f87.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5561454372ad</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C05 · 配置/调试会话与框架释放</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>配置关闭→会话取消/等待→回调解除→资源释放</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>框架关闭如何消费插件取消与结果生命周期</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>用已交付会话在运行中关配置/换方案/退出；记录线程/回调/内存与资源所有者</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>只改main消费与生命周期；插件会话由插件线交付；无悬挂旧回调或误杀他任务进程</dd></dl><p>当前配置/调试取消、等待和scope释放合同；原版全宿主生命周期及真实关闭矩阵未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C05</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7bd18e5c18ff3dddd42d9c9c0eaa7b4b0e6740f750505b9c88ae0bbfb7828a4d" href="../../证据/7bd18e5c18ff3dddd42d9c9c0eaa7b4b0e6740f750505b9c88ae0bbfb7828a4d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7bd18e5c18ff</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C06 · 外部服务调度与故障隔离</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>全局触发/脚本/通信/设备服务的实际入口到执行链</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>服务由谁创建、触发流程、停止和保存</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>对A05每个服务建立子任务并REA取得原实现；无设备时先闭合managed/native调用，真实设备矩阵待资源</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每服务有显式证据/合同/错误和资源边界；没有设备证据不得标硬件闭合；不默认操作连接设备</dd></dl><p>函数源/MQ及通信换方案、触发即时写入和通信文件保护的有界调查；SDK生产/native与全服务仍未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C06</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="805ad58f7626bc5d5443e009993ac0439a586f104a7c488613d7b0d5547e6205" href="../../证据/805ad58f7626bc5d5443e009993ac0439a586f104a7c488613d7b0d5547e6205.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>805ad58f7626</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C07 · 长稳、并发与异常恢复</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>连续调度/Dispatcher/SDK callbacks/关闭与恢复路径</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>长跑、并发编辑、失败后继续和退出的实际状态</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>预先定义负载/时长/内存线程句柄基线；故障用自有副本；记录全部失败与恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>测量窗口与阈值有依据；无无界增长/悬挂任务；失败记录不删除；不虚报全平台无泄漏</dd></dl><p>停止等待、消息重入和当前租约释放的风险/状态分支；不包含长稳负载、阈值或无泄漏实测</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C07</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="911fd935548a0972b2b6e8e3ad6fa8c5d52ca80fb03284c0531e1c0d0124b47d" href="../../证据/911fd935548a0972b2b6e8e3ad6fa8c5d52ca80fb03284c0531e1c0d0124b47d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>911fd935548a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C08 · 执行与历史组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>原机同状态流程/Group/配置/历史综合链</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>运行编辑保存切换撤销之间是否存在状态污染</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>运行→编辑→停止→撤销→保存重开→再次运行；含嵌套、错误、取消和关闭</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每步结果/历史/文件/资源同时核对；独立重构差异显式保留</dd></dl><p>执行/历史组合验收：需运行、编辑、停止、撤销、保存重开和关闭的连续状态证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13fc665d3cc7e8867e5ff2c971b4aba671e67a2b2d42dc0cefeb1e14159816fc" href="../../证据/13fc665d3cc7e8867e5ff2c971b4aba671e67a2b2d42dc0cefeb1e14159816fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13fc665d3cc7</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>CP05 · 进入ExecuteAsync前的有效参数 → scope按过程/模块/节点保存Seed和Values</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor在ExecuteAsync之前调用RememberExecutionParameters；该方法分别Clone seed与applied，所以缓存不依赖模块执行结束才写入，失败/取消也可能留下本次入参。ReadEffectiveParameters先Clone缓存Values，再把当前配置中与Seed的GetRawText不同的字段覆盖进去；RememberConfigurationParameters又可更新已变字段。因此“有效参数”是供编辑器继续配置的托管视图，不能直接标成上次成功算法实际使用的精确历史记录或原生setter确认。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“进入ExecuteAsync前的有效参数 → scope按过程/模块/节点保存Seed和Values”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：没有逐工具核其如何消费每个参数、是否忽略字段、何时复制到native；这些不能从托管入参缓存替代取证。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：删除节点与旧在飞请求的全部竞争仍需具体调用时序验证，缓存删除不等于全局排空。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f" href="../../证据/2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2f3bad3dab71</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.Parameters.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c827a1b26669642473dd9503c7ecb82a7717b78fc37ff6822c8b360650721236" href="../../证据/c827a1b26669642473dd9503c7ecb82a7717b78fc37ff6822c8b360650721236.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c827a1b26669</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a718146e6141fe220b1543247b919e2340a695a52f504d083d0e0e7b70c241dc" href="../../证据/a718146e6141fe220b1543247b919e2340a695a52f504d083d0e0e7b70c241dc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a718146e6141</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9372e51b811508f8adfc9b4eb36b249716410bd671fd070fcb17e4eec1426fe4" href="../../证据/9372e51b811508f8adfc9b4eb36b249716410bd671fd070fcb17e4eec1426fe4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9372e51b8115</small></a></details></details><details><summary>DR05 · ModuleExecutionScope.Close / RemoveNode / lease → 取消 → 等租约归零 → 去重释放owned state/service</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>借用流程scope.Dispose直接return。根Dispose令closing=true并cancel，只有cancellationComplete且leases==0且未releaseStarted才Release。Release按引用去重states/ownedServices，先清字典再Dispose资源，单项异常记录后继续。GraphExecutor的using scopeLease在调用退出时归还租约；这不证明UI结果或历史持有的像素引用也被清除。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“ModuleExecutionScope.Close / RemoveNode / lease → 取消 → 等租约归零 → 去重释放owned state/service”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：跨窗口/provider仍持有的输出引用和节点删除时活租约与state移除的完整并发边界另列，不推全域线程安全。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58374d2a1ded1c3eacb2813f60c107e96da734c47c1afe7eb98ade8041f60908" href="../../证据/58374d2a1ded1c3eacb2813f60c107e96da734c47c1afe7eb98ade8041f60908.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58374d2a1ded</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="80b4324b185bc5c252fc1a846b24bf4987606dc2a6bd71d5158b013e72497566" href="../../证据/80b4324b185bc5c252fc1a846b24bf4987606dc2a6bd71d5158b013e72497566.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>80b4324b185b</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="95cd8566c683e5945c10c93f03f1cdcddec201f16932bfa248e17036f8f16461" href="../../证据/95cd8566c683e5945c10c93f03f1cdcddec201f16932bfa248e17036f8f16461.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>95cd8566c683</small></a></details></details><details><summary>IF05 · ClearImageView / RenderControlBase_Unloaded / DeInitRenderControl → 清引用、退委托不撤销已经排队的工作</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>已核选定ClearImageView调用Init/UpdateImageView(null)或清输入图属性，Unloaded退掉OnSetImageEnd与OnFreshExtendContent委托，DeInitRenderControl解除显示事件/过滤并清临时字典。对应CIL中没有等待此前两条Task.Run返回句柄、DispatcherOperation.Abort或取消token操作；Task调用点又没有保留该句柄。这些动作因此不能作为已排队闭包不再持有控件、不能再读当前状态/调用更新的证明。下一次源为空的ImageViewBox回调仍是自己的同步清显示/通知旧新图像事件链，不构成上游工作排空屏障。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“ClearImageView / RenderControlBase_Unloaded / DeInitRenderControl → 清引用、退委托不撤销已经排队的工作”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不能仅凭选定体没有取消调用断言原程序全局不存在排空；进程/父窗口关闭及其它所有者仍需独立追踪。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未观察原机清空/卸载与回调竞争，实际过期呈现、异常或内存滞留是否发生及概率均未知。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-bridge.resources/VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7d7afaa970ff293867d8433b7a2c928034fcc825014319e70217311efca824c6" href="../../证据/7d7afaa970ff293867d8433b7a2c928034fcc825014319e70217311efca824c6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7d7afaa970ff</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-bridge.resources/VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="082a0c5ec0406be63609eef5d74c6986ad54d58573b288b7a1b79c91ef63c6e0" href="../../证据/082a0c5ec0406be63609eef5d74c6986ad54d58573b288b7a1b79c91ef63c6e0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>082a0c5ec040</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-bridge.resources/VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4a0e69fc64e8d8bc3928e2823cf101adb9afce695fff0925bb654003f20ecd73" href="../../证据/4a0e69fc64e8d8bc3928e2823cf101adb9afce695fff0925bb654003f20ecd73.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4a0e69fc64e8</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-chain.resources/VMBaseControls.ImageViewBox.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f79b7aa4dd3be6f1aaf38f2e4165e935a728084fe9234860e2aa01d0fcccd62" href="../../证据/0f79b7aa4dd3be6f1aaf38f2e4165e935a728084fe9234860e2aa01d0fcccd62.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f79b7aa4dd3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/display-inflight.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b6182a448c5c6c986f312d9ecb7aadb3990f97f9a0268888a74e8adbeedc6c8f" href="../../证据/b6182a448c5c6c986f312d9ecb7aadb3990f97f9a0268888a74e8adbeedc6c8f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b6182a448c5c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/display-inflight.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d5728187da701944d236a970b43a86c0e474b7329b6f7cec8d3ba3295bf3887d" href="../../证据/d5728187da701944d236a970b43a86c0e474b7329b6f7cec8d3ba3295bf3887d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d5728187da70</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/display-inflight.cil.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="988f78a56eea29d995487d2f0b741458cd3d008a43602b65935910c2cbb1cbe8" href="../../证据/988f78a56eea29d995487d2f0b741458cd3d008a43602b65935910c2cbb1cbe8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>988f78a56eea</small></a></details></details><details><summary>RC04 · ClearDisplayStore / Init / DeInit → 仅清当前display、清三仓及迟到回调的边界</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ClearDisplayStore仅Clear当前display图像/图形字典，不改buffer/spare、三个计数、两个固定标志或SelectedImage等选择引用。Init只设isInit=true。DeInit则设isInit=false，Clear三套图像/图形字典，清计数和固定标志，置CheckImagesName/SelectedImage/SelectedInputImage为空；没有逐图Dispose或像素free。SetRenderDataToStore以isInit阻止继续入值，但SetDataToStore本身并未先检查isInit：反初始化后迟到的有效回调仍可更新仓库计数和走Clear，然后在下层不存值。所以DeInit不等同所有生产回调已经停止或排空。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“ClearDisplayStore / Init / DeInit → 仅清当前display、清三仓及迟到回调的边界”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：三仓只属于RenderDataCenter→ModuleResultView/ModuleDisplayDecorator的A链；不得归到没有引用RenderDataCenter的RenderControlBase/tempImageStore B链。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原机异步排空、外部消费者、图像/位图与native资源最终释放仍未验证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-store-ownership.resources/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4196eeb9c3d44dc42b4421616ee6173e53e6705f3a5be85111133cd780a3686" href="../../证据/f4196eeb9c3d44dc42b4421616ee6173e53e6705f3a5be85111133cd780a3686.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4196eeb9c3d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-store-ownership.resources/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="80236437d3a3c3be603370c06dde685aef7bcb0319f210c1c738dbc98c8a9288" href="../../证据/80236437d3a3c3be603370c06dde685aef7bcb0319f210c1c738dbc98c8a9288.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>80236437d3a3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-store-ownership.resources/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="030d659d176c669b37965c4ec84dd6032f783ce617597ee875455f08767a7488" href="../../证据/030d659d176c669b37965c4ec84dd6032f783ce617597ee875455f08767a7488.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>030d659d176c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-store-ownership.resources/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e9df5081da7e43c3e78e04fcc4e1c94189a10947657b74d0984c842cb062944f" href="../../证据/e9df5081da7e43c3e78e04fcc4e1c94189a10947657b74d0984c842cb062944f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e9df5081da7e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/result-store-ownership.resources/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter.decompiled.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dfe79e9a6c63a6d87058754200e888991d9fdedc8f30924e484d8051bf3736b1" href="../../证据/dfe79e9a6c63a6d87058754200e888991d9fdedc8f30924e484d8051bf3736b1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dfe79e9a6c63</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3c2c0bcfc2b8bffdd9dbf1341276ec70a3ddae3292ac9e4ea8d9379f7baa6335" href="../../证据/3c2c0bcfc2b8bffdd9dbf1341276ec70a3ddae3292ac9e4ea8d9379f7baa6335.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3c2c0bcfc2b8</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="24b026ebc4fb04f9177075595ffa5389a3595fc4f1d5ea14d3e7d900096e271d" href="../../证据/24b026ebc4fb04f9177075595ffa5389a3595fc4f1d5ea14d3e7d900096e271d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>24b026ebc4fb</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/render-store-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="35d5a5c75622a0f1490f1ed847edc8f82ee19e86a2e1df3b8a8fc779b7ddaa81" href="../../证据/35d5a5c75622a0f1490f1ed847edc8f82ee19e86a2e1df3b8a8fc779b7ddaa81.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>35d5a5c75622</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX02 · record退役0x25c40 → 清零计数，释放+0x440/+0x458/+0x460/+0x468/+0x470</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>0x25c40真实原体是缓冲清理，不是初始化：先写+0x43c=0、+0x450=0；非空+0x440、+0x458、+0x460分别delete[]，清pointer；+0x468调用1ba20(pointer,3)，+0x470调用1bc70(pointer,3)，返回后清pointer及+0x450。它未调用ModuleFrame删除变量值，不能把record缓冲清理等同全局最终存储删除。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“record退役0x25c40 → 清零计数，释放+0x440/+0x458/+0x460/+0x468/+0x470”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：record整体析构、并发最后读者和调用0x25c40的全部路径未在本切片遍历。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180025c40.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="63e274c94625f277e6d286a7f5af032c2a2c0a3c4c8953f105d2b00262a85b6b" href="../../证据/63e274c94625f277e6d286a7f5af032c2a2c0a3c4c8953f105d2b00262a85b6b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>63e274c94625</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180025c40.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="83bfe57ae454769a4194fff2f0b15fdf73ffaa838443596dfb48fefe7192c0d2" href="../../证据/83bfe57ae454769a4194fff2f0b15fdf73ffaa838443596dfb48fefe7192c0d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>83bfe57ae454</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX03 · record+0x470数组析构1bc70(pointer,3) → 逐0x130子描述析构，再释放cookie前的数组分配</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>1bc70参数3同时启用vector析构与delete[]：从pointer-8读数量，以0x130步长调用1b900，然后delete[](pointer-8)。每个1b900对子描述+0x108/+0x110非空指针直接delete[]，清pointer与+0x104；+0x118非空则调用1ba20(pointer,3)。1ba20以0x60步长调用1b830并delete[]其pointer-8。1b830只有描述+0x50的int非0且+0pointer非0时才delete[]内容、清pointer与+8长度，最后始终清+0xc容量。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“record+0x470数组析构1bc70(pointer,3) → 逐0x130子描述析构，再释放cookie前的数组分配”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：+0x50正式所有权语义、每个生产分支如何置位/转移仍未闭合；不由delete条件猜字段名。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001bc70.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb146ba90b7409f4710bed80d27ee8ed733c5651fb5fcf0515f67461e760db7d" href="../../证据/cb146ba90b7409f4710bed80d27ee8ed733c5651fb5fcf0515f67461e760db7d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb146ba90b74</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001bc70.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="36b12553da384ed3fa61819c1ab8db81dc7e4ae461dd8dfc8df5db9ac037527c" href="../../证据/36b12553da384ed3fa61819c1ab8db81dc7e4ae461dd8dfc8df5db9ac037527c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>36b12553da38</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b900.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161" href="../../证据/d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d55b696b7636</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b900.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="68e726aee9d5048c9b0f861be252a835373dc7d2af298852f8192cc20cf63225" href="../../证据/68e726aee9d5048c9b0f861be252a835373dc7d2af298852f8192cc20cf63225.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>68e726aee9d5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001ba20.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7a2b430230145c8abc26e777b89212b81b23ce6735b86452685683001ac8da07" href="../../证据/7a2b430230145c8abc26e777b89212b81b23ce6735b86452685683001ac8da07.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7a2b43023014</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b830.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="85a3e5e558b5033c23fe210411421e293bd471f74b4ab97816a8c1bd4071e6b3" href="../../证据/85a3e5e558b5033c23fe210411421e293bd471f74b4ab97816a8c1bd4071e6b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>85a3e5e558b5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b830.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="775f61ca653ec23a67610e68a4205aaf99080666438a87f257f6fdd4481a1816" href="../../证据/775f61ca653ec23a67610e68a4205aaf99080666438a87f257f6fdd4481a1816.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>775f61ca653e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP02 · typed对象虚表+8 → 清逻辑长度，保留既有数值/字符串分配</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原表明确int/float/string的+8槽为f3fb0/f40b0/f42e0。int/float在当前数量大于0时仅把payload+0x68/+0x40写0；string逐项将内部字符串长度写0并首字符置零（按capacity选择SSO或heap），最后把payload+0x30计数写0。所选体没有delete/free；VZ03所调用的+8现在可细化为逻辑清空，不能称完整释放。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“typed对象虚表+8 → 清逻辑长度，保留既有数值/字符串分配”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：所有消费者最后读者以及何时触发最终载荷析构仍未知。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3fb0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2a188934e53b1d2ab5b67e78889d4c3ec5b0115615a35d4659be3e790a238558" href="../../证据/2a188934e53b1d2ab5b67e78889d4c3ec5b0115615a35d4659be3e790a238558.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2a188934e53b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f40b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9a6d1845477ec819bfcb39c052ef1010e1cb8cd3a8aa2b63971f1bad6c080be1" href="../../证据/9a6d1845477ec819bfcb39c052ef1010e1cb8cd3a8aa2b63971f1bad6c080be1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9a6d1845477e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f42e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="764d603111ef7d55c0e071cdb9983edd1b004da6ec7ad835d57b521e4062e731" href="../../证据/764d603111ef7d55c0e071cdb9983edd1b004da6ec7ad835d57b521e4062e731.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>764d603111ef</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3f90.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d6c6dbf32cfdc9db8a070ba0c71187b7e8ea0dabfc1773b508288d7bd379b60" href="../../证据/0d6c6dbf32cfdc9db8a070ba0c71187b7e8ea0dabfc1773b508288d7bd379b60.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d6c6dbf32cf</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3fa0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="19b76cd83bfe520a59fa58b3f8727486236d5de04398be6837f4faa15b8c40b3" href="../../证据/19b76cd83bfe520a59fa58b3f8727486236d5de04398be6837f4faa15b8c40b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>19b76cd83bfe</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f40a0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="695ba0dc66e664b4b142e9ed8a3ca9b722b412781c99f7b624436d33ec19d8b0" href="../../证据/695ba0dc66e664b4b142e9ed8a3ca9b722b412781c99f7b624436d33ec19d8b0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>695ba0dc66e6</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f42d0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dad4af1710b9cb2029d7407ab7dda63883d0c41297f279e37ed8e18476220bcd" href="../../证据/dad4af1710b9cb2029d7407ab7dda63883d0c41297f279e37ed8e18476220bcd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dad4af1710b9</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP05 · VZ06强计数归零后的真实控制块slot0 → fa730清理包装对象，再delete包装对象本身</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>三个实际控制块表首槽均为fa730：读取控制块+0x10对象，非null调用f7410，然后汇编把同一对象放RCX并尾跳operator delete IAT180204580。f7410对名称/类型capacity>=16分别delete其堆块，复位字段；若callable存在，RCX传callable、DL=(callable!=对象内联区+0x18)，调用其虚槽+0x20后置null。本体未直接读取对象+0x10以free原始载荷。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“VZ06强计数归零后的真实控制块slot0 → fa730清理包装对象，再delete包装对象本身”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：callable实际虚表+0x20接收者未定位；不能由f7410的清理形态推断返回载荷被销毁。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa730.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3a74010e42ecc18ac1211c518cd5fe96153db74be48f61673b1e64a4dfc05df9" href="../../证据/3a74010e42ecc18ac1211c518cd5fe96153db74be48f61673b1e64a4dfc05df9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3a74010e42ec</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa730.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d6a67cb1de41193bd98dcba8403de590d701628fea70fc7f2d71f1d994684fc2" href="../../证据/d6a67cb1de41193bd98dcba8403de590d701628fea70fc7f2d71f1d994684fc2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d6a67cb1de41</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f7410.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8aca91fdad2c8226d8b2f445e57ad4ca0beec57a574f797ee21134b731a80499" href="../../证据/8aca91fdad2c8226d8b2f445e57ad4ca0beec57a574f797ee21134b731a80499.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8aca91fdad2c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f7410.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2b6f6b2be5cfdf4f86d0513789bc25fad0443acea31f489cec33219b8dd563a0" href="../../证据/2b6f6b2be5cfdf4f86d0513789bc25fad0443acea31f489cec33219b8dd563a0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2b6f6b2be5cf</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP06 · VZ06弱计数归零后的真实控制块slot+8 → 0210d0再派发slot+0x10并按DL低位delete控制块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>三个控制块表+8均为0210d0；它把同一控制块作为RCX、第二参数1转交自身vtable+0x10。原表该槽均为0210f0；其汇编TEST DL,1，非零调用operator delete IAT180204580，RCX仍为控制块。本证据补齐弱归零时控制块本身退役，不把包装对象与原始载荷混同。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“VZ06弱计数归零后的真实控制块slot+8 → 0210d0再派发slot+0x10并按DL低位delete控制块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：最终读者、跨仓共享、异常回收与原机运行未确认。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800210d0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9d8734be956bedc5f43fcc929f9ee53f0e14c80513b8236656e07d35c2b0a826" href="../../证据/9d8734be956bedc5f43fcc929f9ee53f0e14c80513b8236656e07d35c2b0a826.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9d8734be956b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800210f0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="476f3d988e1951c9636d7b44909ad63f135da2550b28b38a1c82ce6fd4baa1b7" href="../../证据/476f3d988e1951c9636d7b44909ad63f135da2550b28b38a1c82ce6fd4baa1b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>476f3d988e19</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800210f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cdabfa36a5a6f00faa54073d9f2b392a2c2bb81f30c32a2d09d812b1323e45cc" href="../../证据/cdabfa36a5a6f00faa54073d9f2b392a2c2bb81f30c32a2d09d812b1323e45cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cdabfa36a5a6</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OG07 · DoWork正常退出的本次描述链表 → 退役临时节点与shared持有，结果最后读者仍未知</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoWork收尾把本次输出链表头复位，逐节点调用a77a0(节点+0xa8)与a03a0(节点+0x18)，operator delete节点，最后delete链表头。a77a0与a03a0对各shared控制块真实LOCK递减强计数，仅强归零调用虚槽0，再递减弱计数，弱归零调用虚槽+8；a77a0还清文本。节点及符合capacity条件的临时文本有直接delete证据，不能把局部shared撤销写成所有结果payload立即释放。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“DoWork正常退出的本次描述链表 → 退役临时节点与shared持有，结果最后读者仍未知”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：typed结果载荷最终free、异常栈展开与并发最后读者未知；正常收尾不是所有异常必清理证明。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a0930.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3830ff584bd56ecc1abcde6f50469ab4522090d0dcb83ac1ac04f65e0b8a581a" href="../../证据/3830ff584bd56ecc1abcde6f50469ab4522090d0dcb83ac1ac04f65e0b8a581a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3830ff584bd5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a77a0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bfdaedaf2f00478f6df0d4261bde15f7a16fa632c03d706c7480361a114e6087" href="../../证据/bfdaedaf2f00478f6df0d4261bde15f7a16fa632c03d706c7480361a114e6087.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bfdaedaf2f00</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a03a0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3da61facae3f789760c4e3686abcf363bc04923e486624a35958672d0bbf250c" href="../../证据/3da61facae3f789760c4e3686abcf363bc04923e486624a35958672d0bbf250c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3da61facae3f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/group-original-data.resources/1800a77a0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3a50e3c796cf168576c984affad04772b3821a85918d52ce8973f9cc899f441a" href="../../证据/3a50e3c796cf168576c984affad04772b3821a85918d52ce8973f9cc899f441a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3a50e3c796cf</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG09 · Group正常结束/中断/失败/取消 → 末轮session改写聚合，父调用保留Calls但门控输出</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>正常loop出口返回last或新Success空session，再with覆盖CompletedGroupIterations/GroupBroke/GroupBreakIndex/diagnostics/累积outputs与displays。零轮时last为null，Finish对可累积项产生空typed数组；成功break保留前轮节点记录。body返回非Success后先completed++再break，未Add该轮；返回状态仍取last，非累计输出可来自该last。父Graph收到child先存calls[id]，仅child.Success把WorkflowOutputs作为模块结果，否则输出Empty并SubprogramFailed。轮前Throw或Interval Delay抛取消会绕过Group最终聚合return，由父Graph catch/取消/超时门分类，不能宣称任何取消都保留部分累计结果。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“Group正常结束/中断/失败/取消 → 末轮session改写聚合，父调用保留Calls但门控输出”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：超时/外部取消/Scope.Stopping涉及不同token，不能从一个分支推出所有race结果；本切片仅静态核顺序，没有新运行探针。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="edb3d91bee1a3c59cf2a58ad059bca4d944a1dbe1a4f5a6ac6aac5d433491d91" href="../../证据/edb3d91bee1a3c59cf2a58ad059bca4d944a1dbe1a4f5a6ac6aac5d433491d91.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>edb3d91bee1a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="700cd74215bdf92d618e1baf80b16e6e23e1a89fed8580cfedb0b1716c497e20" href="../../证据/700cd74215bdf92d618e1baf80b16e6e23e1a89fed8580cfedb0b1716c497e20.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>700cd74215bd</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f" href="../../证据/2f3bad3dab71c1170faa6aa507491f5727cc90bc3c220d99e4622dc987059e2f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2f3bad3dab71</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e59c8e573396c2e41cd7fd0b21c07e060bddbfd552e1db6bd436e74f2e16c724" href="../../证据/e59c8e573396c2e41cd7fd0b21c07e060bddbfd552e1db6bd436e74f2e16c724.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e59c8e573396</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CG10 · 每轮scope.Enter/ForProcedure与solution关闭 → 跨轮state/有效参数持有，closing后等租约再释放</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor每次RunAsync using scope.Enter；body与父run沿用同root scope。模块context的Scope为ForProcedure(p.Id)借用view，State缓存键为(procedure,module,node)，因此同body多轮同键复用state而非每轮Dispose。RememberExecutionParameters在模块入口前对seed/applied逐JsonElement.Clone，覆写该键缓存。scope.Dispose对借用view无动作；root先closing=true并Cancel stopping，取消完成且leases==0才TryRelease，最后Exit也可触发。Release先快照distinct states+ownedServices，再清states/effectiveParameters/services/ownedServices，再逐IDisposable.Dispose，异常记录并保留failedResources。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“每轮scope.Enter/ForProcedure与solution关闭 → 跨轮state/有效参数持有，closing后等租约再释放”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：谁创建/最终Dispose宿主root scope需在具体solution lifecycle入口另追；本页不把局部Group结束等同应用关窗。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：当前源码的参数缓存不是native SDK SetParam已确认值；cleanup异常、外部state引用和具体图像原生资源由实现另证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9b1bc69960793ee8cd7c99ab26caa9bb4333ad6075fb47d931d735f7494e5e5e" href="../../证据/9b1bc69960793ee8cd7c99ab26caa9bb4333ad6075fb47d931d735f7494e5e5e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9b1bc6996079</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b00ffd9614c944e8c9a5abb9477401b86b04667d03783a92c8ba7c428d2f24e5" href="../../证据/b00ffd9614c944e8c9a5abb9477401b86b04667d03783a92c8ba7c428d2f24e5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b00ffd9614c9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f176b7e0c007166f796f1bdfcb36a41ad182d4d2f7f185dd276d483c41e2950" href="../../证据/0f176b7e0c007166f796f1bdfcb36a41ad182d4d2f7f185dd276d483c41e2950.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f176b7e0c00</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58374d2a1ded1c3eacb2813f60c107e96da734c47c1afe7eb98ade8041f60908" href="../../证据/58374d2a1ded1c3eacb2813f60c107e96da734c47c1afe7eb98ade8041f60908.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58374d2a1ded</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="964864aa21e58faf7a7b428113c7ab05132acdd2407ce54206ab7388147a21c8" href="../../证据/964864aa21e58faf7a7b428113c7ab05132acdd2407ce54206ab7388147a21c8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>964864aa21e5</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.Parameters.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b558c3b9ba103353a2b4ab2bd208249d1eef1ac95c393d4ea47d4db9719625e7" href="../../证据/b558c3b9ba103353a2b4ab2bd208249d1eef1ac95c393d4ea47d4db9719625e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b558c3b9ba10</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR01 · ProcedureConfigControl.OnSolutionChanged → 关闭当前参数窗后替换DecoratorSolution</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Solution依赖属性变化回调先看curTabControlBase是否为IsClosing=false的BaseWindow，仅该门通过才Close当前参数窗；新方案非null时创建新的VmSolutionDecorator并设DecorateSource，否则把DecoratorSolution置null。所选体对old solution的if块为空，没有直接调用旧decorator.Dispose、ClearDataStore或图像释放。这个外层入口不可用窗口关闭名补成渲染对象全部回收。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“ProcedureConfigControl.OnSolutionChanged → 关闭当前参数窗后替换DecoratorSolution”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：当前活宿主是否发生该DP变化、窗口是否确实关闭及该窗口卸载后的显示源解绑顺序未运行确认。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：旧DecoratorSolution是否另由集合/容器清理，尚未取得完整caller到payload退出的绑定链。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c2b817b6d084684144af5adda8ed4677df62b39912b63164bb1bb2c23264719" href="../../证据/7c2b817b6d084684144af5adda8ed4677df62b39912b63164bb1bb2c23264719.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c2b817b6d08</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR02 · ProcedureConfigControl流程容器更换/Remove/Reset → 解除集合订阅、移除装饰项与条件清选中项</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>OnProceduresChanged对旧集合RemoveHandler并ClearProcedures，对新集合先Remove再Add CollectionChanged handler，随后按复制状态重新AddProcedures。ClearProcedures调用ResetDisposeStatus把IsDisposeNotify先true再false，再清DecoratedProcedures/DecoratedModules。Remove通知逐来源移除匹配装饰项，并仅在OldItems含当前DecorateSource时把SelectedItem/SelectedTabItem置null；Reset调用ClearProcedures。所选体没有逐装饰项调用Dispose。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“ProcedureConfigControl流程容器更换/Remove/Reset → 解除集合订阅、移除装饰项与条件清选中项”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：已定位SearchDryPopup一个消费者及其退搜索事件行为；其它消费者与Release包装Dispose的更外层caller仍未闭合；包装层到MainViewControl的直接调用另见OR07。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：单模块删除的所有选择同步和全部UI消费者未闭合；不能以流程集合Remove代表所有模块删除都已清屏。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="00d457f9c26d3f5ab484cec8cd7b4ae35ef605a9760cb4d48263d8ca3fa1d4c1" href="../../证据/00d457f9c26d3f5ab484cec8cd7b4ae35ef605a9760cb4d48263d8ca3fa1d4c1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>00d457f9c26d</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b3898d7c62c8cb38b954ff3b62dac37630237c6e5ff9f3461568c2812e066a90" href="../../证据/b3898d7c62c8cb38b954ff3b62dac37630237c6e5ff9f3461568c2812e066a90.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b3898d7c62c8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR03 · 参数窗Closed → CurTabControlBase_Closed → 清窗引用/Tag，关闭参数与ROI状态</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>参数窗创建后以WeakEventManager登记Closed。Closed处理使用Dispatcher.Invoke把curTabControlBase置null；ROIPartUI若是ModuleResultView只把其Tag置null，随后IsOpenParams=false、SetRoiVisible(false)，再让Undo服务RemoveEmptyOperation。这个所见关闭尾部没有把ModuleSource或ImageDataSource置null，也没有调用ClearDataStore/Decorator.Dispose。关参数窗不能直接读成清除主界面图像/历史结果。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“参数窗Closed → CurTabControlBase_Closed → 清窗引用/Tag，关闭参数与ROI状态”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：专用配置窗口内部Unloaded/DisposeFunction以及已排队的显示任务退出，必须按对应控件另核；本轮不扩为所有插件配置窗通用合同。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="93898410662c6b97fb675542cd19b3e39cfad78e2cb67aea50b2cddfd76a5ead" href="../../证据/93898410662c6b97fb675542cd19b3e39cfad78e2cb67aea50b2cddfd76a5ead.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>93898410662c</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9f7a6dac7969a6a699b7329d1771030b2068b76c0ee858677fc684624b2dd3e2" href="../../证据/9f7a6dac7969a6a699b7329d1771030b2068b76c0ee858677fc684624b2dd3e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9f7a6dac7969</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3a8cdd39e8b6fc1b41ee906288da9c31581ea6ea1c903cb69b06b5bb5aabcc50" href="../../证据/3a8cdd39e8b6fc1b41ee906288da9c31581ea6ea1c903cb69b06b5bb5aabcc50.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3a8cdd39e8b6</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR04 · VmModule.Dispose → CommonDispose → VmIO.Dispose → 撤关联/移出模型及交SDK关闭模块；IO值字段不由Dispose直接清空</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>VmModule.Dispose先设置IsOnDispose并拒绝重复disposedValue；清变量关联、可选导出Undo数据、删除内部模块、解除前后继与参数绑定，然后CommonDispose。CommonDispose反向删除NextModules、调用父UnSubInnerModule，再逆序Dispose每个Inputs/Outputs。VmIO.Dispose对子项递归Dispose，CollectionParent.Remove(this)、RelateIO=null、disposedValue=true；所选体没有直接写_value或_valueList。模块随后移出父Modules与AllModules，再CloseModuleInterface→SDK CloseOneModule。删除结构/断IO关系和结果载荷最后读者不是同一保证。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“VmModule.Dispose → CommonDispose → VmIO.Dispose → 撤关联/移出模型及交SDK关闭模块；IO值字段不由Dispose直接清空”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：CloseOneModule底层句柄/缓冲退出、删除后旧显示装饰器是否收到换源通知及所有最后读者未在本切片闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：异常时IsOnDispose复位不等于前面已完成的IO/模型移除具有事务回滚。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="98325eb622fb846ab24011862147528546677679475fbaa0f290d95a8fff8b14" href="../../证据/98325eb622fb846ab24011862147528546677679475fbaa0f290d95a8fff8b14.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>98325eb622fb</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="192d0c48cf23b0dfb6648ad107c5d2d0bb30c7dbc9a00e81e39231fc5ead23ad" href="../../证据/192d0c48cf23b0dfb6648ad107c5d2d0bb30c7dbc9a00e81e39231fc5ead23ad.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>192d0c48cf23</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmIO.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4ee346131170998897f7bc32318819e5ad8d4076be063cf50cab1056eaec4d9" href="../../证据/f4ee346131170998897f7bc32318819e5ad8d4076be063cf50cab1056eaec4d9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4ee34613117</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR05 · VmSolution.Dispose(bool isTakeOver) → 向VmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle传0或1</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>现有应用退出已有L17调用VmSolution.Dispose(isRunBackground)。本轮只补到该bool重载的实际体：记录DestoryHandle日志，然后调用mVmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle(isTakeOver?1:0)。无参Dispose还有SDKMode的DestoryThirdHandle任务+SyncWaitor路径，另一路base.Dispose后调用bool重载并设置IsDispose；不能把这些重载自动当同一退出模式。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“VmSolution.Dispose(bool isTakeOver) → 向VmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle传0或1”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：VmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle原生接收体、后台接管实际存活资源、异步回调全部停止时点未取，本轮不启动原版。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmSolution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f2986948c80348d84f725999c2f15b94527621325f79b6911098e01e822271e4" href="../../证据/f2986948c80348d84f725999c2f15b94527621325f79b6911098e01e822271e4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f2986948c803</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR06 · MainViewControl.Dispose可调用入口 → 仅将其模板ModuleResultView.ModuleSource设null</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>OnApplyTemplate把m_ModuleView取为ModuleResultView，Dispose仅在mrv非null时将ModuleSource置null。该属性后续若实际发生变化，可关联已有V02的旧decorator清理；本体没有调用RenderThreadPool.ShutDown，也没有直接清所有图层/历史仓。本轮已定位Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose的直接调用（OR07）；该Release.Dispose在具体退出/换方案场景中的更外层caller仍未闭合，不能宣称每次切方案/主窗关闭都必经。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“MainViewControl.Dispose可调用入口 → 仅将其模板ModuleResultView.ModuleSource设null”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：初始三个PE的5630个有体方法查得0直接引用，仅是有限scope；随后补入Release层986个方法并定位VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose直接调用（OR07）。它的更外层caller、224个接口候选和动态分派仍未知，不能声称每次切方案/关主窗都已释放图像。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/MainViewControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5589d054d5bc9b53856ce77058a6e8bc400162bebb22cb8dbb69df6978fb70ab" href="../../证据/5589d054d5bc9b53856ce77058a6e8bc400162bebb22cb8dbb69df6978fb70ab.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5589d054d5bc</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/MainViewControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="638d5cb8db93a568ccddf6f2efc05a5c7f53ab0685a70768b75a1ba15239360b" href="../../证据/638d5cb8db93a568ccddf6f2efc05a5c7f53ab0685a70768b75a1ba15239360b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>638d5cb8db93</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-retirement.resources/caller-scan.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f84264f50a87cc472c6d5251bb01e2fc01298aaa4da39d2f54f37548e583c7f" href="../../证据/4f84264f50a87cc472c6d5251bb01e2fc01298aaa4da39d2f54f37548e583c7f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f84264f50a8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR01 · ModuleExecutionScope.RegisterService&lt;T>替换旧owned服务 → 先撤owned标记，再Dispose；抛错可留下未回滚的旧映射</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>条件必须同时满足：同T已有previous、新service不是同引用、ownedServices.Remove(previous)返回true且previous实现IDisposable。该条件链先从ownedServices删除旧对象，再调用previous.Dispose；只有其正常返回才写services[typeof(T)]=新service及按owned标记登记新对象。旧Dispose抛异常时方法无catch/finally回滚：services仍映射旧previous，旧owned标记已移除，新service未写入，异常直接向调用者传播，也不调用RecordCleanupFailure。不能把注册失败描述为原状态完全不变。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“ModuleExecutionScope.RegisterService&lt;T>替换旧owned服务 → 先撤owned标记，再Dispose；抛错可留下未回滚的旧映射”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本条是源码静态事实；另列ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限合成Disposable替换异常。真实相机/工具服务、GUI与设备未观测，不直接宣称现有资源会触发。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ownedServices按对象而非逐Type独立计数；所有多接口别名注册/外部所有者的实际组合未穷尽。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d10827d45e12e725d58d37e417f5352795f67844251dadcc24751e5c042b741d" href="../../证据/d10827d45e12e725d58d37e417f5352795f67844251dadcc24751e5c042b741d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d10827d45e12</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7d4f5619157a41957f0121e6ffe2c757e00e17489e154a3b2476533cbff9ac23" href="../../证据/7d4f5619157a41957f0121e6ffe2c757e00e17489e154a3b2476533cbff9ac23.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7d4f5619157a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188" href="../../证据/310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>310faafd8596</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="964864aa21e58faf7a7b428113c7ab05132acdd2407ce54206ab7388147a21c8" href="../../证据/964864aa21e58faf7a7b428113c7ab05132acdd2407ce54206ab7388147a21c8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>964864aa21e5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR02 · RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes批量裁剪 → 删除记录在Dispose之前完成；首个异常中断剩余裁剪</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>RemoveNode在root.gate内先删除effectiveParameters键，再从states.Remove取出value；离锁后仅当value实现IDisposable才Dispose，没有catch和RecordCleanupFailure。Dispose抛错时该node状态及参数已从这些字典移除，调用直接失败；重复RemoveNode找不到state就return，不自动重试旧对象。RetainProcedureNodes先批量删除不在keep中的全部参数键，再快照待移state键并foreach RemoveNode；其中一项抛错将中断剩余foreach，后续state仍可留在states，而其参数键可能已在第一阶段删除。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes批量裁剪 → 删除记录在Dispose之前完成；首个异常中断剩余裁剪”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：WPF doc.Changed等上层对传播异常如何显示/恢复需按调用者另追；本切片不宣称文档编辑或整个solution关闭必然失败。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe已观测有限顺序Remove/Retain异常；并发与真实资源异常未观测，本条仍按源码关系取证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="80b4324b185bc5c252fc1a846b24bf4987606dc2a6bd71d5158b013e72497566" href="../../证据/80b4324b185bc5c252fc1a846b24bf4987606dc2a6bd71d5158b013e72497566.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>80b4324b185b</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0bbb7367df0c905d24020ff5ff34dbeba70df59ec4e7bbde034b690f21abeb95" href="../../证据/0bbb7367df0c905d24020ff5ff34dbeba70df59ec4e7bbde034b690f21abeb95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0bbb7367df0c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="38deced2927f8aa66655a09c85876f006fe64220ac9e266292c5008d9042b661" href="../../证据/38deced2927f8aa66655a09c85876f006fe64220ac9e266292c5008d9042b661.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>38deced2927f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR03 · root closing置位与API准入 / 租约 → 立即拒新状态与租约，不等于所有查询/删除都禁用</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>root Dispose在gate下先设置closing=true再调用stopping.Cancel；State&lt;T>、RegisterService、Enter与参数Parameters入口均以closing抛ObjectDisposedException。与之不同，Service&lt;T>只锁gate查询，无closing检查：若活跃租约阻止Release清字典，它仍可在closing期间返回旧服务；Release清空后则返回null。ForProcedure只验证procedure字符串，可以继续生成borrowed view；RequestRun/RequestRefresh在closing直接返回。RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes没有closing或leases门，故root完整Release等待租约不能被概括成任何节点移除/替换都受同一租约保护。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“root closing置位与API准入 / 租约 → 立即拒新状态与租约，不等于所有查询/删除都禁用”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：代码未给出所有方法的全域并发安全保证；不将允许调用某查询/Remove的事实解释为对资源在用状态必然安全。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：stopping.Token在CancellationTokenSource已Dispose之后的外部访问合同未在这里运行验证，不作应用级行为推断。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b00ffd9614c944e8c9a5abb9477401b86b04667d03783a92c8ba7c428d2f24e5" href="../../证据/b00ffd9614c944e8c9a5abb9477401b86b04667d03783a92c8ba7c428d2f24e5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b00ffd9614c9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c1fdec128386617fb806271f04cf9c49ebc3ffb414286470b3d305f549a896a6" href="../../证据/c1fdec128386617fb806271f04cf9c49ebc3ffb414286470b3d305f549a896a6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c1fdec128386</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9b1bc69960793ee8cd7c99ab26caa9bb4333ad6075fb47d931d735f7494e5e5e" href="../../证据/9b1bc69960793ee8cd7c99ab26caa9bb4333ad6075fb47d931d735f7494e5e5e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9b1bc6996079</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9bdb5ada7a12a4eb3889a4bf900f9c7482008d0490a4d04017f3d5118683c81" href="../../证据/b9bdb5ada7a12a4eb3889a4bf900f9c7482008d0490a4d04017f3d5118683c81.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9bdb5ada7a1</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4091fd40ad598f1bef1ca79035d29af8d004e4c17e7f12659d90fd5e779afeba" href="../../证据/4091fd40ad598f1bef1ca79035d29af8d004e4c17e7f12659d90fd5e779afeba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4091fd40ad59</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2fb74670d574a271d0cb5235bcc52177ff5b4839e9c22fdcb02759751e179343" href="../../证据/2fb74670d574a271d0cb5235bcc52177ff5b4839e9c22fdcb02759751e179343.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2fb74670d574</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.Parameters.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da16abd392367c1273981da0cd67a30389675f77d48ba998c04ea64931f8e9b1" href="../../证据/da16abd392367c1273981da0cd67a30389675f77d48ba998c04ea64931f8e9b1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da16abd39236</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR04 · 取消或资源Dispose异常后的root Dispose / Lease.Exit → root清理是一次性尝试；failedResources保留不等于排队重试</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Dispose设置closing后，stopping.Cancel抛Exception会RecordCleanupFailure(cancel,stopping,error)，finally仍设置cancellationComplete并TryRelease；不是因取消回调异常就跳过该finally。TryRelease要求closing、cancellationComplete、leases==0且!releaseStarted，在真正Release前置releaseStarted=true。Release对各IDisposable的Exception分别记录后继续下一资源，并单独尝试stopping.Dispose；这点现有CR06已有，本事实新增明确重试边界：root重复Dispose因closing立即return，后续Exit也因releaseStarted不再启动第二遍，failedResources只保留对象，所选类没有重试/清空该表的方法。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“取消或资源Dispose异常后的root Dispose / Lease.Exit → root清理是一次性尝试；failedResources保留不等于排队重试”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不把源码Exception catch扩大为任何OOM、进程退出或任意RecordCleanupFailure自身失败时也必完整清理。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本条是源码静态事实；另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限异常与重复Dispose。GC、真实资源/GUI/设备及native释放未观测，不以幂等调用门推成功释放/原版等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="25130754904625cadcdad559712b1e9298d053ebf76c32aa1fd99c72476ca2de" href="../../证据/25130754904625cadcdad559712b1e9298d053ebf76c32aa1fd99c72476ca2de.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>251307549046</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f2e6a8876eda1fe94b3bfcc7876c5a9418ec89c22b3f630b0946e517cf0c13a0" href="../../证据/f2e6a8876eda1fe94b3bfcc7876c5a9418ec89c22b3f630b0946e517cf0c13a0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f2e6a8876eda</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="61daf69cd32d9631373aa1e2980f2bcdfb5c67b3667360b8d8ac2aca74c61898" href="../../证据/61daf69cd32d9631373aa1e2980f2bcdfb5c67b3667360b8d8ac2aca74c61898.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>61daf69cd32d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188" href="../../证据/310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>310faafd8596</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd2d67c66bdbf31088a906a44fad23a3cec8952a95b0b9cae68c729032eb3644" href="../../证据/bd2d67c66bdbf31088a906a44fad23a3cec8952a95b0b9cae68c729032eb3644.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd2d67c66bdb</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ca8fde56b8897ea11321f59623422ce5471c7fe1eda7a67886f3d360b0e0a7ba" href="../../证据/ca8fde56b8897ea11321f59623422ce5471c7fe1eda7a67886f3d360b0e0a7ba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ca8fde56b889</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0564c5545b60182cc37a0c1578d6e328f22f0eb5693b954dd058b2adf97291f7" href="../../证据/0564c5545b60182cc37a0c1578d6e328f22f0eb5693b954dd058b2adf97291f7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0564c5545b60</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR07 · Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose → 退宿主事件 → MainViewControl.Dispose → Content=null</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>已恢复的Release包装层Dispose先调用自身Unloaded处理以解除方案事件，再解除RestoreDefaultDisplay，mainViewControl非null才调用其Dispose，最后Content=null。新PE扫描确认其method token 0x06000038、IL offset 40的call目标正是VMControls.WPF.MainViewControl.Dispose（MemberRef 0x0a000086），不是接口候选猜测。保留shell MainWindow.xaml实例化Release控件、该控件XAML嵌入普通MainViewControl的声明，原三份对应BAML资源已重取。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose → 退宿主事件 → MainViewControl.Dispose → Content=null”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：谁在具体关闭主窗/切方案操作中调用Release.Dispose尚未定位，不能由XAML构造或IDisposable实现推自动调用。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原生像素与显示最后读者、全部异常退出和主宿主实际运行顺序仍未知。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF.Release/VMControls.WPF.Release/VmMainViewConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="83ecb93cd769f476908429cb9afae47c53089dcb0427541083e4fa6da98437d2" href="../../证据/83ecb93cd769f476908429cb9afae47c53089dcb0427541083e4fa6da98437d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>83ecb93cd769</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF.Release/VMControls.WPF.Release/VmMainViewConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="73ecf41af0f60dcfd6a249a43574603d39062fc1dca784a4f009a7b5018bb077" href="../../证据/73ecf41af0f60dcfd6a249a43574603d39062fc1dca784a4f009a7b5018bb077.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>73ecf41af0f6</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF.Release/VMControls.WPF.Release/VmMainViewConfigControl.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e9067eaea4f5e89982cc527d195dbe1f78ee22579d692b30cdca13df2dc3bbd8" href="../../证据/e9067eaea4f5e89982cc527d195dbe1f78ee22579d692b30cdca13df2dc3bbd8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e9067eaea4f5</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VisionMasterMain/VisionMasterMain/MainWindow.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0ebc66bd488b52189414bc307634f3d5e79ce68f3cff777b8ced50e1e029fec0" href="../../证据/0ebc66bd488b52189414bc307634f3d5e79ce68f3cff777b8ced50e1e029fec0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0ebc66bd488b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-retirement.resources/caller-scan.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4abac833528f5b0715a470f4cc497e7bcf6d56e9d6a9e3c17f2c333745fae47f" href="../../证据/4abac833528f5b0715a470f4cc497e7bcf6d56e9d6a9e3c17f2c333745fae47f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4abac833528f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR08 · ResetDisposeStatus → ZoomArea SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify → true通知只解除搜索控件事件，不调用图像Dispose</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ProcedureConfigControl.ResetDisposeStatus将IsDisposeNotify先true再false。保留ZoomArea.xaml将祖先ProcedureConfigControl的该属性绑定到DryPopup.IsDisposeNotify；该DP注册OnDisposeStatusChanged，只有NewValue=true才DeleteSelf。DeleteSelf解除TextBox的TextChanged/LostFocus/GotFocus、清除按钮Click及宿主Window的LocationChanged/Deactivated，再_window=null。所选完整体没有调用MainViewControl.Dispose，不清图像或模块结果；这条通知不能再被当成图像释放触发器。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“ResetDisposeStatus → ZoomArea SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify → true通知只解除搜索控件事件，不调用图像Dispose”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：当前只闭合一个静态模板消费者；原模板是否在特定宿主激活、其它IsDisposeNotify消费者与重复模板应用生命周期未穷举。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bcb889050a265f1870abb13b3ab1b318eed6a9eb06785198195020b8a080c0ff" href="../../证据/bcb889050a265f1870abb13b3ab1b318eed6a9eb06785198195020b8a080c0ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bcb889050a26</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/ZoomArea.xaml</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6c123919bc5efd7c2bdc048e1b8cb9cf4d6c476870c450d4d7bef4af9d2d0e4a" href="../../证据/6c123919bc5efd7c2bdc048e1b8cb9cf4d6c476870c450d4d7bef4af9d2d0e4a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6c123919bc5e</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/SearchDryPopup.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ed6af86cce4a8dd11a4097977d5462e346a80b108c355664866e83db91c8ca68" href="../../证据/ed6af86cce4a8dd11a4097977d5462e346a80b108c355664866e83db91c8ca68.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ed6af86cce4a</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/SearchDryPopup.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="065d575258ee3d838663c92a4fdaa6b4f35eccf1552d936ff60156b8555665cd" href="../../证据/065d575258ee3d838663c92a4fdaa6b4f35eccf1552d936ff60156b8555665cd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>065d575258ee</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP04 · 原UserData赋值 → 分支化撤销载荷持有，不是统一原子保存事务</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>全局模块以及CheckedImages/DESIGNERBUFFER/ConfigAvailable直接Set；动态ModifyConfig先登记AllUserData再Set，DynamicIO普通写绕过记录，其他动态分支有先记录或后记录差异。普通分支先Get旧byte[]、Set新值，再按引用不等及CheckItemParamReady特例登记。RecordSingleData将oldValue/newValue直接赋给UnRedo_UserData字段，没有该处数组深复制。AllUserData先保存表达式，CanRegister在允许的root操作且未重复时才Compile执行抓取；不能把表达式创建时点当快照完成时点。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“原UserData赋值 → 分支化撤销载荷持有，不是统一原子保存事务”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不把字节引用登记称深克隆；外部IUnRedoService是否接受/何时清记录、VmModule.GetAllUserData/SetUserData全量格式仍需独立追踪。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d7c92adfd1dd69857d2414aeebb68373772f3f2eb611ee60666f0af1faaa8e4d" href="../../证据/d7c92adfd1dd69857d2414aeebb68373772f3f2eb611ee60666f0af1faaa8e4d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d7c92adfd1dd</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ced43def5b4394e6f7306a84def49f5f1881459868a0774c4a27f63bb1ec61f4" href="../../证据/ced43def5b4394e6f7306a84def49f5f1881459868a0774c4a27f63bb1ec61f4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ced43def5b43</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="974f20afcc09e739f09fa161479cfac33a8d8690f2f051601ab5cab212cfe7b5" href="../../证据/974f20afcc09e739f09fa161479cfac33a8d8690f2f051601ab5cab212cfe7b5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>974f20afcc09</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8ce57591679d6d82fe6b8e7d697d2e994b4d229c8d6a0dc244a8fd9c3cef2614" href="../../证据/8ce57591679d6d82fe6b8e7d697d2e994b4d229c8d6a0dc244a8fd9c3cef2614.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8ce57591679d</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/UserData.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58ef8702b50b9d2e925ce3d8e91483253c4e045795f612f3f95fe1a07ffa2d53" href="../../证据/58ef8702b50b9d2e925ce3d8e91483253c4e045795f612f3f95fe1a07ffa2d53.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58ef8702b50b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>HP01 · GraphEditorDocument.Capture → CaptureSnapshot → 配置文档副本 → 内存快照或独占JSON文件载荷</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Capture先Copy(document)，再SerializeToUtf8Bytes。仅当没有显式historyPayloadParentDirectory且字节数小于64KiB时，Snapshot直接保存传入的文档副本；其余情况创建HistoryPayloadStore并写独占.payload。Snapshot还保存ProcedureId和BaseDirectory。Restore通过Snapshot.Document读取/反序列化，再从旧BaseDirectory重基到当前BaseDirectory，替换document并Dirty/Revision/Changed；没有把workflowSessions、scope或工具像素FIFO装进这个Snapshot。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“GraphEditorDocument.Capture → CaptureSnapshot → 配置文档副本 → 内存快照或独占JSON文件载荷”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：仅源码级配置快照合同；不证明原版undo载荷或当前完整GUI操作等价，也未据此测量内存峰值。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4c3ac12d3435cf9956a0527c054a7d5c0e6d1bfdd336bf65e5198c2fab936e51" href="../../证据/4c3ac12d3435cf9956a0527c054a7d5c0e6d1bfdd336bf65e5198c2fab936e51.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4c3ac12d3435</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="edfe94ff86a2eabb61c6c15c4ba88cbe93ce01e17cf0b1f8cad8ca37ae4c9774" href="../../证据/edfe94ff86a2eabb61c6c15c4ba88cbe93ce01e17cf0b1f8cad8ca37ae4c9774.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>edfe94ff86a2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="646cc4268bf3d69f42b5b28c68e6bd80e27243f739b563fcf00941fa5a8e8e12" href="../../证据/646cc4268bf3d69f42b5b28c68e6bd80e27243f739b563fcf00941fa5a8e8e12.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>646cc4268bf3</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691" href="../../证据/dd3930e245ff32616037405d4b66549c168a5f0d04f49783ac5f1ac23c695691.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dd3930e245ff</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="93ca0cb3fa9c240d2ebca8145901c780625aa5379af2368887cfdc097f0210f8" href="../../证据/93ca0cb3fa9c240d2ebca8145901c780625aa5379af2368887cfdc097f0210f8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>93ca0cb3fa9c</small></a></details></details><details><summary>HP02 · HistoryPayloadStore.CreateMemory / AcquireFile / Retain → 字节复制、共享Entry引用数与借用文件权限分开</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>CreateMemory调用bytes.ToArray，Read内存条目再次ToArray；文件Read调用File.ReadAllBytes。AcquireFile把路径归一并按OrdinalIgnoreCase查既有Entry，命中只增加References并返回新租约；未命中且文件存在时登记BorrowedFile，不取得删除权。Retain同样增加Entry引用数；它不会产生新文件或复制原文件内容。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“HistoryPayloadStore.CreateMemory / AcquireFile / Retain → 字节复制、共享Entry引用数与借用文件权限分开”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：路径大小写策略是当前实现的比较器选择，不是原版路径或跨平台文件身份等价证明；外部修改/删除借用文件的运行竞争未验证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/HistoryPayloadStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="90fadad6f8fd61bc92c7a3a1adb8f9dddd3e03b9b403e182c420f7290dd355c5" href="../../证据/90fadad6f8fd61bc92c7a3a1adb8f9dddd3e03b9b403e182c420f7290dd355c5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>90fadad6f8fd</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/HistoryPayloadStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="06aa4bec97c4fc8317d02fbf200dee7af54cfb4c5a83047855af0cc5210943a2" href="../../证据/06aa4bec97c4fc8317d02fbf200dee7af54cfb4c5a83047855af0cc5210943a2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>06aa4bec97c4</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/HistoryPayloadStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9d32cea65032f916db81a47810fc90a816445033b4e00e33a342c1d8b1093bf9" href="../../证据/9d32cea65032f916db81a47810fc90a816445033b4e00e33a342c1d8b1093bf9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9d32cea65032</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/HistoryPayloadStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="196892f91014c7c935dedb24ba5368c5db2384e2ade3061b6a780d1e26cca251" href="../../证据/196892f91014c7c935dedb24ba5368c5db2384e2ade3061b6a780d1e26cca251.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>196892f91014</small></a></details></details><details><summary>HP03 · HistoryPayloadLease.Dispose → Store.Release → 先删除owned文件再撤Entry；失败可保留可重试租约</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Entry.References>1时只减计数；最后引用若OwnedFile先File.Delete，成功后才entries.Remove、Bytes=null、References=0。删除抛错时Entry仍live，Lease.Dispose保留owner并重抛；如果Entry已移除而随后目录清理抛错，catch依据IsLive=false把owner清空，不能把两类异常都当文件仍有可重试租约。Store.Dispose只closing，尚有Entry时等待最后租约，不强制遍历删除。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“HistoryPayloadLease.Dispose → Store.Release → 先删除owned文件再撤Entry；失败可保留可重试租约”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：源码中两个Dispose方法处于不同类型，引用会保留各自完整区段；未用真实文件占用、权限故障或GUI并发作本轮运行验证。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/HistoryPayloadStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e0ff4a5f2df745288a9acf94380219366668fb7e1032dd9d6b0d7b98a355c2c" href="../../证据/1e0ff4a5f2df745288a9acf94380219366668fb7e1032dd9d6b0d7b98a355c2c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e0ff4a5f2df</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/HistoryPayloadStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c0d35923c459fd5a522aea41911c3d28038a2102f3d0e2928240d1593d28b709" href="../../证据/c0d35923c459fd5a522aea41911c3d28038a2102f3d0e2928240d1593d28b709.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c0d35923c459</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/HistoryPayloadStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a4e0b3f5f4b18b658a9b3b232aaecf46cb38e0129423be7918387dd466a8b232" href="../../证据/a4e0b3f5f4b18b658a9b3b232aaecf46cb38e0129423be7918387dd466a8b232.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a4e0b3f5f4b1</small></a></details></details><details><summary>HP04 · DocumentHistoryPart.AdaptOldValue / AdaptNewValue → 先换当前payload，旧payload释放失败则单独保留</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>AdaptOldValue先调用adapt产生next，非同引用时先将OldValue=next，再ReleaseReplaced(previous)；AdaptNewValue同理且要求IsDataComplete。ReleaseReplaced失败把旧值加入retainedValues并重抛，因此适配失败不表示原payload仍是当前值。Release分别尝试OldValue、已捕获newValue和retainedValues，成功项设标志或移出；Root逐part聚合错误，Engine把失败Root加入retainedReleaseFailures。显式ReleaseRetainedPayloads才重试这些Root。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“DocumentHistoryPart.AdaptOldValue / AdaptNewValue → 先换当前payload，旧payload释放失败则单独保留”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未穷举adapt/capture/restore的全部异常组合；原动作历史与当前JSON载荷的全量对应继续未知。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/DocumentHistoryEngine.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c6784b516addf6f1f7c65c5dec57a9c770c5f4870d7c8e17dc32ca45cf5e4358" href="../../证据/c6784b516addf6f1f7c65c5dec57a9c770c5f4870d7c8e17dc32ca45cf5e4358.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c6784b516add</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/DocumentHistoryEngine.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6e2175afe7d0dbdc47586944859f49269a4e2243aca5ed9b79f425e7263b2c73" href="../../证据/6e2175afe7d0dbdc47586944859f49269a4e2243aca5ed9b79f425e7263b2c73.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6e2175afe7d0</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/DocumentHistoryEngine.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb8381e07097de2fcdc27859c07b71ccba0f4b6bd0d9f71a288919836d214e98" href="../../证据/bb8381e07097de2fcdc27859c07b71ccba0f4b6bd0d9f71a288919836d214e98.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb8381e07097</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/DocumentHistoryEngine.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c17ab4ed0501a950d3eed95f61354e41b787f5831e71fce1406a4180329b07c9" href="../../证据/c17ab4ed0501a950d3eed95f61354e41b787f5831e71fce1406a4180329b07c9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c17ab4ed0501</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PST05 · GraphEditorDocument.Save保留既有history → 旧BaseDirectory快照与SaveAs之后的RestoreSnapshot</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Save没有history.Clear、solutionGeneration递增或SolutionReplaced事件，而Load在提交时明确执行这些操作。Snapshot保留ProcedureId与创建时BaseDirectory，并持有MemoryDocument或payload；Capture把Copy(document)作为快照输入。因此已有历史快照可继续保留旧Resources/嵌入Base64，即使保存投影的新Resources已过滤或替换；并非每次Save必有这样的快照。RestoreSnapshot用snapshot.Document及snapshot.BaseDirectory按当前BaseDirectory重新Rebase，然后替换document/选择流程/标dirty/Revision/Changed，不修改当前FilePath/BaseDirectory，也不写方案文件。</p><p>历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役：这条既有事实明确核实“GraphEditorDocument.Save保留既有history → 旧BaseDirectory快照与SaveAs之后的RestoreSnapshot”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">历史内存/临时gro/sol/UserData载荷与scope/显示队列寿命不同；密码取消、重放次序、文件失败保留及旧回调隔离需联合状态表。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：历史中是否实际存在含旧嵌入资源的快照取决于此前操作，未把条件持有推成所有Save的必然内存驻留。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：这里只确认文档历史与路径边界；payload文件租约/删除失败、GUI回放与原版行为分别保留其独立证据。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a64a42e30e38baee4efcf7db242a1bf79ba4b3828407e0bf1bd6c941820f352f" href="../../证据/a64a42e30e38baee4efcf7db242a1bf79ba4b3828407e0bf1bd6c941820f352f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a64a42e30e38</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4dc95e0a6349fbb0a84a6f728c5ce9ac3a3801585543766179277d1499d2803" href="../../证据/f4dc95e0a6349fbb0a84a6f728c5ce9ac3a3801585543766179277d1499d2803.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4dc95e0a634</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b4cf1c21b98b38823e790df0273588734fb8a00f21effb83f674971f8059246f" href="../../证据/b4cf1c21b98b38823e790df0273588734fb8a00f21effb83f674971f8059246f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b4cf1c21b98b</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="52ea4c767bf701f3e4d50a9e21a741b83c0a21f030046ea2da1f8920b61d5284" href="../../证据/52ea4c767bf701f3e4d50a9e21a741b83c0a21f030046ea2da1f8920b61d5284.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>52ea4c767bf7</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="646cc4268bf3d69f42b5b28c68e6bd80e27243f739b563fcf00941fa5a8e8e12" href="../../证据/646cc4268bf3d69f42b5b28c68e6bd80e27243f739b563fcf00941fa5a8e8e12.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>646cc4268bf3</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>history-replay:H05 · UnRedoSchedule.Register → 录入门 → BuildRoot / BuildPart</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>录入要求_unRedoing&lt;=0与_nLaziLoading&lt;=0；part需已有根且根未ForbidBuild；可选CanRegister也要求根并执行谓词。按IsPart分流，不将所有操作都当整文档快照。</p><p>计划将C01归入F-21，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/batch16-20261019/B/unredo-source/UnRedoSchedule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ce9bd1b274704329013067bb9ff6d7447f571e6fc1615f0338b5ec187c36c772" href="../../证据/ce9bd1b274704329013067bb9ff6d7447f571e6fc1615f0338b5ec187c36c772.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ce9bd1b27470</small></a></details></details><details><summary>history-replay:H06 · BuildRoot / BuildPart → 根入undo / part才清redo</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>BuildRoot构造动作集合、名称/栈归属/类型并TryPush，移出的根Dispose。BuildPart已有undo才按是否IDisposeTempFile选择清redo方式，再挂Parent和动作；创建空根本身未在此清redo。</p><p>计划将C01归入F-21，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/batch16-20261019/B/unredo-source/UnRedoSchedule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0497591fb0e2dd698f13c7931760cb476680475a36ba993872d2acd4e815f6c7" href="../../证据/0497591fb0e2dd698f13c7931760cb476680475a36ba993872d2acd4e815f6c7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0497591fb0e2</small></a></details></details><details><summary>history-replay:H08 · UnRedoSchedule.Undo → 补新数据 → 迁移栈 → 回放</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>递增_unRedoing后UpdateActionData，Pop undo并Push redo，BuildParams内提供反向RecoverStack回调，标栈归属再Undo。捕获异常为空；finally递减并通知，不能推断异常自动恢复栈。</p><p>计划将C04归入F-21，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/batch16-20261019/B/unredo-source/UnRedoSchedule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d3f9b6736cc4576c84bd6def45040315d9d92522e7fc4aa9743706f9aa0c7c01" href="../../证据/d3f9b6736cc4576c84bd6def45040315d9d92522e7fc4aa9743706f9aa0c7c01.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d3f9b6736cc4</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/batch16-20261019/B/unredo-source/UnRedoSchedule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8869d33742c5f4e79ed23911cd49258d27a69dec40672c7ffb938ebf92ea91ec" href="../../证据/8869d33742c5f4e79ed23911cd49258d27a69dec40672c7ffb938ebf92ea91ec.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8869d33742c5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>history-replay:H10 · RootUnRedoOperation.Undo / Redo → CopyModule 特例 / priority顺序</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>CopyModule的Undo逆序全部动作，Redo先非Lower再Lower；普通Undo先Heigher逆序再其余逆序，普通Redo先Heigher正序再其余。不能用统一栈逆序代替动作执行规则。</p><p>计划将C04归入F-21，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/batch16-20261019/B/unredo-source/RootUnRedoOperation.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d0496f59e12d410c7bbd9d106da535e4c05e57c289c2f966da1971a56fafa812" href="../../证据/d0496f59e12d410c7bbd9d106da535e4c05e57c289c2f966da1971a56fafa812.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d0496f59e12d</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/batch16-20261019/B/unredo-source/RootUnRedoOperation.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8299f9a6e338c98001ef83f71635eb574b0e4609482b4c95828bb6d0910114ae" href="../../证据/8299f9a6e338c98001ef83f71635eb574b0e4609482b4c95828bb6d0910114ae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8299f9a6e338</small></a></details></details><details><summary>history-replay:C07 · ReleaseRoot / ReleaseRetainedPayloads → 清理失败保留所有权与错误</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>根释放失败记录error并保留root；显式ReleaseRetainedPayloads重试，Clear/Dispose本身不声称所有文件已删除。不是静默循环重试。</p><p>计划将C04归入F-21，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/DocumentHistoryEngine.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c17ab4ed0501a950d3eed95f61354e41b787f5831e71fce1406a4180329b07c9" href="../../证据/c17ab4ed0501a950d3eed95f61354e41b787f5831e71fce1406a4180329b07c9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c17ab4ed0501</small></a></details></details><details><summary>plugin-sessions:C12 · scope Enter / Dispose / Exit → 取消后等租约归零再释放</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Enter 在根锁下累加lease；Dispose标closing并取消，finally写cancellationComplete，TryRelease要求leases==0且尚未release。最后Exit可能触发Release，逐资源释放并收CleanupFailures；这属于当前资源合同。</p><p>计划将C05/C07归入F-21，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“历史root/part载荷、结果缓存及关闭退役”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="455219ce3023ddf5b572bcfb4661a3bef25d32ed078ee26d46f540c66366f395" href="../../证据/455219ce3023ddf5b572bcfb4661a3bef25d32ed078ee26d46f540c66366f395.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>455219ce3023</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58374d2a1ded1c3eacb2813f60c107e96da734c47c1afe7eb98ade8041f60908" href="../../证据/58374d2a1ded1c3eacb2813f60c107e96da734c47c1afe7eb98ade8041f60908.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58374d2a1ded</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-22" id="F-22"><summary>F-22 · 真实工具集成 · 采用的插件提交、真实数据合同与发布消费</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：注册/源码可见不等于发布版已消费；需明确采用SHA和版本合同，逐工具主窗→Group→保存重开→退出的数据验证，未实现工具保留目录入口。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>A07 · 通用发现接入与缺插件体验</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>ToolNavigation/ModuleRegistry与已审查插件清单</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>目录到注册工厂、重复/版本/禁用的合同与呈现</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>用户选择插件提交后逐文件集成；展开拖放配置运行保存重开；缺失/不兼容/热刷新</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>至少一个真实插件消费；失败无悬挂节点；不扫描执行未知DLL；共享入口锁解除后实施</dd></dl><p>原工具类型构造和当前显式目录/能力注册片段；重复、版本、禁用与真实插件验收未全覆盖</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement A07</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7949338c0b81661e00db76b2d4f74a41cb11c730f1164b92cdce561bc2f9090b" href="../../证据/7949338c0b81661e00db76b2d4f74a41cb11c730f1164b92cdce561bc2f9090b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7949338c0b81</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B07 · 插件交接合同与真实消费</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>FCR生产者/消费者、提交级接口和真实工具</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>已交付插件是否满足框架的身份/数据/会话合同</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>等待用户选择提交；只审已提交差异，逐字段兼容；根流程与Group验证真实端口/参数/ROI</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>明确实际采用SHA与合同；待集成和已实现分开；不搬未提交文件</dd></dl><p>仅映射当前provider、编辑所有者与scope合同消费；提交级采用SHA及真实工具交付验收未在此矩阵证明</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B07</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="240fda248171a769d3c39c3ea86545b7618b69e4e159ad991114ae0f2fb8c229" href="../../证据/240fda248171a769d3c39c3ea86545b7618b69e4e159ad991114ae0f2fb8c229.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>240fda248171</small></a></details></details><details><summary>B08 · 模型与Group组合验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>真实插件、嵌套Group、变量、ROI与历史持久化组合</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>单项通过后组合是否保持身份和数据一致</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>混合类型/多层/循环中断/累积/改型/撤销/保存重开/停止失败恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每场景对照原机输出和状态；失败不读陈旧结果；组合未知仍开放</dd></dl><p>模型/Group组合验收：需嵌套、变量、累积、保存重开和再次运行的同场景证据。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement B08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e" href="../../证据/4f3a8f2e940f3aa0cc3f50f099a0149fd990ab4e79629ef84733d796115b1a4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f3a8f2e940f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D07 · 真实工具集成及干净环境验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>已采用插件提交→主窗口→根流程/Group→发布版</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>最终集成和发布是否重现开发环境结果</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>用户选择合流后按提交整合；真实工具全链；干净win-x64环境、资源路径、离线/失败/升级回退</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>采用SHA明确；用户桌面可见窗口、实际运行、保存重开、退出释放有证据；未交付工具不计覆盖</dd></dl><p>最终集成与发布：需实际采用SHA、发布版主窗、执行与保存重开/退出释放证据；注册代码不等于交付验收。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D07</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="faed7e767fedfd771cb9fc87381d34b5eeef3af2937a6fb377d12bb28b6fa76a" href="../../证据/faed7e767fedfd771cb9fc87381d34b5eeef3af2937a6fb377d12bb28b6fa76a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>faed7e767fed</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>CP03 · 节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每个节点先从已复制n.Parameters建立新的字典，补Clone后的默认JSON值，再在执行到此节点时通过workflow.Resolve解析订阅；参数订阅经WorkflowSubscriptions.Parameter检查标量种类并SerializeToElement，覆盖该节点参数。普通连线则直接把上游PortValue赋入nodeInputs。ExecuteAsync收到两套ReadOnlyDictionary包装；ModuleExecutionContext构造器直接持有这两套只读接口。只读包装没有复制PortValue中图像/对象的含义。</p><p>采用的插件提交、真实数据合同与发布消费：这条既有事实明确核实“节点开始前解析默认值和订阅 → ModuleExecutionContext.Parameters与Inputs”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">注册/源码可见不等于发布版已消费；需明确采用SHA和版本合同，逐工具主窗→Group→保存重开→退出的数据验证，未实现工具保留目录入口。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：DataKinds.Coerce及插件执行可有自己的转换/复制规则；仅凭框架字典不能推定任意具体图像在工具内零复制或深复制。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：下游动态读取服务与原生参数setter认可状态不在这条托管参数传递事实内。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633" href="../../证据/e137f34d98c9bd8d601d0431181d23f39cd9bef3fbb5aaaab397267c0e153633.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e137f34d98c9</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464" href="../../证据/a2d27b66691dbacc09438773a4d253a75eae18c600a4674d4df3be7680813464.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a2d27b66691d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/WorkflowSubscriptions.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662" href="../../证据/f51cff92f0bd326aa4ea33e68021afade3b392de806947e9710a0bb27fe45662.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f51cff92f0bd</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484" href="../../证据/e79249d8651ce00e142ef19325d1a0d3aa42a4e9405006b4e50f0deceedc8484.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e79249d8651c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39" href="../../证据/c50568f01e327d7d3ccf6e9fd8a3c926987d75b4817708d7a55f07317dec7a39.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c50568f01e32</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CP04 · 工具配置自执行RunConfiguredTool → 本次配置参数副本与独立节点请求</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>配置自执行在调度前取得doc.Document中的procedure/node，Clone传入values；已解析参数订阅和默认值后建立isolated节点，再交GraphExecutor。ParameterSeed显式返回这次捕获node.Parameters，applied则是传入编辑值加本次绑定解析后的parameters，二者不可混称同一个快照。上游available重新建字典但里面仍为NodeRunRecord/PortValue引用；图像没有随JSON参数Clone自动复制。</p><p>采用的插件提交、真实数据合同与发布消费：这条既有事实明确核实“工具配置自执行RunConfiguredTool → 本次配置参数副本与独立节点请求”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">注册/源码可见不等于发布版已消费；需明确采用SHA和版本合同，逐工具主窗→Group→保存重开→退出的数据验证，未实现工具保留目录入口。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不能把全流程activeRun门移植成配置自执行期间全部编辑必被拒绝；各配置操作门不同。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：此处记录复用不是图像生产者生命周期或插件缓存释放的完整证明。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f49326ebeac23b3d2f85661096a899bd823bbf4d2bbf3ad811bf1fc7110211a" href="../../证据/4f49326ebeac23b3d2f85661096a899bd823bbf4d2bbf3ad811bf1fc7110211a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f49326ebeac</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2ea3760981c2cf4e1ee0f81cfdec2fd479fec11a947e7d1dc6400f558b75abf8" href="../../证据/2ea3760981c2cf4e1ee0f81cfdec2fd479fec11a947e7d1dc6400f558b75abf8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2ea3760981c2</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5dcb396fb7df87181facc43015df866630ed0359a57776de8aae3fc2cc0829f4" href="../../证据/5dcb396fb7df87181facc43015df866630ed0359a57776de8aae3fc2cc0829f4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5dcb396fb7df</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CP06 · 用户保存方案 → 插件持久化投影→JSON方案文件→编辑器提交</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>MainWindow将doc.PrepareSave接到plugins.PrepareSave(document,baseDirectory,executionScope)。GraphEditorDocument.Save向PrepareSave传入Copy(document)，插件注册表只对IToolAssetPersistence参与者调用其PrepareSave(node,catalog,procedureScope)，回收这些插件前缀资源并采用返回Node/Resources。随后重基路径、SolutionStore验证和序列化方案，经同目录临时文件Flush(true)+Move覆盖成功后编辑器才提交rebased文档。框架没有把scope有效参数或运行结果字典统一自动拷回所有节点。</p><p>采用的插件提交、真实数据合同与发布消费：这条既有事实明确核实“用户保存方案 → 插件持久化投影→JSON方案文件→编辑器提交”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">注册/源码可见不等于发布版已消费；需明确采用SHA和版本合同，逐工具主窗→Group→保存重开→退出的数据验证，未实现工具保留目录入口。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本片段不展开每个IToolAssetPersistence参与者；不能宣称所有最后运行参数、缓存图像、SDK内部状态都能保存和重开恢复。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：插件PrepareSave在最终方案文件提交前可能有自身资产写入副作用；此处只证明方案文件提交顺序，不宣称全资产跨文件事务。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.xaml.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4cc28c3847610e14ba36a44eb663c05de11b3dc92d1ef8e32f727a9df0da8f8b" href="../../证据/4cc28c3847610e14ba36a44eb663c05de11b3dc92d1ef8e32f727a9df0da8f8b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4cc28c384761</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f" href="../../证据/9ed5d7beed272a2479fc0b2c06e161edfe8944d7b740cfef4b6f9266b3858f5f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9ed5d7beed27</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionPluginContracts/Contracts.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b2bf628ee4ba486c7fbcfdee3e2415c7500e722fd23ab5e41b6eb6270108c297" href="../../证据/b2bf628ee4ba486c7fbcfdee3e2415c7500e722fd23ab5e41b6eb6270108c297.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b2bf628ee4ba</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/SolutionStore.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="df7dca5bb4adc6503a57abd82d22c53b76afed5b93a675e219260708e6f671c0" href="../../证据/df7dca5bb4adc6503a57abd82d22c53b76afed5b93a675e219260708e6f671c0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>df7dca5bb4ad</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>loading-navigation:C03 · ReadCategoryTools / RefreshToolCatalog → 显式插件合同注册 / 新分类状态</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>读取 JSON；声明 Implementation 才按身份加载并注册，拒绝已注册身份；刷新清目录/分类状态与失败会话，重建工具栏。不是执行原 InfoCs 目录协议。</p><p>计划将A07/B07归入F-22，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“采用的插件提交、真实数据合同与发布消费”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。ManagedToolCatalogLoadSession 内部二进制装载、注册事务和版本合同需另图。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolNavigation.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="08de1279004c2fc47c2f6a030afb41a35a9ccaaae17321dd42bf515bd81a6c36" href="../../证据/08de1279004c2fc47c2f6a030afb41a35a9ccaaae17321dd42bf515bd81a6c36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>08de1279004c</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolNavigation.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9bd218aa73c8a50b9aa1bacb16f23eea950adcd002171686ddd6a52e247db133" href="../../证据/9bd218aa73c8a50b9aa1bacb16f23eea950adcd002171686ddd6a52e247db133.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9bd218aa73c8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>plugin-sessions:C01 · OpenToolConfiguration → Group 分流 / provider 能力检查</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Group 调用节点转 OpenSubprogramCall；普通节点拒绝关闭/锁/运行态，要求配置 provider 或 WPF factory，无能力则显示未接入。捕获 solution/procedure/node 身份，再交配置窗口宿主。</p><p>计划将A07/B07归入F-22，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“采用的插件提交、真实数据合同与发布消费”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionEditor/ToolConfigurationHost.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="35890cf3dc7d018a4f4185395c21ca80cc8afcf4cc6761c17ca04cb60616a550" href="../../证据/35890cf3dc7d018a4f4185395c21ca80cc8afcf4cc6761c17ca04cb60616a550.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>35890cf3dc7d</small></a></details></details><details><summary>plugin-sessions:C11 · ModuleExecutionScope.ForProcedure / State → 借用流程视图 / 方案根资源</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>ForProcedure 返回绑定流程的借用视图；State 键是 procedure/module/node 三元组，状态由根scope保存。借用视图 Dispose 不关闭整个方案；不是每轮重建所有工具状态。</p><p>计划将B07归入F-22，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“采用的插件提交、真实数据合同与发布消费”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9b1bc69960793ee8cd7c99ab26caa9bb4333ad6075fb47d931d735f7494e5e5e" href="../../证据/9b1bc69960793ee8cd7c99ab26caa9bb4333ad6075fb47d931d735f7494e5e5e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9b1bc6996079</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b00ffd9614c944e8c9a5abb9477401b86b04667d03783a92c8ba7c428d2f24e5" href="../../证据/b00ffd9614c944e8c9a5abb9477401b86b04667d03783a92c8ba7c428d2f24e5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b00ffd9614c9</small></a></details></details><p>本领域完整数据覆盖：尚未证明。不要用关联数量或静态检查当完成率。</p></details><details data-data-domain="F-23" id="F-23"><summary>F-23 · SDK / ABI / 部署 · SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖</summary><p class="dd-gap">仍缺：选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><h4>原计划要求（不当作当前阻塞指令）</h4><details><summary>C06 · 外部服务调度与故障隔离</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>全局触发/脚本/通信/设备服务的实际入口到执行链</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>服务由谁创建、触发流程、停止和保存</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>对A05每个服务建立子任务并REA取得原实现；无设备时先闭合managed/native调用，真实设备矩阵待资源</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>每服务有显式证据/合同/错误和资源边界；没有设备证据不得标硬件闭合；不默认操作连接设备</dd></dl><p>函数源/MQ及通信换方案、触发即时写入和通信文件保护的有界调查；SDK生产/native与全服务仍未闭合</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C06</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="805ad58f7626bc5d5443e009993ac0439a586f104a7c488613d7b0d5547e6205" href="../../证据/805ad58f7626bc5d5443e009993ac0439a586f104a7c488613d7b0d5547e6205.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>805ad58f7626</small></a></details></details><details><summary>C07 · 长稳、并发与异常恢复</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>连续调度/Dispatcher/SDK callbacks/关闭与恢复路径</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>长跑、并发编辑、失败后继续和退出的实际状态</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>预先定义负载/时长/内存线程句柄基线；故障用自有副本；记录全部失败与恢复</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>测量窗口与阈值有依据；无无界增长/悬挂任务；失败记录不删除；不虚报全平台无泄漏</dd></dl><p>停止等待、消息重入和当前租约释放的风险/状态分支；不包含长稳负载、阈值或无泄漏实测</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement C07</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="911fd935548a0972b2b6e8e3ad6fa8c5d52ca80fb03284c0531e1c0d0124b47d" href="../../证据/911fd935548a0972b2b6e8e3ad6fa8c5d52ca80fb03284c0531e1c0d0124b47d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>911fd935548a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D06 · SDK/API/ABI与部署依赖</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>各SDK导出/PInvoke/结构布局/加载路径及发布依赖</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>框架依赖的全部调用、布局、错误和许可/位数限制</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>列出实际调用面，REA核对签名/调用约定/所有权/版本；独立发布与SDK适配分开验证</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>逐导出和结构有证据；不将工具全库算法纳入main；干净机器依赖清单可复现</dd></dl><p>选定停止与通信保护SDK包装/指针/容量边界；不覆盖全部导出/ABI与部署依赖</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D06</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="131db478ab2888a0724f64244b919d8f15f6927c0e454c1a20aafdb65936e392" href="../../证据/131db478ab2888a0724f64244b919d8f15f6927c0e454c1a20aafdb65936e392.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>131db478ab28</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D07 · 真实工具集成及干净环境验收</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>已采用插件提交→主窗口→根流程/Group→发布版</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>最终集成和发布是否重现开发环境结果</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>用户选择合流后按提交整合；真实工具全链；干净win-x64环境、资源路径、离线/失败/升级回退</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>采用SHA明确；用户桌面可见窗口、实际运行、保存重开、退出释放有证据；未交付工具不计覆盖</dd></dl><p>最终集成与发布：需实际采用SHA、发布版主窗、执行与保存重开/退出释放证据；注册代码不等于交付验收。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D07</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="faed7e767fedfd771cb9fc87381d34b5eeef3af2937a6fb377d12bb28b6fa76a" href="../../证据/faed7e767fedfd771cb9fc87381d34b5eeef3af2937a6fb377d12bb28b6fa76a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>faed7e767fed</small></a></details></details><details><summary>D08 · 全域缺口复查与交付</summary><dl><dt>入口</dt><dd>总计划、23领域、所有任务/分支/合同/验收证据</dd><dt>要回答的数据问题</dt><dd>范围是否完整、是否把静态/独立/测试误计原生等价</dd><dt>原要求的动作</dt><dd>逐入口/类型族/文件格式/故障/资源矩阵复查；对账验收JSON/HTML和最新报告；补漏建子任务</dd><dt>原完成门槛</dt><dd>全部必需任务及子任务关闭且证据可复验才声明相应范围完成；任何未知仍保留未完成</dd></dl><p>全域收口：需对全部任务、分支、合同及未知进行完成审计；本矩阵本身不能证明收口。</p><details><summary>Authorized requirement D08</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c" href="../../证据/a8fc8475929fafd6c7fa088617c50e322aed039c274d6b6a309a6c3290bb493c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a8fc8475929f</small></a></details></details><h4>已有数据事实：只证明各自片段</h4><details><summary>VN01 · 原GlobalVariableModule key分发体RVA0x1f8c0 → ModifyVar载荷字段读取与动作跳表</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原PE字符串ModifyVar/DeleteVar的RIP-LEA候选落同一runtime范围0x1f8c0..0x25b80；本轮实际取得对应伪码和解码汇编后，确认其比较参数key并进入ModifyVar分支。入口汇编保存RCX=context、RDX=key、R8=payload、R9D=第四整数参数，分支把payload作为描述读取：名称+4、目标文本+0x204、动作+0、数量+0x304、数据pointer+0x308。动作跳表位于RVA0x25b58，原字节直接确认1→0x245bd、3→0x249ea，与托管VAR_TYPE=1/VAR_VALUE=3的描述枚举相对照。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原GlobalVariableModule key分发体RVA0x1f8c0 → ModifyVar载荷字段读取与动作跳表”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原SDK/ModuleFrame如何选到此虚成员、该成员正式符号和实际进程DLL解析未闭合；不因key一致宣称端到端调用已证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e966ba54b6dce4f2a731c1d2a5c6aed23db44805e2505a52d51c5de72c20cdec" href="../../证据/e966ba54b6dce4f2a731c1d2a5c6aed23db44805e2505a52d51c5de72c20cdec.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e966ba54b6dc</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f6c5a580b030ff6ed54c6fbc61fffeab9a490c967a71a890e53ae7f2f2a3bd88" href="../../证据/f6c5a580b030ff6ed54c6fbc61fffeab9a490c967a71a890e53ae7f2f2a3bd88.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f6c5a580b030</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ef4270aad9fd78219dd180da287dd068c9b6295d93ad1bd4284e0990105f4bb6" href="../../证据/ef4270aad9fd78219dd180da287dd068c9b6295d93ad1bd4284e0990105f4bb6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ef4270aad9fd</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c33f4499f9df6cc4259371f76fb5c3b821a7bbba0108387b7bdbfbb398c5b66" href="../../证据/7c33f4499f9df6cc4259371f76fb5c3b821a7bbba0108387b7bdbfbb398c5b66.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c33f4499f9d</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VN02 · 原VAR_VALUE动作3 → 已有类型核验 → pBinaryValue/数量传入typed值分发</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>case3从payload+0x304读数量，记录+0x448非0时将payload+0x308与数量直接交0x28250；另一分支核目标类型文本：payload+0x204非空且与记录+0x129类型不符时返回0xe000030f。通过门后调用0x28c30，汇编明确RDX=记录名称+0x29、R8=类型文本、R9=payload+0x308内的pointer，第五栈参数为数量；还在调用前stack+0x28写入字节1，不能按伪码五参数显示丢掉这个调用点事实。0x28c30原体按int/float/string分别向0x295b0/0x29eb0/0x2a7b0转发；本轮没取这些最终存储体。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原VAR_VALUE动作3 → 已有类型核验 → pBinaryValue/数量传入typed值分发”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：0x28250组合值体及0x295b0/0x29eb0/0x2a7b0 typed存储体尚未取得；copy、旧值释放和越界行为不推测。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：额外第六字节的业务含义未取得原符号，不将其命名成copy/ownership标志。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800249ea.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd26736750989f51a531369b644ee3521a7d48dc2b5bbd021894568209a2b6bd" href="../../证据/bd26736750989f51a531369b644ee3521a7d48dc2b5bbd021894568209a2b6bd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd2673675098</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800249ea.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ab2227453298c5a9d4b660964bb8937ae7087db25ae80cdf063f9b26d34f169b" href="../../证据/ab2227453298c5a9d4b660964bb8937ae7087db25ae80cdf063f9b26d34f169b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ab2227453298</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800249ea.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4541332abd9292871278901864796e35aa2942d9b3926f1c5a9030c022a17ef9" href="../../证据/4541332abd9292871278901864796e35aa2942d9b3926f1c5a9030c022a17ef9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4541332abd92</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9df3908c4d2ed9487283a192bfed2b52c376aadac922ec387cb457217086bc29" href="../../证据/9df3908c4d2ed9487283a192bfed2b52c376aadac922ec387cb457217086bc29.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9df3908c4d2e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VN03 · 原VAR_TYPE动作1 → 删除旧值成功门 → 新类型文本与0x130子描述复制</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>case1先调用0x28110，返回0才继续；随后清记录+0x139的0x100字节与+0x129的0x10字节，并将payload+0x204的类型文本写入记录。数量非0时按nValueNum×0x130构造数组并保存在记录+0x470，目标为空则返回0xe0000002；分配非空时清数组并调用memcpy_s，从payload+0x308指向区域请求复制同样字节数；所选代码未分支检查其返回值，随后设记录+0x448=1、+0x450=数量。数量0分支另调用0x27080并置+0x448=0。原IAT0x180055568绑定MSVCR120.dll::memcpy_s，原汇编核到RCX目标、RDX容量、R8源pointer、R9长度。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原VAR_TYPE动作1 → 删除旧值成功门 → 新类型文本与0x130子描述复制”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：0x25c40/0x27080初始化清理体、数组构造失败与回滚、嵌套数据深拷贝仍未闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bcfa30253c519667a81ed446938d148d0c69a8710989c5562cad3124afd53e3f" href="../../证据/bcfa30253c519667a81ed446938d148d0c69a8710989c5562cad3124afd53e3f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bcfa30253c51</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6748c12f9603f62d81dc5559a3079f072fc03d9448eb31549374ec6bb0dc6eae" href="../../证据/6748c12f9603f62d81dc5559a3079f072fc03d9448eb31549374ec6bb0dc6eae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6748c12f9603</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02941cd60a3cba0deb6cfd3499d702fcb97760a10282e39ec8c3b3a65a2ec7ee" href="../../证据/02941cd60a3cba0deb6cfd3499d702fcb97760a10282e39ec8c3b3a65a2ec7ee.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02941cd60a3c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="07194a3175f971fa79b0f97f477557ff52ec98112165b8cd0631f0f3d98a0e70" href="../../证据/07194a3175f971fa79b0f97f477557ff52ec98112165b8cd0631f0f3d98a0e70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>07194a3175f9</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6aba67054835d3cfc5fceee02d854c6e6b1a940042247ed1c6307c1e834baf43" href="../../证据/6aba67054835d3cfc5fceee02d854c6e6b1a940042247ed1c6307c1e834baf43.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6aba67054835</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VN04 · 原DeleteVar分支与0x28110 DeleteVarValue体 → ModuleFrame删除通知 → 成功才移除名称记录</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DeleteVar先按payload字符串查名称容器，未找到返回0xe000001f；找到后保存原索引，调用0x28110，只有返回0才擦除名称记录并递减其他记录中更大索引。0x28110对记录+0x448为0调用VM_M_DelGlobalVar(context+8,记录+0x29名称)，组合记录则按+0x450数量、+0x470数组0x130步长逐项调用同一导出；返回码在循环中逐项覆盖，返回的是最终保存值，不能说已聚合所有子项失败。原PE IAT0x1800556f0核为ModuleFrame.dll::VM_M_DelGlobalVar。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原DeleteVar分支与0x28110 DeleteVarValue体 → ModuleFrame删除通知 → 成功才移除名称记录”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModuleFrame.VM_M_DelGlobalVar原体与保留结果/绑定最后读者未恢复；最终码0不证明组合每个子项都成功。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/18001f8c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="822072e15389f3edcf7f74632bda82aa507e7098fda78e1ce5d4361a624075e8" href="../../证据/822072e15389f3edcf7f74632bda82aa507e7098fda78e1ce5d4361a624075e8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>822072e15389</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028110.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5ada5cc32490c3646a5739f4806dfaef7e214c4619aebd9460a13fac880737ac" href="../../证据/5ada5cc32490c3646a5739f4806dfaef7e214c4619aebd9460a13fac880737ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5ada5cc32490</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028110.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="10795cc76285ee40260e52541055bb491c0af07f1f18a0752c49a0cf0386a825" href="../../证据/10795cc76285ee40260e52541055bb491c0af07f1f18a0752c49a0cf0386a825.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>10795cc76285</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VN05 · 原0x28c30值类型包装的额外参数与锁状态调用 → 显式覆盖后续callee栈字节，不由显示签名推ABI</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>0x28c30汇编保存前四入参并读取第五数量；先调用VM_M_SetGlobalVarLockStatus(moduleID,moduleID,1)，保存返回AL，分发int/float/string时将该AL作为第五字节参数、显式把第六字节参数写0，再把原数量置R9D、原payload置R8。所选体结束处调用同一锁状态导出(moduleID,moduleID,0)。因此case3调用前写入的第六字节1不能直接当作最终typed存储callee接收到1；包装有具体覆盖写。这个事实只限已读分支，不能从函数名断言它建立了完整线程互斥。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原0x28c30值类型包装的额外参数与锁状态调用 → 显式覆盖后续callee栈字节，不由显示签名推ABI”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：VM_M_SetGlobalVarLockStatus返回值语义及typedcallee的额外字节含义未取得原体/符号；不造copy标志解释。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="102a819b2dec187a7f37ee2a1326b9358602db993613815581469021739dd27e" href="../../证据/102a819b2dec187a7f37ee2a1326b9358602db993613815581469021739dd27e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>102a819b2dec</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f3f669102bce7f990ea614bc0027ae07a24602de9ff0ca1973e669e6839f0542" href="../../证据/f3f669102bce7f990ea614bc0027ae07a24602de9ff0ca1973e669e6839f0542.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f3f669102bce</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ee57695245612366b73ecb1bd902a38c7a5365b0aa433f6dc29e17ece1c95ddc" href="../../证据/ee57695245612366b73ecb1bd902a38c7a5365b0aa433f6dc29e17ece1c95ddc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ee5769524561</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="88bb0ace7f834b4cddc446f3b33782990cb424a76585fe2cd37d2922f197f666" href="../../证据/88bb0ace7f834b4cddc446f3b33782990cb424a76585fe2cd37d2922f197f666.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>88bb0ace7f83</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/180028c30.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a195b63b2b6bacaf215b2586a31b74b174abca31af66804cd8414ec51835be5c" href="../../证据/a195b63b2b6bacaf215b2586a31b74b174abca31af66804cd8414ec51835be5c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a195b63b2b6b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VS01 · 原typed int@0x295b0 / float@0x29eb0 → 带第五栈字节的ModuleFrame batch调用</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>两个原体对名称或payload指针为0返回0xe0000001，否则先调用ModuleFrame.VM_M_BatchSetGlobalVarInt/Float。原汇编明确RCX=context+8对象、RDX=变量名、R8=原payload指针、R9D=数量，并从typed入口第五字节实参写到调用前stack+0x20；不能因伪码只显示四个参数就称第五标志未传。IAT分别0x180055638和0x1800556c8绑定同名ModuleFrame导出。所选wrapper没有在batch调用前为数值数组分配/逐字节复制新的本地存储，传的是输入数组地址。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原typed int@0x295b0 / float@0x29eb0 → 带第五栈字节的ModuleFrame batch调用”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModuleFrame.VM_M_BatchSetGlobalVarInt RVA0x134710及Float RVA0x134880为已绑定下一种子，本轮未取它们原体，底层存储所有权仍未知。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c24cbecd8f21c26cd78e67acd24062403deb7851d84ac21ae5eb673e56af9501" href="../../证据/c24cbecd8f21c26cd78e67acd24062403deb7851d84ac21ae5eb673e56af9501.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c24cbecd8f21</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dc288a95ba15520517963dbb4380bdbe762f68f0a76f38cc7c902da23eedc525" href="../../证据/dc288a95ba15520517963dbb4380bdbe762f68f0a76f38cc7c902da23eedc525.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dc288a95ba15</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/180029eb0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="28cebe035e23cc0b660c06d71f2d73b2312a17ca437845af35dccd9eab3a41fa" href="../../证据/28cebe035e23cc0b660c06d71f2d73b2312a17ca437845af35dccd9eab3a41fa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>28cebe035e23</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VS02 · 原typed string@0x2a7b0 → 0x60字节输入描述 → 0x10字节STRING_UNIT临时数组</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原体按数量×0x10分配临时数组；逐项从输入记录i×0x60的+0 pointer、+8长度、+0xc容量字段，写到输出i×0x10的同三字段。复制的是pointer/length/size描述，没有在这个循环复制指向的字符串字节。调用ModuleFrame.VM_M_BatchSetGlobalVarString时R8传临时数组、R9D传数量，另传第五栈字节；保存返回码后，无论返回码0还是非0，正常控制流立即对该临时数组delete[]，随后才判断结果/继续联动。IAT0x1800556a0绑定batch string，0x180055540绑定MSVCR120.dll::??_V@YAXPEAX@Z。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原typed string@0x2a7b0 → 0x60字节输入描述 → 0x10字节STRING_UNIT临时数组”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModuleFrame.VM_M_BatchSetGlobalVarString RVA0x1349f0是否同步复制字符串内容、是否保留临时描述pointer、旧值free与失败回滚仍缺原体。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="10e1879bcd6f83d073f0d4467978a46958645a06b395f9c4e144d627a5e53e03" href="../../证据/10e1879bcd6f83d073f0d4467978a46958645a06b395f9c4e144d627a5e53e03.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>10e1879bcd6f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e5392cdab49603bde7a41b4a3e2327ecf9c9f7ac387f2ac809494f07c3ea6e8a" href="../../证据/e5392cdab49603bde7a41b4a3e2327ecf9c9f7ac387f2ac809494f07c3ea6e8a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e5392cdab496</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ac5e545406949eb25d355d2bc82658598532e7b45d953ded0da31f6d674e8413" href="../../证据/ac5e545406949eb25d355d2bc82658598532e7b45d953ded0da31f6d674e8413.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ac5e54540694</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VS03 · 原typed设置成功后的运行参数联动 → 只取第0个值，发送到记录中的linked模块/参数</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>三个typed原体都仅在batch返回0、数量>0且typed入口第六字节为0时进入linked记录循环；记录中+0x43c是链接数量、+0x440按0x94字节步进，每项取目标模块ID及+0x14的参数名。int在调用格式helper0x1b450前，汇编实际从原payload第0项读EDX；伪码遗漏该实参，不能说无值输入。float同样读第0项到XMM1再调用0x1b650。字符串联动用原输入第0条描述的pData/nDataLen直接调用VM_M_SetBinayData，未按每个linked目标选择不同数组元素。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原typed设置成功后的运行参数联动 → 只取第0个值，发送到记录中的linked模块/参数”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：第六字节精确控制是否联动，但其正式参数名/业务语义未取符号；不泛称订阅/copy开关。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModuleFrame.VM_M_SetBinayData对这些linked参数文本的接收和租约仍未闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="43f988348765c1a311662763785a903a0cc6ebfc4fddf2ac84958ebaaa34d4d0" href="../../证据/43f988348765c1a311662763785a903a0cc6ebfc4fddf2ac84958ebaaa34d4d0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>43f988348765</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5db18d9820cbfa4b0a584240d6112e8686427470ffa5e417ca498cb37a5f5bf7" href="../../证据/5db18d9820cbfa4b0a584240d6112e8686427470ffa5e417ca498cb37a5f5bf7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5db18d9820cb</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/180029eb0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cfbedccc0b64ef8d7a5f1740024b831ae63519fa4be1658ad840d253c763a676" href="../../证据/cfbedccc0b64ef8d7a5f1740024b831ae63519fa4be1658ad840d253c763a676.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cfbedccc0b64</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4071b4e835b04171274c2bdaf6debed308b28fc20bb7d81f759c9abaa753f24f" href="../../证据/4071b4e835b04171274c2bdaf6debed308b28fc20bb7d81f759c9abaa753f24f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4071b4e835b0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ea1b8d0d35e5cb8f5fa2fb947b1e3fff7d0df0c5469bf4a621269d901a433f41" href="../../证据/ea1b8d0d35e5cb8f5fa2fb947b1e3fff7d0df0c5469bf4a621269d901a433f41.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ea1b8d0d35e5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VS04 · 原typed返回码与后续链接异常门 → batch结果与各linked更新结果分开保留</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>int/float保存在local_c8的batch结果，string保存在local_c4；batch非0时直接返回该码。batch成功后的linked VM_M_SetBinayData错误保存到另一个local_a0/local_98，仅在日志门下记录，不覆盖最终batch返回值。链接参数名为空时记录后提前返回的也仍是原batch码，剩余链接不再处理。因此函数返回0不能证明每个linked运行参数都已更新；这一结论来自实际局部赋值和返回门，不能把日志存在当作错误向上传播。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原typed返回码与后续链接异常门 → batch结果与各linked更新结果分开保留”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：native最终存储/引用表一致性与跨线程执行顺序未运行验证；正常返回0仅能按所选返回码来源解释。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="abc882c2e17c666c0daaaa97465c9e23fcdb67f513dd95a3ec0e459d86aba3c1" href="../../证据/abc882c2e17c666c0daaaa97465c9e23fcdb67f513dd95a3ec0e459d86aba3c1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>abc882c2e17c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da3b7dfadcce51b7f9ab1ff9e2499c8406bc085a6c995f5b91d8e5407fe41f61" href="../../证据/da3b7dfadcce51b7f9ab1ff9e2499c8406bc085a6c995f5b91d8e5407fe41f61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da3b7dfadcce</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/1800295b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a257c6d6743b95015097d0d4943984352e701eee751ff1aa4ed1c86d0ff47e69" href="../../证据/a257c6d6743b95015097d0d4943984352e701eee751ff1aa4ed1c86d0ff47e69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a257c6d6743b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e88ddec9f944933d4ac657a87f4d692b4df9a64530ca9046235dce7352aa0408" href="../../证据/e88ddec9f944933d4ac657a87f4d692b4df9a64530ca9046235dce7352aa0408.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e88ddec9f944</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-storage.resources/18002a7b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3c5fb8f9636219313b09ad6fa74d798d9d517508da8fce4c72d2851e700e9aad" href="../../证据/3c5fb8f9636219313b09ad6fa74d798d9d517508da8fce4c72d2851e700e9aad.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3c5fb8f96362</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ01 · 原ModuleFrame的Batch int/float/string导出 → 原指针/数量/第五字节进入各内部接收者</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原PE导出表分别确认BatchInt=0x134710、BatchFloat=0x134880、BatchString=0x1349f0，三者不是独立SetGlobalVarInt/Float/String导出。三wrapper汇编保存原RCX/RDX/R8/R9，检查句柄、名称和payload非null；调用内部126f10/127050/127340时，RDX=原句柄指针、R8=原名称、R9=原payload，数量写栈+0x20，原第五字节从当前栈+0xc0读出并写栈+0x28。内部接收体再从句柄首int取得键；不能因伪码callee少显示参数就说原指针或隐藏字节已丢弃。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModuleFrame的Batch int/float/string导出 → 原指针/数量/第五字节进入各内部接收者”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：实际从GlobalVariableModule typed调用进入这些导出的运行实例未执行；已有静态IAT与caller链和本导出体分别保存。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：第五字节的具体业务命名不由ABI位置推定；后续非零分支可据所取体说明，但不命名为通用copy或ownership标志。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180134710.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d0fba8f2fd3f43c8b893abcfa54bc9f0177d3f21ca783153b904ae9a23bb36aa" href="../../证据/d0fba8f2fd3f43c8b893abcfa54bc9f0177d3f21ca783153b904ae9a23bb36aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d0fba8f2fd3f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180134880.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5414fa228e3e76743b123625c90c7f207af3fa1f8e4599bf2e102318b94afbbd" href="../../证据/5414fa228e3e76743b123625c90c7f207af3fa1f8e4599bf2e102318b94afbbd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5414fa228e3e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1801349f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5cff4e556a475c48c26ffbd880449c696518cc35a1804be9339e530e94a9e0c1" href="../../证据/5cff4e556a475c48c26ffbd880449c696518cc35a1804be9339e530e94a9e0c1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5cff4e556a47</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180126f10.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c718b0de5572a3f6b7d0ba570e09b387bc4ecfb34bc159fc8d492c5e32d7d522" href="../../证据/c718b0de5572a3f6b7d0ba570e09b387bc4ecfb34bc159fc8d492c5e32d7d522.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c718b0de5572</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127050.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e5ab0cf15e8875f07074ff9a426fa90377fd934b697e880b2e5271bd3c040ae5" href="../../证据/e5ab0cf15e8875f07074ff9a426fa90377fd934b697e880b2e5271bd3c040ae5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e5ab0cf15e88</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127340.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="48d0d2d5245469dd81ee311bc544064a76fb0e0506ec8444abe5cdb63a7fd9a3" href="../../证据/48d0d2d5245469dd81ee311bc544064a76fb0e0506ec8444abe5cdb63a7fd9a3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>48d0d2d52454</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ02 · Batch内部992e0/99550的附加分支与主仓读取 → 非零字节分支逐值记录，随后取共享模块记录</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>int与float接收体均仅把count==0直接判错；字节参数非零时，按上下文键查另一记录，更新标记/名称，然后仅在count>0时循环从原payload按4字节读取并写各自数值列表。之后仍执行公共检查并进入全局共享模块记录查找：记录为空返回0xe0000003，否则交f4d10/f4dc0处理。这里附加记录与主typed存储是两条持有关系，且负数量不等于被count==0门拒绝。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“Batch内部992e0/99550的附加分支与主仓读取 → 非零字节分支逐值记录，随后取共享模块记录”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：负数量、附加记录与主记录一致性及0x09a7e0完整准入合同没有运行验证；不从本片段推通用线程安全或失败原子性。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800992e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b23ad560142b53472b6c32e3001f55645f1df2c0a6256f3e25ac01c3cea08317" href="../../证据/b23ad560142b53472b6c32e3001f55645f1df2c0a6256f3e25ac01c3cea08317.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b23ad560142b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180099550.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1c9487feac1b03dbe34e5cbbdc5781d0615975f1821541062ff1b5666b311b0b" href="../../证据/1c9487feac1b03dbe34e5cbbdc5781d0615975f1821541062ff1b5666b311b0b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1c9487feac1b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800992e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a5ea0a8c22e033f5412af311fdf32673c2680877c8155cd4fe852ade1a326b77" href="../../证据/a5ea0a8c22e033f5412af311fdf32673c2680877c8155cd4fe852ade1a326b77.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a5ea0a8c22e0</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ03 · f4d10/f4dc0的数值主写入 → 输入每个4字节值复制进所取值记录的内部数组</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>int写入先经f74b0取得共享值对象，空则返回0xe0000003；非空先调用其虚表+8槽，再对正count循环从原pointer+i*4读取4字节并交fc50。fc50经准备函数后取对象+0x10中的载荷，必要时扩容，并向其数组base+8+当前数目*4写入该值、增加计数。float的f4dc0对应fd30，写入另一组+0x40/+0x44/+0x48数组字段。这个层级已有实际标量复制，不能继续说数值始终只是原pointer转发；也不能把虚表+8未解体的行为擅称完整旧值清空。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“f4d10/f4dc0的数值主写入 → 输入每个4字节值复制进所取值记录的内部数组”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：值对象创建、虚表+8目标、扩容失败和所有其它读者的退役仍需独立追体；本轮未运行数值或并发验证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800f4d10.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e648227a5e1775656123c8a489ab2ec8d9901d735bd992251d97fa44a8ce8190" href="../../证据/e648227a5e1775656123c8a489ab2ec8d9901d735bd992251d97fa44a8ce8190.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e648227a5e17</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800f4dc0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ffb1de5af647f1687ba3d663fd984ff2a8ad09a652d29fcd51e36a82480e71a4" href="../../证据/ffb1de5af647f1687ba3d663fd984ff2a8ad09a652d29fcd51e36a82480e71a4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ffb1de5af647</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18000fc50.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13de87f63bfa6f1ab1a08a6112764443401f712e0000ebc0983286a957291bc2" href="../../证据/13de87f63bfa6f1ab1a08a6112764443401f712e0000ebc0983286a957291bc2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13de87f63bfa</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18000fd30.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c546634755a16fdf1e80473d32ddfcff222499c1dd6acc61d85508682f8d919" href="../../证据/5c546634755a16fdf1e80473d32ddfcff222499c1dd6acc61d85508682f8d919.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c546634755a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800f4d10.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b08ad24aae3c3fca07c68a4973f1ab2cf003c6ca1364cc38c4b28d2bddbbb389" href="../../证据/b08ad24aae3c3fca07c68a4973f1ab2cf003c6ca1364cc38c4b28d2bddbbb389.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b08ad24aae3c</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ04 · BatchString接收体997c0 → 描述步长16字节→局部字符串→内部字符串记录副本</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>接收体在正count循环中每次读取16字节描述的首pointer，再按尾零扫描构造局部字符串；还存在字节参数非零时向辅助列表复制字符串的分支。主分支按模块/名称取得字符串值对象后，汇编明确把当前索引和局部字符串作为参数交00ffe0。该体按索引选择已有或新增的内部字符串，再调用006470复制字符；006470在非同对象分支按实际字符串长度调用原IAT memcpy、更新长度并写尾零。00ffe0随后对临时字符串大容量块调用operator delete并重置它。此处释放的是临时字符串存储，不能当作调用者STRING_UNIT数组或其原pointer的释放。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“BatchString接收体997c0 → 描述步长16字节→局部字符串→内部字符串记录副本”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：STRING_UNIT长度/容量字段没有在这些读取分支中作为统一边界消费；不能把它们推成全部字符串均带长度安全读取。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：空指针、嵌入尾零、分配失败和字符串剩余分支没有原机运行验证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800997c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ad9f9ce0c19dea05a04fa72fda3fade01b92bcdfac5a599dd9a5ac2908070709" href="../../证据/ad9f9ce0c19dea05a04fa72fda3fade01b92bcdfac5a599dd9a5ac2908070709.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ad9f9ce0c19d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800997c0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="11333a1f99378032925c9d990ce9bae621b367f8436d41a488bb8b8d8994f453" href="../../证据/11333a1f99378032925c9d990ce9bae621b367f8436d41a488bb8b8d8994f453.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>11333a1f9937</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800997c0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5b449236c5381aa47f70095407da8efdd615e750a85ee54805b1813e6f9dea63" href="../../证据/5b449236c5381aa47f70095407da8efdd615e750a85ee54805b1813e6f9dea63.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5b449236c538</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18000ffe0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f6088371e11903993f19394e2e6e540bbc2ae537bdb94ec9ecc66a79d987a642" href="../../证据/f6088371e11903993f19394e2e6e540bbc2ae537bdb94ec9ecc66a79d987a642.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f6088371e119</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180006470.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f7639568604227fbf64dd23ab699f88806690c07b8bb1f888a2b9b0efbae301c" href="../../证据/f7639568604227fbf64dd23ab699f88806690c07b8bb1f888a2b9b0efbae301c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f76395686042</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ05 · VM_M_DelGlobalVar → 127e60 → 依次按七个类型值查名称，再交带锁的共享模块仓</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Del导出伪码显示void/少参数，但汇编明确把原句柄和名称重排到RDX/R8交127e60，并保存EAX作为返回值。内部读取句柄首int，非-1时对同名依次调用cb820，类型整数次序1/2/7/3/4/5/6。cb820对仓库+0x58执行实际_Mtx_lock，取得模块共享记录，非空才交f82f0；f82f0把七个类型映射到记录内不同map偏移，再调用f9aa0按name求范围、交6eb00擦除。普通返回的0并不包含逐个erase结果聚合证明，map不存在也不等于所有历史结果引用消失。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“VM_M_DelGlobalVar → 127e60 → 依次按七个类型值查名称，再交带锁的共享模块仓”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：句柄有效性、所有map语义、删除后的已发布结果和native绑定最后读者未运行确认；正常控制流mutex操作不是所有异常分支排空证明。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180135660.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c672a26219aadfdefb3bec96d42fa5f2c472fa761bb464b547a65ebc8f6081f7" href="../../证据/c672a26219aadfdefb3bec96d42fa5f2c472fa761bb464b547a65ebc8f6081f7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c672a26219aa</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180135660.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5469b95269369572f0c28970f50fbd19bd7cde18b4672325cda96cde627b2f71" href="../../证据/5469b95269369572f0c28970f50fbd19bd7cde18b4672325cda96cde627b2f71.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5469b9526936</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3829bcaca329d6e9a9c7732fec6642ac96c22b868e8e3acea41a3cb282212b32" href="../../证据/3829bcaca329d6e9a9c7732fec6642ac96c22b868e8e3acea41a3cb282212b32.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3829bcaca329</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2e0a92f3653f7ce14393acc15d9d3e241c4974536cf8b94030b107b7d8136b31" href="../../证据/2e0a92f3653f7ce14393acc15d9d3e241c4974536cf8b94030b107b7d8136b31.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2e0a92f3653f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="83f5fcf7b5ced3ca7890e387ed139dde5135970c442d611659172bd8ae7204eb" href="../../证据/83f5fcf7b5ced3ca7890e387ed139dde5135970c442d611659172bd8ae7204eb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>83f5fcf7b5ce</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d2f7b38ed63b94d923d7a70226ff361522c04ee05a137257f7d88e023ee48d8c" href="../../证据/d2f7b38ed63b94d923d7a70226ff361522c04ee05a137257f7d88e023ee48d8c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d2f7b38ed63b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d1c9895dc35849cc63f4c050cece323e3d83fca16b1c1d20145689ca7ad01a80" href="../../证据/d1c9895dc35849cc63f4c050cece323e3d83fca16b1c1d20145689ca7ad01a80.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d1c9895dc358</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="959d49bd262d6e1d8ee7fd0ac0efab70738afec35db9e86df05f1347a1fea9ce" href="../../证据/959d49bd262d6e1d8ee7fd0ac0efab70738afec35db9e86df05f1347a1fea9ce.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>959d49bd262d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180127e60.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0b57d200679d48277f0de69ae93f869b320ace0c1ea0527bd25e8960b051fe5e" href="../../证据/0b57d200679d48277f0de69ae93f869b320ace0c1ea0527bd25e8960b051fe5e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0b57d200679d</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800cb820.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="917182ee369afe16399e66e7bbb03bbfa4d5018966e7f39c982a7f8c98fe65b1" href="../../证据/917182ee369afe16399e66e7bbb03bbfa4d5018966e7f39c982a7f8c98fe65b1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>917182ee369a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/1800f82f0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="23e331c6d91f498a799996eaf3c17f78aa0772293a521a7cfad357e61bc0e50c" href="../../证据/23e331c6d91f498a799996eaf3c17f78aa0772293a521a7cfad357e61bc0e50c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>23e331c6d91f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ06 · typed map擦除6eb00→6f290/6e570 → 释放节点名称/节点内存；载荷经控制块条件虚析构</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>范围erase在全范围时交6e570递归处理并复位根/计数，局部范围逐节点交6f290。已恢复两叶实际体与汇编：节点+0x48的共享控制块强计数递减，只有降为0才调用其虚表首槽，再递减弱计数，弱计数为0再调用+8槽。节点名称容量>=16时delete其名称堆块，之后重置字符串字段并operator delete节点本身；局部erase还递减容器数目。因此节点与名称的真实释放已可证明，而payload虚析构的动态接收者未定位，不能把该条件虚调用等同于每份数值/字符串buffer都已销毁。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“typed map擦除6eb00→6f290/6e570 → 释放节点名称/节点内存；载荷经控制块条件虚析构”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：未恢复这些shared控制块在每个typed map中的具体虚表实例与payload析构体；不宣称已证明全局无悬挂引用、无泄漏或所有存储已回收。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18006eb00.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="483e061bd48c8c11f7f3eec6a4d4ad48adb76b0ab453984249da44ea0490fac4" href="../../证据/483e061bd48c8c11f7f3eec6a4d4ad48adb76b0ab453984249da44ea0490fac4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>483e061bd48c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18006eb00.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c00725c81f94316e96840c96e72afb4c25fe1571bba4dc8dc4344ad65ba04cad" href="../../证据/c00725c81f94316e96840c96e72afb4c25fe1571bba4dc8dc4344ad65ba04cad.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c00725c81f94</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18006f290.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e8e1098ace68f5b159684e74f88d51be2f917c24de041db432060e5c935173b0" href="../../证据/e8e1098ace68f5b159684e74f88d51be2f917c24de041db432060e5c935173b0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e8e1098ace68</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18006e570.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c68bf0b137c840ac4843cae3acf8ee3d0b4a440da7af3185c38204129ff8d4dd" href="../../证据/c68bf0b137c840ac4843cae3acf8ee3d0b4a440da7af3185c38204129ff8d4dd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c68bf0b137c8</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18006f290.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a7bd88a46ba6a83d0e6276f93a602384db9e951c01d693cfce39a27c8039c7f9" href="../../证据/a7bd88a46ba6a83d0e6276f93a602384db9e951c01d693cfce39a27c8039c7f9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a7bd88a46ba6</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18006e570.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3a34933bf6ae2918420d808661243ec0b4119223c36384709968a69f73176d8f" href="../../证据/3a34933bf6ae2918420d808661243ec0b4119223c36384709968a69f73176d8f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3a34933bf6ae</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VZ07 · VM_M_SetGlobalVarLockStatus → 9a140 → 按键查状态记录，再调用真实mutex与标志写入</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>导出正常分支把两整数参数与原字节传入静态对象的9a140。该体先读对象+0x10，汇编明确TEST该字段后SETZ临时字节，再与请求字节作TEST决定早返0；不能照伪码含糊的位运算优先级另造布尔公式。成功查到键后，非零请求还需对象启用字节与记录首字节通过门，才_Mtx_lock记录+8并写记录+1=1。零请求在记录+1非零时才做额外准备/清理调用、写+1=0后_Mtx_unlock；重复零/不存在记录另有返回1分支。锁/解锁确为原MSVCP120导入，但只有这些分支被静态核实，不把导出名当全局同步或所有异常必解锁保证。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“VM_M_SetGlobalVarLockStatus → 9a140 → 按键查状态记录，再调用真实mutex与标志写入”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：mutex所属线程、重入/重复请求、异常处理以及9a300/69c0对暂存的具体语义未闭合；未运行并发或原始设备。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/180148130.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eadbf2a0064c6ef46c6e03bd65abca09af39146c2074cdfc6cddd9db047ab1f2" href="../../证据/eadbf2a0064c6ef46c6e03bd65abca09af39146c2074cdfc6cddd9db047ab1f2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eadbf2a0064c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18009a140.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e6fced1ece828e9a4675913b2e4f615bc716ac4e217361cb00fbcbfeddfc7991" href="../../证据/e6fced1ece828e9a4675913b2e4f615bc716ac4e217361cb00fbcbfeddfc7991.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e6fced1ece82</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18009a140.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="aad51b5799f0148915fef8577c78a21ed9d9ff4f950fefb1130dcd68e4c8b095" href="../../证据/aad51b5799f0148915fef8577c78a21ed9d9ff4f950fefb1130dcd68e4c8b095.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>aad51b5799f0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18009a140.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8ed9bfdf77938fd7e795ee3aff473f97bad7884beddfc7d3c9fa3cc8fad8d13d" href="../../证据/8ed9bfdf77938fd7e795ee3aff473f97bad7884beddfc7d3c9fa3cc8fad8d13d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8ed9bfdf7793</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-moduleframe-storage.resources/18009a140.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a53bb145cb49744a5867dc5369b86f584e840e4a2d42b189ebc7fe93687104f2" href="../../证据/a53bb145cb49744a5867dc5369b86f584e840e4a2d42b189ebc7fe93687104f2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a53bb145cb49</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PS01 · 原ModuleParam.SetValueBySDK → ModuleManager.SetParamValue → ServerSDKAPI → NativeMethods.IMVS_SetParamValue</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>普通参数键由ModuleParam传Parent.ID/key/value并强制bThrowException:true；仅VmModuleSet且键以%开头转另一动态参数入口。ModuleManager将全局CVmObjectBase.mhandle、uint模块ID、参数名和值原样传ServerSDKAPI，后者直接调用NativeMethods.IMVS_SetParamValue。P/Invoke明确绑定.\iMVS-6000PlatformSDK.dll、StdCall，名称和值声明UTF8Marshaler；这是应用内部IMVS_*入口，不能拼接成Public SDK的IMVS_PF_*链。native返回非0且throw开启时抛VmException；关闭throw时，即使native返回非0仍会到ParamSeted=true，故该标志不等于参数已成功生效。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModuleParam.SetValueBySDK → ModuleManager.SetParamValue → ServerSDKAPI → NativeMethods.IMVS_SetParamValue”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：P/Invoke的厂商DLL导出实现、消息传输与到ImageSourceModule.SetParam的原生调用栈尚缺，不能据同名参数声称闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：该P/Invoke声明之前的StdCall属性另由PS02引用覆盖；x64机器级寄存器ABI不由C#签名替代。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ModuleParam.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6643945c28e934d957363b93e8be1567f706a6b8a5497499943f56d9ff618a14" href="../../证据/6643945c28e934d957363b93e8be1567f706a6b8a5497499943f56d9ff618a14.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6643945c28e9</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="407921e825eb98ed0b8baf755189e9fc8d330a2a194a676e93dcdc5c66dd8369" href="../../证据/407921e825eb98ed0b8baf755189e9fc8d330a2a194a676e93dcdc5c66dd8369.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>407921e825eb</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ServerSDKAPI.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="78d7bb0e57e3443c1d7e64ee853db30650192faf48002aa19b9f89db0d9c9e4f" href="../../证据/78d7bb0e57e3443c1d7e64ee853db30650192faf48002aa19b9f89db0d9c9e4f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>78d7bb0e57e3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="851c35ef27a4c7bb912811922840b49ad73a17a95eba6266d56c2894bf5f890d" href="../../证据/851c35ef27a4c7bb912811922840b49ad73a17a95eba6266d56c2894bf5f890d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>851c35ef27a4</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PS02 · 原UTF8Marshaler.MarshalManagedToNative → UTF8临时HGlobal副本与清理回调</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>自定义marshaller对null返回IntPtr.Zero，对非string抛InvalidOperationException；string用Encoding.UTF8.GetBytes生成byte[]，AllocHGlobal(bytes.Length+1)，Marshal.Copy复制所有字节并写末尾0。CleanUpNativeData实现FreeHGlobal。NativeMethods的Set/Get参数名及Set值显式使用此marshaller；因此参数跨边界存在UTF8字节临时副本，不能描述成直接共享托管string地址。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原UTF8Marshaler.MarshalManagedToNative → UTF8临时HGlobal副本与清理回调”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本条证明marshaller分配/复制/清理函数和声明，不是实际CLR/native异常路径的动态寿命验收。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：字符串内嵌NUL和native截断处理仍需接收方原体；不能把UTF8编码等同于所有文本无损生效。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/UTF8Marshaler.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e590dd0301e18922331a2fd273dc4f66b660965e8dd1b3be9d878ca9b7eb85da" href="../../证据/e590dd0301e18922331a2fd273dc4f66b660965e8dd1b3be9d878ca9b7eb85da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e590dd0301e1</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/UTF8Marshaler.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e61349f18b796ff7ac2d2a851ca3c44a97f9617540ee4b309cd91ea79d3b3f98" href="../../证据/e61349f18b796ff7ac2d2a851ca3c44a97f9617540ee4b309cd91ea79d3b3f98.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e61349f18b79</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/UTF8Marshaler.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="227a4c1de07fed5ad96e2dee99cfe3e90d1601cf99ac814c8f32671d05802b64" href="../../证据/227a4c1de07fed5ad96e2dee99cfe3e90d1601cf99ac814c8f32671d05802b64.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>227a4c1de07f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4eedfa4d3998bb335ae9ac578677e936cdb09e22cc15ed977929074b5999e283" href="../../证据/4eedfa4d3998bb335ae9ac578677e936cdb09e22cc15ed977929074b5999e283.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4eedfa4d3998</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PS03 · 原ModuleManager.GetParamValue → 4096默认接收缓冲 → UTF8解码副本 → FreeHGlobal</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>无尺寸重载显式调用4096尺寸重载；ServerSDKAPI分配nStrValueSize字节HGlobal，将handle/moduleID/参数名/uint尺寸/指针送NativeMethods.IMVS_GetParamValue。只在native返回0时调用UTF8Marshaler.MarshalNativeToManaged赋给ref string，非0保留调用者原字符串；随后正常控制流FreeHGlobal并返原错误码。ModuleManager收到错误且throw开启才抛VmException。解码器逐字节读取到NUL，List&lt;byte>再ToArray并Encoding.UTF8.GetString，读回值独立于临时native块。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModuleManager.GetParamValue → 4096默认接收缓冲 → UTF8解码副本 → FreeHGlobal”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：native失败是否写部分缓冲、返回0是否始终NUL终止、异常清理及各参数真实最大文本长度未取得callee证明。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不把Public SDK另一实现使用Ansi解码的规则套到本应用内部UTF8读参数桥。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="20b7f8e594490c6d642d73a6bc70e65dcc2a010cdcb65842381a6552234a1cc3" href="../../证据/20b7f8e594490c6d642d73a6bc70e65dcc2a010cdcb65842381a6552234a1cc3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>20b7f8e59449</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ServerSDKAPI.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9b37f3f074b432ffecf96f8ce12fb02336d16aa6581bcdce0e1491b47623cb39" href="../../证据/9b37f3f074b432ffecf96f8ce12fb02336d16aa6581bcdce0e1491b47623cb39.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9b37f3f074b4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/UTF8Marshaler.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="abe6a7751db2a3e7a1cdd1cc25d7f59a82a1c0a3077a4495907e18780587cca9" href="../../证据/abe6a7751db2a3e7a1cdd1cc25d7f59a82a1c0a3077a4495907e18780587cca9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>abe6a7751db2</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cefb45a93d6539808a2b9e159f289106ca2d5a6f7cc796ba826b81316851059c" href="../../证据/cefb45a93d6539808a2b9e159f289106ca2d5a6f7cc796ba826b81316851059c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cefb45a93d65</small></a></details></details><details><summary>PS04 · 原VmParamSubManager.SetModuleParamBinding → 绑定描述结构 → 临时HGlobal → IMVS_SetModuleParamBinding</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>引用订阅不走PS01的name/value setter。VmParamSubManager构建nNum=1且128槽数组：目标Owner.ID、参数类型、128字节参数名；绑定值另含变量类型、256字节常量、目标模块ID/128字节来源名、下标类型与256字节常量或下标来源。StringUtil.UTF8GetFixLenBytes先建定长数组，再复制min(UTF8字节长度,len)，超长是按字节截断，满长度不额外加NUL。ModuleManager.SetModuleParamBinding→ServerSDKAPI构造并复制描述列表，AllocHGlobal(Marshal.SizeOf(...))、StructureToPtr、PInvoke IMVS_SetModuleParamBinding(handle,ptr)，正常路径释放outer HGlobal；native错误由ModuleManager抛VmException，VmParamSubManager捕获并返回false。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原VmParamSubManager.SetModuleParamBinding → 绑定描述结构 → 临时HGlobal → IMVS_SetModuleParamBinding”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不从描述复制推断来源像素深拷贝；native关系存储、订阅值更新时序和解绑所有权需实际nativecallee。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：定长UTF8在多字节边界的截断可能形成不完整编码；是否UI前置校验避免此输入，本条没有端到端证明。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/VmParamSubManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4e4ccdabd3f3f28e7ce330601127179aa625a3ab1dcba35bbb0c1e23c9367c1e" href="../../证据/4e4ccdabd3f3f28e7ce330601127179aa625a3ab1dcba35bbb0c1e23c9367c1e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4e4ccdabd3f3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/StringUtil.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c8c07b1b654c35204e40bbe3ff0f4b29f8f996df2b00ec5b676f42fe25743b80" href="../../证据/c8c07b1b654c35204e40bbe3ff0f4b29f8f996df2b00ec5b676f42fe25743b80.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c8c07b1b654c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="99c4dbb9a08a0a38a7c44503368a3ccc6da9e5a462b18ed3713117dc50163a85" href="../../证据/99c4dbb9a08a0a38a7c44503368a3ccc6da9e5a462b18ed3713117dc50163a85.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>99c4dbb9a08a</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/ServerSDKAPI.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="963fec7dd5c7cad93bc9041e9ee1431bc0801994f046a82a79cfd4f1a8a08ce1" href="../../证据/963fec7dd5c7cad93bc9041e9ee1431bc0801994f046a82a79cfd4f1a8a08ce1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>963fec7dd5c7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/parameter-sdk-bridge.resources/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="64218321649fcff71ae2637248023e55e97d380df6e38418210d5d10514bae4f" href="../../证据/64218321649fcff71ae2637248023e55e97d380df6e38418210d5d10514bae4f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>64218321649f</small></a></details></details><details><summary>NP01 · 原CMyAlgorithmManager.Process：缓存容器未满分支 → 接口返回缓冲 → memcpy_s像素复制</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>所选Process原体按(this+0x25d58 − this+0x25d50)/0x3a0与this+0x25d68比较，未满才进入该复制分支。分支通过this+0x10的虚表+8调用取得目标指针；返回非0或目标为空转错误。成功时从this+0x25ab0对象的描述取得源地址和+c长度，调用memcpy_s。原汇编入口保存RCX→R14、RDX→R12、R8→R13；0x1800111de–0x1800111ef在调用前写EDX=目标长度、R9D=源长度、R8=源指针、RCX=目标指针，IAT 0x18002d330由当前原件导入表确认为MSVCR120.dll::memcpy_s。这里证明一次像素复制，不能描述成只转发同一原图指针。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原CMyAlgorithmManager.Process：缓存容器未满分支 → 接口返回缓冲 → memcpy_s像素复制”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：modes=local是按本分支所用文件解码器对象作研究归组，不代表原Process全部模式都有同一缓存或复制行为。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：this+0x10虚表+8的实际分配实现、容器追加helper与释放helper仍需逐体汇合；Process保留的terminal-call limitation未被抹去。</p><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/image-source-native-0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1b398f7a315534a4a4efdb40597d082c459b187e2925f82fd672904870a5555f" href="../../证据/1b398f7a315534a4a4efdb40597d082c459b187e2925f82fd672904870a5555f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1b398f7a3155</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-producer-recovery.resources/ImageSource.Process.retained.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7be6edacebbc14588e7c657920f11f8ade6eb922390d262ffa1091d729651cd2" href="../../证据/7be6edacebbc14588e7c657920f11f8ade6eb922390d262ffa1091d729651cd2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7be6edacebbc</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-producer-recovery.resources/ImageSource.Process.retained.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8e516c6e8cc052b450f93d1df1e9d13342a62097ab98d426f6815098d1e8ec2d" href="../../证据/8e516c6e8cc052b450f93d1df1e9d13342a62097ab98d426f6815098d1e8ec2d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8e516c6e8cc0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-producer-recovery.resources/ImageSource.Process.retained.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2d50d1d450a63d76a70cb429636439331ef30d19cbfbb6562df4d1961725904a" href="../../证据/2d50d1d450a63d76a70cb429636439331ef30d19cbfbb6562df4d1961725904a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2d50d1d450a6</small></a></details></details><details><summary>NP02 · 原Process：帧描述保留列表达到阈值 → FreeBuf通知 → 摘链 → 删除列表节点</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>所选Process分支将this+0x25c90列表长度与this+0x25c80阈值比较，满足条件时从队首处理。节点+0x30非0才调用VM_M_SetBinayData，参数取节点+0x10模块标识、字符串FreeBuf、节点+0x18描述地址与0x40字节长度，然后无论该调用返回值如何都继续摘链、长度减一与operator_delete节点。原汇编0x18000e6a5–0x18000e6b9明确R8=RBX+0x18、R9D=0x40、RDX=FreeBuf字符串地址、ECX=[RBX+0x10]；当前原件IAT 0x18002d598确认为ModuleFrame.dll::VM_M_SetBinayData。发送归还通知、删除列表节点与生产者底层帧真正释放是三个边界。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原Process：帧描述保留列表达到阈值 → FreeBuf通知 → 摘链 → 删除列表节点”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：camera是CameraImage/FreeBuf帧归还支路的研究归组，完整模式前置条件和设备调用时序尚未闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不从FreeBuf名称推断已经完成释放，也不从operator_delete列表节点推断其指向图像一同释放。</p><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/image-source-native-0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3ea971ae5b27bb20a5837257ddd6cdd2c1581b1fe9a7727fd973f39635c7204d" href="../../证据/3ea971ae5b27bb20a5837257ddd6cdd2c1581b1fe9a7727fd973f39635c7204d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3ea971ae5b27</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-producer-recovery.resources/ImageSource.Process.retained.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9a8145ac5de89c915e85f611bf671e84cb74cfa50c12b8803ba427777bcedff" href="../../证据/b9a8145ac5de89c915e85f611bf671e84cb74cfa50c12b8803ba427777bcedff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9a8145ac5de</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/image-producer-recovery.resources/ImageSource.Process.retained.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fefc9093c0c318c1c511ba31eb06976ac521390b8dd3f4c63e445665e811afff" href="../../证据/fefc9093c0c318c1c511ba31eb06976ac521390b8dd3f4c63e445665e811afff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fefc9093c0c3</small></a></details></details><details><summary>NP03 · 原CMyAlgorithmManager.DeInit@0x12470 → 有界等待、句柄关闭与多类资源退役</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>已取回且与保留REA记录逐字匹配的DeInit原体设置停止字节、发送事件；若线程句柄非0，调用WaitForSingleObject(...,2000)后直接CloseHandle并置0，伪码中未分支使用等待结果。它另遍历路径缓存记录，在两个非0指针门下分别调用this+0x10虚表+0x10并清记录指针；对多个图像实例调用DestroyImageInstance后清相应字段，还向保留帧列表发送FreeBuf，再删除列表节点。原件PE导出精确绑定DeInit RVA0x12470，不能再记作“当前根源码体缺失”。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原CMyAlgorithmManager.DeInit@0x12470 → 有界等待、句柄关闭与多类资源退役”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本条复核的是原件身份/PE导出与保留伪码，尚无该函数专属汇编实参再核；特别不据DestroyImageInstance显示成零参数就断言没有传入寄存器。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：线程等待超时路径、共享缓冲callee、重复释放与显示最后读者须继续逐体追踪，未执行原版或设备。</p><details><summary>analysis/full-audit/image-source-native-extra-4.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="44098a875f37e77460ab7b07c945de37ec3246ced2738ae1f58b068884c91cfe" href="../../证据/44098a875f37e77460ab7b07c945de37ec3246ced2738ae1f58b068884c91cfe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>44098a875f37</small></a></details></details><details><summary>NM01 · 原缓存图像this+0x50接口 → 本模块共享内存基类的具体虚表成员</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原构造器先初始化this+0x50的CModuleSharedMemoryBase子对象，再写派生类对应虚表。当前原PE导出的共享内存子表RVA0x13a80逐槽读取：+8=0x180007fa0，+0x10=0x180008380。因此NB01中CopyImage的接口申请可静态接到本DLL的0x7fa0原体，而不再泛称未取得分配callee。0x8380原体包含共享名解析、模块标识校验和按名查找/摘链，再进入CloseMapping；其scanf省参尚未逐寄存器闭合，不据显示签名猜字段写入。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原缓存图像this+0x50接口 → 本模块共享内存基类的具体虚表成员”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：vtable绑定为静态成员关系，不代表运行实例、共享名解析ABI、全部池分支与最后读者已验证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/buffer-interface-origin.resources/18000da70.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="95efc2e52cb8af8215e04f1f26af27542ff16c53f6a8418511b75e7aea854be5" href="../../证据/95efc2e52cb8af8215e04f1f26af27542ff16c53f6a8418511b75e7aea854be5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>95efc2e52cb8</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/buffer-interface-origin.resources/vtable-layout.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9203ff44dc9f7b8024a2e8b1c6f67dbcc9260adc0c675fb80f777838757e8786" href="../../证据/9203ff44dc9f7b8024a2e8b1c6f67dbcc9260adc0c675fb80f777838757e8786.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9203ff44dc9f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/buffer-interface-origin.resources/180007fa0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b5b256c72934ca2d34bedb1178680c128be93c2f8a3e183139f99126e20f424e" href="../../证据/b5b256c72934ca2d34bedb1178680c128be93c2f8a3e183139f99126e20f424e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b5b256c72934</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/buffer-interface-origin.resources/180008380.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9446f0738aa497ab38792e8f11e6eb55a985f1aced1474b60be99f3ec222ceae" href="../../证据/9446f0738aa497ab38792e8f11e6eb55a985f1aced1474b60be99f3ec222ceae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9446f0738aa4</small></a></details></details><details><summary>NM04 · 原缓存节点、模块析构与共享池析构 → 描述拷贝、队列删除与关闭映射三层退役</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>追加helper0xf190分配0x48字节链表节点；0xf630以三次16字节和一次8字节搬运把0x38字节图像描述写到节点+0x10，没有在此复制其像素。模块析构先摘链删除缓存节点及哨兵，再以RCX=this+0x50调用0x7de0。该共享内存基类析构遍历池描述，对每项调用0x90f0关闭映射，然后处理引用控制块和容器。NB04的DeInit只清队列，不能替代这条模块/基类析构链。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原缓存节点、模块析构与共享池析构 → 描述拷贝、队列删除与关闭映射三层退役”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：基类析构末尾的反编译间接跳转警告保留；引用控制块所有callee、模块Destroy调用时序和最后像素读者仍未闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/buffer-interface-origin.resources/18000f190.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c78a1d3d1fdea5575ad8aaa4a549376b2899faa40d632401ae2f69eef4b027d" href="../../证据/5c78a1d3d1fdea5575ad8aaa4a549376b2899faa40d632401ae2f69eef4b027d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c78a1d3d1fd</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/buffer-interface-origin.resources/18000f630.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92cc53cdf0df3bef12969323d9f50629b7123b0ddf94e85a491b8f7e685f3888" href="../../证据/92cc53cdf0df3bef12969323d9f50629b7123b0ddf94e85a491b8f7e685f3888.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92cc53cdf0df</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/buffer-interface-origin.resources/18000db90.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e088611d81198291f1ed9fec618d25e9ecde009f1c6ebfaaf27671c4aac0b162" href="../../证据/e088611d81198291f1ed9fec618d25e9ecde009f1c6ebfaaf27671c4aac0b162.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e088611d8119</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/buffer-interface-origin.resources/18000db90.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="153d7a79a6c138bf3fc281d0d64cb443729e74c2daff0784526f381385f94cfb" href="../../证据/153d7a79a6c138bf3fc281d0d64cb443729e74c2daff0784526f381385f94cfb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>153d7a79a6c1</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/buffer-interface-origin.resources/180007de0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="60e834da81fb42b065fbb292f1e24663c67e6312e6124d7c3406dacef3c8b0fb" href="../../证据/60e834da81fb42b065fbb292f1e24663c67e6312e6124d7c3406dacef3c8b0fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>60e834da81fb</small></a></details></details><details><summary>MF01 · 原VM_M_SetImageEx导出 → 像素指针、长度与第五实参共享名继续向内转发</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>安装目录ModuleProxy/x64/ModuleFrame.dll的原PE将VM_M_SetImageEx绑定RVA0x1312f0。入口检查context、参数名、图像描述和第五实参均非空；从描述+0取像素指针、+8取uint长度。0x180131377–1392汇编把第五入口实参转为后续调用第七参数（调用前[RSP+0x30]），长度放[RSP+0x20]，计算的flag放[RSP+0x28]，随后调用0x122a40。它不是只有伪码显示的四参调用；NB03的额外共享名在这个静态接收候选中未被丢弃。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原VM_M_SetImageEx导出 → 像素指针、长度与第五实参共享名继续向内转发”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：两DLL导入/导出名和ABI建立静态候选关系；原运行实例的装载解析、同帧/同计数及SDK接收对象仍未闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1801312f0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="21977c3babe7256b43cf918eb4ef92f9be33b5a0a216f78b07cd01e49ffc56fc" href="../../证据/21977c3babe7256b43cf918eb4ef92f9be33b5a0a216f78b07cd01e49ffc56fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>21977c3babe7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1801312f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c39220ac9f972d07bc79581747aa311024b2feb141fb81289a82bb530c48904d" href="../../证据/c39220ac9f972d07bc79581747aa311024b2feb141fb81289a82bb530c48904d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c39220ac9f97</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1801312f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="71737fd27421fdeb784265158cefd4783d9c6c907f1bb97c3ab65dc27feccf89" href="../../证据/71737fd27421fdeb784265158cefd4783d9c6c907f1bb97c3ab65dc27feccf89.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>71737fd27421</small></a></details></details><details><summary>MF02 · 原内部0x122a40 → 条件取共享映射指针，失败回到原像素指针再提交</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>0x122a40读取context内模块标识及关联对象，模块标识-1不进入有效提交。模块条件函数0x108b20返回非0时，调用0xeee30，传模块标识、参数名、索引、原指针、长度、共享名及返回指针槽；成功可使用输出映射指针，非0错误则回到原像素指针并按日志门记录。0xeee30所选体在已有名称/容量匹配时使用其映射字段+0x80，否则经0xeff60建立记录并替换/追加缓存项。之后0x122a40将实际选中的指针、长度、共享名继续交0xc99f0→模块对象0xf49a0，不能把它画成无条件像素复制。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原内部0x122a40 → 条件取共享映射指针，失败回到原像素指针再提交”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：映射建立callee0xeff60、条件函数全部含义、注册表销毁和SDK回调接收的同实例关系仍未闭合；不宣称端到端零复制。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/180122a40.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5a2e58e991e3ad9ae4de3ff452c29ad3fc37c10b17e86b90ec494ba8ce2756c2" href="../../证据/5a2e58e991e3ad9ae4de3ff452c29ad3fc37c10b17e86b90ec494ba8ce2756c2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5a2e58e991e3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/180122a40.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d629171b4f577aa360a6894d49948e993b07c75e3cf3d01dc7b48978dc7d481" href="../../证据/0d629171b4f577aa360a6894d49948e993b07c75e3cf3d01dc7b48978dc7d481.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d629171b4f5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1800eee30.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da3c05385b98f925bd12503df5fa236a88f37b16b249b883b8cea5a309967a59" href="../../证据/da3c05385b98f925bd12503df5fa236a88f37b16b249b883b8cea5a309967a59.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da3c05385b98</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1800c99f0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2f3c19c2a8a116c5595b4b8279b26b373fccdce254578294a0d2c542c74be69a" href="../../证据/2f3c19c2a8a116c5595b4b8279b26b373fccdce254578294a0d2c542c74be69a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2f3c19c2a8a1</small></a></details></details><details><summary>MF03 · 原模块图像结果0xf49a0→0xf41e0 → 先形成长度/地址/共享名文本，再按索引存入结果槽</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>0xf49a0在指针、长度和共享名门后取得参数结果对象；对模块对象+0xf0互斥量加锁，在128字节局部缓冲中按原件格式串%d_%p_%s格式化长度、像素地址和共享名，然后调用0xf41e0。格式串从当前原PE RVA0x226ab8读取原字节，0x1800f4b06–4b29汇编确认变参为长度、指针和共享名。0xf41e0拒绝负索引；索引小于当前槽数时写已有字符串槽，否则取得追加槽再写文本。这里存的是图像描述文本，不是把整张像素写入字符串。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原模块图像结果0xf49a0→0xf41e0 → 先形成长度/地址/共享名文本，再按索引存入结果槽”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：格式化失败/截断、槽追加helper全部行为、执行计数头写入和SDK输出转换尚未闭合；未因协议相似宣称原生到托管已经端到端验证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1800f49a0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="12915930b1110a13f06ee27f634ea40ca6f3c7583d91360cfc67a496aa533196" href="../../证据/12915930b1110a13f06ee27f634ea40ca6f3c7583d91360cfc67a496aa533196.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>12915930b111</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1800f49a0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9f9da81a97149e1e072c08eb894770dfcbbdc41bf5682fc0d7e39a559f7a3f36" href="../../证据/9f9da81a97149e1e072c08eb894770dfcbbdc41bf5682fc0d7e39a559f7a3f36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9f9da81a9714</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1800f49a0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c81dc6ff2f5b8d555127bccec702372324af14daea11fff2962b9175f8f1767c" href="../../证据/c81dc6ff2f5b8d555127bccec702372324af14daea11fff2962b9175f8f1767c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c81dc6ff2f5b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1800f41e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7310913dfe19fe0c2588d94b66936cbcc5f5b971113b51dea72d5f6d85b588c4" href="../../证据/7310913dfe19fe0c2588d94b66936cbcc5f5b971113b51dea72d5f6d85b588c4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7310913dfe19</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/protocol.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="82402a3f0e8b5dc924e910bab8e92c0584fb494ef64f1d0cadcc251516ac8962" href="../../证据/82402a3f0e8b5dc924e910bab8e92c0584fb494ef64f1d0cadcc251516ac8962.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>82402a3f0e8b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>MF04 · 原导出与内部函数返回值 → 按汇编保留错误码，不按伪码void解释成无返回</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>本次Ghidra把若干带安全cookie尾调用的函数显示成void；SetImageEx汇编却在内部调用后把EAX保存到R14D，尾部恢复EAX，非法入口分支置0xe0000001，再调用cookie校验。已恢复的0x1e8810在正常返回分支只操作RCX/标志，不改EAX。0xc99f0也显式返回错误码，模块查不到返回0xe0000003。故不能依据void伪码丢失错误传播；本条不补异常/fast-fail返回的假值。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原导出与内部函数返回值 → 按汇编保留错误码，不按伪码void解释成无返回”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：正常返回路径的EAX已核；异常、cookie失败、日志异常和完整回滚仍未验证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1801312f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="986deb603a08e69d310eedb875c2706bcaac643f28f1e9359c663db7a2f1fae1" href="../../证据/986deb603a08e69d310eedb875c2706bcaac643f28f1e9359c663db7a2f1fae1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>986deb603a08</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1801e8810.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="285353db9d73a49f2fe7a9cc023c18f21d88c437b7c6f6a06a52456134e2e99b" href="../../证据/285353db9d73a49f2fe7a9cc023c18f21d88c437b7c6f6a06a52456134e2e99b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>285353db9d73</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/1800c99f0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e78966107c87955e1d8befc29130d32b07d6fb5d64b6ea1d68e95401cd7db4f8" href="../../证据/e78966107c87955e1d8befc29130d32b07d6fb5d64b6ea1d68e95401cd7db4f8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e78966107c87</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/moduleframe-image.resources/180131190.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="50b86915164bf0972692a365cdf3c9131c1b3640f6a06aef1b770ca2a77874a8" href="../../证据/50b86915164bf0972692a365cdf3c9131c1b3640f6a06aef1b770ca2a77874a8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>50b86915164b</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX01 · 原GlobalVariableModule复合设置0x28250 → 0x130描述逐项分发至已绑定typed入口</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>入口RDX是描述数组、R8D是条数，按0x130步进读取+0x100类型与+0x104数量。类型0/1/2分别用+0x108/+0x110/+0x118的payload指针调用295b0/29eb0/2a7b0。汇编确认typed第五栈字节来自VM_M_SetGlobalVarLockStatus返回AL，第六栈字节固定1；据VS03已见第六字节非0跳过typed联动分支。起始SetGlobalVarLockStatus(moduleID,moduleID,1)，正常末尾同入口第三参0；这里只证API及实参，不能等同原生互斥锁实现。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原GlobalVariableModule复合设置0x28250 → 0x130描述逐项分发至已绑定typed入口”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：负条数经MOVSXD后无符号比较的异常输入安全性未运行验证；不据正常条数循环推断边界校验。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：复合条目的创建/命名及不同订阅者看到更新的原子性没有由此证明。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180028250.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="055473846a95f55149afdcd543d0c4bff8f73638368e2477f1a846abd95be06c" href="../../证据/055473846a95f55149afdcd543d0c4bff8f73638368e2477f1a846abd95be06c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>055473846a95</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180028250.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="51f10ad48da32e80dd0f4af7b01d755c17c509c844b2b1b777457d74cc2bfca8" href="../../证据/51f10ad48da32e80dd0f4af7b01d755c17c509c844b2b1b777457d74cc2bfca8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>51f10ad48da3</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX02 · record退役0x25c40 → 清零计数，释放+0x440/+0x458/+0x460/+0x468/+0x470</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>0x25c40真实原体是缓冲清理，不是初始化：先写+0x43c=0、+0x450=0；非空+0x440、+0x458、+0x460分别delete[]，清pointer；+0x468调用1ba20(pointer,3)，+0x470调用1bc70(pointer,3)，返回后清pointer及+0x450。它未调用ModuleFrame删除变量值，不能把record缓冲清理等同全局最终存储删除。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“record退役0x25c40 → 清零计数，释放+0x440/+0x458/+0x460/+0x468/+0x470”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：record整体析构、并发最后读者和调用0x25c40的全部路径未在本切片遍历。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180025c40.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="63e274c94625f277e6d286a7f5af032c2a2c0a3c4c8953f105d2b00262a85b6b" href="../../证据/63e274c94625f277e6d286a7f5af032c2a2c0a3c4c8953f105d2b00262a85b6b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>63e274c94625</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180025c40.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="83bfe57ae454769a4194fff2f0b15fdf73ffaa838443596dfb48fefe7192c0d2" href="../../证据/83bfe57ae454769a4194fff2f0b15fdf73ffaa838443596dfb48fefe7192c0d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>83bfe57ae454</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX03 · record+0x470数组析构1bc70(pointer,3) → 逐0x130子描述析构，再释放cookie前的数组分配</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>1bc70参数3同时启用vector析构与delete[]：从pointer-8读数量，以0x130步长调用1b900，然后delete[](pointer-8)。每个1b900对子描述+0x108/+0x110非空指针直接delete[]，清pointer与+0x104；+0x118非空则调用1ba20(pointer,3)。1ba20以0x60步长调用1b830并delete[]其pointer-8。1b830只有描述+0x50的int非0且+0pointer非0时才delete[]内容、清pointer与+8长度，最后始终清+0xc容量。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“record+0x470数组析构1bc70(pointer,3) → 逐0x130子描述析构，再释放cookie前的数组分配”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：+0x50正式所有权语义、每个生产分支如何置位/转移仍未闭合；不由delete条件猜字段名。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001bc70.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb146ba90b7409f4710bed80d27ee8ed733c5651fb5fcf0515f67461e760db7d" href="../../证据/cb146ba90b7409f4710bed80d27ee8ed733c5651fb5fcf0515f67461e760db7d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb146ba90b74</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001bc70.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="36b12553da384ed3fa61819c1ab8db81dc7e4ae461dd8dfc8df5db9ac037527c" href="../../证据/36b12553da384ed3fa61819c1ab8db81dc7e4ae461dd8dfc8df5db9ac037527c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>36b12553da38</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b900.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161" href="../../证据/d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d55b696b7636</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b900.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="68e726aee9d5048c9b0f861be252a835373dc7d2af298852f8192cc20cf63225" href="../../证据/68e726aee9d5048c9b0f861be252a835373dc7d2af298852f8192cc20cf63225.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>68e726aee9d5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001ba20.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7a2b430230145c8abc26e777b89212b81b23ce6735b86452685683001ac8da07" href="../../证据/7a2b430230145c8abc26e777b89212b81b23ce6735b86452685683001ac8da07.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7a2b43023014</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b830.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="85a3e5e558b5033c23fe210411421e293bd471f74b4ab97816a8c1bd4071e6b3" href="../../证据/85a3e5e558b5033c23fe210411421e293bd471f74b4ab97816a8c1bd4071e6b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>85a3e5e558b5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b830.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="775f61ca653ec23a67610e68a4205aaf99080666438a87f257f6fdd4481a1816" href="../../证据/775f61ca653ec23a67610e68a4205aaf99080666438a87f257f6fdd4481a1816.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>775f61ca653e</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX04 · 复合描述构造1b890与先前VAR_TYPE浅描述复制 → 初始化与后续嵌套释放边界分开</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>本次取到1b890：清名称0x100字节、+0x104=0、+0x100类型=6、+0x108/+0x110/+0x118=0。先前VAR_TYPE分支已见按条数分配带cookie的0x130数组、逐项构造、随后整段memcpy_s输入描述；该整段复制包含指针字段，不能因调用memcpy_s就称嵌套payload已复制。新增析构体证明这些复制进来的非空数值pointer将进入delete[]，内层内容则受+0x50控制。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“复合描述构造1b890与先前VAR_TYPE浅描述复制 → 初始化与后续嵌套释放边界分开”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：VAR_TYPE case是大函数内片段，in_stack字段依赖原整体栈语义，不当成独立函数正式参数。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：输入嵌套地址来源与借用/转移协议尚缺，不能直接断言原版存在double-free。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b890.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c0a84c7530a5d7f8117329c51c2eb2f8c5b3626399b32f9ebd5f90258272ab7c" href="../../证据/c0a84c7530a5d7f8117329c51c2eb2f8c5b3626399b32f9ebd5f90258272ab7c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c0a84c7530a5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-native-receiver.resources/1800245bd.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="abe329fd6070bf0a3f4cbb279191fb7a4e30fba18a1a4c816ad5b4f958c40bf9" href="../../证据/abe329fd6070bf0a3f4cbb279191fb7a4e30fba18a1a4c816ad5b4f958c40bf9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>abe329fd6070</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18001b900.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161" href="../../证据/d55b696b763699f2703b5002852b6a16d4058b1d0d6c63ef2a0ab59304f47161.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d55b696b7636</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX05 · 原SetGlobalValue0x27080 → record中数值数组或紧凑字符串描述发布到ModuleFrame</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>0x27080日志实名CVariableModuBase::SetGlobalValue，实际是发布体，不是清理体。record+0x450非0时先调用SetGlobalVarLockStatus(...,1)，int/float分支分别传+0x458/+0x460地址、数量、返回AL到BatchSet；string且+0x468非空时，分配数量×0x10临时数组，把每个0x60描述的pointer/+8长度/+0xc容量复制进去，调用BatchString后正常路径delete[]临时描述，随后SetGlobalVarLockStatus(...,0)。临时分配返回null分支记录日志并提前return，未经过正常末尾的status(...,0)；这只是所见控制流，不断言status就是实际mutex。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原SetGlobalValue0x27080 → record中数值数组或紧凑字符串描述发布到ModuleFrame”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：锁状态API本身的同步含义及分配异常unwind尚未恢复；不由null失败分支推断所有异常路径。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本体末尾链接参数发送使用record+0x139初始文本，不能据数组设置成功推断每个链接拿到完整数组。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180027080.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1b2c60ee4296f2dff327ae3e601caa80723ccee8244f84376fd0135c3df055d9" href="../../证据/1b2c60ee4296f2dff327ae3e601caa80723ccee8244f84376fd0135c3df055d9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1b2c60ee4296</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180027080.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6bf09bd16cdcbefb483cdb42f54196f88421c0c1b7f9829a1017234b153e9c71" href="../../证据/6bf09bd16cdcbefb483cdb42f54196f88421c0c1b7f9829a1017234b153e9c71.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6bf09bd16cdc</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VX06 · 复合type4分支 → 图像字节进入2b2e0及VM_M_SetGlobalVarImageEx，排除PointSet误归类</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>28250的类型4将+0x118视作0x60描述数组，逐项取pointer/+8长度与下标，调用2b2e0。该helper日志set image start/end，正常申请0x145c0缓冲成功且pointer/handle均非0后，memcpy_s复制输入长度字节到新buffer，并设置局部描述长度。汇编确认调用ImageEx前RCX=context+8、RDX名称、R8D下标、R9=&amp;局部描述；第五栈参数是0x145c0返回的handle，第六字节继承helper入口第六字节（上游由LockStatus返回AL写入）。伪码显示四参不等于handle/第六字节丢失。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“复合type4分支 → 图像字节进入2b2e0及VM_M_SetGlobalVarImageEx，排除PointSet误归类”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：0x145c0分配/复用、ImageEx对handle的保留与释放未取；无原版设备/SDK运行佐证。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：PointSet原生最终存储路径仍未知，不能由类型4或图像分支补齐。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180028250.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="055473846a95f55149afdcd543d0c4bff8f73638368e2477f1a846abd95be06c" href="../../证据/055473846a95f55149afdcd543d0c4bff8f73638368e2477f1a846abd95be06c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>055473846a95</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/180028250.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="51f10ad48da32e80dd0f4af7b01d755c17c509c844b2b1b777457d74cc2bfca8" href="../../证据/51f10ad48da32e80dd0f4af7b01d755c17c509c844b2b1b777457d74cc2bfca8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>51f10ad48da3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18002b2e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="30b86306e19395d6e4f90a0f5ca150fe1d26c5e800bb0e88dd46e9768caa0b36" href="../../证据/30b86306e19395d6e4f90a0f5ca150fe1d26c5e800bb0e88dd46e9768caa0b36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>30b86306e193</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-composite.resources/18002b2e0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2a0295241428c364e4b39908d28a0c299c50a594bbaf5108a1a5bd5ee7901423" href="../../证据/2a0295241428c364e4b39908d28a0c299c50a594bbaf5108a1a5bd5ee7901423.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2a0295241428</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP01 · VZ03/04 typed map factory f74b0/f7650/f7260 → 明确构造的0x88值对象与另一份0x18共享控制块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>名称未命中时三个factory分别分配0x88对象并写vtable 22e690/22e6b8/22e6e0；命中则复制已有节点+0x40共享对。包装体fa090/fa100/fa020另分配0x18控制块，强/弱计数均初始1，保存对象指针+0x10，写22e538/22e560/22e5b0。原PE字节校验这些实际表槽，不能把typed对象虚表与shared控制块虚表混成同一析构入口。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“VZ03/04 typed map factory f74b0/f7650/f7260 → 明确构造的0x88值对象与另一份0x18共享控制块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：初始化所复制callable的动态分配器目标未在本切片定位。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f74b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb91909534d4f84ab527516d41f5f029b5b05a666c180823d29a0712ddee1a99" href="../../证据/cb91909534d4f84ab527516d41f5f029b5b05a666c180823d29a0712ddee1a99.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb91909534d4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f7650.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c195902f1ee88ad4129cdacb8cd63138c9e7ab49174ee79bb4b9e81684cef907" href="../../证据/c195902f1ee88ad4129cdacb8cd63138c9e7ab49174ee79bb4b9e81684cef907.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c195902f1ee8</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f7260.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="85c9884a479f11dfaa0eab71e83f878165d29860dd52d40e2712ad01f36f9f97" href="../../证据/85c9884a479f11dfaa0eab71e83f878165d29860dd52d40e2712ad01f36f9f97.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>85c9884a479f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa090.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="56f01e8413c4c5565ac5d16a6389911b997c8f1729c036aea7002f8c72552b1a" href="../../证据/56f01e8413c4c5565ac5d16a6389911b997c8f1729c036aea7002f8c72552b1a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>56f01e8413c4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa100.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="34cde5ff72b3e6f3075f057a8d04ff817030aea50de849aed89407acf7c641bf" href="../../证据/34cde5ff72b3e6f3075f057a8d04ff817030aea50de849aed89407acf7c641bf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>34cde5ff72b3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa020.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d70e937437973cf687bc12ee18cc2081093a9977b89cfa7426696e18936536c3" href="../../证据/d70e937437973cf687bc12ee18cc2081093a9977b89cfa7426696e18936536c3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d70e93743797</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP02 · typed对象虚表+8 → 清逻辑长度，保留既有数值/字符串分配</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原表明确int/float/string的+8槽为f3fb0/f40b0/f42e0。int/float在当前数量大于0时仅把payload+0x68/+0x40写0；string逐项将内部字符串长度写0并首字符置零（按capacity选择SSO或heap），最后把payload+0x30计数写0。所选体没有delete/free；VZ03所调用的+8现在可细化为逻辑清空，不能称完整释放。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“typed对象虚表+8 → 清逻辑长度，保留既有数值/字符串分配”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：所有消费者最后读者以及何时触发最终载荷析构仍未知。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3fb0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2a188934e53b1d2ab5b67e78889d4c3ec5b0115615a35d4659be3e790a238558" href="../../证据/2a188934e53b1d2ab5b67e78889d4c3ec5b0115615a35d4659be3e790a238558.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2a188934e53b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f40b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9a6d1845477ec819bfcb39c052ef1010e1cb8cd3a8aa2b63971f1bad6c080be1" href="../../证据/9a6d1845477ec819bfcb39c052ef1010e1cb8cd3a8aa2b63971f1bad6c080be1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9a6d1845477e</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f42e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="764d603111ef7d55c0e071cdb9983edd1b004da6ec7ad835d57b521e4062e731" href="../../证据/764d603111ef7d55c0e071cdb9983edd1b004da6ec7ad835d57b521e4062e731.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>764d603111ef</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3f90.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d6c6dbf32cfdc9db8a070ba0c71187b7e8ea0dabfc1773b508288d7bd379b60" href="../../证据/0d6c6dbf32cfdc9db8a070ba0c71187b7e8ea0dabfc1773b508288d7bd379b60.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d6c6dbf32cf</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3fa0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="19b76cd83bfe520a59fa58b3f8727486236d5de04398be6837f4faa15b8c40b3" href="../../证据/19b76cd83bfe520a59fa58b3f8727486236d5de04398be6837f4faa15b8c40b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>19b76cd83bfe</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f40a0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="695ba0dc66e664b4b142e9ed8a3ca9b722b412781c99f7b624436d33ec19d8b0" href="../../证据/695ba0dc66e664b4b142e9ed8a3ca9b722b412781c99f7b624436d33ec19d8b0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>695ba0dc66e6</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f42d0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dad4af1710b9cb2029d7407ab7dda63883d0c41297f279e37ed8e18476220bcd" href="../../证据/dad4af1710b9cb2029d7407ab7dda63883d0c41297f279e37ed8e18476220bcd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dad4af1710b9</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP03 · 00fb90一次准备门 → callable产生原始载荷后调用typed容量准备槽</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>仅对象+0x78非零时检查callable；空则抛bad_function_call，非空调用其虚槽+0x10并把返回指针写对象+0x10。随后载荷flags写入1/2、处理名称/类型文本，再调用typed对象虚槽+0x10，成功正常返回才将待准备字节写0。该typed槽由原表绑定到f3f80/f4080/f42b0。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“00fb90一次准备门 → callable产生原始载荷后调用typed容量准备槽”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：callable实际虚表与其返回载荷的分配/共享仓所有权未定位；不补常见智能指针语义。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/18000fb90.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e63b696322859fe45ceaab105ec353839834d28a162f829f0083a6189b810392" href="../../证据/e63b696322859fe45ceaab105ec353839834d28a162f829f0083a6189b810392.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e63b69632285</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/18000fb90.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3d34a1c3d42886b3d627f155cab9df13f94978cd8a4bb7aee87e14f97edad1d9" href="../../证据/3d34a1c3d42886b3d627f155cab9df13f94978cd8a4bb7aee87e14f97edad1d9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3d34a1c3d428</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP04 · typed虚槽+0x10的数值准备 → 扩容复制旧值，并有条件退役旧数组</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>int/float仅capacity小于对象请求量时扩容，目标容量取请求量、旧容量两倍与最小4的最大值。新块前8字节保存旧块header；数据初始化后按旧count复制4字节值。旧块非null且旧header==0才delete[]，否则本体不释放旧块。string槽仅在数量不足时调用1a39f0追加差额，未将该callee未取体补成数组析构。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“typed虚槽+0x10的数值准备 → 扩容复制旧值，并有条件退役旧数组”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：00f3a0与1a39f0未取体；非零header的最终持有/退役责任未闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3f80.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="516d879359ab56148c3231d7456b54d21b3d2365f2c5790d35b17952ad0196d1" href="../../证据/516d879359ab56148c3231d7456b54d21b3d2365f2c5790d35b17952ad0196d1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>516d879359ab</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f4080.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="82fbd5eba549e448ea2b569bfa18f5c0fa1e9f6616ab9208854a46cc1fd693bf" href="../../证据/82fbd5eba549e448ea2b569bfa18f5c0fa1e9f6616ab9208854a46cc1fd693bf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>82fbd5eba549</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f3f80.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="95e2ca0496f7f44532eb793ac34843afced7a0fd7f2b53170a29bfb936a36d4e" href="../../证据/95e2ca0496f7f44532eb793ac34843afced7a0fd7f2b53170a29bfb936a36d4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>95e2ca0496f7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f42b0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7027861988d462e151a27d955fac3527f1018ce09430244073cbdbcb6c0e9298" href="../../证据/7027861988d462e151a27d955fac3527f1018ce09430244073cbdbcb6c0e9298.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7027861988d4</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP05 · VZ06强计数归零后的真实控制块slot0 → fa730清理包装对象，再delete包装对象本身</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>三个实际控制块表首槽均为fa730：读取控制块+0x10对象，非null调用f7410，然后汇编把同一对象放RCX并尾跳operator delete IAT180204580。f7410对名称/类型capacity>=16分别delete其堆块，复位字段；若callable存在，RCX传callable、DL=(callable!=对象内联区+0x18)，调用其虚槽+0x20后置null。本体未直接读取对象+0x10以free原始载荷。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“VZ06强计数归零后的真实控制块slot0 → fa730清理包装对象，再delete包装对象本身”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：callable实际虚表+0x20接收者未定位；不能由f7410的清理形态推断返回载荷被销毁。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa730.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3a74010e42ecc18ac1211c518cd5fe96153db74be48f61673b1e64a4dfc05df9" href="../../证据/3a74010e42ecc18ac1211c518cd5fe96153db74be48f61673b1e64a4dfc05df9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3a74010e42ec</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800fa730.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d6a67cb1de41193bd98dcba8403de590d701628fea70fc7f2d71f1d994684fc2" href="../../证据/d6a67cb1de41193bd98dcba8403de590d701628fea70fc7f2d71f1d994684fc2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d6a67cb1de41</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f7410.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8aca91fdad2c8226d8b2f445e57ad4ca0beec57a574f797ee21134b731a80499" href="../../证据/8aca91fdad2c8226d8b2f445e57ad4ca0beec57a574f797ee21134b731a80499.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8aca91fdad2c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800f7410.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2b6f6b2be5cfdf4f86d0513789bc25fad0443acea31f489cec33219b8dd563a0" href="../../证据/2b6f6b2be5cfdf4f86d0513789bc25fad0443acea31f489cec33219b8dd563a0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2b6f6b2be5cf</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VP06 · VZ06弱计数归零后的真实控制块slot+8 → 0210d0再派发slot+0x10并按DL低位delete控制块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>三个控制块表+8均为0210d0；它把同一控制块作为RCX、第二参数1转交自身vtable+0x10。原表该槽均为0210f0；其汇编TEST DL,1，非零调用operator delete IAT180204580，RCX仍为控制块。本证据补齐弱归零时控制块本身退役，不把包装对象与原始载荷混同。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“VZ06弱计数归零后的真实控制块slot+8 → 0210d0再派发slot+0x10并按DL低位delete控制块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：最终读者、跨仓共享、异常回收与原机运行未确认。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/vtable-selection.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70" href="../../证据/dcd9ba601e13e12664463ba41bc03f639f8d4d10e5e57acc3f80916458965d70.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9ba601e13</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800210d0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9d8734be956bedc5f43fcc929f9ee53f0e14c80513b8236656e07d35c2b0a826" href="../../证据/9d8734be956bedc5f43fcc929f9ee53f0e14c80513b8236656e07d35c2b0a826.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9d8734be956b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800210f0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="476f3d988e1951c9636d7b44909ad63f135da2550b28b38a1c82ce6fd4baa1b7" href="../../证据/476f3d988e1951c9636d7b44909ad63f135da2550b28b38a1c82ce6fd4baa1b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>476f3d988e19</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-payload.resources/1800210f0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cdabfa36a5a6f00faa54073d9f2b392a2c2bb81f30c32a2d09d812b1323e45cc" href="../../证据/cdabfa36a5a6f00faa54073d9f2b392a2c2bb81f30c32a2d09d812b1323e45cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cdabfa36a5a6</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VB01 · 原GlobalVariableModule.CreateModule RVA0x4f9b0 → 同一factory返回对象首虚表 → slot+0x18 → VN01接收体0x1f8c0</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>本轮取得实际CreateModule/构造器原体：factory请求0x10630字节，非空时以同一分配地址为RCX调用0x4fc30；构造器先调用0x1bf40，再把原PE虚表0x5ad60写到该对象首指针，返回同一地址。factory成功路径返回该对象。原PE逐qword核0x5ad60+0x18=0x18001f8c0；基础构造体0x1bf40较早写入的0x5ab38+0x18也指向同一接收体。两表COL/RTTI分别为CMyAlgorithmManager与CVariableModuBase；这不是仅凭类型或key名字拼接。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原GlobalVariableModule.CreateModule RVA0x4f9b0 → 同一factory返回对象首虚表 → slot+0x18 → VN01接收体0x1f8c0”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：仅证该已识别DLL的静态factory返回类型与接收槽；实际进程采用哪个DLL副本、加载成功的moduleID与活实例未做运行印证。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global-4f9b0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f0dc289a4bb139a4edc969e603d56214401886e64570a992e254934656bb0ce4" href="../../证据/f0dc289a4bb139a4edc969e603d56214401886e64570a992e254934656bb0ce4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f0dc289a4bb1</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global-4f9b0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a4ad30abc47b10da6021f11dfa08b6ae01821080722d694a68655aabc9de64f8" href="../../证据/a4ad30abc47b10da6021f11dfa08b6ae01821080722d694a68655aabc9de64f8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a4ad30abc47b</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global-4f9b0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3689d6cf6fcbf1995970dc29d4dcd66f8a77be1dd11265af21866de2b5d17574" href="../../证据/3689d6cf6fcbf1995970dc29d4dcd66f8a77be1dd11265af21866de2b5d17574.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3689d6cf6fcb</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global-4f9b0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5acce45be0797743cdcbc5f257be9f6c7fa8ca8b05e2003a3d2f79f4fad93630" href="../../证据/5acce45be0797743cdcbc5f257be9f6c7fa8ca8b05e2003a3d2f79f4fad93630.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5acce45be079</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global-4f9b0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b5822edd25e2beddfa9a79ebf7763e0553516bb5d02d9a87df8c86c9d3025aff" href="../../证据/b5822edd25e2beddfa9a79ebf7763e0553516bb5d02d9a87df8c86c9d3025aff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b5822edd25e2</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global/18004fc30.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92fa45d240c623d77eb57da505a1ba111ec2ea1c3d4f6d72a2bd06da37bfb747" href="../../证据/92fa45d240c623d77eb57da505a1ba111ec2ea1c3d4f6d72a2bd06da37bfb747.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92fa45d240c6</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/global-1bf40.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c70f23f9e64f6bb529bf69d6e7ff27cabd9795fbf5a279cffce6e543848d5adf" href="../../证据/c70f23f9e64f6bb529bf69d6e7ff27cabd9795fbf5a279cffce6e543848d5adf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c70f23f9e64f</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/globalvariable-vtable-layout.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b40fe0c13daabfc53e763711500fec06f6e0ca9d949e568f0b75fee775f7b48a" href="../../证据/b40fe0c13daabfc53e763711500fec06f6e0ca9d949e568f0b75fee775f7b48a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b40fe0c13daa</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VB02 · 原ModuleFrame模块创建0x112f40 → loader0xb54e0 → factory返回对象注册 → 0xb6b70按moduleID取原pointer → 模块record+0x128</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>原0xb54e0对选定路径LoadLibraryW，按原字节字符串CreateModule/DestroyModule调用GetProcAddress；两个地址非空时，以创建参数记录调用取得的CreateModule函数，将返回RAX保存在loader记录+8，非0时向返回对象+8写入创建参数pointer。所选注册路径把同一loader记录及控制块放入manager容器。0xb6b70在manager+0x38的真实_Mtx_lock/unlock内遍历：创建参数首int等于传入moduleID且loader记录非空时返回loader记录+8的原factory对象pointer。0x112f40以相同moduleID调用loader成功后调用该getter，保存RAX到R15，再按moduleID查本框架记录，将同一R15写入record+0x128。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModuleFrame模块创建0x112f40 → loader0xb54e0 → factory返回对象注册 → 0xb6b70按moduleID取原pointer → 模块record+0x128”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：loader接受通用模块路径；只有选到VB01识别的GlobalVariableModule原DLL时才把其factory/vtable代入本通用链，不能把每次创建都命名为全局变量模块。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：真实SDK对象handle与该ModuleFrame moduleID/record的上游注册关系尚未闭合；没有活进程同实例运行断言。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b54e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c1f77c2d5276554e4669ffdd7eb42fc077d998aec39604c1a7cdc2d0cd3d16c0" href="../../证据/c1f77c2d5276554e4669ffdd7eb42fc077d998aec39604c1a7cdc2d0cd3d16c0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c1f77c2d5276</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b54e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a50f962f99d1e784ece19f4021d52cdb88a1427cb4ad8fa95b5014ebf656633f" href="../../证据/a50f962f99d1e784ece19f4021d52cdb88a1427cb4ad8fa95b5014ebf656633f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a50f962f99d1</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b54e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8496ccf98cc4474d113e3a215c865ac2004a93c5c6fb4b64d6b9b36c8b74899" href="../../证据/f8496ccf98cc4474d113e3a215c865ac2004a93c5c6fb4b64d6b9b36c8b74899.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8496ccf98cc</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b54e0.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="62613ecfa3a37b1fecb08d40669c458f3dc8a064c46f762964a4f02b4e7274d8" href="../../证据/62613ecfa3a37b1fecb08d40669c458f3dc8a064c46f762964a4f02b4e7274d8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>62613ecfa3a3</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b54e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d52bbf40a0175879af8743423a70dfe5037247b17265dd3497fa57b287ff8c0b" href="../../证据/d52bbf40a0175879af8743423a70dfe5037247b17265dd3497fa57b287ff8c0b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d52bbf40a017</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b54e0.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d0481cbcb2e08f2fe2476273c68c35bb621ac7e0b4dbd85f0f022d2d5ee0fdfe" href="../../证据/d0481cbcb2e08f2fe2476273c68c35bb621ac7e0b4dbd85f0f022d2d5ee0fdfe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d0481cbcb2e0</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/1800b6b70.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cd7ad162bfd48aa53b3262a29ebf186f5ace581ba59fd53ba352ad219a16a25a" href="../../证据/cd7ad162bfd48aa53b3262a29ebf186f5ace581ba59fd53ba352ad219a16a25a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cd7ad162bfd4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/180112f40.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4d9fa32eb4d7026167798b204c78ad43c94144aeed50542155158a12e71d75ef" href="../../证据/4d9fa32eb4d7026167798b204c78ad43c94144aeed50542155158a12e71d75ef.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4d9fa32eb4d7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/180112f40.asm.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b31154fd06805590b142141050be77a8c5a243362b7df9f84793666a8f9307f2" href="../../证据/b31154fd06805590b142141050be77a8c5a243362b7df9f84793666a8f9307f2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b31154fd0680</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/moduleframe.pe.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="67e5c821b385e074860af1962ae75f61c25893100e8cdee58ed1faa8d21be3a5" href="../../证据/67e5c821b385e074860af1962ae75f61c25893100e8cdee58ed1faa8d21be3a5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>67e5c821b385</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VB03 · 原ModuleFrame.VM_M_SetBinayData 0x13aad0 → 一般参数分支 → moduleID查record → record+0x128主虚表+0x18直接派发</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>导出0x13aad0保存ECX=moduleID、RDX=key、R8=payload、R9D=length；调用0x43120时改为RCX=manager(0x2b12d0)、EDX=原moduleID、R8=原key、R9=原payload、第五栈参数=原length。0x43120先验证key非空及manager+0x22状态；特殊key ##ImportModuleData##、DynamicInData、DynamicOutData有各自路线，一般key经0x10a690按moduleID取得record/控制块。若record+0x128非0，原汇编以RCX=该factory对象pointer，RDX=同一key、R8=同一payload、R9D=同一length调用其首虚表+0x18。因此在VB02注册的是VB01工厂对象这一条件下，实际调用目标静态闭合为VN01的0x1f8c0，而非按SetBinaryData同名推定。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModuleFrame.VM_M_SetBinayData 0x13aad0 → 一般参数分支 → moduleID查record → record+0x128主虚表+0x18直接派发”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ModifyVar/DeleteVar不等于上述三个特殊key，因此属于所选一般分支；全体key、错误码和fallback语义未穷举。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：上游SDK的0xbd2 callback如何调用到此ModuleFrame导出仍是VB04明确断点；本条不宣称整个SDK→插件链已闭合。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-13aad0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6b25cd85a3098344c79dc4383ddf2419119a303ee2e3eb01d945c7a0d3d95087" href="../../证据/6b25cd85a3098344c79dc4383ddf2419119a303ee2e3eb01d945c7a0d3d95087.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6b25cd85a309</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-13aad0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ed248e3d3dd4e9421aee20c0db77cd1c17d09ff3d62673dcfa297702be9b47ba" href="../../证据/ed248e3d3dd4e9421aee20c0db77cd1c17d09ff3d62673dcfa297702be9b47ba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ed248e3d3dd4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame/180043120.c</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2059f4977ad5f78d0ca79b0bf203c74b1350c28129700ba6da42fb9d2e961d71" href="../../证据/2059f4977ad5f78d0ca79b0bf203c74b1350c28129700ba6da42fb9d2e961d71.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2059f4977ad5</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-10a690.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ec56029fb2bf269137af3957e9ffb6ecb3f9064e572cb5ee5d27f14818fa3d4b" href="../../证据/ec56029fb2bf269137af3957e9ffb6ecb3f9064e572cb5ee5d27f14818fa3d4b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ec56029fb2bf</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-43120.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c2e389c0d572e4435815e55aac9cacf1b55ee2e5f7cf0b213dece3f7e3e58daa" href="../../证据/c2e389c0d572e4435815e55aac9cacf1b55ee2e5f7cf0b213dece3f7e3e58daa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c2e389c0d572</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-43120.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dce574f93dbbd44a25ae995a71608c7ac1862cf35aa3a6a154a29dd877a165e1" href="../../证据/dce574f93dbbd44a25ae995a71608c7ac1862cf35aa3a6a154a29dd877a165e1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dce574f93dbb</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-43120.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="890e70bf470c56370d3dd50fc69d10064fb30d7674b13de47ac2d91a48f5039d" href="../../证据/890e70bf470c56370d3dd50fc69d10064fb30d7674b13de47ac2d91a48f5039d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>890e70bf470c</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/frame-43120.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1702d3175d4a9c812d1cb8380f877e7c37ac7a5c9f5a31346d20de7790266e7a" href="../../证据/1702d3175d4a9c812d1cb8380f877e7c37ac7a5c9f5a31346d20de7790266e7a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1702d3175d4a</small></a></details></details><details><summary>VB04 · 原托管ModuleManager.SetBinaryData → iMVS-6000PlatformSDK.IMVS_SetBinaryData → SDK实际callback边界0x66f090：opcode0xbd2、binary pointer/length；未证等于ModuleFrame同名接口</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>托管ModuleManager构造IMVS_SET_BINARY_DATA_INFO并调用ServerSDKAPI→NativeMethods，DllImport实际目标是iMVS-6000PlatformSDK.dll。本轮对同SHA原PE重新截取IMVS_SetBinaryData 0x6471f0与直接callee0x66f090原runtime范围及字节：导出先校验handle记录，再把moduleID、描述pointer、timeout交0x66f090；callee从描述+0x100读取binary pointer，从+0x108读取32位长度，读取this+0x23a8函数pointer。函数pointer非空时，以ECX=0xbd2、RDX=临时格式串、R8=描述中的binary pointer、R9D=描述中的length、第五/第六参数0进行间接调用。该调用的真实callee注册和跨组件接收者尚未取得，不能把它和ModuleFrame.VM_M_SetBinayData仅凭名字合并。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原托管ModuleManager.SetBinaryData → iMVS-6000PlatformSDK.IMVS_SetBinaryData → SDK实际callback边界0x66f090：opcode0xbd2、binary pointer/length；未证等于ModuleFrame同名接口”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：尚缺SDK this+0x23a8 callback的赋值来源、opcode0xbd2真实处理者、它到ModuleFrame.VM_M_SetBinayData的具体调用桥及binary载荷租约；不可用SDK/ModuleFrame/插件三个相似方法名替代该缺口。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：原进程handle/moduleID、动态加载路径和内存地址未做运行观测；有限静态对象链不等于运行全等。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="de85f087a58ac7930170b273a5ffc6e8092c01a3a27b6706533c2bf2eaad2ed9" href="../../证据/de85f087a58ac7930170b273a5ffc6e8092c01a3a27b6706533c2bf2eaad2ed9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>de85f087a58a</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89cc7bdd75b4208aba447fe2f53b7703a268fd8c712548fc505d03460bfc7e5b" href="../../证据/89cc7bdd75b4208aba447fe2f53b7703a268fd8c712548fc505d03460bfc7e5b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89cc7bdd75b4</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/sdk-6471f0.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c55a4a1c06d6f273d2965d03e143182d405a6bb1cdc73e5e9fbca52e641d4207" href="../../证据/c55a4a1c06d6f273d2965d03e143182d405a6bb1cdc73e5e9fbca52e641d4207.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c55a4a1c06d6</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/variable-dispatch.resources/sdk-66f090.dumpbin.txt</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9029779583e1b125dd5ab8982f6fa8f77aad09fd8794243ac049703634c13853" href="../../证据/9029779583e1b125dd5ab8982f6fa8f77aad09fd8794243ac049703634c13853.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9029779583e1</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR04 · VmModule.Dispose → CommonDispose → VmIO.Dispose → 撤关联/移出模型及交SDK关闭模块；IO值字段不由Dispose直接清空</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>VmModule.Dispose先设置IsOnDispose并拒绝重复disposedValue；清变量关联、可选导出Undo数据、删除内部模块、解除前后继与参数绑定，然后CommonDispose。CommonDispose反向删除NextModules、调用父UnSubInnerModule，再逆序Dispose每个Inputs/Outputs。VmIO.Dispose对子项递归Dispose，CollectionParent.Remove(this)、RelateIO=null、disposedValue=true；所选体没有直接写_value或_valueList。模块随后移出父Modules与AllModules，再CloseModuleInterface→SDK CloseOneModule。删除结构/断IO关系和结果载荷最后读者不是同一保证。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“VmModule.Dispose → CommonDispose → VmIO.Dispose → 撤关联/移出模型及交SDK关闭模块；IO值字段不由Dispose直接清空”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：CloseOneModule底层句柄/缓冲退出、删除后旧显示装饰器是否收到换源通知及所有最后读者未在本切片闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：异常时IsOnDispose复位不等于前面已完成的IO/模型移除具有事务回滚。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="98325eb622fb846ab24011862147528546677679475fbaa0f290d95a8fff8b14" href="../../证据/98325eb622fb846ab24011862147528546677679475fbaa0f290d95a8fff8b14.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>98325eb622fb</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmModule.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="192d0c48cf23b0dfb6648ad107c5d2d0bb30c7dbc9a00e81e39231fc5ead23ad" href="../../证据/192d0c48cf23b0dfb6648ad107c5d2d0bb30c7dbc9a00e81e39231fc5ead23ad.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>192d0c48cf23</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmIO.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4ee346131170998897f7bc32318819e5ad8d4076be063cf50cab1056eaec4d9" href="../../证据/f4ee346131170998897f7bc32318819e5ad8d4076be063cf50cab1056eaec4d9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4ee34613117</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OR05 · VmSolution.Dispose(bool isTakeOver) → 向VmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle传0或1</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>现有应用退出已有L17调用VmSolution.Dispose(isRunBackground)。本轮只补到该bool重载的实际体：记录DestoryHandle日志，然后调用mVmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle(isTakeOver?1:0)。无参Dispose还有SDKMode的DestoryThirdHandle任务+SyncWaitor路径，另一路base.Dispose后调用bool重载并设置IsDispose；不能把这些重载自动当同一退出模式。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“VmSolution.Dispose(bool isTakeOver) → 向VmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle传0或1”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：VmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle原生接收体、后台接管实际存活资源、异步回调全部停止时点未取，本轮不启动原版。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.Core/VM.Core/VmSolution.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f2986948c80348d84f725999c2f15b94527621325f79b6911098e01e822271e4" href="../../证据/f2986948c80348d84f725999c2f15b94527621325f79b6911098e01e822271e4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f2986948c803</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR01 · ModuleExecutionScope.RegisterService&lt;T>替换旧owned服务 → 先撤owned标记，再Dispose；抛错可留下未回滚的旧映射</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>条件必须同时满足：同T已有previous、新service不是同引用、ownedServices.Remove(previous)返回true且previous实现IDisposable。该条件链先从ownedServices删除旧对象，再调用previous.Dispose；只有其正常返回才写services[typeof(T)]=新service及按owned标记登记新对象。旧Dispose抛异常时方法无catch/finally回滚：services仍映射旧previous，旧owned标记已移除，新service未写入，异常直接向调用者传播，也不调用RecordCleanupFailure。不能把注册失败描述为原状态完全不变。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“ModuleExecutionScope.RegisterService&lt;T>替换旧owned服务 → 先撤owned标记，再Dispose；抛错可留下未回滚的旧映射”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本条是源码静态事实；另列ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限合成Disposable替换异常。真实相机/工具服务、GUI与设备未观测，不直接宣称现有资源会触发。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：ownedServices按对象而非逐Type独立计数；所有多接口别名注册/外部所有者的实际组合未穷尽。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d10827d45e12e725d58d37e417f5352795f67844251dadcc24751e5c042b741d" href="../../证据/d10827d45e12e725d58d37e417f5352795f67844251dadcc24751e5c042b741d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d10827d45e12</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7d4f5619157a41957f0121e6ffe2c757e00e17489e154a3b2476533cbff9ac23" href="../../证据/7d4f5619157a41957f0121e6ffe2c757e00e17489e154a3b2476533cbff9ac23.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7d4f5619157a</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188" href="../../证据/310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>310faafd8596</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="964864aa21e58faf7a7b428113c7ab05132acdd2407ce54206ab7388147a21c8" href="../../证据/964864aa21e58faf7a7b428113c7ab05132acdd2407ce54206ab7388147a21c8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>964864aa21e5</small></a></details></details><details><summary>CSR04 · 取消或资源Dispose异常后的root Dispose / Lease.Exit → root清理是一次性尝试；failedResources保留不等于排队重试</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Dispose设置closing后，stopping.Cancel抛Exception会RecordCleanupFailure(cancel,stopping,error)，finally仍设置cancellationComplete并TryRelease；不是因取消回调异常就跳过该finally。TryRelease要求closing、cancellationComplete、leases==0且!releaseStarted，在真正Release前置releaseStarted=true。Release对各IDisposable的Exception分别记录后继续下一资源，并单独尝试stopping.Dispose；这点现有CR06已有，本事实新增明确重试边界：root重复Dispose因closing立即return，后续Exit也因releaseStarted不再启动第二遍，failedResources只保留对象，所选类没有重试/清空该表的方法。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“取消或资源Dispose异常后的root Dispose / Lease.Exit → root清理是一次性尝试；failedResources保留不等于排队重试”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不把源码Exception catch扩大为任何OOM、进程退出或任意RecordCleanupFailure自身失败时也必完整清理。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：本条是源码静态事实；另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限异常与重复Dispose。GC、真实资源/GUI/设备及native释放未观测，不以幂等调用门推成功释放/原版等价。</p><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="25130754904625cadcdad559712b1e9298d053ebf76c32aa1fd99c72476ca2de" href="../../证据/25130754904625cadcdad559712b1e9298d053ebf76c32aa1fd99c72476ca2de.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>251307549046</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f2e6a8876eda1fe94b3bfcc7876c5a9418ec89c22b3f630b0946e517cf0c13a0" href="../../证据/f2e6a8876eda1fe94b3bfcc7876c5a9418ec89c22b3f630b0946e517cf0c13a0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f2e6a8876eda</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="61daf69cd32d9631373aa1e2980f2bcdfb5c67b3667360b8d8ac2aca74c61898" href="../../证据/61daf69cd32d9631373aa1e2980f2bcdfb5c67b3667360b8d8ac2aca74c61898.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>61daf69cd32d</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188" href="../../证据/310faafd85966d53e0551b8ab00ae4dbac6c00d3119279f2c22e70b291b27188.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>310faafd8596</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd2d67c66bdbf31088a906a44fad23a3cec8952a95b0b9cae68c729032eb3644" href="../../证据/bd2d67c66bdbf31088a906a44fad23a3cec8952a95b0b9cae68c729032eb3644.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd2d67c66bdb</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ca8fde56b8897ea11321f59623422ce5471c7fe1eda7a67886f3d360b0e0a7ba" href="../../证据/ca8fde56b8897ea11321f59623422ce5471c7fe1eda7a67886f3d360b0e0a7ba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ca8fde56b889</small></a></details><details><summary>src/VisionFramework/ModuleExecutionScope.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0564c5545b60182cc37a0c1578d6e328f22f0eb5693b954dd058b2adf97291f7" href="../../证据/0564c5545b60182cc37a0c1578d6e328f22f0eb5693b954dd058b2adf97291f7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0564c5545b60</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP02 · 原ModuleManager.SetUIParamValue / SetDynamicUIParamValue → 临时非托管字节副本 → native setter；空载荷改走删除</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>两setter对非null且Length非0的byte[]按实际Length分配HGlobal并Marshal.Copy，传pointer和uint Length调用native；调用正常返回后FreeHGlobal，再检查返回码抛错。null和空数组都走对应删除方法，不能保存为可区分的零长度值。普通路由另有IsForbidden特殊分支：非null载荷先BytesToStruct&lt;bool>再EnableModule，绕过一般UI键存储。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原ModuleManager.SetUIParamValue / SetDynamicUIParamValue → 临时非托管字节副本 → native setter；空载荷改走删除”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：native setter保存副本或租用pointer的协议、删除最终析构、原.sol打包时点未闭合；本片不重新推断Writer/mdata。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="896e501aa27687ea4d5cce53ee4dadf1c2d3ad6ce17be012d13b507396ef70d6" href="../../证据/896e501aa27687ea4d5cce53ee4dadf1c2d3ad6ce17be012d13b507396ef70d6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>896e501aa276</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="16fba9f8f2bbae08f52324d50cfdf8ad3253e6ddf3c71f311fcb43793bd8da51" href="../../证据/16fba9f8f2bbae08f52324d50cfdf8ad3253e6ddf3c71f311fcb43793bd8da51.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>16fba9f8f2bb</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="09d12348522282e89b68151244116de2755027be286928e55c26f4ddce562cb4" href="../../证据/09d12348522282e89b68151244116de2755027be286928e55c26f4ddce562cb4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>09d123485222</small></a></details></details><details><summary>OP03 · 原普通/动态UserData读取 → native pointer+nDataLen → 新托管byte[]；正常尾请求释放返回块</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>普通GetUIParamValueByKey成功时new byte[nDataLen]并在pData非0时Marshal.Copy；复制异常被吞，随后仍请求RELEASE_MEMORY_BASE_ARRAY，释放失败抛VmException。错误码-536870911返回null，其他非0抛错。动态ModuleManager getter经ServerSDKAPI展开：成功时同样按返回nDataLen新建数组及复制，但Release调用位于pData非0条件内，不能合并成同一无条件尾释放。动态wrapper将byte[]返回给调用者。</p><p>SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖：这条既有事实明确核实“原普通/动态UserData读取 → native pointer+nDataLen → 新托管byte[]；正常尾请求释放返回块”，仅将该具体数据动作纳入本域的需求讨论。</p><p class="dd-gap">选定PInvoke/allocator与映射证据不能外推全部导出；消息结构、容量/编码、回调所有者和干净环境依赖仍需逐合同核对，禁止以工具全库算法扩大main。</p><p class="dd-gap">具体未决：不能由Release成功推断SDK权威存储已删除；本slice未执行SDK，也未恢复该释放类型内部allocator。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="040127f8a7fa0bfd03e501eec77f26c79d1167c395deaf2eb9236347f205cf7f" href="../../证据/040127f8a7fa0bfd03e501eec77f26c79d1167c395deaf2eb9236347f205cf7f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>040127f8a7fa</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ModuleManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="393587e633a044c73457ca65e0bfe4ffdf1d4c12ee1c2a4c71a86a2c091a5582" href="../../证据/393587e633a044c73457ca65e0bfe4ffdf1d4c12ee1c2a4c71a86a2c091a5582.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>393587e633a0</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ServerSDKAPI.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c5c2d283f34efba0d09c4875a819be3a7b2a8fd01466a027e9a72322701f1862" href="../../证据/c5c2d283f34efba0d09c4875a819be3a7b2a8fd01466a027e9a72322701f1862.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c5c2d283f34e</small></a></details></details><h4>已有正式关系：完整成员与源码</h4><details><summary>communication-protection:P14 · SolutionManager检测/取key包装 → 固定16字节key缓冲、pin及错误码返回</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>CheckDataEncryptByDongle先GCHandle.Alloc(dataByte,Pinned)，try内AddrOfPinnedObject/IsAllocated门再调用SDK，非零直接return；finally在已分配时Free。GetEncryptionFromDongle先keyBuff=new byte[16]并pin，SDK入参buffSize=16，返回非零同样直接return，finally Free。分配在try外；上层服务丢弃这些int，不能把返回0与数据/存在位有效合成一个结论。</p><p>计划将D06归入F-23，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。native bool写回、mhandle来源、分配/固定失败与真实调用仍未验证；分配16字节不是取得有效秘密材料的运行证据。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/SolutionManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c1f3de16eba708f88c0cf0fa8a0c1b925bff93d6dc86f30c1284e8b2e4841016" href="../../证据/c1f3de16eba708f88c0cf0fa8a0c1b925bff93d6dc86f30c1284e8b2e4841016.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c1f3de16eba7</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/SolutionManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eb60e3df4d11a7b2d58eaa5a3d2efa8d91c3186cd73ef2a3b270c83f1fda00b1" href="../../证据/eb60e3df4d11a7b2d58eaa5a3d2efa8d91c3186cd73ef2a3b270c83f1fda00b1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eb60e3df4d11</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/communication-protection-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="63cfd8d7f4f18584d9a8c029e61946de90a7834dec0dc37711c342f366afe02a" href="../../证据/63cfd8d7f4f18584d9a8c029e61946de90a7834dec0dc37711c342f366afe02a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>63cfd8d7f4f1</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/communication-protection-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="63844147a267353ec586261423e60501cac0081e18d89d7938409c2f14850aee" href="../../证据/63844147a267353ec586261423e60501cac0081e18d89d7938409c2f14850aee.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>63844147a267</small></a></details></details><details><summary>communication-protection:P15 · SolutionManager.DataEncryptByDongle / DataDecryptByDongle → 按输入长度±84预分配 → 三pin → 原码返回</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>加密dataOut长度为dataIn.Length+84，解密为Length-84；输出分配和三次GCHandle.Alloc均在try之前。try内取三指针并检查IsAllocated，传入原输入Length、key指针、输出容量和ref nDataLenOut；非零直接返回。finally分别Free已分配句柄。所选体不按nDataLenOut裁剪数组，也不显式预检null/短于84输入；不能由固定84推出native头格式或实际明文长度。</p><p>计划将D06归入F-23，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。native算法/ABI/输出长度与边界输入、pre-try分配失败后的已分配句柄状态未知；未调用原包装，不以托管数组容量代替实际有效字节数。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/SolutionManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="63c17e21b98d9dabf81bc57330b18c0d9149e9734014dedc94b2fc8b55e08fe0" href="../../证据/63c17e21b98d9dabf81bc57330b18c0d9149e9734014dedc94b2fc8b55e08fe0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>63c17e21b98d</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/SolutionManager.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="51828fc83cf719850524f9a11d3d177f0e7f72c2245a0b6e6f70f8b08b9b73b6" href="../../证据/51828fc83cf719850524f9a11d3d177f0e7f72c2245a0b6e6f70f8b08b9b73b6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>51828fc83cf7</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/communication-protection-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f3d401214c9415ea506d2341841dacefbe8a38d1e8447d2b01cecf6c5ab372be" href="../../证据/f3d401214c9415ea506d2341841dacefbe8a38d1e8447d2b01cecf6c5ab372be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f3d401214c94</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/communication-protection-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="24c77af4a5b8681a067f3766725ab983ce0335f458cc89d528342c06215cc1e9" href="../../证据/24c77af4a5b8681a067f3766725ab983ce0335f458cc89d528342c06215cc1e9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>24c77af4a5b8</small></a></details></details><details><summary>communication-protection:P16 · ServerSDKAPI四个直接包装 → NativeMethods.IMVS_* DllImport</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>四个ServerSDKAPI成员直接将handle/指针/长度/ref参数交同名NativeMethods并返回int；本地NativeMethods声明绑定相对.\iMVS-6000PlatformSDK.dll。这四声明未显式指定CallingConvention或bool MarshalAs；邻近其它声明有StdCall并不能替代这四声明。所选原SDK CIL仅证明托管直接转发，不证明native二进制实际加载路径、ABI实现或硬件行为。</p><p>计划将D06归入F-23，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。实际native导出/位数/调用约定/布尔布局、已加载DLL身份、handle生命周期及设备密钥接口未恢复；未加载或执行任何SDK。</p><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ServerSDKAPI.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="10c9eaa9ed1729bd7be142e5537f885b2a917a056fe72404d8150f6c9150b3e6" href="../../证据/10c9eaa9ed1729bd7be142e5537f885b2a917a056fe72404d8150f6c9150b3e6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>10c9eaa9ed17</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/communication-protection-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="30ca1e5d95c5d89e6a0e9dc1e1dcc6757fce9a1e0a2dcc766c7a7ef726c8ac21" href="../../证据/30ca1e5d95c5d89e6a0e9dc1e1dcc6757fce9a1e0a2dcc766c7a7ef726c8ac21.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>30ca1e5d95c5</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3010b529e5bb77b0c6687a89c9dac8aa79a8b967f1a8a29ddde853fa6b5c3291" href="../../证据/3010b529e5bb77b0c6687a89c9dac8aa79a8b967f1a8a29ddde853fa6b5c3291.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3010b529e5bb</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/communication-protection-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8baecddeff0fcc24d64ba567972734ed8898fd13b80d47da39e259937f790c5a" href="../../证据/8baecddeff0fcc24d64ba567972734ed8898fd13b80d47da39e259937f790c5a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8baecddeff0f</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a9077f3f7052564d595c48623bf6b2e5b06ce81feea8ea556323dfbf161de3bc" href="../../证据/a9077f3f7052564d595c48623bf6b2e5b06ce81feea8ea556323dfbf161de3bc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a9077f3f7052</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/communication-protection-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3c423878f52de2afc74694d34b34f8775a2493cbed665e4c9df46e8b0a7309e2" href="../../证据/3c423878f52de2afc74694d34b34f8775a2493cbed665e4c9df46e8b0a7309e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3c423878f52d</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="019b5f909d734d3c01d2c0a74f8028e0a5ba080f161f1609185c0e4c8b6c65fa" href="../../证据/019b5f909d734d3c01d2c0a74f8028e0a5ba080f161f1609185c0e4c8b6c65fa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>019b5f909d73</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/communication-protection-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bdd22c829bb3933a03961d16b8a3bc1b4f1c69bef5d9dd019456cee520368ae5" href="../../证据/bdd22c829bb3933a03961d16b8a3bc1b4f1c69bef5d9dd019456cee520368ae5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bdd22c829bb3</small></a></details><details><summary>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/NativeMethods.cs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4925a03ebf0950ef47ea9d537c7b43c48ee6f1b25328a698092f6178a89ad937" href="../../证据/4925a03ebf0950ef47ea9d537c7b43c48ee6f1b25328a698092f6178a89ad937.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4925a03ebf09</small></a></details></details><details><summary>external-entries:T08 · Base构造 / 两种CallReceived状态机 → 回调初始null / 非null才Invoke</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Base构造先写OnZmqReceived=null。两个CallReceived入口本身创建async状态机，实际接收与回调读取在MoveNext；原体检查字段非null后才调用。选定EXE未见其它直接写字段的指令，尚无证据把MQ消息连到菜单命令或tool的21个载荷执行。</p><p>计划将C06归入F-23，该任务映射明确列此成员边；仅对照本域“SDK缓冲、ABI、错误码、服务载荷及部署依赖”的具体动作。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是已有任务映射中的有限成员关系，不证明任务完成门槛、同实例/全分支、原机运行或当前实现等价。外部赋值/反射、消息源、订阅生命周期、业务分派、权限和异常回收仍开放；回调类型声明存在不证明已挂业务处理器。</p><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/mq-entry-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="98bc44aef3faf692f9d6c5276b902069f63933d0d1750b4ed7f3f6bc51ecc462" href="../../证据/98bc44aef3faf692f9d6c5276b902069f63933d0d1750b4ed7f3f6bc51ecc462.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>98bc44aef3fa</small></a></details><details><summary>docs/architecture-recovery/mq-entry-cil-evidence.json</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b1052703a26fb24d6bdd0750bf